(933448, 108979, 93, '<td valign="top">woah.. man.. I think you''ve single-handedly caused me to need glasses.  Incredible idea, the lines and B&amp;W just shout out at you as loud as they can.  Only problem I have is that I''m not getting the strongest compositional feel from it, but damned if I can explain why.</td>', 'woah.. man.. I think you''ve single-handedly caused me to need glasses.  Incredible idea, the lines and B&W just shout out at you as loud as they can.  Only problem I have is that I''m not getting the strongest compositional feel from it, but damned if I can explain why.', '2004-10-01 01:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(933450, 108984, 93, '<td valign="top">Love the complementary color thing going on.  Too bad about the harsh lighting on the pepper, did you diffuse at all?  The blue background.. I can''t figure out if I like it or not. It''s definitely a nice change from white or black.</td>', 'Love the complementary color thing going on.  Too bad about the harsh lighting on the pepper, did you diffuse at all?  The blue background.. I can''t figure out if I like it or not. It''s definitely a nice change from white or black.', '2004-10-01 01:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(933451, 107969, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture but way too processed to qualify as a photo.  Digital art it is, photo it is not...</td>', 'Beautiful picture but way too processed to qualify as a photo.  Digital art it is, photo it is not...', '2004-10-01 01:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(933453, 107969, 20210, '<td valign="top">I wish this one were right-side up instead of upside down.  Beautiful crystal water captured, and phenomenal texture on the kiwi.</td>', 'I wish this one were right-side up instead of upside down.  Beautiful crystal water captured, and phenomenal texture on the kiwi.', '2004-10-01 01:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(933454, 108276, 93, '<td valign="top">Now this is a classic example of how to capture scenery.  You''ve taken a mundane landscape, and transformed it.  Absolutely gorgeous. The lighting is haunting, and leads you into the trees.  Perhaps a little *too* blown out in the clouds on the left.  However, it''s like looking at a fine painting</td>', 'Now this is a classic example of how to capture scenery.  You''ve taken a mundane landscape, and transformed it.  Absolutely gorgeous. The lighting is haunting, and leads you into the trees.  Perhaps a little *too* blown out in the clouds on the left.  However, it''s like looking at a fine painting', '2004-10-01 01:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(933455, 108924, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lol, my shot is named ''Solitude'' as well, yours probably fits it better, but I chose mine out of about 15 others. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Lol, my shot is named ''Solitude'' as well, yours probably fits it better, but I chose mine out of about 15 others. Beautiful shot.', '2004-10-01 01:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(933456, 107202, 11518, '<td valign="top">DrJones?  Beautiful shot!  Great pose and lighting.</td>', 'DrJones?  Beautiful shot!  Great pose and lighting.', '2004-10-01 01:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(933457, 107969, 93, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  I take it you inverted this?  What a great idea, and so wonderfully captured.  Like a toadstool in a fantasy land.</td>', 'Fantastic!  I take it you inverted this?  What a great idea, and so wonderfully captured.  Like a toadstool in a fantasy land.', '2004-10-01 01:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(933458, 108843, 11518, '<td valign="top">Horizon is too centered.</td>', 'Horizon is too centered.', '2004-10-01 01:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(933460, 104134, 93, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen a little more depth of focus on her face. The nose and lips are just a little out of focus, and my eyes keep getting drawn to them because of it, instead of staying on the eyes.  Wonderfully composited however, and such a gorgeous little girl.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen a little more depth of focus on her face. The nose and lips are just a little out of focus, and my eyes keep getting drawn to them because of it, instead of staying on the eyes.  Wonderfully composited however, and such a gorgeous little girl.', '2004-10-01 01:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(933461, 108843, 6349, '<td valign="top">This looks REALLY familiar.  :)</td>', 'This looks REALLY familiar.  :)', '2004-10-01 01:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(933462, 108072, 20210, '<td valign="top">The neck of the horse I find distracting as it exits the frame.  Also, I wish the man were looking into the camera for a more emotive look.  The blue colors are beautiful, and the DOF is perfect.</td>', 'The neck of the horse I find distracting as it exits the frame.  Also, I wish the man were looking into the camera for a more emotive look.  The blue colors are beautiful, and the DOF is perfect.', '2004-10-01 01:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(933464, 107586, 92, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite type of photography. It would be a 10 for me if it was cropped without the hand due to the blur. Still a high vote. Love it !</td>', 'This is my favorite type of photography. It would be a 10 for me if it was cropped without the hand due to the blur. Still a high vote. Love it !', '2004-10-01 01:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(933465, 109013, 4226, '<td valign="top">I think I have seen this photo somewhere.....let me think.... oh i remember Laurie and her photo a day project :)</td>', 'I think I have seen this photo somewhere.....let me think.... oh i remember Laurie and her photo a day project :)', '2004-10-01 01:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(933468, 108872, 93, '<td valign="top">Very simple, great use of complementary colors, great use of negative space.. even your lighting seems to be spot on.. great job.</td>', 'Very simple, great use of complementary colors, great use of negative space.. even your lighting seems to be spot on.. great job.', '2004-10-01 01:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(933469, 104134, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a very strong image which displays a strong will character. yes, there is sweetness and there is charm but the gaze is ever so steady and the mouth adds to the conviction of the eyes. In this pose I would have prefered the whole thumb showing rather than bent at the first joint. The tones are very friendly and pleasing and the loose falling hair adds a candid touch. The feeling that this is a remarkable young lady has been very well conveyed.  Outside of the minor point of the thumb joint, my most critical note is in the focusing. The right eye, and the eyes are so impotant is not in focus. here you have one sharp catchlight versus a spreading one. Here dof was critical. In portrait, the eyes trump because we try to lock eyes with the subject. My current evaluation is a 6 on the strength of the character study.</td>', 'This is a very strong image which displays a strong will character. yes, there is sweetness and there is charm but the gaze is ever so steady and the mouth adds to the conviction of the eyes. In this pose I would have prefered the whole thumb showing rather than bent at the first joint. The tones are very friendly and pleasing and the loose falling hair adds a candid touch. The feeling that this is a remarkable young lady has been very well conveyed.  Outside of the minor point of the thumb joint, my most critical note is in the focusing. The right eye, and the eyes are so impotant is not in focus. here you have one sharp catchlight versus a spreading one. Here dof was critical. In portrait, the eyes trump because we try to lock eyes with the subject. My current evaluation is a 6 on the strength of the character study.', '2004-10-01 01:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(933470, 107902, 92, '<td valign="top">So far...this has to be my favorite ! I love the way it''s done. Is this a miniature? I hope to get a email from you explaining how you did this. The lighting and selective color is perfect ! 10</td>', 'So far...this has to be my favorite ! I love the way it''s done. Is this a miniature? I hope to get a email from you explaining how you did this. The lighting and selective color is perfect ! 10', '2004-10-01 01:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(933472, 108984, 3280, '<td valign="top">Just jumps out at you among all of the entries.  Incredible color and focus.  I like everything about this one including the simple and yet effective border.  Wonderful job!</td>', 'Just jumps out at you among all of the entries.  Incredible color and focus.  I like everything about this one including the simple and yet effective border.  Wonderful job!', '2004-10-01 01:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(933473, 108991, 92, '<td valign="top">Stunning. The composition and color tone work perfect together !</td>', 'Stunning. The composition and color tone work perfect together !', '2004-10-01 01:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(933474, 103619, 11518, '<td valign="top">I''d really like to know how this was done legally.  Great idea and well executed!  (That is if this is not a photoshop job.)</td>', 'I''d really like to know how this was done legally.  Great idea and well executed!  (That is if this is not a photoshop job.)', '2004-10-01 01:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(933477, 102742, 70, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best uses of selective desaturation that I''ve seen in awhile. Great shot.</td>', 'This is one of the best uses of selective desaturation that I''ve seen in awhile. Great shot.', '2004-10-01 01:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(933478, 103788, 93, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely *stunning* photograph.  I''ve, personally, never seen a ship''s mainsale photographed from this angle, and it, with the clouds and sky, combine for one of the most striking images I''ve seen. The mix of open space and the confusion of the wires on either side of the sail is also pretty powerful.  The lighting is subtle.. kind of haunting.. as if it is hinting of an approaching storm.<br/> <br/>Great work.</td>', 'This is an absolutely *stunning* photograph.  I''ve, personally, never seen a ship''s mainsale photographed from this angle, and it, with the clouds and sky, combine for one of the most striking images I''ve seen. The mix of open space and the confusion of the wires on either side of the sail is also pretty powerful.  The lighting is subtle.. kind of haunting.. as if it is hinting of an approaching storm. Great work.', '2004-10-01 01:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(933479, 109019, 92, '<td valign="top">OMG @ That look ! The color, clarity, lighting and composition are perfect !</td>', 'OMG @ That look ! The color, clarity, lighting and composition are perfect !', '2004-10-01 01:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(933482, 107969, 92, '<td valign="top">Major cool.. This look like a jelly fish ! Very nice !</td>', 'Major cool.. This look like a jelly fish ! Very nice !', '2004-10-01 01:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(933484, 107995, 11518, '<td valign="top">LMAOO, very well done. Perfect lighting.  This works very well.</td>', 'LMAOO, very well done. Perfect lighting.  This works very well.', '2004-10-01 01:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(933486, 102742, 92, '<td valign="top">I love this. Very cool selective coloring. Perfect composition and lighting.</td>', 'I love this. Very cool selective coloring. Perfect composition and lighting.', '2004-10-01 01:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(933487, 108986, 20210, '<td valign="top">the DOF is slightly too shallow to keep the other eye in focus, which makes this feel oddly weighted to me.  A great capture on the texture of the wet feathers, and a good overall composition.</td>', 'the DOF is slightly too shallow to keep the other eye in focus, which makes this feel oddly weighted to me.  A great capture on the texture of the wet feathers, and a good overall composition.', '2004-10-01 01:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(933488, 108832, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a feast for the eyes and its treatment most pleasing to create a wonderful internal mood. I will currently place it at 6 and I will return for final comments and evaluation.</td>', 'This is a feast for the eyes and its treatment most pleasing to create a wonderful internal mood. I will currently place it at 6 and I will return for final comments and evaluation.', '2004-10-01 01:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
