(933497, 108995, 20210, '<td valign="top">hrmm...the title is killing me, since he''s playing a bass, not a guitar...bass guitar, I suppose you could argue.  I really like the grain, but there''s not quite enough dynamic range to really work for me.</td>', 'hrmm...the title is killing me, since he''s playing a bass, not a guitar...bass guitar, I suppose you could argue.  I really like the grain, but there''s not quite enough dynamic range to really work for me.', '2004-10-01 01:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
