(933501, 102742, 3280, '<td valign="top">Wonderful and one of my favorties of the challenge.  Composition is dead on.  I love the message and the way the little girls legs are set up.  The DeSat is great for this shot as well.  Even the purple handprint on the pants shows your great attention to detail.  Congratulations on  a fantastic photo!</td>', 'Wonderful and one of my favorties of the challenge.  Composition is dead on.  I love the message and the way the little girls legs are set up.  The DeSat is great for this shot as well.  Even the purple handprint on the pants shows your great attention to detail.  Congratulations on  a fantastic photo!', '2004-10-01 01:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(933503, 105966, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition... the placement of the balloons, the subtle tones of sunset behind them, and the glow create an elegant and soothing mood.  Great work!!!  :o)</td>', 'Beautiful composition... the placement of the balloons, the subtle tones of sunset behind them, and the glow create an elegant and soothing mood.  Great work!!!  :o)', '2004-10-01 01:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(933505, 108924, 93, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a closer crop would have helped a little.  I don''t like that I can see where the land around the hill levels out. (personal taste, I admit), and the silhouette of the figure would probably be stronger if it were larger.</td>', 'Perhaps a closer crop would have helped a little.  I don''t like that I can see where the land around the hill levels out. (personal taste, I admit), and the silhouette of the figure would probably be stronger if it were larger.', '2004-10-01 01:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(933506, 104027, 11518, '<td valign="top">Love that place in Melbourne, too bad it''s alomst deserted these days.</td>', 'Love that place in Melbourne, too bad it''s alomst deserted these days.', '2004-10-01 01:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(933508, 107365, 3280, '<td valign="top">Super Shot!  Focus and composition are excellent as is the lighting.  I wish that the nostrils were just a bit more in focus.  The green reflection works well too.</td>', 'Super Shot!  Focus and composition are excellent as is the lighting.  I wish that the nostrils were just a bit more in focus.  The green reflection works well too.', '2004-10-01 01:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(933509, 107397, 21245, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an incredible location!  This is a brilliant shot.  Well done!</td>', 'Wow, what an incredible location!  This is a brilliant shot.  Well done!', '2004-10-01 01:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(933511, 107397, 11518, '<td valign="top">Wow, what else can I say but I''ll be there next summer and hopefully get pictures as good as this one! 10</td>', 'Wow, what else can I say but I''ll be there next summer and hopefully get pictures as good as this one! 10', '2004-10-01 01:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(933514, 108454, 21245, '<td valign="top">I love these kind of rock formations.  I grew up in Utah were they were abundant, now I live in VA where they are non existant.  I took them for granted I''m afraid.  The sky is brilliantly blue, must have been a fantastic day.  Lovely shot.</td>', 'I love these kind of rock formations.  I grew up in Utah were they were abundant, now I live in VA where they are non existant.  I took them for granted I''m afraid.  The sky is brilliantly blue, must have been a fantastic day.  Lovely shot.', '2004-10-01 01:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(933515, 103788, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is such a perfect image in so many respects... the angle, the lighting, the tones, the framing, the choice of subject matter... all I can keep saying is WOW.  :o)</td>', 'This is such a perfect image in so many respects... the angle, the lighting, the tones, the framing, the choice of subject matter... all I can keep saying is WOW.  :o)', '2004-10-01 01:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(933517, 108843, 16230, '<td valign="top">Would this be the work of young Master Robinson? :)<br/> <br/>It''s a beautiful photo. To my eye, it looks like an early evening low tide at Cannon Beach. I think the colors are beautiful, but I wouldn''t be surprised to see comments like, "Too much blue."<br/> <br/>Congratulations on a great photo. One of my top picks so far.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Would this be the work of young Master Robinson? :) It''s a beautiful photo. To my eye, it looks like an early evening low tide at Cannon Beach. I think the colors are beautiful, but I wouldn''t be surprised to see comments like, "Too much blue." Congratulations on a great photo. One of my top picks so far. ', '2004-10-01 01:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(933518, 106953, 6870, '<td valign="top">Perfect tones, engaging expression, natural pose. This is just marvelous. The glossy lips get a little too  much attention, perhaps, but this is a marvelous shot. 10</td>', 'Perfect tones, engaging expression, natural pose. This is just marvelous. The glossy lips get a little too  much attention, perhaps, but this is a marvelous shot. 10', '2004-10-01 01:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
