(933541, 106488, 714, '<td valign="top">This rocks!  I have always wanted to do this, but always seem to forget to buy the filter.  I love the snow feel to it.  Great shot and good luck!</td>', 'This rocks!  I have always wanted to do this, but always seem to forget to buy the filter.  I love the snow feel to it.  Great shot and good luck!', '2004-10-01 01:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(933542, 105647, 21245, '<td valign="top">What a cool building.  I love the skyline with that blue.  Great level for the horizon.</td>', 'What a cool building.  I love the skyline with that blue.  Great level for the horizon.', '2004-10-01 01:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(933543, 107387, 772, '<td valign="top">This is incredible... simply beautiful and candid...  I''m a sucker for great street photography because its a new area i''m starting to explore myself.  I''m just unfortunatley bound by an uninteresting hometown to do it effectively.  The culture here is a bit bland.  I think I''m gonna need to travel a little more to capture images that stir me like this one does.  <br/> <br/>I can actually hear the haunting sound of this instrument in my head as I look at this photo.  I don''t know what it''s called but I know what it sounds like.  <br/> <br/>If I had to guess at the owner of this photo, I would say that Mr. Marlin has been spending just the right amount of time wandering the streets with his camera.  If its not Peter''s photo, whoever owns it deserves a ribbon for some excellent work.  <br/> <br/>+FAVORITE<br/> <br/>= Best of show, in my humble opinion.....<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is incredible... simply beautiful and candid...  I''m a sucker for great street photography because its a new area i''m starting to explore myself.  I''m just unfortunatley bound by an uninteresting hometown to do it effectively.  The culture here is a bit bland.  I think I''m gonna need to travel a little more to capture images that stir me like this one does.   I can actually hear the haunting sound of this instrument in my head as I look at this photo.  I don''t know what it''s called but I know what it sounds like.   If I had to guess at the owner of this photo, I would say that Mr. Marlin has been spending just the right amount of time wandering the streets with his camera.  If its not Peter''s photo, whoever owns it deserves a ribbon for some excellent work.   +FAVORITE = Best of show, in my humble opinion..... ', '2004-10-01 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(933544, 106707, 21245, '<td valign="top">Wow, just wow.  I feel like I''m on a horse riding throught Ireland and I''ve just come upon this scene.  Brilliant.</td>', 'Wow, just wow.  I feel like I''m on a horse riding throught Ireland and I''ve just come upon this scene.  Brilliant.', '2004-10-01 01:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
