(933546, 103105, 772, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture... the warmth of the light and the ''love'' in this photo is quite radiant.  There is also a small element of mystery here that is quite intriguing... something to frame left has their attention :)  It could be some goon with a camera :D  <br/> <br/>I love the way monkeys resemble humans... or possibly the other way around... They are simply intriguing because of this... excellent work :) = 10</td>', 'Beautiful capture... the warmth of the light and the ''love'' in this photo is quite radiant.  There is also a small element of mystery here that is quite intriguing... something to frame left has their attention :)  It could be some goon with a camera :D   I love the way monkeys resemble humans... or possibly the other way around... They are simply intriguing because of this... excellent work :) = 10', '2004-10-01 01:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
