(933558, 109032, 93, '<td valign="top">What a unique and hilarious idea!  I can''t wait to find out how you pulled it off.. I can see how the shadow image seems to be in front of the boxer.. was it cut out of some kind of material? Is it a double-exposure?  However you did it, bloody brilliant.</td>', 'What a unique and hilarious idea!  I can''t wait to find out how you pulled it off.. I can see how the shadow image seems to be in front of the boxer.. was it cut out of some kind of material? Is it a double-exposure?  However you did it, bloody brilliant.', '2004-10-01 01:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(933559, 107902, 6870, '<td valign="top">This has the feel of a painted photo, just like the ones that came from this era. So nicely captured, clear, vivid and effective image. It may be just a bit busy, but that could also be a plus. 8</td>', 'This has the feel of a painted photo, just like the ones that came from this era. So nicely captured, clear, vivid and effective image. It may be just a bit busy, but that could also be a plus. 8', '2004-10-01 01:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
