(933573, 107609, 5112, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail and toning.  Excellent composition.  I like how the light falls on his left eye, and it looks transparent, while the other eye is in the dark.  There are many good shots in this challenge, but this is one of my favourites (for what it''s worth).</td>', 'Lovely detail and toning.  Excellent composition.  I like how the light falls on his left eye, and it looks transparent, while the other eye is in the dark.  There are many good shots in this challenge, but this is one of my favourites (for what it''s worth).', '2004-10-01 01:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
