(933803, 107609, 4008, '<td valign="top">Wow, really love this one. Like one of the classical masters. The hard shadow fits perfectly with the pose, with the diagonal created by the arm. Great empty space as well. I don''t like the title, it explains too much what is going on, while the image is open for so many interpretations. I think you should have left the viewer wonder what he is looking at or what he is thinking about.</td>', 'Wow, really love this one. Like one of the classical masters. The hard shadow fits perfectly with the pose, with the diagonal created by the arm. Great empty space as well. I don''t like the title, it explains too much what is going on, while the image is open for so many interpretations. I think you should have left the viewer wonder what he is looking at or what he is thinking about.', '2004-10-01 03:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(933804, 107609, 20779, '<td valign="top">Pure classic. Superb capture.</td>', 'Pure classic. Superb capture.', '2004-10-01 03:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
