(933809, 108843, 21072, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking scene.  The colours are fabulous, and I love the texture of the sand.</td>', 'Breathtaking scene.  The colours are fabulous, and I love the texture of the sand.', '2004-10-01 03:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(933810, 108897, 4008, '<td valign="top">What a lovely portrait, great soft atmosphere and a very good choice of props and colors. And a beautiful model. Nice soft light distribution on the background as well and a border which really adds to the image. Fantastic. I personally love tight crops and wonder whether a slightly closer crop on the right side would have made it even stronger, I would have tried to crop out up to the black shirt, no skin showing.</td>', 'What a lovely portrait, great soft atmosphere and a very good choice of props and colors. And a beautiful model. Nice soft light distribution on the background as well and a border which really adds to the image. Fantastic. I personally love tight crops and wonder whether a slightly closer crop on the right side would have made it even stronger, I would have tried to crop out up to the black shirt, no skin showing.', '2004-10-01 03:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
