(933842, 107202, 19332, '<td valign="top">This picture is sexy, very sexy, but since this is an artistic contest, I would like it to have made me learn or imagine something about the girl, I mean something other than "Oh my GOD!". Maybe seeing the expresion of her face I would have felt suprsised, or amused, or intrigued or anything - you would have opened more possibilities for my interpretation of her and her sourroundings. Anyway, you lose the 10 for the above reasons and you also lose the 9 because you were there and I wasn''t =&gt; 8<br/> <br/>Did I mention the girl is sexy?</td>', 'This picture is sexy, very sexy, but since this is an artistic contest, I would like it to have made me learn or imagine something about the girl, I mean something other than "Oh my GOD!". Maybe seeing the expresion of her face I would have felt suprsised, or amused, or intrigued or anything - you would have opened more possibilities for my interpretation of her and her sourroundings. Anyway, you lose the 10 for the above reasons and you also lose the 9 because you were there and I wasn''t => 8 Did I mention the girl is sexy?', '2004-10-01 04:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
