(933967, 107969, 16266, '<td valign="top">this is a really cool shot, with very interesting lighting, and large wow factor, as well as a how did they do it factor.  The blur above the kiwi is a bit distracting though... looks like a poorly cloned out something holding up the kiwi. I know how hard it is to cone out things right against things.. and it might be just the blurry background that makes it look like this.  otherwise, great shot.</td>', 'this is a really cool shot, with very interesting lighting, and large wow factor, as well as a how did they do it factor.  The blur above the kiwi is a bit distracting though... looks like a poorly cloned out something holding up the kiwi. I know how hard it is to cone out things right against things.. and it might be just the blurry background that makes it look like this.  otherwise, great shot.', '2004-10-01 07:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(933974, 109032, 16266, '<td valign="top">interesting concept, and i like that the boxers are fighting against eachother.  I didn''t catch it at the first second though. It seems a little low contrast or all too middle gray for my liking.</td>', 'interesting concept, and i like that the boxers are fighting against eachother.  I didn''t catch it at the first second though. It seems a little low contrast or all too middle gray for my liking.', '2004-10-01 07:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(933978, 107586, 24407, '<td valign="top">Lost for words, the image speaks for itself, perfect!<br/></td>', 'Lost for words, the image speaks for itself, perfect!', '2004-10-01 07:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(933981, 103105, 17233, '<td valign="top">What an amazing image! I love the lighting (although I bet some say too dark) and such a natural, unstartled expression on both mother and baby. Well done (10)</td>', 'What an amazing image! I love the lighting (although I bet some say too dark) and such a natural, unstartled expression on both mother and baby. Well done (10)', '2004-10-01 07:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(933985, 107995, 17233, '<td valign="top">Very novel and well executed. Good lighting with no harsh reflections of the mag. Well done (8)</td>', 'Very novel and well executed. Good lighting with no harsh reflections of the mag. Well done (8)', '2004-10-01 07:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(933987, 102742, 3306, '<td valign="top">There are a few very special pictures in this challenge. This is one of them.</td>', 'There are a few very special pictures in this challenge. This is one of them.', '2004-10-01 07:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(933989, 107609, 3306, '<td valign="top">A fantastic portrait filled with character. Everything is perfect here. Great job.</td>', 'A fantastic portrait filled with character. Everything is perfect here. Great job.', '2004-10-01 07:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(933991, 108832, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a spectacular sunset, but in my opinion it needs some kind of object in the foreground, just to add something else to the photo. At the moment it looks a bit plain to me. 6</td>', 'This is a spectacular sunset, but in my opinion it needs some kind of object in the foreground, just to add something else to the photo. At the moment it looks a bit plain to me. 6', '2004-10-01 07:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(933992, 108940, 17233, '<td valign="top">Beautiful backlighting that brings out the vibrance of the colours. Good contrast and DOF too. (8)</td>', 'Beautiful backlighting that brings out the vibrance of the colours. Good contrast and DOF too. (8)', '2004-10-01 07:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(933993, 107586, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent emotive shot. The toning and contrast are perfect. 10</td>', 'This is an excellent emotive shot. The toning and contrast are perfect. 10', '2004-10-01 07:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(933995, 106171, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but it seems slightly flat. You could try bumping up the contrast a little or dodge/burn it. Also, I think it would be much better in B&amp;W or duotone, because the green in the background doesn''t suit the type of bird this is. 6</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but it seems slightly flat. You could try bumping up the contrast a little or dodge/burn it. Also, I think it would be much better in B&W or duotone, because the green in the background doesn''t suit the type of bird this is. 6', '2004-10-01 07:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(933998, 107902, 17233, '<td valign="top">I love the composition - busy but still interesting. Interesting use of selective desaturation too. Well done (8)</td>', 'I love the composition - busy but still interesting. Interesting use of selective desaturation too. Well done (8)', '2004-10-01 07:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(933999, 103619, 3306, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully unique and creative. Your submission stands out atop the Masters. If you are not Kiwiness you are his clone and that is quite a complement!</td>', 'Wonderfully unique and creative. Your submission stands out atop the Masters. If you are not Kiwiness you are his clone and that is quite a complement!', '2004-10-01 07:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(934000, 104027, 17233, '<td valign="top">Fantastic perspective, sharp and great DOF (9)</td>', 'Fantastic perspective, sharp and great DOF (9)', '2004-10-01 07:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(934001, 106171, 3306, '<td valign="top">Wildlife photography is defined by this picture. It couldn''t have been done any better from the clarity of the bird to the complementary backround. This is of Setzler proportions!</td>', 'Wildlife photography is defined by this picture. It couldn''t have been done any better from the clarity of the bird to the complementary backround. This is of Setzler proportions!', '2004-10-01 07:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(934002, 108872, 17233, '<td valign="top">Simple composition, vivid colour and sharp as a pin. I love it (10)</td>', 'Simple composition, vivid colour and sharp as a pin. I love it (10)', '2004-10-01 07:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(934003, 103219, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but I think it is let down in post-processing. I really feel it should have some soft focus applied to it, not only to make it more dreamy, but to increase the tonal contrast in the skin to stop it looking so flat. Also, a warmer sepia might be nicer than B&amp;W. 5</td>', 'I like this shot but I think it is let down in post-processing. I really feel it should have some soft focus applied to it, not only to make it more dreamy, but to increase the tonal contrast in the skin to stop it looking so flat. Also, a warmer sepia might be nicer than B&W. 5', '2004-10-01 07:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(934004, 108269, 15832, '<td valign="top">Why do i have a icelandic feeling about this one?<br/>Great shot.</td>', 'Why do i have a icelandic feeling about this one?Great shot.', '2004-10-01 07:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(934005, 107397, 15832, '<td valign="top">Wow... I love photos like that!!!<br/>8</td>', 'Wow... I love photos like that!!!8', '2004-10-01 07:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(934006, 108986, 2780, '<td valign="top">Those are great eyes, but really could do with a catch light to give them some emotion. As you probably couldn''t control natural ones, it is fine to add small ones in post processing. I think you should also burn around the edges to get some proper blacks into the feathers rather than greys. 6</td>', 'Those are great eyes, but really could do with a catch light to give them some emotion. As you probably couldn''t control natural ones, it is fine to add small ones in post processing. I think you should also burn around the edges to get some proper blacks into the feathers rather than greys. 6', '2004-10-01 07:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(934007, 109032, 17233, '<td valign="top">Great concept and good side lighting. I think that the layers should have been the other way around so that the shadow is behind the subject..</td>', 'Great concept and good side lighting. I think that the layers should have been the other way around so that the shadow is behind the subject..', '2004-10-01 07:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(934009, 103105, 2780, '<td valign="top">This photo is absolutely perfect. I think the grey border spoils it and should be black or not there at all, but I can''t take any marks off for that. If this was my shot I would be tempted to just make it B&amp;W straight away but I''m so glad you left it in colour as it works really well after looking at it for a while. 10</td>', 'This photo is absolutely perfect. I think the grey border spoils it and should be black or not there at all, but I can''t take any marks off for that. If this was my shot I would be tempted to just make it B&W straight away but I''m so glad you left it in colour as it works really well after looking at it for a while. 10', '2004-10-01 07:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(934010, 104027, 2780, '<td valign="top">This photo is too busy for my taste. I think there is too much going on and no real focal point. I do think it would make a good abstract though, with some funky duotone colouring and a closer crop. 4</td>', 'This photo is too busy for my taste. I think there is too much going on and no real focal point. I do think it would make a good abstract though, with some funky duotone colouring and a closer crop. 4', '2004-10-01 07:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(934011, 108537, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot and definately have the film noir feel to it. The way she is looking off screen is very effective, and the soft focus, although slightly excessive in my opinion, works really well. I think the whites of the eyes should be slightly lightened too. 8</td>', 'This is a great shot and definately have the film noir feel to it. The way she is looking off screen is very effective, and the soft focus, although slightly excessive in my opinion, works really well. I think the whites of the eyes should be slightly lightened too. 8', '2004-10-01 07:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(934012, 106931, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo of a nice looking location, but there is too much empty space in my opinion. The bottom and the right of the shot don''t really add anything. I would have taken a square crop from the top-left, as thats where it''s all happening, with the clouds, mountains, and grass converging. That would have had much more impact I think. 6</td>', 'This is a very nice photo of a nice looking location, but there is too much empty space in my opinion. The bottom and the right of the shot don''t really add anything. I would have taken a square crop from the top-left, as thats where it''s all happening, with the clouds, mountains, and grass converging. That would have had much more impact I think. 6', '2004-10-01 07:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(934015, 108843, 18191, '<td valign="top">Hi Zoom...this is my favourite photograph of Canon Beach thus far. The textures in the sand are phenomenal and the balance is extraordinary. The reflection of Haystack Rock is what makes this for me. The moon is also a great addition to this piece. If the moon could be sharpened up a litle bit and maybe burnt in just a singe...it would be all too perfect for me. Although the skies look burnt in a  little as it is, try experimenting with some more burning, maybe closer to Haystack Rock with the smaller clouds farther away. Good luck on a great image. The first 10 in the challenge from me.<br/>Lee</td>', 'Hi Zoom...this is my favourite photograph of Canon Beach thus far. The textures in the sand are phenomenal and the balance is extraordinary. The reflection of Haystack Rock is what makes this for me. The moon is also a great addition to this piece. If the moon could be sharpened up a litle bit and maybe burnt in just a singe...it would be all too perfect for me. Although the skies look burnt in a  little as it is, try experimenting with some more burning, maybe closer to Haystack Rock with the smaller clouds farther away. Good luck on a great image. The first 10 in the challenge from me.Lee', '2004-10-01 07:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(934016, 108767, 2780, '<td valign="top">This photo just begs for a contrast boost in post-processing in my opinion. It''s a great shot but I feel it just needs some proper blacks in there, not the dark greys which are there currently. I think some of the sky should be cropped out too, probably all of the blue bit down to just above the dark cloud. 6</td>', 'This photo just begs for a contrast boost in post-processing in my opinion. It''s a great shot but I feel it just needs some proper blacks in there, not the dark greys which are there currently. I think some of the sky should be cropped out too, probably all of the blue bit down to just above the dark cloud. 6', '2004-10-01 07:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(934017, 106707, 18191, '<td valign="top">In assumpstion this is Mr. Rose, you captured a wonderful array of late afternoon colors on this piece. I love the range in the sky; from blue to red. And where the red is, it meets very nicely with its complementing green. The yellow of the "castle" brings my attention to it with its strength and interest. Great image. My only criticism is that the castle looks just a little bit oversharpened. Otherwise, a great shot.</td>', 'In assumpstion this is Mr. Rose, you captured a wonderful array of late afternoon colors on this piece. I love the range in the sky; from blue to red. And where the red is, it meets very nicely with its complementing green. The yellow of the "castle" brings my attention to it with its strength and interest. Great image. My only criticism is that the castle looks just a little bit oversharpened. Otherwise, a great shot.', '2004-10-01 07:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(934018, 108454, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think this should would be much better in B&amp;W or sepia with a closer crop on the rocks to really show off the detail. As it is, the colours aren''t really that interesting and nor is teh composition. A closer crop and B&amp;W would really add some interest and ''feel'' to the photo. 5</td>', 'I think this should would be much better in B&W or sepia with a closer crop on the rocks to really show off the detail. As it is, the colours aren''t really that interesting and nor is teh composition. A closer crop and B&W would really add some interest and ''feel'' to the photo. 5', '2004-10-01 07:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(934020, 106953, 15832, '<td valign="top">girlgirl?<br/>Hope you get my spelling ;)<br/>Who ever it was.... Professional. The colors and the lights, her hair lock in front of the eyes is perfeckt (creates this mysterious atmosphere), Beutyful girl,her lips with that reflektion, The eyes (in a way sad but with some hope, Perfect cropping. And i could go on and on,  You got my 10 and fav</td>', 'girlgirl?Hope you get my spelling ;)Who ever it was.... Professional. The colors and the lights, her hair lock in front of the eyes is perfeckt (creates this mysterious atmosphere), Beutyful girl,her lips with that reflektion, The eyes (in a way sad but with some hope, Perfect cropping. And i could go on and on,  You got my 10 and fav', '2004-10-01 07:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(934022, 107586, 15832, '<td valign="top">9.   No words<br/></td>', '9.   No words', '2004-10-01 08:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(934024, 108872, 12611, '<td valign="top">This would be a ten for me but there is a synthetic feel; there is also a weird spacing to the decorations around the sun.  I absolutely love the orange color, the white sill and the blue of the window. I think that the window and negative space would be enough... nice entry anyway.</td>', 'This would be a ten for me but there is a synthetic feel; there is also a weird spacing to the decorations around the sun.  I absolutely love the orange color, the white sill and the blue of the window. I think that the window and negative space would be enough... nice entry anyway.', '2004-10-01 08:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(934027, 105190, 17233, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - great use of slow shutter and well composed. Well done (10)</td>', 'Beautiful - great use of slow shutter and well composed. Well done (10)', '2004-10-01 08:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(934029, 107902, 15832, '<td valign="top">I love the colours in this one.  It most have bin alot of work for you ;)<br/>Nice eye you got for things. 8</td>', 'I love the colours in this one.  It most have bin alot of work for you ;)Nice eye you got for things. 8', '2004-10-01 08:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(934030, 107901, 15832, '<td valign="top">That´s a really cool shot!!<br/>If only the DOF would be deeper and the tail of the fly would be sharper<br/>Great colors..</td>', 'That´s a really cool shot!!If only the DOF would be deeper and the tail of the fly would be sharperGreat colors..', '2004-10-01 08:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(934031, 104030, 12611, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition. quite dramatic placement of the falls. I can''t deduct points, but I will say that the green does not play perfectly against the shale; the elements of orange in th emiddle are detailed and placed well to help the overall "color mood of the shot."</td>', 'beautiful composition. quite dramatic placement of the falls. I can''t deduct points, but I will say that the green does not play perfectly against the shale; the elements of orange in th emiddle are detailed and placed well to help the overall "color mood of the shot."', '2004-10-01 08:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(934033, 106707, 16385, '<td valign="top">Wow<br/>great colours and composytion <br/>more than 10<br/>:)</td>', 'Wowgreat colours and composytion more than 10:)', '2004-10-01 08:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(934040, 107202, 12611, '<td valign="top">Not only for the fact that this shot perfectly sums up lust attraction and playful sexuality. But I love the complex nature of the exquisite sharpness on the behind, the out of focus maple furniture and glassware, and the facial expression and head title, hair placement. This is a beautiful work of lust and playful sexuality.</td>', 'Not only for the fact that this shot perfectly sums up lust attraction and playful sexuality. But I love the complex nature of the exquisite sharpness on the behind, the out of focus maple furniture and glassware, and the facial expression and head title, hair placement. This is a beautiful work of lust and playful sexuality.', '2004-10-01 08:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(934047, 108122, 12611, '<td valign="top">From someone who has taken a ton of my own dirty faced children''s shots, I must say this is a good one. For some reason, I like extreme face portraits of children to be in color, especially when the mood is cheerful or surprised, and I assume the kid has huge blue eyes. What I will say is that the shot has fantastic focus, tone and is nicely darkened to a perffefct contrast imo.</td>', 'From someone who has taken a ton of my own dirty faced children''s shots, I must say this is a good one. For some reason, I like extreme face portraits of children to be in color, especially when the mood is cheerful or surprised, and I assume the kid has huge blue eyes. What I will say is that the shot has fantastic focus, tone and is nicely darkened to a perffefct contrast imo.', '2004-10-01 08:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(934050, 106707, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great job, what a dramatic and beautiful atmosphere. I assume the colors are not fully like they were in real life, but I think they are not too artifical to hurt the image. It all fits well together, I especially like the low light across the grass and against the tower.</td>', 'Great job, what a dramatic and beautiful atmosphere. I assume the colors are not fully like they were in real life, but I think they are not too artifical to hurt the image. It all fits well together, I especially like the low light across the grass and against the tower.', '2004-10-01 08:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(934051, 109031, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but I think the water droplets look a little be strange just stopped in mid air. Since your title is ''through time'' and it''s a smooth statue, I think a long exposure creating water streams would look really good with the subject matter. At the moment there is nothing that really interests me in the photo. 5</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but I think the water droplets look a little be strange just stopped in mid air. Since your title is ''through time'' and it''s a smooth statue, I think a long exposure creating water streams would look really good with the subject matter. At the moment there is nothing that really interests me in the photo. 5', '2004-10-01 08:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(934052, 107876, 2780, '<td valign="top">Yum! That looks delicious. I think to finish this shot off nicely you sould dodge around the edges to make the background white rather than grey. Technically good, but nothing that makes the shot stand out amongst the crowd. 6</td>', 'Yum! That looks delicious. I think to finish this shot off nicely you sould dodge around the edges to make the background white rather than grey. Technically good, but nothing that makes the shot stand out amongst the crowd. 6', '2004-10-01 08:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(934053, 105647, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think there is too much black in the photo. The blue of the sky is really nice, and the college looks very impressive, but it''s just a bit too far away to appreciate fully. I would have cropped in tighter on that. 6</td>', 'I think there is too much black in the photo. The blue of the sky is really nice, and the college looks very impressive, but it''s just a bit too far away to appreciate fully. I would have cropped in tighter on that. 6', '2004-10-01 08:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(934054, 103788, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great, fantastic atmosphere, great choice of toning of the image.  Such a sailing ship can really give a messy image with all the ropes going across, but I think you have managed to use that to your advantage here. The diagonals created by the sails, the line of the mast, the ropes and then on top of it the lines in the sky all add to a well composed image. Congrats.</td>', 'Great, fantastic atmosphere, great choice of toning of the image.  Such a sailing ship can really give a messy image with all the ropes going across, but I think you have managed to use that to your advantage here. The diagonals created by the sails, the line of the mast, the ropes and then on top of it the lines in the sky all add to a well composed image. Congrats.', '2004-10-01 08:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(934055, 109013, 2780, '<td valign="top">The duotone works well here in my opinion, and the exposure is spot on. The only thing that bothers me is the soft focus effect. I''m not even sure if there is one applied, but some areas, specifically the trees around the man''s hat, kinda blend in to other objects. 6</td>', 'The duotone works well here in my opinion, and the exposure is spot on. The only thing that bothers me is the soft focus effect. I''m not even sure if there is one applied, but some areas, specifically the trees around the man''s hat, kinda blend in to other objects. 6', '2004-10-01 08:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(934056, 108986, 12611, '<td valign="top">This would have been a great wildlife challenge shot. This has the great quality of a seamless look of film, with lovely brown and white tones.The yellow eye is especially clear. I don''t think this is a winner, especially in the master''s challenge, although it is quite good an demonstrates your talent for freezing a natural predator, and displaying a nice animal portrait. If you care to hear it, what would put this over the top would be a slightly better crop adn the  conveyance of some human quality through the portrait of this bird;. Right now it is cold and reptilian,and predictably predatorial.</td>', 'This would have been a great wildlife challenge shot. This has the great quality of a seamless look of film, with lovely brown and white tones.The yellow eye is especially clear. I don''t think this is a winner, especially in the master''s challenge, although it is quite good an demonstrates your talent for freezing a natural predator, and displaying a nice animal portrait. If you care to hear it, what would put this over the top would be a slightly better crop adn the  conveyance of some human quality through the portrait of this bird;. Right now it is cold and reptilian,and predictably predatorial.', '2004-10-01 08:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(934057, 109019, 18799, '<td valign="top">This is such a great photo.  I just wish she was looking at the bubble in frame.</td>', 'This is such a great photo.  I just wish she was looking at the bubble in frame.', '2004-10-01 08:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(934058, 108210, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think this shot is a bit too oversharpened. I notice it most between the trees and sky. I think this would look nice in black and white, as the colours look a bit muted and don''t really add much to the shot. A nice nostalgic B&amp;W would look a lot better in my opinion :) 6.</td>', 'I think this shot is a bit too oversharpened. I notice it most between the trees and sky. I think this would look nice in black and white, as the colours look a bit muted and don''t really add much to the shot. A nice nostalgic B&W would look a lot better in my opinion :) 6.', '2004-10-01 08:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(934059, 108984, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and good vibrant colours. 7</td>', 'Very nice lighting and good vibrant colours. 7', '2004-10-01 08:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(934060, 105190, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. The composition, colour, exposure, all spot on. 10</td>', 'This is excellent. The composition, colour, exposure, all spot on. 10', '2004-10-01 08:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(934061, 106707, 2780, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. The mixture of red orange and blue in the sky is great and very powerful. The lighting on the castle and the grass is fantastic too. 10</td>', 'I love this shot. The mixture of red orange and blue in the sky is great and very powerful. The lighting on the castle and the grass is fantastic too. 10', '2004-10-01 08:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(934063, 102742, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is technical and emotive, the color the compositiona dn the message are all done quite well. Something about the overall feel is lacking for me. The letters are not easy for the eye to look at; the y make me feel uncomfortable and push my eye down to the girls feet. Its still damn good though! Is it too late to just draw a peace sign?</td>', 'This is technical and emotive, the color the compositiona dn the message are all done quite well. Something about the overall feel is lacking for me. The letters are not easy for the eye to look at; the y make me feel uncomfortable and push my eye down to the girls feet. Its still damn good though! Is it too late to just draw a peace sign?', '2004-10-01 08:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(934064, 107020, 2780, '<td valign="top">The white areas look a little over exposed to me. I think you should have underexposed this shot, and then dodged and burned it to a good exposure. This would make it more dramatic I think. Also, I would have liked to see some kind of subject in the right hand side of the frame as it looks a bit empty as it is. I know you can''t change the landscape, but it''s just what I feel :) 6.</td>', 'The white areas look a little over exposed to me. I think you should have underexposed this shot, and then dodged and burned it to a good exposure. This would make it more dramatic I think. Also, I would have liked to see some kind of subject in the right hand side of the frame as it looks a bit empty as it is. I know you can''t change the landscape, but it''s just what I feel :) 6.', '2004-10-01 08:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(934065, 109019, 19474, '<td valign="top">I love this shot..it has a timeless feel to it<br/>but your post editing has let you down, mostly around the elbows where you have selected the background and not feathered the the selection all the way to the arm and part of her hair looks blown out too<br/>this would be a 10 if you could fix these 2 things in a re-edit ~~ 9</td>', 'I love this shot..it has a timeless feel to itbut your post editing has let you down, mostly around the elbows where you have selected the background and not feathered the the selection all the way to the arm and part of her hair looks blown out toothis would be a 10 if you could fix these 2 things in a re-edit ~~ 9', '2004-10-01 08:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(934066, 107300, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the blown out sky and good exposure on all the whites, its a very romantic photo. The one thing I don''t really like is the white fade around the edges. I think cropping with each edge half way through one of the pillars would be good too, letting us see more of the bride :) 7</td>', 'I like the blown out sky and good exposure on all the whites, its a very romantic photo. The one thing I don''t really like is the white fade around the edges. I think cropping with each edge half way through one of the pillars would be good too, letting us see more of the bride :) 7', '2004-10-01 08:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(934069, 107387, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like the toning and the contrast. The DoF is used to great effect too. We can see he is still on the street but it isn''t distracting us :) 9</td>', 'I really like the toning and the contrast. The DoF is used to great effect too. We can see he is still on the street but it isn''t distracting us :) 9', '2004-10-01 08:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(934070, 107995, 2780, '<td valign="top">Clever shot. You got the faces to line up really well! I think a more interesting chair and background would help the photo tho, it looks a bit snap-shotty at the moment, in my opinion. 5</td>', 'Clever shot. You got the faces to line up really well! I think a more interesting chair and background would help the photo tho, it looks a bit snap-shotty at the moment, in my opinion. 5', '2004-10-01 08:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(934071, 109031, 12611, '<td valign="top">This has fantastic depth with the water and the brown discoloration and the marble...The composition is stunning, the light is perfect, there is a busy quality about the top 1/6 of the photo but the contrast adn depth is excellent. All these qualities only speak to the fact that you are a master among masters. Does this lack the emotive  message that would send it soaring above the other photos? maybe. Even still its top notch.</td>', 'This has fantastic depth with the water and the brown discoloration and the marble...The composition is stunning, the light is perfect, there is a busy quality about the top 1/6 of the photo but the contrast adn depth is excellent. All these qualities only speak to the fact that you are a master among masters. Does this lack the emotive  message that would send it soaring above the other photos? maybe. Even still its top notch.', '2004-10-01 08:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(934072, 102742, 1368, '<td valign="top">This is a master piece! Simply amazing!!</td>', 'This is a master piece! Simply amazing!!', '2004-10-01 08:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(934073, 108991, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the toning, but it looks like you dodged the sky after toning it. I say that becayse there is a yellow halo around the white part of the sky, which doesnt match the toning in the rest of the photo. Normally I re-tone photos after I use dodge or burn to match up all the tones again. I might be wrong and you didn''t do that, and if so, call me an idiot and ignore this comment :P Its a good photo with a nice composition and a nice hazy dreamy feel. 7</td>', 'I like the toning, but it looks like you dodged the sky after toning it. I say that becayse there is a yellow halo around the white part of the sky, which doesnt match the toning in the rest of the photo. Normally I re-tone photos after I use dodge or burn to match up all the tones again. I might be wrong and you didn''t do that, and if so, call me an idiot and ignore this comment :P Its a good photo with a nice composition and a nice hazy dreamy feel. 7', '2004-10-01 08:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(934075, 107397, 2780, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see this a little sharper and with a little more contrast in the tonality, but it''s a really nice shot. 9</td>', 'I would have liked to see this a little sharper and with a little more contrast in the tonality, but it''s a really nice shot. 9', '2004-10-01 08:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(934076, 109014, 22125, '<td valign="top">Magnificent study of a magnificent bird, 10</td>', 'Magnificent study of a magnificent bird, 10', '2004-10-01 08:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(934077, 108569, 2780, '<td valign="top">I would be interested in seeing this in colour, but as it is, it has an interesting composition with leads the eye around effectively. 7</td>', 'I would be interested in seeing this in colour, but as it is, it has an interesting composition with leads the eye around effectively. 7', '2004-10-01 08:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(934080, 106953, 9821, '<td valign="top">very nicely done ... you''ve brought out the eyes nicely and her glossy lips stand out as well ... i don''t always like hair covering the eyes, but it works nicely here ... great job</td>', 'very nicely done ... you''ve brought out the eyes nicely and her glossy lips stand out as well ... i don''t always like hair covering the eyes, but it works nicely here ... great job', '2004-10-01 08:52:16.000000', NULL, 1);
