(934127, 108233, 9821, '<td valign="top">if you aren''t making money in sports photography, you should be ... 10</td>', 'if you aren''t making money in sports photography, you should be ... 10', '2004-10-01 09:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(934128, 107202, 9821, '<td valign="top">excellent job, doc. the set-up is simple ... the colors are pleasing ... the shiny rubber clothes grab light perfectly ... and your model is, ...well, ...very pretty<br/> <br/>10</td>', 'excellent job, doc. the set-up is simple ... the colors are pleasing ... the shiny rubber clothes grab light perfectly ... and your model is, ...well, ...very pretty 10', '2004-10-01 09:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(934130, 102742, 9821, '<td valign="top">best of the bunch ... which is saying a lot in this group ... i hope you make a print available to buy ... 10</td>', 'best of the bunch ... which is saying a lot in this group ... i hope you make a print available to buy ... 10', '2004-10-01 09:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(934131, 106707, 509, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot.  The lighting and colors are beautiful.  Don''t change a thing on it = )<br/>-10-</td>', 'Stunning shot.  The lighting and colors are beautiful.  Don''t change a thing on it = )-10-', '2004-10-01 09:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(934132, 103788, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice use of monotones.  I really like the composition - the diagonals and verticals created by the masts and the rigging almost appear to physically connect the subject to the right side of the frame.  Wish I could offer some suggestions, but I have none.  One of my favorites this round.</td>', 'Nice use of monotones.  I really like the composition - the diagonals and verticals created by the masts and the rigging almost appear to physically connect the subject to the right side of the frame.  Wish I could offer some suggestions, but I have none.  One of my favorites this round.', '2004-10-01 09:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(934133, 103189, 12827, '<td valign="top">feels like there is too much image on top</td>', 'feels like there is too much image on top', '2004-10-01 09:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(934134, 109013, 2490, '<td valign="top">The crop is just off center enough to be distracting, and the power lines steal a bit of my attention.  I''m not "anti-power lines", but here they seem to crush the element of "country" that it seems you were after.  The photo feels too static to be off center.</td>', 'The crop is just off center enough to be distracting, and the power lines steal a bit of my attention.  I''m not "anti-power lines", but here they seem to crush the element of "country" that it seems you were after.  The photo feels too static to be off center.', '2004-10-01 09:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(934135, 108173, 4871, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot - I love the detail in his face and the DOF is just perfect!</td>', 'Fantastic shot - I love the detail in his face and the DOF is just perfect!', '2004-10-01 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(934139, 107586, 4871, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of my favourites. There is a lot of emotion in this shot and the lighting is perfect. Very very well done!</td>', 'Definitely one of my favourites. There is a lot of emotion in this shot and the lighting is perfect. Very very well done!', '2004-10-01 09:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(934144, 104027, 4871, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been better if the balcony in the top left of the pic wasn''t there - it detracts from the rest of the pic.</td>', 'I think this could have been better if the balcony in the top left of the pic wasn''t there - it detracts from the rest of the pic.', '2004-10-01 09:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(934151, 107609, 4871, '<td valign="top">I LOVE these kind of photographs - I wish I could take more myself! I love the positioning of your subject and a great use of negative space. Great sepia toning! Congrats on a fantastic shot!!</td>', 'I LOVE these kind of photographs - I wish I could take more myself! I love the positioning of your subject and a great use of negative space. Great sepia toning! Congrats on a fantastic shot!!', '2004-10-01 09:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(934155, 108940, 9821, '<td valign="top">The flowers have nice color and the light is ok, but the composition is lacking a little. The flower on the left is cut off a bit, and there doesn''t seem to be a solid thing for my eye to look at (no clearly defined focal point).</td>', 'The flowers have nice color and the light is ok, but the composition is lacking a little. The flower on the left is cut off a bit, and there doesn''t seem to be a solid thing for my eye to look at (no clearly defined focal point).', '2004-10-01 09:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(934157, 108454, 9821, '<td valign="top">The location of the sun makes the photo look a little flat and textureless, but the colors are nice and it''s a good composition.</td>', 'The location of the sun makes the photo look a little flat and textureless, but the colors are nice and it''s a good composition.', '2004-10-01 09:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(934160, 107300, 9821, '<td valign="top">beautiful location and bride .... but the trees are a bit distracting as well as the white fade in border.</td>', 'beautiful location and bride .... but the trees are a bit distracting as well as the white fade in border.', '2004-10-01 09:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(934164, 105190, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful landscape shot... The motion blur of the water adnn the compsotion remind me of something right out of Tony Sweet''s "Fine Art Nature Photography" book.  The colors are absolutely lovely.  This image has nice ''layers'' and the rock in the foreground anchors the composition very nicely.  I don''t think this image could be improved at all... great work :) = 10</td>', 'This is a beautiful landscape shot... The motion blur of the water adnn the compsotion remind me of something right out of Tony Sweet''s "Fine Art Nature Photography" book.  The colors are absolutely lovely.  This image has nice ''layers'' and the rock in the foreground anchors the composition very nicely.  I don''t think this image could be improved at all... great work :) = 10', '2004-10-01 09:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(934165, 109013, 4871, '<td valign="top">I think this shot is great. One thing that I personally would have done differently would have been to position your subjects slightly left so that you could see the road leading off the horizion into converging lines. Those kind of pics really work for me!<br/></td>', 'I think this shot is great. One thing that I personally would have done differently would have been to position your subjects slightly left so that you could see the road leading off the horizion into converging lines. Those kind of pics really work for me!', '2004-10-01 09:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(934167, 108210, 9821, '<td valign="top">I think this one would have greatly benefitted from a lower sun location to make the scene a little warmer. Also, perhaps sliding to your right a bit would have showed just a little more of the lighthouse (which is very cool, by the way)</td>', 'I think this one would have greatly benefitted from a lower sun location to make the scene a little warmer. Also, perhaps sliding to your right a bit would have showed just a little more of the lighthouse (which is very cool, by the way)', '2004-10-01 09:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(934169, 107488, 24846, '<td valign="top">The displaced molding on top left corner and missing sas on far left drape are distracting. I like the symmetry. The b/w anf lighting definitely relays a haunting effect.</td>', 'The displaced molding on top left corner and missing sas on far left drape are distracting. I like the symmetry. The b/w anf lighting definitely relays a haunting effect.', '2004-10-01 09:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(934170, 107901, 9821, '<td valign="top">awesome shot, looks like the focus just missed a little (it''s eyes aren''t the sharpest part of the photo).</td>', 'awesome shot, looks like the focus just missed a little (it''s eyes aren''t the sharpest part of the photo).', '2004-10-01 09:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(934174, 107599, 9821, '<td valign="top">I think the human elements take away from this one a bit. Cloning out the buoys would have helped a lot i think. It''s nice, though.</td>', 'I think the human elements take away from this one a bit. Cloning out the buoys would have helped a lot i think. It''s nice, though.', '2004-10-01 10:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(934175, 103788, 9821, '<td valign="top">probably not much you could have done about it, but the composition seems a little smushed ... a wider angle (looks pretty wide already) would have given the subject a little more room. cool boat :)</td>', 'probably not much you could have done about it, but the composition seems a little smushed ... a wider angle (looks pretty wide already) would have given the subject a little more room. cool boat :)', '2004-10-01 10:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(934178, 107876, 9821, '<td valign="top">i think more dof would have been a little better - there would have been more in focus to look at ... the strawberry alone doesn''t hold my attention very long.</td>', 'i think more dof would have been a little better - there would have been more in focus to look at ... the strawberry alone doesn''t hold my attention very long.', '2004-10-01 10:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(934182, 104027, 9821, '<td valign="top">i like the curves, but my eye seems to be drawn down and out of the picture, rather than up towards the roof ... i can''t help but think lowering the camera by 1/3 of the frame would have improve it a little (but maybe not, i wasn''t there :)</td>', 'i like the curves, but my eye seems to be drawn down and out of the picture, rather than up towards the roof ... i can''t help but think lowering the camera by 1/3 of the frame would have improve it a little (but maybe not, i wasn''t there :)', '2004-10-01 10:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(934183, 107902, 10785, '<td valign="top">This shot has very good depth and rich tones... Sorry, no criticism here.</td>', 'This shot has very good depth and rich tones... Sorry, no criticism here.', '2004-10-01 10:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(934192, 103189, 18667, '<td valign="top">You must have caught this one pretty quick after opening the shutter.  Nice job!</td>', 'You must have caught this one pretty quick after opening the shutter.  Nice job!', '2004-10-01 10:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(934193, 103219, 8860, '<td valign="top">Yummy shoulder and neckline. This kind of shot leaves one sensing aroma and touch thanks to what you have left out of the frame. Your model looks gorgeous and I bet she smells nice too. : )<br/> <br/>A provocative shot. My only comment is that the lighting is a touch flat and could have been more atmospheric.</td>', 'Yummy shoulder and neckline. This kind of shot leaves one sensing aroma and touch thanks to what you have left out of the frame. Your model looks gorgeous and I bet she smells nice too. : ) A provocative shot. My only comment is that the lighting is a touch flat and could have been more atmospheric.', '2004-10-01 10:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(934194, 108275, 24128, '<td valign="top">I know how he feels - reminds me of what I see in the mirror on a monday morning :)</td>', 'I know how he feels - reminds me of what I see in the mirror on a monday morning :)', '2004-10-01 10:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(934197, 108537, 24128, '<td valign="top">Excellent - I just love everything about this pic, and as I love the whole old movie thing I have to give you a 10 :)</td>', 'Excellent - I just love everything about this pic, and as I love the whole old movie thing I have to give you a 10 :)', '2004-10-01 10:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(934198, 103105, 24128, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture - well done!</td>', 'Beautiful capture - well done!', '2004-10-01 10:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(934199, 106488, 8860, '<td valign="top">I think this is the first time I''ve seen a golf course in IR. I''m not a major fan of the effect personally unless it has real purpose which, because of the surreality of it, tends to be good for supernatural vibes or social statements, like pollution shots etc. I do quite like it when it''s mixed with full colour though.<br/> <br/>You''ve done it well and your shot is well composed.</td>', 'I think this is the first time I''ve seen a golf course in IR. I''m not a major fan of the effect personally unless it has real purpose which, because of the surreality of it, tends to be good for supernatural vibes or social statements, like pollution shots etc. I do quite like it when it''s mixed with full colour though. You''ve done it well and your shot is well composed.', '2004-10-01 10:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(934200, 107876, 24128, '<td valign="top">I can almost taste it! very sweet pic - well done :)</td>', 'I can almost taste it! very sweet pic - well done :)', '2004-10-01 10:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(934201, 102660, 24128, '<td valign="top">wonderful image, beautifully captured, the eyes are simply perfect - well done</td>', 'wonderful image, beautifully captured, the eyes are simply perfect - well done', '2004-10-01 10:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(934202, 104027, 24128, '<td valign="top">ok, I''m feeling dizzy now, nice pic :)</td>', 'ok, I''m feeling dizzy now, nice pic :)', '2004-10-01 10:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(934203, 109019, 24128, '<td valign="top">simply wonderful</td>', 'simply wonderful', '2004-10-01 10:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(934204, 107876, 8624, '<td valign="top">I have found doing food photography to be very difficult, so I am always impressed by people who can do it successfully. I think you have done this here with the pastry looking very appetizing. Your presentation, using not other distracting elemnts lets me focus on the subject with the berry being the predominant visual draw. The hot spot that forms a ring around the seed on the left side of the berry is one small distraction. I like the use of shallow DOF here. nicely done.</td>', 'I have found doing food photography to be very difficult, so I am always impressed by people who can do it successfully. I think you have done this here with the pastry looking very appetizing. Your presentation, using not other distracting elemnts lets me focus on the subject with the berry being the predominant visual draw. The hot spot that forms a ring around the seed on the left side of the berry is one small distraction. I like the use of shallow DOF here. nicely done.', '2004-10-01 10:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(934205, 109013, 24846, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia effect. The arrangement of the walkers is nice with the left boy on the grass row. I can almost here Dad speaking softly to his boys of nature and life.<br/>I''m probably wrong, but I think this may be the lens of L.B. ? Anyway, great study.</td>', 'I like the sepia effect. The arrangement of the walkers is nice with the left boy on the grass row. I can almost here Dad speaking softly to his boys of nature and life.I''m probably wrong, but I think this may be the lens of L.B. ? Anyway, great study.', '2004-10-01 10:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(934206, 109008, 14386, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and good composition. DOF is a bit shallow so the blur on the blue part stands out. A very good pic nonetheless.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and good composition. DOF is a bit shallow so the blur on the blue part stands out. A very good pic nonetheless.', '2004-10-01 10:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(934207, 107901, 14386, '<td valign="top">Is it a motion blur? Or a shallow DOF. Frankly, I don''t care because the effect is stunning. Good shot!</td>', 'Is it a motion blur? Or a shallow DOF. Frankly, I don''t care because the effect is stunning. Good shot!', '2004-10-01 10:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
