(934244, 108767, 26115, '<td valign="top">possibly look at cropping a rather large section of the blue sky to the top of the photo, IMHO i dont believe it adds much to this photo overall and its absence i believe could improve it as it would provide alot more focus to the mist and contrast to the sunrise/ sunset     a soft border could possibly also add alot to this photo however overall this is a fabulous photo and deffinitely deserves to be one of the top contenders<br/>~ hope the comment helps ~          Tatjana</td>', 'possibly look at cropping a rather large section of the blue sky to the top of the photo, IMHO i dont believe it adds much to this photo overall and its absence i believe could improve it as it would provide alot more focus to the mist and contrast to the sunrise/ sunset     a soft border could possibly also add alot to this photo however overall this is a fabulous photo and deffinitely deserves to be one of the top contenders~ hope the comment helps ~          Tatjana', '2004-10-01 10:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
