(934261, 107995, 16230, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The illusion would have worked a little better with the magazine closer to her face. As it is, the head on the magazine is larger than the woman''s.<br/></td>', 'Nice idea. The illusion would have worked a little better with the magazine closer to her face. As it is, the head on the magazine is larger than the woman''s.', '2004-10-01 11:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(934273, 106953, 21711, '<td valign="top">this is a great photo. good job.</td>', 'this is a great photo. good job.', '2004-10-01 11:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(934283, 107969, 16126, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture!  The only thing that bothers me a bit about this image is that there appears to be no support for the kiwi or the splash, gives it a ''floating'' appearance but a bit too much for my taste.  I''m very curious how you did this, I''m guessing it was taken upside down, but then I still don''t know how you managed such a beautiful splash.</td>', 'Fantastic capture!  The only thing that bothers me a bit about this image is that there appears to be no support for the kiwi or the splash, gives it a ''floating'' appearance but a bit too much for my taste.  I''m very curious how you did this, I''m guessing it was taken upside down, but then I still don''t know how you managed such a beautiful splash.', '2004-10-01 11:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(934284, 107969, 24171, '<td valign="top">This looks like some sort of crystalline mushroom. Very beautiful :)</td>', 'This looks like some sort of crystalline mushroom. Very beautiful :)', '2004-10-01 11:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(934287, 108995, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice... I like the grain and the overall mood of live entertainment photos of this nature.  The tight composition also increases the intensity of this photo.</td>', 'Very nice... I like the grain and the overall mood of live entertainment photos of this nature.  The tight composition also increases the intensity of this photo.', '2004-10-01 11:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(934289, 107969, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is really nice, clear, and sharp, but it does show some signs of bad editing, specially the glow around the kiwi, which is a shame because it spoils the photo for me. 6</td>', 'This is really nice, clear, and sharp, but it does show some signs of bad editing, specially the glow around the kiwi, which is a shame because it spoils the photo for me. 6', '2004-10-01 11:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(934291, 108122, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a really good candid portrait. I really love the high contrast and the shallow DoF. The slightly off-centre composition is good and the expression tells a story :) 9</td>', 'This is a really good candid portrait. I really love the high contrast and the shallow DoF. The slightly off-centre composition is good and the expression tells a story :) 9', '2004-10-01 11:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(934293, 109008, 2780, '<td valign="top">The white part on the face looks a little blown out to me, but other than that, its a nice photo with good vibrant colours and sharp detail. 7</td>', 'The white part on the face looks a little blown out to me, but other than that, its a nice photo with good vibrant colours and sharp detail. 7', '2004-10-01 11:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(934295, 108072, 2780, '<td valign="top">The DoF does well to blur out the background. It would have been nice to get some catchlights in his eyes (or drawn them in during post processing) just to give the shot a little more emotion. 6</td>', 'The DoF does well to blur out the background. It would have been nice to get some catchlights in his eyes (or drawn them in during post processing) just to give the shot a little more emotion. 6', '2004-10-01 11:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(934297, 107902, 2780, '<td valign="top">Woah, selective desaturation to the max! That or its a very colorless building. Either way, I think the shot is too busy. It''s nice that there is a lot to look at and keep interest, because I keep spotting new things, but as a photo overall it just seems to cluttered. 6</td>', 'Woah, selective desaturation to the max! That or its a very colorless building. Either way, I think the shot is too busy. It''s nice that there is a lot to look at and keep interest, because I keep spotting new things, but as a photo overall it just seems to cluttered. 6', '2004-10-01 11:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(934298, 103788, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is great. I really like the angle because it adds to the height of the mast. The clouds look great and dramatic, and the B&amp;W really suits the photo well. 10</td>', 'This is great. I really like the angle because it adds to the height of the mast. The clouds look great and dramatic, and the B&W really suits the photo well. 10', '2004-10-01 11:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(934300, 105984, 2780, '<td valign="top">The green colour looks a bit unnatural to me. I think tweaking the green channel in post processing would help. I would also adjust the levels a bit so that the white on the wings is brighter. 6</td>', 'The green colour looks a bit unnatural to me. I think tweaking the green channel in post processing would help. I would also adjust the levels a bit so that the white on the wings is brighter. 6', '2004-10-01 11:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(934302, 107091, 2780, '<td valign="top">I am a fan of negative space and silhouettes, and in this case you have very interesting silhouettes, however I think there is too much sky with no detail. If the sky had better defined clouds to make it more dramatic, I think this crop would work, as it does suggest we are tiny as humans and there is a huge expanse of space for us to explore above us, but I think in this case, a landscape crop on the people, cutting off just above the glider, would look better. 7</td>', 'I am a fan of negative space and silhouettes, and in this case you have very interesting silhouettes, however I think there is too much sky with no detail. If the sky had better defined clouds to make it more dramatic, I think this crop would work, as it does suggest we are tiny as humans and there is a huge expanse of space for us to explore above us, but I think in this case, a landscape crop on the people, cutting off just above the glider, would look better. 7', '2004-10-01 11:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(934304, 109032, 27485, '<td valign="top">nice shadows, I feel the face needs a bit more contrast - it''s a bit washed.  Very nice anger shot - she must have been thinking of punching Pres. Bush in the face.  :)</td>', 'nice shadows, I feel the face needs a bit more contrast - it''s a bit washed.  Very nice anger shot - she must have been thinking of punching Pres. Bush in the face.  :)', '2004-10-01 11:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(934308, 106488, 15832, '<td valign="top">This is amazing!!! All the white in it. It´s photos like that, that shows me how much i still have to learn 9</td>', 'This is amazing!!! All the white in it. It´s photos like that, that shows me how much i still have to learn 9', '2004-10-01 11:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(934309, 107488, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, something like I would expect to see in a film. It''s a bit blurred but I really like that about it. It''s imperfections give it a haunting character. 10</td>', 'This is a great shot, something like I would expect to see in a film. It''s a bit blurred but I really like that about it. It''s imperfections give it a haunting character. 10', '2004-10-01 11:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(934311, 102742, 8624, '<td valign="top">beautifully toned. great pose and a simple and sweet message.  I love many of the small details - the paint on her arm, her bandana, the wall textures, the painted handprints. I give it a 10 even though I find her feet posed awkwardly.</td>', 'beautifully toned. great pose and a simple and sweet message.  I love many of the small details - the paint on her arm, her bandana, the wall textures, the painted handprints. I give it a 10 even though I find her feet posed awkwardly.', '2004-10-01 11:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(934312, 106953, 2780, '<td valign="top">I find the way her hair is over the catchlight in [her] right eye is a bit distracting, and it makes her look evil, with no detail in the eye at all. I do like the desaturation and the background though. 7</td>', 'I find the way her hair is over the catchlight in [her] right eye is a bit distracting, and it makes her look evil, with no detail in the eye at all. I do like the desaturation and the background though. 7', '2004-10-01 11:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(934313, 108843, 2780, '<td valign="top">II love the colours here, and the reflection is great. Is that the moon between the clouds? Fantastic shot. I think if you cropped in a bit closer on the rock (but not too much) it would be even better. 9</td>', 'II love the colours here, and the reflection is great. Is that the moon between the clouds? Fantastic shot. I think if you cropped in a bit closer on the rock (but not too much) it would be even better. 9', '2004-10-01 11:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(934315, 103105, 8624, '<td valign="top">wonderful lighting on the fur. a great momenet captured between mom and baby.  the overall lighting looks very dark to me, however, hiding many details that may have been evident in the shot.</td>', 'wonderful lighting on the fur. a great momenet captured between mom and baby.  the overall lighting looks very dark to me, however, hiding many details that may have been evident in the shot.', '2004-10-01 12:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(934316, 109032, 9821, '<td valign="top">don''t know how you did it, but it''s cool</td>', 'don''t know how you did it, but it''s cool', '2004-10-01 12:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(934318, 102660, 9821, '<td valign="top">selective coloring is subtle enough that it doesn''t look cliche ... well done</td>', 'selective coloring is subtle enough that it doesn''t look cliche ... well done', '2004-10-01 12:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(934319, 109019, 2780, '<td valign="top">No offence meant, but I think she looks more shifty than captivated. If she was looking at the bubble it would make this shot a lot lot better. Also the grain is a bit distracting and the overall image quality (I can''t quite put my finger on why) is not great. It all seems a bit fuzzy. I think black and white would have worked better too, because the greeny brown colour in the background isn''t very attractive. 5</td>', 'No offence meant, but I think she looks more shifty than captivated. If she was looking at the bubble it would make this shot a lot lot better. Also the grain is a bit distracting and the overall image quality (I can''t quite put my finger on why) is not great. It all seems a bit fuzzy. I think black and white would have worked better too, because the greeny brown colour in the background isn''t very attractive. 5', '2004-10-01 12:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(934320, 108173, 9821, '<td valign="top">great detail</td>', 'great detail', '2004-10-01 12:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(934321, 108897, 2780, '<td valign="top">This photo has great lighting and clarity. I think some of the right should be cropped though, so she is less centered. I normally don''t like big borders but in this case I think it works really well. 9</td>', 'This photo has great lighting and clarity. I think some of the right should be cropped though, so she is less centered. I normally don''t like big borders but in this case I think it works really well. 9', '2004-10-01 12:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(934323, 108872, 2780, '<td valign="top">The colours here are really nice and vibrant. I would like to see the right side of the photo on its own, with a crop down the middle, because I think the sun at the bottom right spoils the simplicity and composition, and I''m not sure why it''s there. 6</td>', 'The colours here are really nice and vibrant. I would like to see the right side of the photo on its own, with a crop down the middle, because I think the sun at the bottom right spoils the simplicity and composition, and I''m not sure why it''s there. 6', '2004-10-01 12:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(934325, 108992, 2780, '<td valign="top">This, to me, is a photo which would definately look better in B&amp;W. It would show off all the textures and shadows a lot better. When I looked at this the first thing I noticed was the blue of the sky, which, due to me living in England, looks quite unnatural. In a B&amp;W photo I would look at the haystacks first without the distraction of the blue. 5</td>', 'This, to me, is a photo which would definately look better in B&W. It would show off all the textures and shadows a lot better. When I looked at this the first thing I noticed was the blue of the sky, which, due to me living in England, looks quite unnatural. In a B&W photo I would look at the haystacks first without the distraction of the blue. 5', '2004-10-01 12:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(934329, 103619, 2780, '<td valign="top">The creativity in taking this photo is amazing (I saw your photographer comments when you requested an admin note). To improve the shot I think cropping a bit further away from the man''s shorts so they weren''t up against the edge of the frame would be a good idea, and also the shadow from the right person is a little distracting. 7</td>', 'The creativity in taking this photo is amazing (I saw your photographer comments when you requested an admin note). To improve the shot I think cropping a bit further away from the man''s shorts so they weren''t up against the edge of the frame would be a good idea, and also the shadow from the right person is a little distracting. 7', '2004-10-01 12:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(934330, 103615, 2780, '<td valign="top">Your model has great eyes, but I would have lightened the whites a little. The overexposure in the hair is a bit distracting, and in the background too, but other than that it''s nice. I like the wind blowing the hair around. It adds a bit of dynamics to the shot. 6</td>', 'Your model has great eyes, but I would have lightened the whites a little. The overexposure in the hair is a bit distracting, and in the background too, but other than that it''s nice. I like the wind blowing the hair around. It adds a bit of dynamics to the shot. 6', '2004-10-01 12:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(934331, 107969, 3102, '<td valign="top">It''s certainly hard to pick a winner with the quality entries of this particular challenge... but I think you may have done it here!  For now, this is my only 10 of the challenge.  Very impressive work!</td>', 'It''s certainly hard to pick a winner with the quality entries of this particular challenge... but I think you may have done it here!  For now, this is my only 10 of the challenge.  Very impressive work!', '2004-10-01 12:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(934333, 106488, 2780, '<td valign="top">The is a great shot, infrared I guess? The toning is really efffective and the vignetting suits the photo wonderfully. My only gripe is that the horizon isn''t straight, which makes the tree appear to not be straight either. Even if the horizon isn''t straight in real life, I think straightening it in this photo would improve it. 9</td>', 'The is a great shot, infrared I guess? The toning is really efffective and the vignetting suits the photo wonderfully. My only gripe is that the horizon isn''t straight, which makes the tree appear to not be straight either. Even if the horizon isn''t straight in real life, I think straightening it in this photo would improve it. 9', '2004-10-01 12:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(934334, 109032, 8624, '<td valign="top">very clever and original idea. I like the black and white treatment. Excellent attention to detail, expecially with the blood or sweat spraying from the face of the shadow. The one thing that bothers me is the bottom of the boxer. Her shirt and pants blend together somewhat formlessly, creating a dark featureless area in the frame. I wish the line of the bottom of her shirt was more visible or the stripe on her pants legs more pronounced. All in all a wonderful idea well executed!</td>', 'very clever and original idea. I like the black and white treatment. Excellent attention to detail, expecially with the blood or sweat spraying from the face of the shadow. The one thing that bothers me is the bottom of the boxer. Her shirt and pants blend together somewhat formlessly, creating a dark featureless area in the frame. I wish the line of the bottom of her shirt was more visible or the stripe on her pants legs more pronounced. All in all a wonderful idea well executed!', '2004-10-01 12:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(934335, 108122, 4008, '<td valign="top">The expression is great, the eyes are radiating, full of energy, and the B&amp;W works well. To fully appreciate this image I think you must be a relative or close friend. For me it does not have the appeal that some of the others in the challenge have, but a good image anyway.</td>', 'The expression is great, the eyes are radiating, full of energy, and the B&W works well. To fully appreciate this image I think you must be a relative or close friend. For me it does not have the appeal that some of the others in the challenge have, but a good image anyway.', '2004-10-01 12:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(934336, 105190, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow -- beautiful!  This looks like one of those shots they''d use as a background for a scripture reading.  Very peaceful... the long exposure made this a really slick shot.  Kudos all around!</td>', 'Wow -- beautiful!  This looks like one of those shots they''d use as a background for a scripture reading.  Very peaceful... the long exposure made this a really slick shot.  Kudos all around!', '2004-10-01 12:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(934337, 106488, 11467, '<td valign="top">The Horizon seems a little crooked.<br/>Still an interesting shot</td>', 'The Horizon seems a little crooked.Still an interesting shot', '2004-10-01 12:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(934338, 108276, 2780, '<td valign="top">The colours here are nice and vibrant, and the photo has good clarity. The sky is a bit overexposed on the left but that''s not too important. 7</td>', 'The colours here are nice and vibrant, and the photo has good clarity. The sky is a bit overexposed on the left but that''s not too important. 7', '2004-10-01 12:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(934340, 104030, 2780, '<td valign="top">I''m not really keen on the green in this photo, it takes too much attention away from the waterfall in my opinon. I would have liked to see this in B&amp;W or a pale sepia, with either a closer crop, or a less centered composition. 6</td>', 'I''m not really keen on the green in this photo, it takes too much attention away from the waterfall in my opinon. I would have liked to see this in B&W or a pale sepia, with either a closer crop, or a less centered composition. 6', '2004-10-01 12:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(934341, 108269, 11467, '<td valign="top">Amazing atmosphere.<br/>A shame the centerof attention is so central in the image.<br/>Still an amazing image to look at.</td>', 'Amazing atmosphere.A shame the centerof attention is so central in the image.Still an amazing image to look at.', '2004-10-01 12:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(934344, 106707, 3102, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of this challenge is guessing who might be behind the lens for these shots since the ribbon winners are among the better known, and we''ve learned their styles a bit.  This reminds me of the work of heida, whose work has certainly been an inspiration to many of us.  Even though I doubt that the sky was really that color in the original, I find this to be a beautiful shot with wonderfully warm colors.  It should certainly become a poster on someone''s wall!</td>', 'Part of the fun of this challenge is guessing who might be behind the lens for these shots since the ribbon winners are among the better known, and we''ve learned their styles a bit.  This reminds me of the work of heida, whose work has certainly been an inspiration to many of us.  Even though I doubt that the sky was really that color in the original, I find this to be a beautiful shot with wonderfully warm colors.  It should certainly become a poster on someone''s wall!', '2004-10-01 12:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(934346, 107876, 4008, '<td valign="top">An attractive image to me, appealing, but no WOW factor. Could be used in advertising with some more empty space around it. Technically I cannot suggest any improvements. Nice clean background. Good focus on the strawberry, nice depth of field and blur, good soft light without overexposed white parts.</td>', 'An attractive image to me, appealing, but no WOW factor. Could be used in advertising with some more empty space around it. Technically I cannot suggest any improvements. Nice clean background. Good focus on the strawberry, nice depth of field and blur, good soft light without overexposed white parts.', '2004-10-01 12:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(934347, 108233, 11467, '<td valign="top">Seems too cropped at the bottom.<br/>Amazing action capture though</td>', 'Seems too cropped at the bottom.Amazing action capture though', '2004-10-01 12:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(934348, 108979, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, although the more I look at it, I must confess that my eyes are going a bit buggy!  :)</td>', 'I like this a lot, although the more I look at it, I must confess that my eyes are going a bit buggy!  :)', '2004-10-01 12:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(934349, 109013, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and toning of this one quite a bit.  My only nitpick for this shot is that the guy''s head/hat seem to get a little lost in the background.  A nice use of sepia (something I''m not usually a fan of).</td>', 'I like the concept and toning of this one quite a bit.  My only nitpick for this shot is that the guy''s head/hat seem to get a little lost in the background.  A nice use of sepia (something I''m not usually a fan of).', '2004-10-01 12:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(934350, 107488, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like it that this image makes me wonder what is going on, what is the story behind it. It looks overall slightly soft. Also I find my eyes moving back and forth between the lights and the chair and, considering your title, the chair should maybe have had a more prominent position so it becomes the one and only focal point.</td>', 'I like it that this image makes me wonder what is going on, what is the story behind it. It looks overall slightly soft. Also I find my eyes moving back and forth between the lights and the chair and, considering your title, the chair should maybe have had a more prominent position so it becomes the one and only focal point.', '2004-10-01 12:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(934363, 106953, 20375, '<td valign="top">Stunning beauty captured wonderfully. Tasteful and sensuous shot.<br/>Textures and composition are lovely. My only critcism is the whites of the eyes are unaturally whitened to the point of distraction to the viewer....9<br/>I''m back. I keep coming back to this photo. Despite the eyes...it''s too good. 10.</td>', 'Stunning beauty captured wonderfully. Tasteful and sensuous shot.Textures and composition are lovely. My only critcism is the whites of the eyes are unaturally whitened to the point of distraction to the viewer....9I''m back. I keep coming back to this photo. Despite the eyes...it''s too good. 10.', '2004-10-01 12:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(934364, 107586, 772, '<td valign="top">Very moody... nice "National Geographic" type documentary image... excellent composition and nice work with the post processing...</td>', 'Very moody... nice "National Geographic" type documentary image... excellent composition and nice work with the post processing...', '2004-10-01 12:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(934366, 108537, 5112, '<td valign="top">OK, I keep looking at this shot.  It''s really attractive.  It''s very good.  One thing bothers me though, she looks so "modern" and happy - in my mind the noir girls all looked rather serious, or intense.  I also don''t think they had that kind of fabric in noir times (her tank top) :)  I guess this is a "modern noir".  It''s a lovely shot.</td>', 'OK, I keep looking at this shot.  It''s really attractive.  It''s very good.  One thing bothers me though, she looks so "modern" and happy - in my mind the noir girls all looked rather serious, or intense.  I also don''t think they had that kind of fabric in noir times (her tank top) :)  I guess this is a "modern noir".  It''s a lovely shot.', '2004-10-01 12:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(934368, 108875, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice light, that is, the sun going down but still shining between the mountains onto the mountains to the left.  The glow on the water is lovely.</td>', 'Nice light, that is, the sun going down but still shining between the mountains onto the mountains to the left.  The glow on the water is lovely.', '2004-10-01 12:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(934369, 105984, 4008, '<td valign="top">I am going to be critical (well I usually am anyway). I like the shot but think it could have been better. I like the colors and details of the butterfly and the soft green undistracting surroundings. But the butterfly is in the perfect position to get full sharpness and in your image the top of the wings and the top of the antenna is outside the depth of field. You were probably limited from using a smaller aperture due to low light (I don''t see sunny highlights or flash) but I am making my comments anyway.</td>', 'I am going to be critical (well I usually am anyway). I like the shot but think it could have been better. I like the colors and details of the butterfly and the soft green undistracting surroundings. But the butterfly is in the perfect position to get full sharpness and in your image the top of the wings and the top of the antenna is outside the depth of field. You were probably limited from using a smaller aperture due to low light (I don''t see sunny highlights or flash) but I am making my comments anyway.', '2004-10-01 12:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(934373, 107902, 5112, '<td valign="top">What a place!</td>', 'What a place!', '2004-10-01 12:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(934380, 107397, 10702, '<td valign="top">Great work.. Love the soft focus and the colors. If all the sky would have been blue I presonally think it would look better but it still is GREAT like it is. You truly belong among the masters.</td>', 'Great work.. Love the soft focus and the colors. If all the sky would have been blue I presonally think it would look better but it still is GREAT like it is. You truly belong among the masters.', '2004-10-01 12:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(934382, 107202, 12962, '<td valign="top">Very distinctive.  I love the curves, the creaminess of the complexion, the voluptuous gluteus, the curls of the hair, the feel of the dress (OMG, I sound like some kind of a perv, but maybe I am).  I feel like a voyeur looking at this photograph or even better ... an adolescent first dicovering sensuality and sexuality. And lastly,  redheads rock.</td>', 'Very distinctive.  I love the curves, the creaminess of the complexion, the voluptuous gluteus, the curls of the hair, the feel of the dress (OMG, I sound like some kind of a perv, but maybe I am).  I feel like a voyeur looking at this photograph or even better ... an adolescent first dicovering sensuality and sexuality. And lastly,  redheads rock.', '2004-10-01 12:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(934384, 103219, 20375, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Very tasteful, elegant....superb lines and composition.<br/>The exposure is bang on. Very visually pleasing.<br/>10</td>', 'I love this shot. Very tasteful, elegant....superb lines and composition.The exposure is bang on. Very visually pleasing.10', '2004-10-01 12:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(934385, 108269, 12962, '<td valign="top">Even with the foreboding clouds in the background, I feel calm looking at this photograph.  Interestingly, centering of the sun (sunset? sunrise?) works here.</td>', 'Even with the foreboding clouds in the background, I feel calm looking at this photograph.  Interestingly, centering of the sun (sunset? sunrise?) works here.', '2004-10-01 12:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(934387, 108995, 10702, '<td valign="top">Personally I dont like all that grain. But I know that it is intentional so that will not lower the score. But one thing I can say is not good enough is the lighting on his face.  And you know I'',m just being extra hard on you because this is masters :)</td>', 'Personally I dont like all that grain. But I know that it is intentional so that will not lower the score. But one thing I can say is not good enough is the lighting on his face.  And you know I'',m just being extra hard on you because this is masters :)', '2004-10-01 12:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(934389, 108991, 20375, '<td valign="top">Excellent job at setting mood. Composition is wonderful and exposure is bang on.<br/>Lovely capture. Thank-you.</td>', 'Excellent job at setting mood. Composition is wonderful and exposure is bang on.Lovely capture. Thank-you.', '2004-10-01 12:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(934390, 108173, 12962, '<td valign="top">Like a scene from 1960s Japanese horror movies :-).</td>', 'Like a scene from 1960s Japanese horror movies :-).', '2004-10-01 12:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(934392, 107397, 20375, '<td valign="top">Wow. I love the muted colours in this shot with the soft focus. It creates a dreamy "looking back" effect which matches perfectly with old ruins.<br/>Excellent picture. You should be proud</td>', 'Wow. I love the muted colours in this shot with the soft focus. It creates a dreamy "looking back" effect which matches perfectly with old ruins.Excellent picture. You should be proud', '2004-10-01 12:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(934393, 106488, 10702, '<td valign="top">Woww, what a great shot. I just love the blue color and the atmosphere in this photo. Perhaps a little to much sky, but it looks so great that it doesn''t make the shot bad. <br/>You belong right here, in the master challenge.</td>', 'Woww, what a great shot. I just love the blue color and the atmosphere in this photo. Perhaps a little to much sky, but it looks so great that it doesn''t make the shot bad. You belong right here, in the master challenge.', '2004-10-01 12:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(934394, 107020, 12962, '<td valign="top">The mood is dark and gloomy ... very dynamic ...  the clouds are like coffins marching in a funeral.</td>', 'The mood is dark and gloomy ... very dynamic ...  the clouds are like coffins marching in a funeral.', '2004-10-01 12:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(934396, 108872, 4008, '<td valign="top">I love the vibrant colors and the soft light in the image. I think I would have preferred just one main focal point, I find my eyes moving back and forth between the sundial and the window. The window is non square, probably due to your viewpoint below it, I would have tried to distort it to make it absolutely square, although it also works well as it is.</td>', 'I love the vibrant colors and the soft light in the image. I think I would have preferred just one main focal point, I find my eyes moving back and forth between the sundial and the window. The window is non square, probably due to your viewpoint below it, I would have tried to distort it to make it absolutely square, although it also works well as it is.', '2004-10-01 12:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(934398, 108924, 9821, '<td valign="top">(just entered a comment and computer went crazy ... hope this doesn''t post twice)<br/> <br/>It''s awesome. My only nit pick would be the pose of the model ... it''s hard to tell what she''s doing (dancing, lifting a foot) as i only see one leg. ... 9</td>', '(just entered a comment and computer went crazy ... hope this doesn''t post twice) It''s awesome. My only nit pick would be the pose of the model ... it''s hard to tell what she''s doing (dancing, lifting a foot) as i only see one leg. ... 9', '2004-10-01 12:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(934400, 108210, 10702, '<td valign="top">Good colors, good lighting and well done. But I would say that I have seen better subjects.<br/>Of course I''m being a little tough on you because this is masters...</td>', 'Good colors, good lighting and well done. But I would say that I have seen better subjects.Of course I''m being a little tough on you because this is masters...', '2004-10-01 12:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(934402, 106488, 20375, '<td valign="top">Wow. Thought I was looking at a winter shot initially. Very dramatic effect created here. Lovely depth. Landscape features are sculpted nicely.<br/>Colours create a "surreal" effect. I like it.</td>', 'Wow. Thought I was looking at a winter shot initially. Very dramatic effect created here. Lovely depth. Landscape features are sculpted nicely.Colours create a "surreal" effect. I like it.', '2004-10-01 12:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(934403, 107300, 10702, '<td valign="top">Well this one is going to the album I''ll guess. Beutiful shot.</td>', 'Well this one is going to the album I''ll guess. Beutiful shot.', '2004-10-01 12:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(934406, 109019, 20375, '<td valign="top">She''s beautiful. I think I know who''s entry this is.<br/>You know how to make an image "soft" without compromising focus. <br/>A wonderful "candid" shot of this little girl. Colours in this photo are lovely.<br/>Treasure her...they''re young like this for such a short time.</td>', 'She''s beautiful. I think I know who''s entry this is.You know how to make an image "soft" without compromising focus. A wonderful "candid" shot of this little girl. Colours in this photo are lovely.Treasure her...they''re young like this for such a short time.', '2004-10-01 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(934407, 107397, 12962, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite understand the dark shadow cast on the right side ... if it is really a part of the composition to set the mood or should it be corrected (gradient layer or something)?  But I like the subject, it is a very powreful portrait of many farms across America. I drove from the midwest to the east coast and back last summer and decaying farm houses and barns like this are common sights.  As a foreigner, I can''t quite understand it.</td>', 'I can''t quite understand the dark shadow cast on the right side ... if it is really a part of the composition to set the mood or should it be corrected (gradient layer or something)?  But I like the subject, it is a very powreful portrait of many farms across America. I drove from the midwest to the east coast and back last summer and decaying farm houses and barns like this are common sights.  As a foreigner, I can''t quite understand it.', '2004-10-01 12:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(934408, 106707, 10702, '<td valign="top">Looks llike a painting. Don''t get me wrong, it looks like a GREAT painting, The colors are unreal and the shadows looks strange but the shot looks great. I really love the look of it. Good luck against the other masters.</td>', 'Looks llike a painting. Don''t get me wrong, it looks like a GREAT painting, The colors are unreal and the shadows looks strange but the shot looks great. I really love the look of it. Good luck against the other masters.', '2004-10-01 12:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(934409, 108843, 10702, '<td valign="top">Hmmm , what to say....  Beutiful !   Looks so quite and peaceful. Great work.</td>', 'Hmmm , what to say....  Beutiful !   Looks so quite and peaceful. Great work.', '2004-10-01 12:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(934411, 103219, 9821, '<td valign="top">nice tone ... cool lips ... creative composition ... 8</td>', 'nice tone ... cool lips ... creative composition ... 8', '2004-10-01 12:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(934415, 107995, 9821, '<td valign="top">i''ve seen this doen before, but it always makes me smile ... great job ... 8</td>', 'i''ve seen this doen before, but it always makes me smile ... great job ... 8', '2004-10-01 12:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(934416, 108767, 20375, '<td valign="top">I love mornings like this. Taking into account the angle of the sunlight, the fog and the landscape ....  you''ve exposed wonderfully here. No overexposed areas, and dark areas have detail.</td>', 'I love mornings like this. Taking into account the angle of the sunlight, the fog and the landscape ....  you''ve exposed wonderfully here. No overexposed areas, and dark areas have detail.', '2004-10-01 12:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(934417, 107969, 10702, '<td valign="top">Great stopped action shot that dont only have the woow factor but also the How ? factor.</td>', 'Great stopped action shot that dont only have the woow factor but also the How ? factor.', '2004-10-01 12:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(934418, 103219, 12962, '<td valign="top">The line of the neck is very sensuous and inviting.  A suggestion for another shot, why not just crop the swathe of cloth to have a nude feel?</td>', 'The line of the neck is very sensuous and inviting.  A suggestion for another shot, why not just crop the swathe of cloth to have a nude feel?', '2004-10-01 12:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
