(934453, 108276, 10702, '<td valign="top">Nice, love the colors of the leaves and the lighting.</td>', 'Nice, love the colors of the leaves and the lighting.', '2004-10-01 12:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(934455, 108979, 10702, '<td valign="top">IMHO i think the masters should be little more creative than that. Well done though.</td>', 'IMHO i think the masters should be little more creative than that. Well done though.', '2004-10-01 12:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(934457, 107995, 20375, '<td valign="top">Wow! So simple but so effective. I really like this little gem.<br/>Background and chair are not my favourite setting but the cleverness of the shot stands out. Good exposure.<br/>Did you plan this out or was it fortunate circumstance?<br/>Good eye nonetheless.</td>', 'Wow! So simple but so effective. I really like this little gem.Background and chair are not my favourite setting but the cleverness of the shot stands out. Good exposure.Did you plan this out or was it fortunate circumstance?Good eye nonetheless.', '2004-10-01 12:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(934460, 108537, 10702, '<td valign="top">Great softness and lighting. Really well done.</td>', 'Great softness and lighting. Really well done.', '2004-10-01 12:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(934462, 107609, 20375, '<td valign="top">What stands out in this photo for me?<br/>Lighting and texture. The strong side lighting adds shape and depth and brings out the textures on your subject. His face, the cloth in his sweater and jacket.<br/>Very nice photo especially use of available light.<br/></td>', 'What stands out in this photo for me?Lighting and texture. The strong side lighting adds shape and depth and brings out the textures on your subject. His face, the cloth in his sweater and jacket.Very nice photo especially use of available light.', '2004-10-01 12:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(934463, 104030, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice rendering ... I''ve been to this place.  Munising is a wonderful surprise really (I was on my way from Green Bay, WI to Sault Ste.  Marie (?), stopped for gas at Munising and fell in love with the place.  Suffice it to say that I never reached Sault Ste. Marie.).  So much for chit chat.  I like the creaminess that you''ve achieved for the water and the green color for the surrounding vegetation.   I have no other suggestion except perhaps to burn the haze on the green on top of the falls.</td>', 'Nice rendering ... I''ve been to this place.  Munising is a wonderful surprise really (I was on my way from Green Bay, WI to Sault Ste.  Marie (?), stopped for gas at Munising and fell in love with the place.  Suffice it to say that I never reached Sault Ste. Marie.).  So much for chit chat.  I like the creaminess that you''ve achieved for the water and the green color for the surrounding vegetation.   I have no other suggestion except perhaps to burn the haze on the green on top of the falls.', '2004-10-01 12:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(934465, 103619, 10702, '<td valign="top">"This photo has been validated." Seeing that text made me think HOW, well few hours later I''m still thinking it.  The background is ugly and I dont like the shadows on it but the HOW factor is so strong that you will get a great score. Also extra point for showing off something new.<br/></td>', '"This photo has been validated." Seeing that text made me think HOW, well few hours later I''m still thinking it.  The background is ugly and I dont like the shadows on it but the HOW factor is so strong that you will get a great score. Also extra point for showing off something new.', '2004-10-01 12:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(934467, 108872, 20375, '<td valign="top">Wow. Simplicity and colour along with a sense of composition and balance make this a strong strong image. Excellent exposure.</td>', 'Wow. Simplicity and colour along with a sense of composition and balance make this a strong strong image. Excellent exposure.', '2004-10-01 12:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(934471, 103189, 509, '<td valign="top">I like that she image is divided by the darker elements.  The blue sky at the top resembles what the sky might look like at dusk.  Below the first separation though, the lightning offers a stark contrast to the peaceful connotations drawn from the top.  The reflection of the water at the bottom is a little bit of a return to a calmer subject.  I don''t know if this is what you were intending when you shot this, but I think it really makes this special.  Nice work.</td>', 'I like that she image is divided by the darker elements.  The blue sky at the top resembles what the sky might look like at dusk.  Below the first separation though, the lightning offers a stark contrast to the peaceful connotations drawn from the top.  The reflection of the water at the bottom is a little bit of a return to a calmer subject.  I don''t know if this is what you were intending when you shot this, but I think it really makes this special.  Nice work.', '2004-10-01 12:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(934472, 107202, 10702, '<td valign="top">This is a cut out of a mens magazine, right ?  Looks perfect.</td>', 'This is a cut out of a mens magazine, right ?  Looks perfect.', '2004-10-01 12:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(934474, 108843, 12962, '<td valign="top">I can just look at this forever, I think.  You were so correct in waiting for the moon to appear.</td>', 'I can just look at this forever, I think.  You were so correct in waiting for the moon to appear.', '2004-10-01 13:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(934476, 108832, 16151, '<td valign="top">Nice colors</td>', 'Nice colors', '2004-10-01 13:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(934477, 107876, 10702, '<td valign="top">Damn you, I drewled so much over my keyboard that I had to get my self a new one. Looks real tasty.</td>', 'Damn you, I drewled so much over my keyboard that I had to get my self a new one. Looks real tasty.', '2004-10-01 13:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(934480, 102742, 20375, '<td valign="top">Excellent work. Very creative shot. I love the muted colours as well as the theme. The message being delivered by a child only makes it more effective.<br/>She has a wonderful stance by the way, creates a natural feel to it and adds a childs "playfullness" to this picture.</td>', 'Excellent work. Very creative shot. I love the muted colours as well as the theme. The message being delivered by a child only makes it more effective.She has a wonderful stance by the way, creates a natural feel to it and adds a childs "playfullness" to this picture.', '2004-10-01 13:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(934481, 107488, 509, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of lighting and perspective to give this the eerie feeling suggested by the title.  The symmetry of the windows adds balance and strength the composition while the chair slightly throws off that balance - very nice.</td>', 'Excellent use of lighting and perspective to give this the eerie feeling suggested by the title.  The symmetry of the windows adds balance and strength the composition while the chair slightly throws off that balance - very nice.', '2004-10-01 13:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(934482, 108537, 16151, '<td valign="top">A woman with a gun...can''t beat that!</td>', 'A woman with a gun...can''t beat that!', '2004-10-01 13:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(934483, 105966, 509, '<td valign="top">Excellent job on a tough exposure.</td>', 'Excellent job on a tough exposure.', '2004-10-01 13:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(934484, 107876, 12962, '<td valign="top">Got a craving ... went down to the cafeteria to look for exactly this.  If this were an ad, you were successful in enticing your customers.  Food photography is very difficult for me to achieve.</td>', 'Got a craving ... went down to the cafeteria to look for exactly this.  If this were an ad, you were successful in enticing your customers.  Food photography is very difficult for me to achieve.', '2004-10-01 13:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(934485, 107599, 16151, '<td valign="top">footsteps make this photo.  good job.</td>', 'footsteps make this photo.  good job.', '2004-10-01 13:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(934486, 108984, 16151, '<td valign="top">Nice vibrant colors.</td>', 'Nice vibrant colors.', '2004-10-01 13:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(934492, 108642, 20375, '<td valign="top">My son, when he was quite young, while watching his little sister and cousins playing turned to me and blew me away when he said, "Pretty girls on a sunny day dad. Nice huh?"<br/>Your picture snapped me back to that moment. THIS is what he meant with that comment. You''ve captured the playful, magical energy of youth here...and..you dusted off an old memory...thanks.</td>', 'My son, when he was quite young, while watching his little sister and cousins playing turned to me and blew me away when he said, "Pretty girls on a sunny day dad. Nice huh?"Your picture snapped me back to that moment. THIS is what he meant with that comment. You''ve captured the playful, magical energy of youth here...and..you dusted off an old memory...thanks.', '2004-10-01 13:04:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(934496, 107202, 20375, '<td valign="top">Lighting, colours, focus...it all comes together in this shot. Not to mention textures.<br/>Of course the pose, as provocative as it is, is still tastefully done and creates a<br/>very sensual, erotic image. Well posed.<br/></td>', 'Lighting, colours, focus...it all comes together in this shot. Not to mention textures.Of course the pose, as provocative as it is, is still tastefully done and creates avery sensual, erotic image. Well posed.', '2004-10-01 13:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(934502, 108843, 27293, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the composition here at all.</td>', 'Don''t like the composition here at all.', '2004-10-01 13:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(934503, 107902, 20375, '<td valign="top">I like the muted colours coupled with the desat here. Where is this. It''s almost too<br/>"laid out"..everything has it''s place. Very nice nostalgic feel to it. A nice poster shot. -8</td>', 'I like the muted colours coupled with the desat here. Where is this. It''s almost too"laid out"..everything has it''s place. Very nice nostalgic feel to it. A nice poster shot. -8', '2004-10-01 13:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(934504, 103788, 10702, '<td valign="top">How can you get a shot to look like this. Please can you tell me what you did. It looks so freaking perfect.</td>', 'How can you get a shot to look like this. Please can you tell me what you did. It looks so freaking perfect.', '2004-10-01 13:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(934505, 107969, 6388, '<td valign="top">neat idea inverting the pic like that...though i''d have preferred it if you leveled the water rather than the kiwi i think.  it''s very crisply focussed , which i like, but methinks it''s maybe a little oversharpened as all your highlights have that "USM glow" to them.  Of course, that may simply be your lighting too...can''t really tell.<br/>nonetheless, a great shot.</td>', 'neat idea inverting the pic like that...though i''d have preferred it if you leveled the water rather than the kiwi i think.  it''s very crisply focussed , which i like, but methinks it''s maybe a little oversharpened as all your highlights have that "USM glow" to them.  Of course, that may simply be your lighting too...can''t really tell.nonetheless, a great shot.', '2004-10-01 13:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(934506, 105647, 27293, '<td valign="top">z<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-12 08:17:45.</i></td>', 'z', '2004-10-01 13:08:50.000000', '2005-07-12 09:17:45.000000', 1),
(934507, 107995, 10702, '<td valign="top">hahaha, never seen this before. Very creative.</td>', 'hahaha, never seen this before. Very creative.', '2004-10-01 13:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(934511, 108984, 27293, '<td valign="top">z<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-12 08:17:04.</i></td>', 'z', '2004-10-01 13:09:43.000000', '2005-07-12 09:17:04.000000', 1),
(934512, 108897, 20375, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait. Well posed. Lighting is very well done as in all your shots!<br/>Her demeanor, the warm tone of her skin, brown eyes certainly do create a feeling of warmth.</td>', 'Excellent portrait. Well posed. Lighting is very well done as in all your shots!Her demeanor, the warm tone of her skin, brown eyes certainly do create a feeling of warmth.', '2004-10-01 13:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(934513, 108569, 27293, '<td valign="top">z<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-12 08:16:41.</i></td>', 'z', '2004-10-01 13:10:41.000000', '2005-07-12 09:16:41.000000', 1),
(934514, 102742, 6388, '<td valign="top">minus the selective desat, this is my favourite composition so far.  I''d have givin it a higher vote if it were either all colour or duotoned.<br/>everything else about it is perfect.  my top vote so far.</td>', 'minus the selective desat, this is my favourite composition so far.  I''d have givin it a higher vote if it were either all colour or duotoned.everything else about it is perfect.  my top vote so far.', '2004-10-01 13:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(934516, 108767, 27293, '<td valign="top">z<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-12 08:16:21.</i></td>', 'z', '2004-10-01 13:11:59.000000', '2005-07-12 09:16:21.000000', 1),
(934518, 108275, 27293, '<td valign="top">z<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-12 08:16:07.</i></td>', 'z', '2004-10-01 13:13:22.000000', '2005-07-12 09:16:07.000000', 1),
(934519, 107091, 10686, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, nice use of neg space. -8</td>', 'Cool idea, nice use of neg space. -8', '2004-10-01 13:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(934520, 107488, 20375, '<td valign="top">Pattern, lines, and the strong sense of balanced "centred" composition are enhanced by the chair and chandelier as pleasing "disruptions" to the sense of pattern and order.<br/>The chair being empty does create an eriee absence! Well done. -8</td>', 'Pattern, lines, and the strong sense of balanced "centred" composition are enhanced by the chair and chandelier as pleasing "disruptions" to the sense of pattern and order.The chair being empty does create an eriee absence! Well done. -8', '2004-10-01 13:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(934523, 107876, 27293, '<td valign="top">z<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-12 08:15:52.</i></td>', 'z', '2004-10-01 13:14:25.000000', '2005-07-12 09:15:52.000000', 1),
(934524, 109019, 10686, '<td valign="top">The expression is priceless, I''m digging the post processing too -9</td>', 'The expression is priceless, I''m digging the post processing too -9', '2004-10-01 13:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(934526, 108832, 27293, '<td valign="top">z<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-12 08:15:33.</i></td>', 'z', '2004-10-01 13:16:13.000000', '2005-07-12 09:15:33.000000', 1),
(934527, 109013, 10686, '<td valign="top">Great imagery, reminds me of country walks with my uncle. Sepia tone works well. -8</td>', 'Great imagery, reminds me of country walks with my uncle. Sepia tone works well. -8', '2004-10-01 13:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(934528, 103619, 6388, '<td valign="top">great concept, but i don''t love the execution.  specifically i don''t dig the graduated transitionon the shorts (fading out).  i prefer how you did the boots with a clear-cut transition.  lighting is pretty good, but a little overdone on the right.  a reflector onthe left to brighten  his face would  have helped i think.<br/>neat idea - out of the box.... i like that.<br/>P-ness</td>', 'great concept, but i don''t love the execution.  specifically i don''t dig the graduated transitionon the shorts (fading out).  i prefer how you did the boots with a clear-cut transition.  lighting is pretty good, but a little overdone on the right.  a reflector onthe left to brighten  his face would  have helped i think.neat idea - out of the box.... i like that.P-ness', '2004-10-01 13:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(934529, 107586, 10702, '<td valign="top">Congrats, the only 10 from me in this challenge, so far. I''m just lacking words to describe how I feel. Truly awesome.</td>', 'Congrats, the only 10 from me in this challenge, so far. I''m just lacking words to describe how I feel. Truly awesome.', '2004-10-01 13:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(934530, 107995, 4008, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea, I like it. The match is not perfect, but I don''t care. I think you could not have moved the magazine closer to achieve a perfect match with the face and at the same time have a natural look with a normal reading distance. What I do find disturbing are the imperfections around the edge of the desaturation, especially the edge of the left arm (viewer right) holding the magazine, a part of the hair and a small spot on the magazine.</td>', 'Very creative idea, I like it. The match is not perfect, but I don''t care. I think you could not have moved the magazine closer to achieve a perfect match with the face and at the same time have a natural look with a normal reading distance. What I do find disturbing are the imperfections around the edge of the desaturation, especially the edge of the left arm (viewer right) holding the magazine, a part of the hair and a small spot on the magazine.', '2004-10-01 13:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(934532, 107995, 10686, '<td valign="top">Great juxtaposition. We are what we read? 7</td>', 'Great juxtaposition. We are what we read? 7', '2004-10-01 13:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(934533, 107901, 27293, '<td valign="top">z<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-12 08:15:15.</i></td>', 'z', '2004-10-01 13:18:02.000000', '2005-07-12 09:15:15.000000', 1),
(934536, 103615, 6388, '<td valign="top">love the catch lights in her eyes (reflector? most likely).  A little blown out through the trees which gives the initial impression that her face is underexposed, which i don''t believe it is.  Nice placement of the model in the frame, and nice use of the tree to frame her face.</td>', 'love the catch lights in her eyes (reflector? most likely).  A little blown out through the trees which gives the initial impression that her face is underexposed, which i don''t believe it is.  Nice placement of the model in the frame, and nice use of the tree to frame her face.', '2004-10-01 13:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(934537, 106931, 27293, '<td valign="top">z<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-12 08:14:52.</i></td>', 'z', '2004-10-01 13:18:43.000000', '2005-07-12 09:14:52.000000', 1),
(934538, 106707, 10686, '<td valign="top">Light and colors look almost too good to be true. Very nice 7</td>', 'Light and colors look almost too good to be true. Very nice 7', '2004-10-01 13:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(934539, 108872, 6388, '<td valign="top">sweet.  really like this.  might like it even more without the sundial, frankly. fab contrast in colours, and simple lines.  it takes a good eye to see this kind of shot.  I''ll bet the surroundings would paint an entirely different picture.</td>', 'sweet.  really like this.  might like it even more without the sundial, frankly. fab contrast in colours, and simple lines.  it takes a good eye to see this kind of shot.  I''ll bet the surroundings would paint an entirely different picture.', '2004-10-01 13:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(934540, 107091, 27293, '<td valign="top">z<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-12 08:14:33.</i></td>', 'z', '2004-10-01 13:20:32.000000', '2005-07-12 09:14:33.000000', 1),
(934542, 108767, 10686, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and a beautiful moment. The composition doesn''t do much for me though, sorry. 4</td>', 'Lovely colors and a beautiful moment. The composition doesn''t do much for me though, sorry. 4', '2004-10-01 13:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(934543, 105190, 4008, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous, you early morning rise certainly paid off, it is hard isn''t it ? Especially the blur of the flowing water, the glow from the sunrise on the water and the large stones breaking the water and giving a point to rest the eyes upon are perfect. The sunrise itself and the cliff finish the image off nicely but the front really creates the appeal for me.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous, you early morning rise certainly paid off, it is hard isn''t it ? Especially the blur of the flowing water, the glow from the sunrise on the water and the large stones breaking the water and giving a point to rest the eyes upon are perfect. The sunrise itself and the cliff finish the image off nicely but the front really creates the appeal for me.', '2004-10-01 13:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(934546, 107609, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is a great image.  The textures are phenomenal.  The only thing I don''t like, which is of course a matter of opinion, is the shadow and lighting on the face; it gives the appearance that the cap is sort of floating in mid-air.  The focus on the face is also a bit soft, which I understand is intentional to bring the eye to the cup which is the actual subject, but the light combined with the focus makes it hard to read the man''s expression which I think is an important part of this sort of image.  Nonetheless, this is an outstanding image. 9</td>', 'This is a great image.  The textures are phenomenal.  The only thing I don''t like, which is of course a matter of opinion, is the shadow and lighting on the face; it gives the appearance that the cap is sort of floating in mid-air.  The focus on the face is also a bit soft, which I understand is intentional to bring the eye to the cup which is the actual subject, but the light combined with the focus makes it hard to read the man''s expression which I think is an important part of this sort of image.  Nonetheless, this is an outstanding image. 9', '2004-10-01 13:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(934548, 108537, 1024, '<td valign="top">This photo is my choice for the blue ribbon.  I can not see any way to improve it.  10</td>', 'This photo is my choice for the blue ribbon.  I can not see any way to improve it.  10', '2004-10-01 13:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(934549, 104030, 27293, '<td valign="top">z<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-12 08:27:02.</i></td>', 'z', '2004-10-01 13:23:56.000000', '2005-07-12 09:27:02.000000', 1),
(934551, 107901, 4008, '<td valign="top">The colors are great, very vibrant combination, reminding me of late summer. I have some difficulty with the composition, I would have preferred to see some more empty space to the left, so the dragonfly moves out of the middle.  Maybe that would also have given the opportunity to get a bit more depth of field.</td>', 'The colors are great, very vibrant combination, reminding me of late summer. I have some difficulty with the composition, I would have preferred to see some more empty space to the left, so the dragonfly moves out of the middle.  Maybe that would also have given the opportunity to get a bit more depth of field.', '2004-10-01 13:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(934552, 107586, 3087, '<td valign="top">This image has a really high impact for me. The expression on the face conveys so much. It suggests to me that this child has experienced more in his short lifetime than any child should have to experience. The lighting and composition work well and the toned black and white does too. 9</td>', 'This image has a really high impact for me. The expression on the face conveys so much. It suggests to me that this child has experienced more in his short lifetime than any child should have to experience. The lighting and composition work well and the toned black and white does too. 9', '2004-10-01 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(934553, 105190, 1024, '<td valign="top">I am a real sucker for slow shutter speed water shots.  This is absolutely gorgeous.  10</td>', 'I am a real sucker for slow shutter speed water shots.  This is absolutely gorgeous.  10', '2004-10-01 13:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(934556, 108832, 4008, '<td valign="top">A beautiful sunset, great warm colors and lines in the sky. A small crop of the left would make it better in my opinion, my eye is moving away to the left because of the leading line, also because I am missing a single focal point. Could you have placed yourself in the image as silhouette ? That would have done it.</td>', 'A beautiful sunset, great warm colors and lines in the sky. A small crop of the left would make it better in my opinion, my eye is moving away to the left because of the leading line, also because I am missing a single focal point. Could you have placed yourself in the image as silhouette ? That would have done it.', '2004-10-01 13:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(934559, 102742, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a charming image and beautifully presented. I think the idea of combining peace and please is a very clever way to communicate that the child is asking "can''t we please have peace?". The composition works well with the child, paintpot and text positioned very well within the frame. This is also one of the few examples of selective desaturation that I have seen lately that really adds something to the impact of the finished image. 9</td>', 'This is a charming image and beautifully presented. I think the idea of combining peace and please is a very clever way to communicate that the child is asking "can''t we please have peace?". The composition works well with the child, paintpot and text positioned very well within the frame. This is also one of the few examples of selective desaturation that I have seen lately that really adds something to the impact of the finished image. 9', '2004-10-01 13:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(934560, 109008, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, nice rich black background, just the right amount of reflection in his eye, good choice of viewpoint/ angle to the subject. 8</td>', 'Nice lighting, nice rich black background, just the right amount of reflection in his eye, good choice of viewpoint/ angle to the subject. 8', '2004-10-01 13:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(934561, 107397, 6388, '<td valign="top">I''m guilty of overburning a lot of the time, and in my mind you''ve done almost exactly what i would do :).  it makes for a neat effect - kind of surreal - but looks quite unnatural; The ''shadows'' at the front don''t seem to mesh with the shadows on the buildings or in the sky.  Nice composition though, and fabulous colours.</td>', 'I''m guilty of overburning a lot of the time, and in my mind you''ve done almost exactly what i would do :).  it makes for a neat effect - kind of surreal - but looks quite unnatural; The ''shadows'' at the front don''t seem to mesh with the shadows on the buildings or in the sky.  Nice composition though, and fabulous colours.', '2004-10-01 13:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(934562, 106707, 3087, '<td valign="top">The composition of this is stunning - not just the positioning of that lone castle but also the strong clouds themselves. The rich golden light on the stonework is beautiful. The blue sky at the top contrasts well with that. The red seems unreal, I''m curious about whether it''s an accurate representation or a creative use of a filter. Either way I like the result. Very striking. 8</td>', 'The composition of this is stunning - not just the positioning of that lone castle but also the strong clouds themselves. The rich golden light on the stonework is beautiful. The blue sky at the top contrasts well with that. The red seems unreal, I''m curious about whether it''s an accurate representation or a creative use of a filter. Either way I like the result. Very striking. 8', '2004-10-01 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(934565, 107902, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a facinating look at our past.  I love how you have made this almost dreamlike.</td>', 'This is a facinating look at our past.  I love how you have made this almost dreamlike.', '2004-10-01 13:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(934567, 107202, 6388, '<td valign="top">someone said to me earlier (before i saw this pic) "have you seen ''Maid''?  If that''s not Bianca''s a$$, I''ll print the picture and eat it"  Now i know what they were referring to. :)<br/> <br/>Great shot - love the apparent shallow depth, though that may well be Gaussian Blur - I can''t tell.  nice job.</td>', 'someone said to me earlier (before i saw this pic) "have you seen ''Maid''?  If that''s not Bianca''s a$$, I''ll print the picture and eat it"  Now i know what they were referring to. :) Great shot - love the apparent shallow depth, though that may well be Gaussian Blur - I can''t tell.  nice job.', '2004-10-01 13:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(934568, 109014, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lovely bird portrait with great focus, nice lighting - great catchlight in the eye and excellent composition - the position of the branch within the frame is superb. I like the blurred background a lot - the colours within it complement the bird but allow it to stand out from the background enough that we can appreciate it''s form. 8</td>', 'A lovely bird portrait with great focus, nice lighting - great catchlight in the eye and excellent composition - the position of the branch within the frame is superb. I like the blurred background a lot - the colours within it complement the bird but allow it to stand out from the background enough that we can appreciate it''s form. 8', '2004-10-01 13:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(934569, 108454, 4517, '<td valign="top">Interesting rock but lighting harsh. Would be better shot at sunset or sunrise.</td>', 'Interesting rock but lighting harsh. Would be better shot at sunset or sunrise.', '2004-10-01 13:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(934571, 109008, 10686, '<td valign="top">Great colors and detail -8</td>', 'Great colors and detail -8', '2004-10-01 13:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(934572, 103615, 3306, '<td valign="top">An amazingly beautiful portrait. A lovely young lady helps to accent your talent. Great job.</td>', 'An amazingly beautiful portrait. A lovely young lady helps to accent your talent. Great job.', '2004-10-01 13:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(934573, 108991, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful "mood" shot. The mist is beautifully captured - the lighting and exposure are just right. The rocks on the left are really important for me within the coimposition - they serve to anchor the scene somehow. At first I wasn''t sure that the horizon should be so centred but actually I realise that it''s just the right composition. 8</td>', 'What a beautiful "mood" shot. The mist is beautifully captured - the lighting and exposure are just right. The rocks on the left are really important for me within the coimposition - they serve to anchor the scene somehow. At first I wasn''t sure that the horizon should be so centred but actually I realise that it''s just the right composition. 8', '2004-10-01 13:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(934575, 108072, 4517, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp well composed shot.</td>', 'Nice sharp well composed shot.', '2004-10-01 13:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(934576, 108924, 10686, '<td valign="top">WHat can I say? Great colors and the figure, brings a sense of solitude and humanity to it -8</td>', 'WHat can I say? Great colors and the figure, brings a sense of solitude and humanity to it -8', '2004-10-01 13:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(934577, 107397, 1024, '<td valign="top">This has an old time post card feel to it.  Just lovely!</td>', 'This has an old time post card feel to it.  Just lovely!', '2004-10-01 13:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(934580, 107586, 3306, '<td valign="top">A touching portrait. I can only imagine what is in the eyes of this child who has obviously seen much in his few years.</td>', 'A touching portrait. I can only imagine what is in the eyes of this child who has obviously seen much in his few years.', '2004-10-01 13:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(934582, 107995, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photo.  I love the theme... I think a tighter crop would make it even more perfect, IMO.  This also makes an excellent black and white.. I played around with it some to confirm that suspicion, but it''s just my preference :)  Great shot...</td>', 'This is an excellent photo.  I love the theme... I think a tighter crop would make it even more perfect, IMO.  This also makes an excellent black and white.. I played around with it some to confirm that suspicion, but it''s just my preference :)  Great shot...', '2004-10-01 13:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(934584, 107609, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the use of shadow to create an interestingly shaped negative space area. It makes the portrait more interesting overall. My only criticism would be that I can''t see the detail of his eye, which I would really like to be able to see more clearly. Black and white works well with the subject. 8</td>', 'I love the use of shadow to create an interestingly shaped negative space area. It makes the portrait more interesting overall. My only criticism would be that I can''t see the detail of his eye, which I would really like to be able to see more clearly. Black and white works well with the subject. 8', '2004-10-01 13:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(934588, 107300, 10686, '<td valign="top">I like this quite a bit, great pose and for once, I even like a border -7</td>', 'I like this quite a bit, great pose and for once, I even like a border -7', '2004-10-01 13:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(934590, 106171, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautifully presented portrait that really shows this bird off to it''s best. The detail in teh eye is wonderful. The rich green background is just the right colour to show off the brown, white and yellows of the bird and the depth of field blurs it out excellently. 8</td>', 'A beautifully presented portrait that really shows this bird off to it''s best. The detail in teh eye is wonderful. The rich green background is just the right colour to show off the brown, white and yellows of the bird and the depth of field blurs it out excellently. 8', '2004-10-01 13:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(934591, 102660, 5822, '<td valign="top">I really like the soft tones and narrow DOF. Gives her a dreamy appearance. The eyes, with just a bit of coloring are quite captivating. I also like the flow of movement of how my eyes are led...up the neck to the earing and over to the eyes, and then down her hair.  I don''t mind that the top of head was cut off. Nice intimate portrait.  8</td>', 'I really like the soft tones and narrow DOF. Gives her a dreamy appearance. The eyes, with just a bit of coloring are quite captivating. I also like the flow of movement of how my eyes are led...up the neck to the earing and over to the eyes, and then down her hair.  I don''t mind that the top of head was cut off. Nice intimate portrait.  8', '2004-10-01 13:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(934594, 108767, 4517, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. I would have cropped all of the sky above the cloud to put more emphasis on the mist. 7.</td>', 'Lovely shot. I would have cropped all of the sky above the cloud to put more emphasis on the mist. 7.', '2004-10-01 13:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(934596, 108173, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not into bugs but this is a great shot. I like the detail in his... er... face... and the tilted angle really conveys the way these critters can land on any surface. Interesting split-toned background too. DOF seems weird, it looks like there are two planes of focus which is impossible. Have you manually blurred any areas or am I just going mad? 8</td>', 'Not into bugs but this is a great shot. I like the detail in his... er... face... and the tilted angle really conveys the way these critters can land on any surface. Interesting split-toned background too. DOF seems weird, it looks like there are two planes of focus which is impossible. Have you manually blurred any areas or am I just going mad? 8', '2004-10-01 13:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(934597, 108949, 2764, '<td valign="top">This looks like Richard Parker.  Have you read The Life of Pi?</td>', 'This looks like Richard Parker.  Have you read The Life of Pi?', '2004-10-01 13:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(934598, 109032, 5822, '<td valign="top">I"m going to guess that this was done with a filter/mask. I think the composition is really excellent.  The way the arms of both the real person and the mask go flying off in different directions and the beads of sweat of the shadow-mask really give the image a sense of hitting someone hard and sending them flying.  Along with the way the subject''s body is turned and way the shadow-mask is leaning really give the image a lot of energy.  On the whole, I think the choise of harsh lighting was very good, but think there could be slightly more fill light on the face of your subject.   Good choice of B&amp;W and low contrast tones.  This image was well thought out and masterfully executed. Bravo! 10</td>', 'I"m going to guess that this was done with a filter/mask. I think the composition is really excellent.  The way the arms of both the real person and the mask go flying off in different directions and the beads of sweat of the shadow-mask really give the image a sense of hitting someone hard and sending them flying.  Along with the way the subject''s body is turned and way the shadow-mask is leaning really give the image a lot of energy.  On the whole, I think the choise of harsh lighting was very good, but think there could be slightly more fill light on the face of your subject.   Good choice of B&W and low contrast tones.  This image was well thought out and masterfully executed. Bravo! 10', '2004-10-01 13:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(934599, 105190, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of slow shutter speed to create a ghost effect with the motion of the water. Great colour and light. Strong composition. The rock in the foreground really helps anchor that. 8</td>', 'Beautiful use of slow shutter speed to create a ghost effect with the motion of the water. Great colour and light. Strong composition. The rock in the foreground really helps anchor that. 8', '2004-10-01 13:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(934601, 106931, 5822, '<td valign="top">What can you say when you have such wondeful light and scenic to match? The clouds really pop out and the color is outstanding (must be polarized).  The deep DOF is very good as well, but would have been really brought out had there been some kind of subject matter to focus on, such as, a boat in the water, or fowl floating along. Still, a wonderful photograph. 9</td>', 'What can you say when you have such wondeful light and scenic to match? The clouds really pop out and the color is outstanding (must be polarized).  The deep DOF is very good as well, but would have been really brought out had there been some kind of subject matter to focus on, such as, a boat in the water, or fowl floating along. Still, a wonderful photograph. 9', '2004-10-01 13:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(934603, 105190, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset/seascape photo! The colors are excellent and I like the way they reflect in the water.  Compositionally, I really like how silky smooth water (from long exposure?) leads the eye in an S-shape from rock to rock and to the sunset.  The large and dark land mass at the top of the pic gives it balance and stability.  Excellent work! 10</td>', 'Beautiful sunset/seascape photo! The colors are excellent and I like the way they reflect in the water.  Compositionally, I really like how silky smooth water (from long exposure?) leads the eye in an S-shape from rock to rock and to the sunset.  The large and dark land mass at the top of the pic gives it balance and stability.  Excellent work! 10', '2004-10-01 13:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(934606, 109014, 5822, '<td valign="top">Terrific detail in the feathers adn the narrow DOF is excellent.  The fine bokeh really helps to isolate this bird. I especially like the colors of the background. Very autumn-like colors. Exposure is outstanding and it doesn''t appear that you had that much light to work with. 9</td>', 'Terrific detail in the feathers adn the narrow DOF is excellent.  The fine bokeh really helps to isolate this bird. I especially like the colors of the background. Very autumn-like colors. Exposure is outstanding and it doesn''t appear that you had that much light to work with. 9', '2004-10-01 13:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(934608, 107995, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is very clever!  I think a tighter  crop might have been a little more effective.</td>', 'This is very clever!  I think a tighter  crop might have been a little more effective.', '2004-10-01 13:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(934609, 108275, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very emotive animal portrait. I particularly like the low contrast and the gradual gradations of tone from darker at the bottom, to lighter at the top. Great detail in the gorilla''s coat and the connection with the eyes are captivating.  It''s almost as if this animal sat in a studio for you and posed.  Only criticism would be the close crop at the top of the head but other than that, very well done. 9</td>', 'Very emotive animal portrait. I particularly like the low contrast and the gradual gradations of tone from darker at the bottom, to lighter at the top. Great detail in the gorilla''s coat and the connection with the eyes are captivating.  It''s almost as if this animal sat in a studio for you and posed.  Only criticism would be the close crop at the top of the head but other than that, very well done. 9', '2004-10-01 13:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(934611, 108276, 10686, '<td valign="top">Wonderful mix of light and colors -6</td>', 'Wonderful mix of light and colors -6', '2004-10-01 13:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(934613, 108991, 10686, '<td valign="top">Lovely ethereal moment -7</td>', 'Lovely ethereal moment -7', '2004-10-01 13:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(934615, 104030, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture of the falls and the details in the rock. Color is very vibrant and this image has great clarity and pop. The centering of the falls is not that big of a deal and does not detract from this beautiful wide angled view. 8</td>', 'Wonderful capture of the falls and the details in the rock. Color is very vibrant and this image has great clarity and pop. The centering of the falls is not that big of a deal and does not detract from this beautiful wide angled view. 8', '2004-10-01 13:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(934619, 107609, 10686, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and great subject - 6</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and great subject - 6', '2004-10-01 13:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(934624, 108940, 12962, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.</td>', 'Gorgeous.', '2004-10-01 13:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(934626, 108979, 10686, '<td valign="top">Interesting optical effects, but nothing that really excites me -4</td>', 'Interesting optical effects, but nothing that really excites me -4', '2004-10-01 13:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(934627, 107609, 5585, '<td valign="top">I like the negative space here...another plus... doutone</td>', 'I like the negative space here...another plus... doutone', '2004-10-01 13:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(934632, 107020, 4517, '<td valign="top">Cool sky and reflection.</td>', 'Cool sky and reflection.', '2004-10-01 13:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(934636, 108872, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice rich and vibrant complementary colors, not too saturated and very clean looking.  I also like the uncluttered appearance of this photo and glad you did not include a border.  I do however, wish you cloned out the two hooks below the window, as they are slightly distracting.  The sundial gives an interesting foil juxtaposed with the window.  8</td>', 'Very nice rich and vibrant complementary colors, not too saturated and very clean looking.  I also like the uncluttered appearance of this photo and glad you did not include a border.  I do however, wish you cloned out the two hooks below the window, as they are slightly distracting.  The sundial gives an interesting foil juxtaposed with the window.  8', '2004-10-01 13:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(934640, 109014, 4517, '<td valign="top">Pretty sharp and great background colour. 8</td>', 'Pretty sharp and great background colour. 8', '2004-10-01 13:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(934643, 107091, 12962, '<td valign="top">I am a fan of the creative use of negative space.  I would probably crop about an inch from the top for this one ... for utility (so when your viewers with smaller monitors open this page, you see the picture right away, and not just a gray space).</td>', 'I am a fan of the creative use of negative space.  I would probably crop about an inch from the top for this one ... for utility (so when your viewers with smaller monitors open this page, you see the picture right away, and not just a gray space).', '2004-10-01 13:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(934645, 107902, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but I think the selective desaturation is a bit haywire and seems to be applied willy nilly. - 4</td>', 'Nice image, but I think the selective desaturation is a bit haywire and seems to be applied willy nilly. - 4', '2004-10-01 13:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(934647, 106488, 5822, '<td valign="top">I really like the IR tones.  Along with the deep DOF and very wide angle view, as well as, the miniscule appearance of the person and golf bag(?) the impact of this photo lies in how it conveys the immensity and scale of the space it presents.  It does this in both the verticle and horizontal dimensions. Very well done. 8</td>', 'I really like the IR tones.  Along with the deep DOF and very wide angle view, as well as, the miniscule appearance of the person and golf bag(?) the impact of this photo lies in how it conveys the immensity and scale of the space it presents.  It does this in both the verticle and horizontal dimensions. Very well done. 8', '2004-10-01 13:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(934649, 103219, 4517, '<td valign="top">Interesting view point and very good lighting.</td>', 'Interesting view point and very good lighting.', '2004-10-01 13:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(934652, 107397, 10686, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene of decay -7</td>', 'Beautiful scene of decay -7', '2004-10-01 13:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(934653, 109032, 6388, '<td valign="top">great idea...little weak in the lighting department in my mind.  the lighting on the boxer is quite flat, and loses a lot of detail.  you did a fantastic job on the shadow.  I''ll be interested to see how you did it.  the spewing slobber was a nice touch :)<br/> <br/>P-ness</td>', 'great idea...little weak in the lighting department in my mind.  the lighting on the boxer is quite flat, and loses a lot of detail.  you did a fantastic job on the shadow.  I''ll be interested to see how you did it.  the spewing slobber was a nice touch :) P-ness', '2004-10-01 13:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(934657, 107202, 23653, '<td valign="top">Wow very nice I give her a 10 but the photo a 9.....</td>', 'Wow very nice I give her a 10 but the photo a 9.....', '2004-10-01 13:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(934660, 107365, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great detail in the gator and I really like color and blur of the water. You can just about feel the glide and stealth of this gator as it swims.  You''ve also captured very well the formidible look of the creature and wonder what prey it has it''s eyes on.  Cropping is a bit close on the snout but doesn''t detract all that much Very well done.  9</td>', 'Great detail in the gator and I really like color and blur of the water. You can just about feel the glide and stealth of this gator as it swims.  You''ve also captured very well the formidible look of the creature and wonder what prey it has it''s eyes on.  Cropping is a bit close on the snout but doesn''t detract all that much Very well done.  9', '2004-10-01 13:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(934661, 108872, 10686, '<td valign="top">WOW, those colors do POP -6</td>', 'WOW, those colors do POP -6', '2004-10-01 13:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(934666, 108233, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and sharpness.</td>', 'Great clarity and sharpness.', '2004-10-01 13:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(934668, 108233, 20204, '<td valign="top">This is a wild scene, and with the expression on the far left player''s face you definitely tripped the shutter at exactly the right time.  But, I can''t help but feel the cropping is too tight at the bottom.</td>', 'This is a wild scene, and with the expression on the far left player''s face you definitely tripped the shutter at exactly the right time.  But, I can''t help but feel the cropping is too tight at the bottom.', '2004-10-01 14:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(934674, 103615, 20204, '<td valign="top">Creative use of space - I like the tree obscuring the subject.  Great natural expression as well.  The problem for me is that the highlights in the background compete with the model''s face.  If you could have taken this image when the sun was less intense, and the histogram more compressed, I think it would have been amazing.</td>', 'Creative use of space - I like the tree obscuring the subject.  Great natural expression as well.  The problem for me is that the highlights in the background compete with the model''s face.  If you could have taken this image when the sun was less intense, and the histogram more compressed, I think it would have been amazing.', '2004-10-01 14:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(934679, 107969, 23653, '<td valign="top">Hmm makes me think of a martini glass picture....10</td>', 'Hmm makes me think of a martini glass picture....10', '2004-10-01 14:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(934687, 108569, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the leading lines and angling of this image as it takes your eyes from the lower right to the upper left.   Not sure why you chose B&amp;W for this image, though, as there is not enough tonal variation in this high contrast image to be truly interesting.  I think the color of the lighting would have made for more interesting contrasts. Also, the tree at the right adds nothing and I find it detracts. I think you should have cloned it out. 6</td>', 'I like the leading lines and angling of this image as it takes your eyes from the lower right to the upper left.   Not sure why you chose B&W for this image, though, as there is not enough tonal variation in this high contrast image to be truly interesting.  I think the color of the lighting would have made for more interesting contrasts. Also, the tree at the right adds nothing and I find it detracts. I think you should have cloned it out. 6', '2004-10-01 14:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(934689, 107202, 22734, '<td valign="top">Done to perfection with pose and outfit. The background very appropiate and the lighting is exquisite and enhances the edgyness in the image. 7</td>', 'Done to perfection with pose and outfit. The background very appropiate and the lighting is exquisite and enhances the edgyness in the image. 7', '2004-10-01 14:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(934692, 105190, 4517, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. Beautiful scene and perfectly blurred water. The pic has a fair bit of noise near the rock and looks as if you may have sharpened it after you added the border. Neatimage would be good. 9</td>', 'I really like this one. Beautiful scene and perfectly blurred water. The pic has a fair bit of noise near the rock and looks as if you may have sharpened it after you added the border. Neatimage would be good. 9', '2004-10-01 14:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(934694, 106953, 5585, '<td valign="top">One of My Top 5</td>', 'One of My Top 5', '2004-10-01 14:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(934696, 107397, 669, '<td valign="top">Congratulations - my only 10.</td>', 'Congratulations - my only 10.', '2004-10-01 14:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(934697, 108269, 5822, '<td valign="top">The layering of color is very good but I wonder what subject my eyes are supposed to rest on.  There isn''t much detail to see in the break of sun. Despite the division of this photo into horizontal thirds this scene seems static and somewhat sterile...almost lifeless. Also, the abundance of color does not provide me with any feeling as it''s too much stimulation without purpose. The sudden change in clouds from dark blue to dark grey also seems odd.  One more thing, the image appears to have been overly processed. Looks like too much PS burning and color shift was used. Sorry for the longwidedness of my comment.  6</td>', 'The layering of color is very good but I wonder what subject my eyes are supposed to rest on.  There isn''t much detail to see in the break of sun. Despite the division of this photo into horizontal thirds this scene seems static and somewhat sterile...almost lifeless. Also, the abundance of color does not provide me with any feeling as it''s too much stimulation without purpose. The sudden change in clouds from dark blue to dark grey also seems odd.  One more thing, the image appears to have been overly processed. Looks like too much PS burning and color shift was used. Sorry for the longwidedness of my comment.  6', '2004-10-01 14:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(934700, 108642, 5822, '<td valign="top">A couple of things I think you really did very well here is the exposure is excellent with the backlighting. Don''t know if you used fill lighting or some kind of reflection, but the girl''s faces are clearly visible and not dark at all.  Secondly, I like the way the dark bushes frame the photo and give the scene a kind of private look so that the view here is almost as if we''re spying on the girl''s private moment of prancing and playing about. What makes this picture for me is the way the light shines through the dress of the girl nearest to the cam. The grass seems oddly too yellowish/green, but still not a big deal and like the effect of it''s bright luminance. I think the scene lacks is some other main element, such as a fountain or gazebo to unite the girls in some kind of activity, because as it is now, they are to disconnected.  7</td>', 'A couple of things I think you really did very well here is the exposure is excellent with the backlighting. Don''t know if you used fill lighting or some kind of reflection, but the girl''s faces are clearly visible and not dark at all.  Secondly, I like the way the dark bushes frame the photo and give the scene a kind of private look so that the view here is almost as if we''re spying on the girl''s private moment of prancing and playing about. What makes this picture for me is the way the light shines through the dress of the girl nearest to the cam. The grass seems oddly too yellowish/green, but still not a big deal and like the effect of it''s bright luminance. I think the scene lacks is some other main element, such as a fountain or gazebo to unite the girls in some kind of activity, because as it is now, they are to disconnected.  7', '2004-10-01 14:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(934702, 109032, 24494, '<td valign="top">this is great 9</td>', 'this is great 9', '2004-10-01 14:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(934703, 108872, 26475, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot. It reminds me of Greece. Is it? I think I''d like it even better though, if it was just the window on the wall. Blocking out the lower left hand corner would do wonders for the composition.</td>', 'I like this image a lot. It reminds me of Greece. Is it? I think I''d like it even better though, if it was just the window on the wall. Blocking out the lower left hand corner would do wonders for the composition.', '2004-10-01 14:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(934715, 107901, 26475, '<td valign="top">I like it, but there''s nothing in pure focus. There''s the eyes of the Dragon Fly, and parts of the flower, but no one central point of focus, and it detracts from the beauty of this simple shot. Simple meaning simple beauty. Not in technique.</td>', 'I like it, but there''s nothing in pure focus. There''s the eyes of the Dragon Fly, and parts of the flower, but no one central point of focus, and it detracts from the beauty of this simple shot. Simple meaning simple beauty. Not in technique.', '2004-10-01 14:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(934726, 107969, 24494, '<td valign="top">this is so  amazing 10+ great shot</td>', 'this is so  amazing 10+ great shot', '2004-10-01 14:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(934741, 107586, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light, tone and treatment. I sense that there should be sadness here which is inferred by the title rather than visible in the image (despite the child''s distant expression). That doesn''t detract from an excellent and clearly competent shot.</td>', 'Beautiful light, tone and treatment. I sense that there should be sadness here which is inferred by the title rather than visible in the image (despite the child''s distant expression). That doesn''t detract from an excellent and clearly competent shot.', '2004-10-01 14:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(934745, 107599, 8860, '<td valign="top">A glacially still water may or may not have improved this - I don''t know. It''s a lovely time of day but it''s a shame that much of the beach is in shade, so I ccan''t help thinking that an evening shot may have been more effective. I''d also have removed the boundary markers too.<br/> <br/>Competent composition, but not a great deal to latch onto beyond the pretty scene.</td>', 'A glacially still water may or may not have improved this - I don''t know. It''s a lovely time of day but it''s a shame that much of the beach is in shade, so I ccan''t help thinking that an evening shot may have been more effective. I''d also have removed the boundary markers too. Competent composition, but not a great deal to latch onto beyond the pretty scene.', '2004-10-01 14:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(934746, 107902, 4008, '<td valign="top">A very special image, looks like it was painted with light with all those shadows and highlights.  I am curious how it looks without the partial desaturation, the way you have done it is very special, not concentrating on one single item, but maybe just a bit over the top, I am unsure. Anyway a visually fascinating image.</td>', 'A very special image, looks like it was painted with light with all those shadows and highlights.  I am curious how it looks without the partial desaturation, the way you have done it is very special, not concentrating on one single item, but maybe just a bit over the top, I am unsure. Anyway a visually fascinating image.', '2004-10-01 14:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(934748, 107387, 3087, '<td valign="top">They say that successful portraits should have direct eye contact. Well, this one doesn''t and I think it''s still great! It''s hard to know whether it would be improved even further by direct eye contact or whether that would change the mood too much. I really like the crispness of the foreground subject against the blurred background. I like the high contrast black and white. I like the strong vertical of his instrument and the way it''s echoed by that metal girder to the right. I like the detail of the open instrument case. This image makes me want to be able to hear him and that means it''s definitely communicated to me. 10</td>', 'They say that successful portraits should have direct eye contact. Well, this one doesn''t and I think it''s still great! It''s hard to know whether it would be improved even further by direct eye contact or whether that would change the mood too much. I really like the crispness of the foreground subject against the blurred background. I like the high contrast black and white. I like the strong vertical of his instrument and the way it''s echoed by that metal girder to the right. I like the detail of the open instrument case. This image makes me want to be able to hear him and that means it''s definitely communicated to me. 10', '2004-10-01 14:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(934749, 108767, 4008, '<td valign="top">Another fine example that it is worth it getting up early. Great early morning atmosphere, the first warm light above the cold morning mist. Lovely soft colors. I would have cropped away more of the front, not only is this part darker and attracts attention, it also contains this nasty little iron pole on the left. Just cropping it straight above the pole makes it better, in my opinion.</td>', 'Another fine example that it is worth it getting up early. Great early morning atmosphere, the first warm light above the cold morning mist. Lovely soft colors. I would have cropped away more of the front, not only is this part darker and attracts attention, it also contains this nasty little iron pole on the left. Just cropping it straight above the pole makes it better, in my opinion.', '2004-10-01 14:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(934758, 109032, 4008, '<td valign="top">I am sorry I am not really impressed with this one. It is a nice idea but does not really work for me. At first I thought the shadow was supposed to be hers, but now I understand it is not. The shadow is so big that it does not fit. Also the blur it causes across her body feels somehow strange. I do like the drops flying of her face, that''s a nice touch.</td>', 'I am sorry I am not really impressed with this one. It is a nice idea but does not really work for me. At first I thought the shadow was supposed to be hers, but now I understand it is not. The shadow is so big that it does not fit. Also the blur it causes across her body feels somehow strange. I do like the drops flying of her face, that''s a nice touch.', '2004-10-01 14:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(934760, 108569, 8054, '<td valign="top">Oh my god! I''ve taken almost the EXACT same picture with my F717! Except since mine came out a tad blurry, I added some noise and it made it look very nice. But I see you used a faster ISO setting and introduced noise anyway. I think it would look a lot better with some monochromatic noise to give it an old/European feel. Hard to describe but I really liked the way mine turned out although your focusing is better than mine. I would have cropped more off the bottom as the lights on the awnings are a bit distracting. 7</td>', 'Oh my god! I''ve taken almost the EXACT same picture with my F717! Except since mine came out a tad blurry, I added some noise and it made it look very nice. But I see you used a faster ISO setting and introduced noise anyway. I think it would look a lot better with some monochromatic noise to give it an old/European feel. Hard to describe but I really liked the way mine turned out although your focusing is better than mine. I would have cropped more off the bottom as the lights on the awnings are a bit distracting. 7', '2004-10-01 14:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(934765, 106488, 24494, '<td valign="top">so beautiful i''m in love</td>', 'so beautiful i''m in love', '2004-10-01 14:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(934767, 106953, 3087, '<td valign="top">A nice lowkey image with subtle lighting. I like the way the hair falls onto her face. I like your choice of cropping - taking off the top of her head brings us closer and creates a feeling of intimacy. I also like the non-centred composition. I''m not sure I like the way in which her hair merges into the background. 7 (<br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)</td>', 'A nice lowkey image with subtle lighting. I like the way the hair falls onto her face. I like your choice of cropping - taking off the top of her head brings us closer and creates a feeling of intimacy. I also like the non-centred composition. I''m not sure I like the way in which her hair merges into the background. 7 (//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)', '2004-10-01 14:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(934768, 108269, 8054, '<td valign="top">Technically a very good shot with just the right amount of overexposure on the sunlight but I feel the overall composition is strange and doesn''t feel right. If the sunlight was a bit lower on the horizon I think it would be better. Maybe even showing more sky/clouds vs shoreline as I personally feel that the clouds are more interesting than the ground. 6</td>', 'Technically a very good shot with just the right amount of overexposure on the sunlight but I feel the overall composition is strange and doesn''t feel right. If the sunlight was a bit lower on the horizon I think it would be better. Maybe even showing more sky/clouds vs shoreline as I personally feel that the clouds are more interesting than the ground. 6', '2004-10-01 14:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(934769, 103619, 4008, '<td valign="top">I see it has been validated and am curious to find out how it was done, it feels like extensive photoshopped but apparently is not. It is a nice idea and the posture of the man on the right is dynamic, good. The left one looks a bit static, with both feet flat on the ground and with such a tight crop. I think it general it could have done with some more space around it.</td>', 'I see it has been validated and am curious to find out how it was done, it feels like extensive photoshopped but apparently is not. It is a nice idea and the posture of the man on the right is dynamic, good. The left one looks a bit static, with both feet flat on the ground and with such a tight crop. I think it general it could have done with some more space around it.', '2004-10-01 14:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(934770, 106953, 24494, '<td valign="top">prefect</td>', 'prefect', '2004-10-01 14:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(934773, 108875, 3087, '<td valign="top">Pretty landscape and nice use of light. To me it lacks something in terms of pulling me into it, perhaps needs a focal point. Peaceful though. 7 (//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)</td>', 'Pretty landscape and nice use of light. To me it lacks something in terms of pulling me into it, perhaps needs a focal point. Peaceful though. 7 (//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)', '2004-10-01 14:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(934776, 107586, 24494, '<td valign="top">so much emotion here i love it</td>', 'so much emotion here i love it', '2004-10-01 14:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(934777, 109019, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a sweet portrait and I like the close crop that creates an intimacy between subject and viewer. I''m not a fan of soft focus effect so that doesn''t appeal to me. I''m also finding that her focus on the bubble that is so far to her side means it''s hard for me to see much detail in her eyes, and I''d like to. I wonder if it would be a stronger impact for me if she were looking at a bubble that were higher up? 6 (//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)</td>', 'This is a sweet portrait and I like the close crop that creates an intimacy between subject and viewer. I''m not a fan of soft focus effect so that doesn''t appeal to me. I''m also finding that her focus on the bubble that is so far to her side means it''s hard for me to see much detail in her eyes, and I''d like to. I wonder if it would be a stronger impact for me if she were looking at a bubble that were higher up? 6 (//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)', '2004-10-01 14:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(934779, 107387, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice and clear, lovely toning.  I like the way he''s holding his left hand, and how he looks at you as if he''s saying, "What do you want? I''m working."</td>', 'Nice and clear, lovely toning.  I like the way he''s holding his left hand, and how he looks at you as if he''s saying, "What do you want? I''m working."', '2004-10-01 14:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(934784, 106171, 3599, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the shallow depth of field as well.  Nice composition and lighting.  Not the most interesting picture but still well composed and nice capture (7).</td>', 'I like the colors and the shallow depth of field as well.  Nice composition and lighting.  Not the most interesting picture but still well composed and nice capture (7).', '2004-10-01 14:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(934789, 108897, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a well-taken portrait with lovely soft lighting, a good use of props, wonderful composition. The only thing that doesn''t work for me is her expression - I can''t tell what mood she''s in and hence I don''t connect with the portrait on an emotional level. Technically a beautiful portrait though. 7 (//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)</td>', 'This is a well-taken portrait with lovely soft lighting, a good use of props, wonderful composition. The only thing that doesn''t work for me is her expression - I can''t tell what mood she''s in and hence I don''t connect with the portrait on an emotional level. Technically a beautiful portrait though. 7 (//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)', '2004-10-01 14:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(934797, 108875, 3599, '<td valign="top">It is soft and I like that aspect but I think the haze in the sky ruins the picture a bit.   Nice tranquil landscape (6).</td>', 'It is soft and I like that aspect but I think the haze in the sky ruins the picture a bit.   Nice tranquil landscape (6).', '2004-10-01 14:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(934799, 108233, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the expression of the man on the left. That man, the ball and the small piece of grass are for me the main elements. I would have like to see a bit wider context. As your title already indicates, one cannot see where the ball is going, into the goal ? I find there is too much in between the ball and the man on the left, a fraction of a second earlier , with the ball in the middle, would have been better, but I realise that is easy to say but difficult to do.</td>', 'I like the expression of the man on the left. That man, the ball and the small piece of grass are for me the main elements. I would have like to see a bit wider context. As your title already indicates, one cannot see where the ball is going, into the goal ? I find there is too much in between the ball and the man on the left, a fraction of a second earlier , with the ball in the middle, would have been better, but I realise that is easy to say but difficult to do.', '2004-10-01 14:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(934800, 108569, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like the unusual viewpoint here and the inclusion of the fairylit tree in what would be neg space works well too. This has a weird inverted feel. Very interesting. 7 (//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)</td>', 'I really like the unusual viewpoint here and the inclusion of the fairylit tree in what would be neg space works well too. This has a weird inverted feel. Very interesting. 7 (//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)', '2004-10-01 14:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(934803, 108897, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice how this picture does give a warm feeling, even with all the greys and blacks and blues in it.  The frame is beautiful here.</td>', 'Nice how this picture does give a warm feeling, even with all the greys and blacks and blues in it.  The frame is beautiful here.', '2004-10-01 14:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(934804, 109019, 3599, '<td valign="top">This is a cute picture.  It reminds me of something taken in the 50s.  I imagine there was more then one bubble but she doesn''t seem to be captivated by the one in the picture.  That''s nit-picky I know but this is a great shot anyway (8).</td>', 'This is a cute picture.  It reminds me of something taken in the 50s.  I imagine there was more then one bubble but she doesn''t seem to be captivated by the one in the picture.  That''s nit-picky I know but this is a great shot anyway (8).', '2004-10-01 14:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(934805, 105190, 5112, '<td valign="top">Lovely water movement.  The colours are beautiful.</td>', 'Lovely water movement.  The colours are beautiful.', '2004-10-01 14:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(934808, 107387, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excellent duotone! Great contrast and focus especially on the jacket which looks like a nightmare to expose correctly. I''d crop this shot a bit differently, however. Starting with the upper left corner. Maybe crop the left side a small amount to eliminate that dark triangle. I''m suggesting this since you already cropped part of the case so a little bit more would not hurt the composition. Now for the right side. The dark part of the post needs to go as I feel it draws too much attention away from the man''s jacket. If you cropped right up to the gray portion of that post would be perfect. 8</td>', 'Excellent duotone! Great contrast and focus especially on the jacket which looks like a nightmare to expose correctly. I''d crop this shot a bit differently, however. Starting with the upper left corner. Maybe crop the left side a small amount to eliminate that dark triangle. I''m suggesting this since you already cropped part of the case so a little bit more would not hurt the composition. Now for the right side. The dark part of the post needs to go as I feel it draws too much attention away from the man''s jacket. If you cropped right up to the gray portion of that post would be perfect. 8', '2004-10-01 14:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(934815, 107609, 3599, '<td valign="top">I don''t the name of the technique used here but I like how his face, shoulder, and arm disappear in the shadow.  One thing I find too noticeable is the dodged eye and lips (5).</td>', 'I don''t the name of the technique used here but I like how his face, shoulder, and arm disappear in the shadow.  One thing I find too noticeable is the dodged eye and lips (5).', '2004-10-01 14:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(934816, 102660, 4008, '<td valign="top">Wow, her eyes draw all the attention, nice subtle coloring. I am not usually fond of partial saturation but the effect does work here, I am wondering whether it would be any less without the coloring. Good portrait, focus and depth of field is just perfect, as is the composition.</td>', 'Wow, her eyes draw all the attention, nice subtle coloring. I am not usually fond of partial saturation but the effect does work here, I am wondering whether it would be any less without the coloring. Good portrait, focus and depth of field is just perfect, as is the composition.', '2004-10-01 14:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(934817, 107969, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great stop action shot marred by that halo from masking and/or oversharpening. 6</td>', 'Great stop action shot marred by that halo from masking and/or oversharpening. 6', '2004-10-01 14:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(934820, 102660, 3599, '<td valign="top">NIce tight crop.  I can''t tell if you tried to use selective desat. here with the eyes.  Also, I like this because her face pops off the screen like a 3-D illusion. (6).</td>', 'NIce tight crop.  I can''t tell if you tried to use selective desat. here with the eyes.  Also, I like this because her face pops off the screen like a 3-D illusion. (6).', '2004-10-01 15:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(934821, 109014, 4008, '<td valign="top">A perfect bird portrait , I can''t think of anything that would improve it further.</td>', 'A perfect bird portrait , I can''t think of anything that would improve it further.', '2004-10-01 15:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(934822, 102660, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lovely portrait with intimacy created by the close crop. Nice angle to her face within the frame and hair frames her face very nicely. Earring adds nice detail. 7 (//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)</td>', 'A lovely portrait with intimacy created by the close crop. Nice angle to her face within the frame and hair frames her face very nicely. Earring adds nice detail. 7 (//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)', '2004-10-01 15:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(934823, 108843, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of patterned negative space. Love the details of the fluffy clouds and the mini sand bars in the water. I''m also impressed that you were able to capture the subtle hints of fog along the rock. Now for the negative. I feel there is almost too much negative space at the bottom of the frame but I understand you wanted to show the details of the water and sand. 9</td>', 'Excellent use of patterned negative space. Love the details of the fluffy clouds and the mini sand bars in the water. I''m also impressed that you were able to capture the subtle hints of fog along the rock. Now for the negative. I feel there is almost too much negative space at the bottom of the frame but I understand you wanted to show the details of the water and sand. 9', '2004-10-01 15:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(934827, 107969, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice warmth to the lighting and lovely reflections on the water. That blue bit on the left is a little odd - would prefer green (or blue) background throughout. Very strange. Quite funky! 7 (//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)</td>', 'Nice warmth to the lighting and lovely reflections on the water. That blue bit on the left is a little odd - would prefer green (or blue) background throughout. Very strange. Quite funky! 7 (//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)', '2004-10-01 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(934829, 104030, 4008, '<td valign="top">A very nice scene, a small waterfall with a peaceful and vibrant green surrounding. Such an image can help you relax after a long workweek. The longer I look the more I appreciate the subtleness of the scene, it is not overwhelming, just beautiful.</td>', 'A very nice scene, a small waterfall with a peaceful and vibrant green surrounding. Such an image can help you relax after a long workweek. The longer I look the more I appreciate the subtleness of the scene, it is not overwhelming, just beautiful.', '2004-10-01 15:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(934835, 108986, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the decision to crop in close on three sides but include a small sliver of background on left. Nice detail in feathers. Would love to see a catchlight in eyes. 7 (//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)</td>', 'I like the decision to crop in close on three sides but include a small sliver of background on left. Nice detail in feathers. Would love to see a catchlight in eyes. 7 (//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)', '2004-10-01 15:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(934836, 106488, 25525, '<td valign="top">How did you get the infared look?  Love the photo!</td>', 'How did you get the infared look?  Love the photo!', '2004-10-01 15:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(934842, 108995, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the candid nature and the atmospheric lighting and grain. That said, would still prefer a touch more detail to his nearer eye. 7 (//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)</td>', 'I like the candid nature and the atmospheric lighting and grain. That said, would still prefer a touch more detail to his nearer eye. 7 (//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&FORUM_THREAD_ID=129433)', '2004-10-01 15:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(934843, 103615, 4008, '<td valign="top">A beautiful portrait of a beautiful girl. I especially like it how her green eyes match the color of the tree in front and leaves in the background. The flash does create a bit flat light and removes all shadow, could maybe have been a little less.</td>', 'A beautiful portrait of a beautiful girl. I especially like it how her green eyes match the color of the tree in front and leaves in the background. The flash does create a bit flat light and removes all shadow, could maybe have been a little less.', '2004-10-01 15:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(934850, 107202, 3599, '<td valign="top">I found all of the background elements to very distracting.  Other then that it isn''t a bad photo (6).</td>', 'I found all of the background elements to very distracting.  Other then that it isn''t a bad photo (6).', '2004-10-01 15:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
