(934868, 107969, 3599, '<td valign="top">This is one of the coolest shots in the challenge.  Did you flip the picture upside down?  Cool colors and lighting (10).</td>', 'This is one of the coolest shots in the challenge.  Did you flip the picture upside down?  Cool colors and lighting (10).', '2004-10-01 15:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(934869, 104030, 3087, '<td valign="top">This image has grown on me each as I''ve viewed it again and again during voting. I think it''s the composition that''s particularly strong - the inclusion of just the right amount of foliage at left and grass and tree at the right creates a strong composition. The detail is really nice. 8</td>', 'This image has grown on me each as I''ve viewed it again and again during voting. I think it''s the composition that''s particularly strong - the inclusion of just the right amount of foliage at left and grass and tree at the right creates a strong composition. The detail is really nice. 8', '2004-10-01 15:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
