(935018, 102742, 16301, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea, I like the message too. The desat job really works. (9)<br/> <br/>Good luck...<br/></td>', 'Awesome idea, I like the message too. The desat job really works. (9) Good luck...', '2004-10-01 16:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
