(935027, 106707, 16301, '<td valign="top">Bobster? Beautiful colors and composition, the light is so awesome. I''ve seen this before, but not as a challenge entry ;)<br/> <br/>(10) Good luck...</td>', 'Bobster? Beautiful colors and composition, the light is so awesome. I''ve seen this before, but not as a challenge entry ;) (10) Good luck...', '2004-10-01 16:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
