(935032, 103105, 20204, '<td valign="top">The lighting is more dramatic than I''m used to seeing on wildlife prints, but I *really* like it.  You''ve not only captured a subject of natural history, but you''ve done so in an artistic manner.  Great work!</td>', 'The lighting is more dramatic than I''m used to seeing on wildlife prints, but I *really* like it.  You''ve not only captured a subject of natural history, but you''ve done so in an artistic manner.  Great work!', '2004-10-01 16:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
