(935035, 109031, 22239, '<td valign="top">Cool subject... good job keeping the shutter speed nice and short to get nice, defined drops but keeping the subject sharp from front to back, even with the wide aperture required for the shot.  The smooth, white marble, transitioning to a darker color looks almost like the water bearer is coming to life in real flesh through the marble, particularly around the shoulder.</td>', 'Cool subject... good job keeping the shutter speed nice and short to get nice, defined drops but keeping the subject sharp from front to back, even with the wide aperture required for the shot.  The smooth, white marble, transitioning to a darker color looks almost like the water bearer is coming to life in real flesh through the marble, particularly around the shoulder.', '2004-10-01 16:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(935036, 106953, 16301, '<td valign="top">I''m really lovin the hair! Very cool colors...</td>', 'I''m really lovin the hair! Very cool colors...', '2004-10-01 16:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(935037, 107300, 20539, '<td valign="top">very good use of fading the white on the sides... this must be the first time that technique fits perfectly...<br/>im sure the bride is very happy with a picture like this! if not already done, i would suggest ordering her one through dpcprints =)</td>', 'very good use of fading the white on the sides... this must be the first time that technique fits perfectly...im sure the bride is very happy with a picture like this! if not already done, i would suggest ordering her one through dpcprints =)', '2004-10-01 16:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
