(935040, 103219, 22239, '<td valign="top">Clean, simple shot with smooth skin tones and good detail.  The edge of the towel is a little washed out, and the reflection on her lip gloss is somewhat distracting.  The dark background has some unintelligible detail that''s a little distracting to my eye.</td>', 'Clean, simple shot with smooth skin tones and good detail.  The edge of the towel is a little washed out, and the reflection on her lip gloss is somewhat distracting.  The dark background has some unintelligible detail that''s a little distracting to my eye.', '2004-10-01 16:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(935043, 107969, 20539, '<td valign="top">the only thing that really dissapoints me here is the blurred haris of the kiwi on the top part. that would take a minute to fix, and make the image perfect. im a big fan of mushroom art, so this is going into my favorites. great idea and capture!</td>', 'the only thing that really dissapoints me here is the blurred haris of the kiwi on the top part. that would take a minute to fix, and make the image perfect. im a big fan of mushroom art, so this is going into my favorites. great idea and capture!', '2004-10-01 16:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(935044, 108872, 16301, '<td valign="top">I''m really lovin this abstract! I would have cloned out the stuff in the lower left because it balances the composition for me. Great job! (8)</td>', 'I''m really lovin this abstract! I would have cloned out the stuff in the lower left because it balances the composition for me. Great job! (8)', '2004-10-01 16:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
