(935049, 108767, 22239, '<td valign="top">Tough shot to catch... the bright light of the sunrise can really overpower the image and make the foreground underexposed, but you manage a good compromise here.  The color reflected in the fog is a neat effect.  Gradient density filters can really help with shots like this, allowing you to get a bit more exposure and detail in the foreground without washing out the sky colors.</td>', 'Tough shot to catch... the bright light of the sunrise can really overpower the image and make the foreground underexposed, but you manage a good compromise here.  The color reflected in the fog is a neat effect.  Gradient density filters can really help with shots like this, allowing you to get a bit more exposure and detail in the foreground without washing out the sky colors.', '2004-10-01 16:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(935050, 107599, 20539, '<td valign="top">overexposure fits very well here! looks liek its gonna be a nice day!</td>', 'overexposure fits very well here! looks liek its gonna be a nice day!', '2004-10-01 16:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(935051, 107300, 3575, '<td valign="top">I love the lightness, the symetry the overall composition. The bride is beautifully posed to sho off her beautiful train and her beautiful face. I think it is slightly overexposed and I don''t care from the fog effect on the sides of th photo very much, I think it''s because it''s too square but on the other hand, it give the feeling of floating in the clouds. If I was this bride, I''d hug you for days for this photo. 8</td>', 'I love the lightness, the symetry the overall composition. The bride is beautifully posed to sho off her beautiful train and her beautiful face. I think it is slightly overexposed and I don''t care from the fog effect on the sides of th photo very much, I think it''s because it''s too square but on the other hand, it give the feeling of floating in the clouds. If I was this bride, I''d hug you for days for this photo. 8', '2004-10-01 16:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(935052, 108843, 4008, '<td valign="top">I have seen this rock before (zoomdak ?), but never in such an atmosphere. I love the blue. I love the wide space around it this time, the low tide and the sand pattern. The image gives plenty of space to look around in, while also providing a resting point in form of the rock. The moon in between the clouds is a nice touch as well, good timing.</td>', 'I have seen this rock before (zoomdak ?), but never in such an atmosphere. I love the blue. I love the wide space around it this time, the low tide and the sand pattern. The image gives plenty of space to look around in, while also providing a resting point in form of the rock. The moon in between the clouds is a nice touch as well, good timing.', '2004-10-01 16:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(935053, 108276, 12332, '<td valign="top">nice composition and drama in the sky, and great exposure</td>', 'nice composition and drama in the sky, and great exposure', '2004-10-01 16:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
