(935055, 104027, 24846, '<td valign="top">It appears that I am looking at an eye.  Ilike the arc of the balcony and how the structure pulls me into the center. Nice work. I can''t imagin what or where this structure is. Great study of such an interesting perspective.</td>', 'It appears that I am looking at an eye.  Ilike the arc of the balcony and how the structure pulls me into the center. Nice work. I can''t imagin what or where this structure is. Great study of such an interesting perspective.', '2004-10-01 16:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
