(935059, 104027, 3575, '<td valign="top">Yes! What an awesome shot! DOF is perfect, I love the exposure too. You could have easily lost the detail of the outer edges in the shadows but you didn''t and I applaud you for that. I will be interested in how you did this, on your back, on a tripod...</td>', 'Yes! What an awesome shot! DOF is perfect, I love the exposure too. You could have easily lost the detail of the outer edges in the shadows but you didn''t and I applaud you for that. I will be interested in how you did this, on your back, on a tripod...', '2004-10-01 16:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
