(935076, 107995, 22239, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot.  The veritcal wall detail directly behind her head is a bit distracting, but the alignment and skin tone match really makes you double-take this shot.  Lighting is solid, neutral color choice on the hair, furniture, and room (whether done naturally or with desaturation) keeps the focus in the right place.</td>', 'Very cute shot.  The veritcal wall detail directly behind her head is a bit distracting, but the alignment and skin tone match really makes you double-take this shot.  Lighting is solid, neutral color choice on the hair, furniture, and room (whether done naturally or with desaturation) keeps the focus in the right place.', '2004-10-01 16:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
