(935098, 103788, 14863, '<td valign="top">This is great! There''s such detail and mood- I love how moody and crispt the colors are. I love tat there''s a sail and not much else. This is awesome, great job! 10</td>', 'This is great! There''s such detail and mood- I love how moody and crispt the colors are. I love tat there''s a sail and not much else. This is awesome, great job! 10', '2004-10-01 16:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(935099, 107387, 4482, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning candid shot! from a 9 to a 10! The tonal rage is impressive and the choice of B&amp;W is idealfor this shot. I don''t know how I could improve this! great job!!</td>', 'This is a stunning candid shot! from a 9 to a 10! The tonal rage is impressive and the choice of B&W is idealfor this shot. I don''t know how I could improve this! great job!!', '2004-10-01 16:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(935102, 108843, 22239, '<td valign="top">The pattern in the foreground, whatever it is, is really neat!  The rock formations have a great symmetry, both laterally (with the two smaller formations balanced on either side) and vertically (against the reflections in the water).  Moving the horizon up or down a bit (perhaps to a thirds line?) would give us even more of that foreground pattern, or more of those puffy clouds.</td>', 'The pattern in the foreground, whatever it is, is really neat!  The rock formations have a great symmetry, both laterally (with the two smaller formations balanced on either side) and vertically (against the reflections in the water).  Moving the horizon up or down a bit (perhaps to a thirds line?) would give us even more of that foreground pattern, or more of those puffy clouds.', '2004-10-01 16:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(935103, 106707, 14863, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is great- I love how the sky is so strong and you can see the castle so strongly against the background. The grass is so crisp and the details are amazing- this is awesome 9</td>', 'Wow, this is great- I love how the sky is so strong and you can see the castle so strongly against the background. The grass is so crisp and the details are amazing- this is awesome 9', '2004-10-01 16:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(935104, 106953, 3280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Sharpness of focus is outstanding as is the lightng and contrast.  I like the composition as well.   A perfect shot to show "rule of thirds" to new photographers and how it works.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Sharpness of focus is outstanding as is the lightng and contrast.  I like the composition as well.   A perfect shot to show "rule of thirds" to new photographers and how it works.', '2004-10-01 16:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(935107, 108843, 4482, '<td valign="top">This say ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh to me. :-) I think that the 50-50 split works well here and the color range is quite soothing.  Th elight and dark side, even though subtle, balance out quite nicely. Good job! 9</td>', 'This say ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh to me. :-) I think that the 50-50 split works well here and the color range is quite soothing.  Th elight and dark side, even though subtle, balance out quite nicely. Good job! 9', '2004-10-01 16:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(935108, 109019, 14863, '<td valign="top">This is great- I love her expression, its priceless. The colors are so nice The muted colors make this photo. She''s so cute! 9</td>', 'This is great- I love her expression, its priceless. The colors are so nice The muted colors make this photo. She''s so cute! 9', '2004-10-01 16:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(935109, 108642, 22239, '<td valign="top">Soft focus gives this a sort of dreamlike feel, and the use of shadow on the right side of the shot helps to complete a frame with the treeline in the background and the branches to the left.  The composition seems crowded, and slightly imbalanced with the bench where it is.  Also, without a bottom edge to your natural framing, it seems somewhat topheavy.  Croppign it tighter on the bottom might alleviate that, but you run the risk of getting to close to the girl''s shadow.</td>', 'Soft focus gives this a sort of dreamlike feel, and the use of shadow on the right side of the shot helps to complete a frame with the treeline in the background and the branches to the left.  The composition seems crowded, and slightly imbalanced with the bench where it is.  Also, without a bottom edge to your natural framing, it seems somewhat topheavy.  Croppign it tighter on the bottom might alleviate that, but you run the risk of getting to close to the girl''s shadow.', '2004-10-01 16:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(935114, 103105, 16301, '<td valign="top">Awesome, I really love the light here, its what makes this shot really special. Great job and good luck!</td>', 'Awesome, I really love the light here, its what makes this shot really special. Great job and good luck!', '2004-10-01 16:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(935118, 106707, 4482, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors thus visually stimulating.  The composition is splendid and the PS work ia awsome. The only reason I can''t give you a ten is that the oversaturated orange  doesn''t quite seem to fit the light intensity on the building.</td>', 'Stunning colors thus visually stimulating.  The composition is splendid and the PS work ia awsome. The only reason I can''t give you a ten is that the oversaturated orange  doesn''t quite seem to fit the light intensity on the building.', '2004-10-01 16:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(935119, 107599, 22239, '<td valign="top">Smooth shot, exposed enough to get texture in the sand, with the footsteps.  The overexposure on the left, though, really overpowers the image.  Although this might be intentional (when considering the title), it seems to be a bit much.</td>', 'Smooth shot, exposed enough to get texture in the sand, with the footsteps.  The overexposure on the left, though, really overpowers the image.  Although this might be intentional (when considering the title), it seems to be a bit much.', '2004-10-01 16:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(935120, 107902, 14863, '<td valign="top">This is so cool- the desaturation creates such a nostalgic modd and there''s such great symmetry. I love the mood it gives and how much detail there is. It''d be absolutely prefect if the lighting was more even but I still love it, great job<br/>9</td>', 'This is so cool- the desaturation creates such a nostalgic modd and there''s such great symmetry. I love the mood it gives and how much detail there is. It''d be absolutely prefect if the lighting was more even but I still love it, great job9', '2004-10-01 16:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(935122, 108276, 14863, '<td valign="top">This is so good- I love how the leaves are so crisp and the details are so perfect. The sky is great and there is such a mood, so  relaxing. Awesome, love it!<br/>9</td>', 'This is so good- I love how the leaves are so crisp and the details are so perfect. The sky is great and there is such a mood, so  relaxing. Awesome, love it!9', '2004-10-01 16:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
