(935128, 105966, 14863, '<td valign="top">This is amazing- I love that there''s sillouhettes of the other balloons but the lighting is so perfect on the one balloon. The colors are so calming and muted- there''s such a mood, great job! 9</td>', 'This is amazing- I love that there''s sillouhettes of the other balloons but the lighting is so perfect on the one balloon. The colors are so calming and muted- there''s such a mood, great job! 9', '2004-10-01 16:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(935130, 108995, 3280, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure EVERYONE will like it but I really enjoy the grain in this shot.  It might be cropped just a bit too tight at the top but I  like it alot!</td>', 'I''m not sure EVERYONE will like it but I really enjoy the grain in this shot.  It might be cropped just a bit too tight at the top but I  like it alot!', '2004-10-01 16:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(935131, 107969, 22239, '<td valign="top">Wow.  The lighting here is great (from the top, judging from the reflection toward the right), and the detail on the kiwi fuzz is spot-on.  The shape of the water seems so unnatural,  but the dynamic motion of the shot, coupled with the internal reflections of the kiwi''s innards throughout the water adds a "splash" of color that balances everything perfectly.  The blue area toward the lower left seems a bit incongruous.</td>', 'Wow.  The lighting here is great (from the top, judging from the reflection toward the right), and the detail on the kiwi fuzz is spot-on.  The shape of the water seems so unnatural,  but the dynamic motion of the shot, coupled with the internal reflections of the kiwi''s innards throughout the water adds a "splash" of color that balances everything perfectly.  The blue area toward the lower left seems a bit incongruous.', '2004-10-01 16:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(935132, 108872, 14863, '<td valign="top">I really love this one- I love the colors, the complimentary colors are so strong and give such a mood. It''s be even more perfect if t hat little sun thingy wasn''t there but it''s still really great- so calming and interesting. Great job! 9</td>', 'I really love this one- I love the colors, the complimentary colors are so strong and give such a mood. It''s be even more perfect if t hat little sun thingy wasn''t there but it''s still really great- so calming and interesting. Great job! 9', '2004-10-01 16:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(935133, 108991, 4482, '<td valign="top">Purity and simplicity at it''s best! My fav nature shot of the challenge. a 9 from me.  The composition is superbe and the tonal range is pleasing to the eye. Maybe adding a slight tint (blue, magenta or sepia) would envoke stronger emotions??? But just nit-picking here! Great shot!</td>', 'Purity and simplicity at it''s best! My fav nature shot of the challenge. a 9 from me.  The composition is superbe and the tonal range is pleasing to the eye. Maybe adding a slight tint (blue, magenta or sepia) would envoke stronger emotions??? But just nit-picking here! Great shot!', '2004-10-01 16:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(935134, 108986, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice,  although I wonder if you had cropped out the left eye and that side of the face if having everything in focus might have worked even better.  Color is excellent.</td>', 'Very nice,  although I wonder if you had cropped out the left eye and that side of the face if having everything in focus might have worked even better.  Color is excellent.', '2004-10-01 16:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(935135, 103619, 22239, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, good play on words.  The lighting and contrast are well managed, and it certainly has "how did you do it?" written all over it.  <br/></td>', 'Neat shot, good play on words.  The lighting and contrast are well managed, and it certainly has "how did you do it?" written all over it.  ', '2004-10-01 16:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
