(935154, 107202, 4482, '<td valign="top">Well well well mister Dude!!! Est-ce ton nouveau bar que je vois là?!?!? :-) Super bell photo as always.... je pense qu''elle aurait eu un petit impact de plus si elle était en train de faire une fonction de maid (épousetter, vaccum....) Très sexy! Great job my friend! :-)</td>', 'Well well well mister Dude!!! Est-ce ton nouveau bar que je vois là?!?!? :-) Super bell photo as always.... je pense qu''elle aurait eu un petit impact de plus si elle était en train de faire une fonction de maid (épousetter, vaccum....) Très sexy! Great job my friend! :-)', '2004-10-01 16:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(935155, 103788, 22239, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.  Contrast and exposure are perfect.  The clouds are impressive, and the clarity of the lines, and the shadows against the sail manage to create a true sense of the complexity aloft on a vessel.  At once, the sepia tone gives an older feel, while the clarity of the shot gives a distinctly modern, mathematical, geometric feel.</td>', 'Wonderful shot.  Contrast and exposure are perfect.  The clouds are impressive, and the clarity of the lines, and the shadows against the sail manage to create a true sense of the complexity aloft on a vessel.  At once, the sepia tone gives an older feel, while the clarity of the shot gives a distinctly modern, mathematical, geometric feel.', '2004-10-01 16:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(935156, 105190, 25906, '<td valign="top">Amazing, these colors are so beautiful. ~10~<br/>I feel so warm and cozy when I look at this photo, I wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'Amazing, these colors are so beautiful. ~10~I feel so warm and cozy when I look at this photo, I wouldn''t change a thing.', '2004-10-01 16:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
