(935181, 108269, 20375, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. What an opportune moment provided here for a unique shot.<br/>I''m wondering if the light is a little overexposed....regardless it has an almost uneartly feel to it....warm. You get an 8 from me. Thank-you for the beautiful image.</td>', 'Very nice image. What an opportune moment provided here for a unique shot.I''m wondering if the light is a little overexposed....regardless it has an almost uneartly feel to it....warm. You get an 8 from me. Thank-you for the beautiful image.', '2004-10-01 16:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
