(935184, 108537, 4482, '<td valign="top">All in all this is a vrey good shot. It is sharp and soft at the same time and the tonal range is great. Some might complain about the hot spot in the hair but I don''t find it distracting. There are a couple things that, to me, lack to make this photo a ten. 1- if this is role-play then she would need a different wardrobe to fit the character. 2- her expression lacks conviction to create the proper mood set forth with the gun. <br/> <br/>Good job!</td>', 'All in all this is a vrey good shot. It is sharp and soft at the same time and the tonal range is great. Some might complain about the hot spot in the hair but I don''t find it distracting. There are a couple things that, to me, lack to make this photo a ten. 1- if this is role-play then she would need a different wardrobe to fit the character. 2- her expression lacks conviction to create the proper mood set forth with the gun.  Good job!', '2004-10-01 16:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
