(935188, 103219, 3280, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, the small amount of dress or towel in the lower right makes it.  Sometimes it is better to see a bit of clothing than none at all.  It can actually be more alluring as it is in this shot.  I like the lips in the upper corner as well.</td>', 'Wonderful, the small amount of dress or towel in the lower right makes it.  Sometimes it is better to see a bit of clothing than none at all.  It can actually be more alluring as it is in this shot.  I like the lips in the upper corner as well.', '2004-10-01 16:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(935190, 107586, 20375, '<td valign="top">Very strong image here. Lovely tonal range..no overexposed areas, great focus.<br/>Your subject conveys feeling to the viewer as well.<br/>Very, very well done</td>', 'Very strong image here. Lovely tonal range..no overexposed areas, great focus.Your subject conveys feeling to the viewer as well.Very, very well done', '2004-10-01 16:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
