(935240, 107202, 22239, '<td valign="top">Gotta'' be DrJones... another beautiful model, and racy, but tasteful costume.  The use of subdued color in the background, with a red backdrop to match her hair, manages to bring a balance to the composition that wouldn''t exist otherwise.  Great capture of the skin tones and smooth, graceful lines of your model.</td>', 'Gotta'' be DrJones... another beautiful model, and racy, but tasteful costume.  The use of subdued color in the background, with a red backdrop to match her hair, manages to bring a balance to the composition that wouldn''t exist otherwise.  Great capture of the skin tones and smooth, graceful lines of your model.', '2004-10-01 17:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(935241, 108995, 24896, '<td valign="top">I''m sure that others have told you already the he is playing a bass not a guitar. Other then that I really like the hard light on his hand and the soft light on his face it draws some attention to his expression but the lighting on his hand really amplifies where his attention is at. And the noise adds a great mood to this pic.</td>', 'I''m sure that others have told you already the he is playing a bass not a guitar. Other then that I really like the hard light on his hand and the soft light on his face it draws some attention to his expression but the lighting on his hand really amplifies where his attention is at. And the noise adds a great mood to this pic.', '2004-10-01 17:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(935243, 106171, 3280, '<td valign="top">My favorite animal and a wonderul photo of him.  Focus is excellent.  I wonder what it would have looked like a little less centered.  The only nit I have is the light coloring behind his head on the left.   Great shot.</td>', 'My favorite animal and a wonderul photo of him.  Focus is excellent.  I wonder what it would have looked like a little less centered.  The only nit I have is the light coloring behind his head on the left.   Great shot.', '2004-10-01 17:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
