(935315, 106707, 25347, '<td valign="top">Just an absolutely amazing photo!  I love the contrast in the clouds, between the blue sky and the orange. 9</td>', 'Just an absolutely amazing photo!  I love the contrast in the clouds, between the blue sky and the orange. 9', '2004-10-01 17:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
