(935321, 109014, 25347, '<td valign="top">I love the detail in the feathers.  When I was in Australia I couldn''t capture one of these little buggers, and I was very dissappointed.  Great clarity, excellent shot. 7</td>', 'I love the detail in the feathers.  When I was in Australia I couldn''t capture one of these little buggers, and I was very dissappointed.  Great clarity, excellent shot. 7', '2004-10-01 17:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(935325, 107365, 25347, '<td valign="top">I like the way the water reflects the background, and though there''s not much you could''ve done to change it (I understand how shooting animals is) I think it would''ve been a nice effect if the ripples from his movement were more visible.  6</td>', 'I like the way the water reflects the background, and though there''s not much you could''ve done to change it (I understand how shooting animals is) I think it would''ve been a nice effect if the ripples from his movement were more visible.  6', '2004-10-01 17:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(935328, 108897, 25347, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite see how this photo says warmth.  The basket and the leaves are nce, but the white background, her shirt and headband sort of deduct of the warmness of the prior elements.  5</td>', 'I don''t quite see how this photo says warmth.  The basket and the leaves are nce, but the white background, her shirt and headband sort of deduct of the warmness of the prior elements.  5', '2004-10-01 17:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(935331, 106953, 25347, '<td valign="top">Excellent Portrait!  The black and white really draws the subject out.  7</td>', 'Excellent Portrait!  The black and white really draws the subject out.  7', '2004-10-01 17:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(935333, 103219, 25347, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if I understand this photo, really.  It is an interesting composition, it just doesn''t appeal to me.  The rigid abruptness of the collar bone takes away from the lips and the shirt.  Perhaps the shot might be better taken of her back and have her looking over her shoulder?  also, I think the hair that is visible distracts.  5</td>', 'I''m not sure if I understand this photo, really.  It is an interesting composition, it just doesn''t appeal to me.  The rigid abruptness of the collar bone takes away from the lips and the shirt.  Perhaps the shot might be better taken of her back and have her looking over her shoulder?  also, I think the hair that is visible distracts.  5', '2004-10-01 17:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(935334, 108991, 3599, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the challenge.  Not much else to say except good work (10).</td>', 'One of the best in the challenge.  Not much else to say except good work (10).', '2004-10-01 17:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(935337, 109013, 25347, '<td valign="top">Good image, the sepia really adds to the compostion.  If only the powerline were cropped out!  6</td>', 'Good image, the sepia really adds to the compostion.  If only the powerline were cropped out!  6', '2004-10-01 17:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
