(935341, 107902, 25347, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you''ve excentuated the certain colors on the building.  It keeps the viewer interested  My only comment would be that some of the colorized whites look blue.  6</td>', 'I really like the way you''ve excentuated the certain colors on the building.  It keeps the viewer interested  My only comment would be that some of the colorized whites look blue.  6', '2004-10-01 17:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
