(935343, 106953, 3599, '<td valign="top">Her face really stands out, nice DOF and I like the B&amp;W.  Certainly one of better shots this week.  Nice job (10).</td>', 'Her face really stands out, nice DOF and I like the B&W.  Certainly one of better shots this week.  Nice job (10).', '2004-10-01 17:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(935345, 108984, 25347, '<td valign="top">This is a great image.  The texture in the stem and the fine detail in the pepper show that there''s more to even the simplest objects.  Good choice of background color, too. 8</td>', 'This is a great image.  The texture in the stem and the fine detail in the pepper show that there''s more to even the simplest objects.  Good choice of background color, too. 8', '2004-10-01 17:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(935346, 108122, 3599, '<td valign="top">Nice expression on Ethan''s face.  Great DOF, love the B&amp;W (9).</td>', 'Nice expression on Ethan''s face.  Great DOF, love the B&W (9).', '2004-10-01 17:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(935347, 108875, 25347, '<td valign="top">The picture is nice but the grass seems a little dark and grainy.  Also, I''m not too fond of the pale yellow color in the sky, though I like the difference between the sky and the reflection in the Loch.  6</td>', 'The picture is nice but the grass seems a little dark and grainy.  Also, I''m not too fond of the pale yellow color in the sky, though I like the difference between the sky and the reflection in the Loch.  6', '2004-10-01 17:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(935348, 108537, 25347, '<td valign="top">The portrait makes her look like one of the classy stars from the 30s and 40s. My only problem is the carpet shirt and the chain around her neck.  6</td>', 'The portrait makes her look like one of the classy stars from the 30s and 40s. My only problem is the carpet shirt and the chain around her neck.  6', '2004-10-01 17:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
