(935355, 108986, 25347, '<td valign="top">Another marvelous bird photo!  The detail on this is outstanding.  I have trouble capturing birds eyes, but it is clear that you don''t.  I love the detail in the feathers and eyes, I wish I could see more of the right eye though.  7</td>', 'Another marvelous bird photo!  The detail on this is outstanding.  I have trouble capturing birds eyes, but it is clear that you don''t.  I love the detail in the feathers and eyes, I wish I could see more of the right eye though.  7', '2004-10-01 18:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
