(935362, 109032, 25347, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, it''s creative.  I imagine you shot through an etched transparency, blurring the shape of the fighter?  My onlyproblem is you lose a lof of detail in the live fighter.  Maybe you could''ve placed the transparency on a projector and shot it on the wall from an angle where the girl would not blurred?  Of course, I couldn''t say, I''ve never tried it.  7</td>', 'I like this photo, it''s creative.  I imagine you shot through an etched transparency, blurring the shape of the fighter?  My onlyproblem is you lose a lof of detail in the live fighter.  Maybe you could''ve placed the transparency on a projector and shot it on the wall from an angle where the girl would not blurred?  Of course, I couldn''t say, I''ve never tried it.  7', '2004-10-01 18:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(935363, 107876, 25347, '<td valign="top">This shot makes me hungry!  The only think I disslike about this shot is that its too white.  I thought at first it would do well against a black background, but that would cancel the pristine effect it creates and void the "nice" part of the title.  6</td>', 'This shot makes me hungry!  The only think I disslike about this shot is that its too white.  I thought at first it would do well against a black background, but that would cancel the pristine effect it creates and void the "nice" part of the title.  6', '2004-10-01 18:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(935365, 108940, 25347, '<td valign="top">This is a very creative shot.  I don''t know that I would''ve used a light source that is that yellow.  Maybe a whiter source and a lighter background?  6</td>', 'This is a very creative shot.  I don''t know that I would''ve used a light source that is that yellow.  Maybe a whiter source and a lighter background?  6', '2004-10-01 18:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(935367, 103105, 25347, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!  I love capturing animals, and you''ve done a good job doing that here.  I wish the background were lighter, though.  7</td>', 'This is a great shot!  I love capturing animals, and you''ve done a good job doing that here.  I wish the background were lighter, though.  7', '2004-10-01 18:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(935368, 108872, 25347, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but the colors are so vibrant, it would look better without the sun and it''s surroundings.  Good use of off center composition, however I feel like I''m drawn between two subjects. 6.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but the colors are so vibrant, it would look better without the sun and it''s surroundings.  Good use of off center composition, however I feel like I''m drawn between two subjects. 6.', '2004-10-01 18:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(935369, 107387, 16301, '<td valign="top">Very nice street candid, I really like the tone. I''ve never seen that type of instrument. Great job (8)</td>', 'Very nice street candid, I really like the tone. I''ve never seen that type of instrument. Great job (8)', '2004-10-01 18:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(935400, 109019, 255, '<td valign="top">she could not be any cuter! my favorite part about this shot is her reflection in the bubble. very cool! :)</td>', 'she could not be any cuter! my favorite part about this shot is her reflection in the bubble. very cool! :)', '2004-10-01 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(935404, 106488, 3032, '<td valign="top">One of the interesting things with IR is that it sometimes turns into this wonderful winter wonder land. That''s what happened here, very nice.</td>', 'One of the interesting things with IR is that it sometimes turns into this wonderful winter wonder land. That''s what happened here, very nice.', '2004-10-01 18:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(935406, 106171, 12332, '<td valign="top">fine picture of a beautiful bird - top feathers are alittle overexposed, but the sharpness is fantastic</td>', 'fine picture of a beautiful bird - top feathers are alittle overexposed, but the sharpness is fantastic', '2004-10-01 18:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
