(935410, 108995, 19978, '<td valign="top">Or perhaps "bassist, but who knew? Nice effect with the BW and grain. I also like the tightness of the crop. Really good photo.</td>', 'Or perhaps "bassist, but who knew? Nice effect with the BW and grain. I also like the tightness of the crop. Really good photo.', '2004-10-01 18:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(935411, 107599, 12332, '<td valign="top">nice reflections and ripples - the sky is bright for "first light" - overall pleasing effect, but the darks are little too dark, and the lights are a little too light</td>', 'nice reflections and ripples - the sky is bright for "first light" - overall pleasing effect, but the darks are little too dark, and the lights are a little too light', '2004-10-01 18:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(935412, 107387, 12332, '<td valign="top">interesting composition with nice tones and candid facial expression</td>', 'interesting composition with nice tones and candid facial expression', '2004-10-01 18:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(935415, 107902, 12332, '<td valign="top">wow what a throwback!  composition is really balanced, so I assume that''s what you were shooting for- it works</td>', 'wow what a throwback!  composition is really balanced, so I assume that''s what you were shooting for- it works', '2004-10-01 18:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(935416, 108832, 19978, '<td valign="top">Extremely beautiful sunset (rise?) and wonderful capture of the crepuscular rays. I also like the way you''ve captured the gentle curve of the beach. An outstanding photo, but unfortunately, it does not really stand out from the pack.</td>', 'Extremely beautiful sunset (rise?) and wonderful capture of the crepuscular rays. I also like the way you''ve captured the gentle curve of the beach. An outstanding photo, but unfortunately, it does not really stand out from the pack.', '2004-10-01 18:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(935417, 106488, 26394, '<td valign="top">just beutifull!!!</td>', 'just beutifull!!!', '2004-10-01 18:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(935418, 108995, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is obviously a picture taken by a talented photographer.  It''s emotive and I think you pulled off the feel you wanted.   I gave it a 5, however, because my personal tastes are just not drawn to the grainy look of it, and I would have liked it better if his entire head were in the picture.</td>', 'This is obviously a picture taken by a talented photographer.  It''s emotive and I think you pulled off the feel you wanted.   I gave it a 5, however, because my personal tastes are just not drawn to the grainy look of it, and I would have liked it better if his entire head were in the picture.', '2004-10-01 18:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(935421, 105647, 12332, '<td valign="top">lack of mid-tones hurts the photo, in my opinion - great sharpness and light-area detail - overall effect is pleasing</td>', 'lack of mid-tones hurts the photo, in my opinion - great sharpness and light-area detail - overall effect is pleasing', '2004-10-01 18:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(935425, 106931, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.   I love the blue color of the water, and the reflections of the banks in the water.   The sky is great -- nice pretty clouds, which can be hard to catch sometimes.  I gave this one an 8</td>', 'This is beautiful.   I love the blue color of the water, and the reflections of the banks in the water.   The sky is great -- nice pretty clouds, which can be hard to catch sometimes.  I gave this one an 8', '2004-10-01 18:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(935427, 103619, 12332, '<td valign="top">cool idea - glad it''s validated!  Nicely executed - could you have had a shadow cast by the left self?</td>', 'cool idea - glad it''s validated!  Nicely executed - could you have had a shadow cast by the left self?', '2004-10-01 18:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
