(935464, 102660, 3575, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of colorized images so the blue eyes trouble me. Other than that (I know, I should have started out on a positive note, sorry ''bout that) The portrait is gorgeous. Wonderful soft light without any shadows. I''ve been staring at her baby blues trying to see if you used a reflector and I think you did. Very lovely girl, a redhead? I''d love to see a true color photo of her sometime.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of colorized images so the blue eyes trouble me. Other than that (I know, I should have started out on a positive note, sorry ''bout that) The portrait is gorgeous. Wonderful soft light without any shadows. I''ve been staring at her baby blues trying to see if you used a reflector and I think you did. Very lovely girl, a redhead? I''d love to see a true color photo of her sometime.', '2004-10-01 18:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(935467, 106931, 12332, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors and dramatic clouds - maybe could have lightened some of the midtones in the marsh grass</td>', 'beautiful colors and dramatic clouds - maybe could have lightened some of the midtones in the marsh grass', '2004-10-01 18:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
