(935542, 105984, 3599, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I don''t find this very interesting.  It isn''t a bad photo but it looks like a normal butterfly photo to me (4).</td>', 'I''m sorry but I don''t find this very interesting.  It isn''t a bad photo but it looks like a normal butterfly photo to me (4).', '2004-10-01 19:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(935543, 106707, 3575, '<td valign="top">A bit too much ps work for my taste but it is a striking image - with a surreal look.</td>', 'A bit too much ps work for my taste but it is a striking image - with a surreal look.', '2004-10-01 19:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(935544, 108984, 3599, '<td valign="top">I like the color and the texture.  Other than that it isn''t a very interesting photo (4).</td>', 'I like the color and the texture.  Other than that it isn''t a very interesting photo (4).', '2004-10-01 19:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(935546, 108979, 3575, '<td valign="top">Weren''t you amazed at the different patters you got? I am. What a wonderful composition. I''ll have to do home and try it :)</td>', 'Weren''t you amazed at the different patters you got? I am. What a wonderful composition. I''ll have to do home and try it :)', '2004-10-01 19:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(935547, 108992, 3599, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a very interesting photo.  Technically it isn''t bad but it just doesn''t stand out amoung the other photos in this challenge (4).</td>', 'This isn''t a very interesting photo.  Technically it isn''t bad but it just doesn''t stand out amoung the other photos in this challenge (4).', '2004-10-01 19:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(935549, 108940, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2004-10-01 19:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(935552, 109032, 3599, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you used some sort of transperancy for this?  Vey interesting concept (6).</td>', 'I''m guessing you used some sort of transperancy for this?  Vey interesting concept (6).', '2004-10-01 19:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(935554, 102742, 3599, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  I like the message and I like the selective desat. (9)</td>', 'Very nice photo.  I like the message and I like the selective desat. (9)', '2004-10-01 19:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(935556, 107488, 20941, '<td valign="top">I think you did a great job conveying your impression of this scene. The b/w, the cropping, the position of the chair all done with precision. Nice job IMO.</td>', 'I think you did a great job conveying your impression of this scene. The b/w, the cropping, the position of the chair all done with precision. Nice job IMO.', '2004-10-01 19:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(935559, 108269, 3599, '<td valign="top">I think you may have played around with PS a little too much on this one.  It is an interesting photo but too much post processing for my taste (5).</td>', 'I think you may have played around with PS a little too much on this one.  It is an interesting photo but too much post processing for my taste (5).', '2004-10-01 19:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(935561, 108269, 20941, '<td valign="top">nice capture of land, sea and sky.</td>', 'nice capture of land, sea and sky.', '2004-10-01 19:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(935562, 103105, 4536, '<td valign="top">This is beautifully highlighted, only wish their eyes had catchlight in them.</td>', 'This is beautifully highlighted, only wish their eyes had catchlight in them.', '2004-10-01 19:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(935564, 107387, 3599, '<td valign="top">Very nice candid and nice shallow DOF.  It may have a little too much USM applied but other than that not bad (7).</td>', 'Very nice candid and nice shallow DOF.  It may have a little too much USM applied but other than that not bad (7).', '2004-10-01 19:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(935565, 102742, 5728, '<td valign="top">Perfect photo! This is one that stands out and the work you have put into it has paid off more than well, all I can say is WOW!. Wonderful lighting, composition and  post processing. The girl''s stance is very natural, amazing, I would give it an 11 if I could, but I can''t so a 10 will have to suffice! It has a kind of Sonifo feel to it :)</td>', 'Perfect photo! This is one that stands out and the work you have put into it has paid off more than well, all I can say is WOW!. Wonderful lighting, composition and  post processing. The girl''s stance is very natural, amazing, I would give it an 11 if I could, but I can''t so a 10 will have to suffice! It has a kind of Sonifo feel to it :)', '2004-10-01 19:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(935567, 109031, 20941, '<td valign="top">Great capture of all the tiny water droplets, masterfully done! Beautiful subject.</td>', 'Great capture of all the tiny water droplets, masterfully done! Beautiful subject.', '2004-10-01 19:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(935569, 107202, 4536, '<td valign="top">Dr. Jones written all over it. Beautifully done. Only wish I knew what she was bending over for (besides the camera)  :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-08 13:00:11.</i></td>', 'Dr. Jones written all over it. Beautifully done. Only wish I knew what she was bending over for (besides the camera)  :)', '2004-10-01 19:31:28.000000', '2004-10-08 14:00:11.000000', 1),
(935575, 108924, 3599, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful sky but obvious post processing is distracting (5).</td>', 'Really beautiful sky but obvious post processing is distracting (5).', '2004-10-01 19:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(935577, 107300, 20941, '<td valign="top">Stunning wedding photo that I''m sure would more than please a client. Wow, well done.</td>', 'Stunning wedding photo that I''m sure would more than please a client. Wow, well done.', '2004-10-01 19:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(935578, 102742, 4536, '<td valign="top">Awesome setup. Well thoughout and executed well. A ten.</td>', 'Awesome setup. Well thoughout and executed well. A ten.', '2004-10-01 19:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(935579, 107091, 7778, '<td valign="top">Outstanding, simple, surreal - a perfect example of classic photography.<br/> <br/>I  feel profoundly exhilarated by this unexpected find: a timeless subject which never ceases to excite the imagination, a distinctly deliberate composition, which makes cosmic child''s play out of our endeavors, a wonderful detached perspective, something rarely present in contemporary photography.<br/> <br/>The dynamic between the near-silhouetted men, accentuated by both intervals and lines is deliciously contrasted with the slumped pose of the flyer hanging from his precarious perch. Even the exposure, trimmed to the sky, where the action is, renders a fine gradation of tones -tangibly. <br/> <br/>The portrait format, apt to more than this purpose, employs the whole vertical expanse of sky (all the gauze-like subtlety of it) to counter-weigh the silhouetted base of the image. The effect, although not new, has been so nearly forgotten that, at least to me, seeing it resurrected here so simply feels dramatically new and fresh.<br/> <br/>The title, too, moves me like a 24-karat surrealist hyperbole :-), nevertheless distinctly consistent with the visual manner of this remarkable capture.<br/> <br/>I have not given out a 10 in about a year or so. Here it is.<br/>-Use it wisely. ;-)</td>', 'Outstanding, simple, surreal - a perfect example of classic photography. I  feel profoundly exhilarated by this unexpected find: a timeless subject which never ceases to excite the imagination, a distinctly deliberate composition, which makes cosmic child''s play out of our endeavors, a wonderful detached perspective, something rarely present in contemporary photography. The dynamic between the near-silhouetted men, accentuated by both intervals and lines is deliciously contrasted with the slumped pose of the flyer hanging from his precarious perch. Even the exposure, trimmed to the sky, where the action is, renders a fine gradation of tones -tangibly.  The portrait format, apt to more than this purpose, employs the whole vertical expanse of sky (all the gauze-like subtlety of it) to counter-weigh the silhouetted base of the image. The effect, although not new, has been so nearly forgotten that, at least to me, seeing it resurrected here so simply feels dramatically new and fresh. The title, too, moves me like a 24-karat surrealist hyperbole :-), nevertheless distinctly consistent with the visual manner of this remarkable capture. I have not given out a 10 in about a year or so. Here it is.-Use it wisely. ;-)', '2004-10-01 19:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(935580, 108984, 20941, '<td valign="top">Great composition and colors, you''ve made a work of art of an ordinary veggie. Well done.</td>', 'Great composition and colors, you''ve made a work of art of an ordinary veggie. Well done.', '2004-10-01 19:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(935582, 109013, 4536, '<td valign="top">The walk to where? Something starnge about this shot, gives me a feeling of doom for the kids. Nice tones, but wish the power lines/poles weren''t there.</td>', 'The walk to where? Something starnge about this shot, gives me a feeling of doom for the kids. Nice tones, but wish the power lines/poles weren''t there.', '2004-10-01 19:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(935583, 106707, 20941, '<td valign="top">beautiful storybook like scene!</td>', 'beautiful storybook like scene!', '2004-10-01 19:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(935585, 107902, 4536, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of toning. Good subject to use your skills on. Looks like a minature version of the real thing or fake somehow, perhaps it''s the toning or the ground.</td>', 'Excellent use of toning. Good subject to use your skills on. Looks like a minature version of the real thing or fake somehow, perhaps it''s the toning or the ground.', '2004-10-01 19:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(935586, 103619, 3599, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you achieved this.  I like it and yet I don''t like it.  I can''t explain why, but if I figure it out I''ll repost a comment (5).<br/>Just wanted to add that I like the concept but I don''t like how you split the body in half.</td>', 'I don''t know how you achieved this.  I like it and yet I don''t like it.  I can''t explain why, but if I figure it out I''ll repost a comment (5).Just wanted to add that I like the concept but I don''t like how you split the body in half.', '2004-10-01 19:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(935588, 108072, 20941, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this portrait shot! Masterfully done Your subject must be over joyed.</td>', 'I love the composition of this portrait shot! Masterfully done Your subject must be over joyed.', '2004-10-01 19:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(935589, 108122, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent work, you pulled in an amazing tonal range here. I know you spent a lot of time on this image, but you know what makes it such a good image? That you can''t see at all that you have spent so much time post processing it. You did a very good job working the eyes, just enough dodging to keep the details in, especially around he white of the eyes, where a lot of people tend to dodge far too much detal out of them. My hat off to you, I want this one to ribbon!</td>', 'Excellent work, you pulled in an amazing tonal range here. I know you spent a lot of time on this image, but you know what makes it such a good image? That you can''t see at all that you have spent so much time post processing it. You did a very good job working the eyes, just enough dodging to keep the details in, especially around he white of the eyes, where a lot of people tend to dodge far too much detal out of them. My hat off to you, I want this one to ribbon!', '2004-10-01 19:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(935594, 107586, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  Please don''t take it bad, but I wonder about the out of focus hand in front; to my eyes it takes away from an otherwise excellent shot.  But it is one of the best shots IMO in this challenge.</td>', 'Good shot.  Please don''t take it bad, but I wonder about the out of focus hand in front; to my eyes it takes away from an otherwise excellent shot.  But it is one of the best shots IMO in this challenge.', '2004-10-01 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(935596, 104030, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, great greens.</td>', 'Beautiful composition, great greens.', '2004-10-01 19:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(935599, 109032, 5112, '<td valign="top">I was wondering how this had been done, then I noticed the "shadow" is in front of the woman, and it''s transparent.  Nicely done!  Love the bubbles coming out of the shadow''s mouth.</td>', 'I was wondering how this had been done, then I noticed the "shadow" is in front of the woman, and it''s transparent.  Nicely done!  Love the bubbles coming out of the shadow''s mouth.', '2004-10-01 19:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(935600, 103788, 5112, '<td valign="top">Great sky, wonderful angle.</td>', 'Great sky, wonderful angle.', '2004-10-01 19:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
