(935635, 106707, 4536, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I get the feeling that this had major reconstuctive surgery though  :)<br/>Still a very nice piece of eye candy.</td>', 'Beautiful. I get the feeling that this had major reconstuctive surgery though  :)Still a very nice piece of eye candy.', '2004-10-01 20:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
