(935980, 103788, 22010, '<td valign="top">The color here is wonderful. The composition is imo, the most striking and best one in the competition. I hope you ribbon. One of mine if I were the judge. 10.</td>', 'The color here is wonderful. The composition is imo, the most striking and best one in the competition. I hope you ribbon. One of mine if I were the judge. 10.', '2004-10-01 23:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(935981, 106953, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/> <br/>This is a wonderful tone study with one minor flaw. Dark eyes, and these are beautiful, will be sought by the viewer. The hair across the pupil interferes with their shape because hair, eyebrows and shadows are in the same zone. It also steals the catchlight which low key images need.<br/> <br/> <br/>Yet, this is a very appealing and almost mystical study with great tonal vitality and superbly captured essence. The lips are a delight with immaculate highlights and the hair is just flowing and framing the lovely and pensive face. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments. This is a wonderful tone study with one minor flaw. Dark eyes, and these are beautiful, will be sought by the viewer. The hair across the pupil interferes with their shape because hair, eyebrows and shadows are in the same zone. It also steals the catchlight which low key images need.  Yet, this is a very appealing and almost mystical study with great tonal vitality and superbly captured essence. The lips are a delight with immaculate highlights and the hair is just flowing and framing the lovely and pensive face. Bumping up.', '2004-10-01 23:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(935982, 108276, 3306, '<td valign="top">your picture has an eery yet solemn mood. The light on the trees is wonderfully contrasted by the clouds fortelling a coming storm. Very nice capture.</td>', 'your picture has an eery yet solemn mood. The light on the trees is wonderfully contrasted by the clouds fortelling a coming storm. Very nice capture.', '2004-10-01 23:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
