(935987, 107969, 22010, '<td valign="top">Great composition! I''m sure this took many tries and you definitely thought it through. I''m just wondering what the blue thing in the lower left hand corner is. :D Good luck. 10.</td>', 'Great composition! I''m sure this took many tries and you definitely thought it through. I''m just wondering what the blue thing in the lower left hand corner is. :D Good luck. 10.', '2004-10-01 23:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
