(935989, 107365, 10686, '<td valign="top">Big lizard with sharp teeth.  I''m sure he''s looking at you and thinking " hey, that guy would make a fine dinner" -7</td>', 'Big lizard with sharp teeth.  I''m sure he''s looking at you and thinking " hey, that guy would make a fine dinner" -7', '2004-10-01 23:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(935990, 108173, 17304, '<td valign="top">THe whitish shine across the eye detracts from the photo in my opinion..It makes the eye appear more out of focus than it really is. How did you get him to sit so still to pose though? Nice macro</td>', 'THe whitish shine across the eye detracts from the photo in my opinion..It makes the eye appear more out of focus than it really is. How did you get him to sit so still to pose though? Nice macro', '2004-10-01 23:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(935991, 103788, 3306, '<td valign="top">A terrific angle for this shot. It feels as if this great ship is out to sea. The choice of B&amp;W is an excellent one and helps to accent the feeling you are trying to get across.</td>', 'A terrific angle for this shot. It feels as if this great ship is out to sea. The choice of B&W is an excellent one and helps to accent the feeling you are trying to get across.', '2004-10-01 23:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
