(935993, 103619, 17304, '<td valign="top">will be looking forward to knowing how this photo was set up!! Nice job!</td>', 'will be looking forward to knowing how this photo was set up!! Nice job!', '2004-10-01 23:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(935994, 108843, 22010, '<td valign="top">If I were there, I''d probably be so awe struck that I wouldn''t know how to work the camera into auto, let alone take a great shot like this. The blue is very appealing to me and the title gives it a wonderful context. Top 5 picture in the challenge IMO. 9.</td>', 'If I were there, I''d probably be so awe struck that I wouldn''t know how to work the camera into auto, let alone take a great shot like this. The blue is very appealing to me and the title gives it a wonderful context. Top 5 picture in the challenge IMO. 9.', '2004-10-01 23:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(935995, 109032, 22010, '<td valign="top">Wow. I can''t wait to see your explanation on how you did this. The composition is startling. I love it!</td>', 'Wow. I can''t wait to see your explanation on how you did this. The composition is startling. I love it!', '2004-10-01 23:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
