(936001, 104027, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very interesting lines, curves and shadows. Excellent DOF. I will be interested to read about this building and where it is. I am trying to figure out what that brick building is doing here. Great shot.</td>', 'Very interesting lines, curves and shadows. Excellent DOF. I will be interested to read about this building and where it is. I am trying to figure out what that brick building is doing here. Great shot.', '2004-10-01 23:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
