(936022, 107300, 17304, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful bridal portrait....my eye keeps going to the bottom of the photo though because that is where everything is in focus...the soft white in front of her head is not working for me....But I am sure this is a potrait that she is going to cherish forever. 9</td>', 'This is a beautiful bridal portrait....my eye keeps going to the bottom of the photo though because that is where everything is in focus...the soft white in front of her head is not working for me....But I am sure this is a potrait that she is going to cherish forever. 9', '2004-10-02 00:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
