(936056, 108843, 10275, '<td valign="top">I wish I could give you 11 for this shot. This is one of the best photos on DPC. Love the patterns in the sands and the subtle reflections. This kind of photo I would definitely hang on my wall.</td>', 'I wish I could give you 11 for this shot. This is one of the best photos on DPC. Love the patterns in the sands and the subtle reflections. This kind of photo I would definitely hang on my wall.', '2004-10-02 00:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
