(936386, 107969, 22689, '<td valign="top">I love so much the textures , it''s like I could touch it..Great job !<br/>I still don''t know if the blue color is a bit destracting or not ! My vote : 9 .</td>', 'I love so much the textures , it''s like I could touch it..Great job !I still don''t know if the blue color is a bit destracting or not ! My vote : 9 .', '2004-10-02 06:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
