(936388, 107599, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot, but in my opinion a bit too bright on the left hand side. I like the footprints in the sand, as they add a littl;e extra interest. 7</td>', 'This is a very nice shot, but in my opinion a bit too bright on the left hand side. I like the footprints in the sand, as they add a littl;e extra interest. 7', '2004-10-02 06:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
