(936403, 107202, 2780, '<td valign="top">I don''t really know what to say about this. It looks very professional with great lighting and good DoF. I think showing the face side on a little more would be nice, but my guess is the face isn''t the subject of the photo :P   8</td>', 'I don''t really know what to say about this. It looks very professional with great lighting and good DoF. I think showing the face side on a little more would be nice, but my guess is the face isn''t the subject of the photo :P   8', '2004-10-02 06:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
