(936418, 103189, 2780, '<td valign="top">In my opinion there is too much black space in this photo. A much closer crop on the lightning would drastically improve it. 6</td>', 'In my opinion there is too much black space in this photo. A much closer crop on the lightning would drastically improve it. 6', '2004-10-02 07:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(936419, 108872, 26455, '<td valign="top">clean, dont really get the window and the yellow subject, are you trying to say something here ?</td>', 'clean, dont really get the window and the yellow subject, are you trying to say something here ?', '2004-10-02 07:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(936420, 108537, 26455, '<td valign="top">love your lightings</td>', 'love your lightings', '2004-10-02 07:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(936421, 108940, 2780, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this is very effective, bringing out the nice colours of the flowers, which go really well with your choice of background colour. I don''t really like your eneven border though, because it''s too thin and not a very nice colour in my opinion. 6</td>', 'The lighting in this is very effective, bringing out the nice colours of the flowers, which go really well with your choice of background colour. I don''t really like your eneven border though, because it''s too thin and not a very nice colour in my opinion. 6', '2004-10-02 07:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(936422, 109031, 26455, '<td valign="top">i feel his pain. good shot</td>', 'i feel his pain. good shot', '2004-10-02 07:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(936423, 107609, 2780, '<td valign="top">This has great lighting and the sepia works very well. The composition within the frame is great too. 8</td>', 'This has great lighting and the sepia works very well. The composition within the frame is great too. 8', '2004-10-02 07:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(936424, 103219, 26455, '<td valign="top">a wider shot would be nicer, the models face is a bit oddly cropped</td>', 'a wider shot would be nicer, the models face is a bit oddly cropped', '2004-10-02 07:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(936425, 108979, 26455, '<td valign="top">nice vases but the composition can be more intesting, a bit oddly spaced</td>', 'nice vases but the composition can be more intesting, a bit oddly spaced', '2004-10-02 07:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(936426, 108995, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like grain in photos but in this case I think it is slightly too much. Without grain the photo would lose it''s atmosphere, but a little less than this would look better. Also, I think boosting the contrast a fair amount would make this a lot better. 5</td>', 'I like grain in photos but in this case I think it is slightly too much. Without grain the photo would lose it''s atmosphere, but a little less than this would look better. Also, I think boosting the contrast a fair amount would make this a lot better. 5', '2004-10-02 07:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(936427, 108991, 26455, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot love your tones</td>', 'beautiful shot love your tones', '2004-10-02 07:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(936428, 108984, 26455, '<td valign="top">a bit tight on the composition, a bit more blue breathing space would be nicer. nice shot though</td>', 'a bit tight on the composition, a bit more blue breathing space would be nicer. nice shot though', '2004-10-02 07:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(936429, 107387, 26455, '<td valign="top">nice shot<br/></td>', 'nice shot', '2004-10-02 07:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(936430, 108269, 2780, '<td valign="top">The clouds and overexposed sun looks really dramatic, but then the bottom of the photo spoils it, I think, by being so plain. A crop before the shoreline would improve this a lot I think, and having a boat or something to add a little interest in the expanse of water would help too. 6</td>', 'The clouds and overexposed sun looks really dramatic, but then the bottom of the photo spoils it, I think, by being so plain. A crop before the shoreline would improve this a lot I think, and having a boat or something to add a little interest in the expanse of water would help too. 6', '2004-10-02 07:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(936431, 103788, 26455, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, beautiful tones<br/></td>', 'interesting shot, beautiful tones', '2004-10-02 07:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(936432, 107901, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the DoF is slightly too shallow, but other than that this is a really good shot. The bright colours are great, and the composition, although centered, works really well in this case. 9</td>', 'I think the DoF is slightly too shallow, but other than that this is a really good shot. The bright colours are great, and the composition, although centered, works really well in this case. 9', '2004-10-02 07:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(936433, 107969, 26455, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, a bit overplayed in ps though, color saturation slightly too rich, looks fake and plasticy. but in a good way. beautiful composition and techniqic used</td>', 'interesting shot, a bit overplayed in ps though, color saturation slightly too rich, looks fake and plasticy. but in a good way. beautiful composition and techniqic used', '2004-10-02 07:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
