(936450, 107995, 3306, '<td valign="top">What a clever and original picture. It lines up perfectly even to the eyebrow. It is simple but very effective. Well done</td>', 'What a clever and original picture. It lines up perfectly even to the eyebrow. It is simple but very effective. Well done', '2004-10-02 07:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(936452, 108872, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely captured colorful and interesting picture. nicely place and well executed. Good job.</td>', 'This is a nicely captured colorful and interesting picture. nicely place and well executed. Good job.', '2004-10-02 07:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(936457, 108275, 3306, '<td valign="top">Its hard to say what that expression is in Gorilla language but he looks very sad to me but who knows! Very nice portrait. Its interesting that you chose to do it in B&amp;W. I like it. I would like to see the color version to compare. Nicely focused and the subject is well placed in the frame.</td>', 'Its hard to say what that expression is in Gorilla language but he looks very sad to me but who knows! Very nice portrait. Its interesting that you chose to do it in B&W. I like it. I would like to see the color version to compare. Nicely focused and the subject is well placed in the frame.', '2004-10-02 07:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(936459, 108122, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones and facial expression. Narrow DOF really helps to isolate the sharp focus on the eyes and very good catchlight in the eyes, as well. 7</td>', 'Wonderful tones and facial expression. Narrow DOF really helps to isolate the sharp focus on the eyes and very good catchlight in the eyes, as well. 7', '2004-10-02 07:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(936461, 107387, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites. I love the spontaneity of your shot, the position of the subject and the expression on his face. The backround is perfectly out of focus and there are no distracting elements. Great shot.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites. I love the spontaneity of your shot, the position of the subject and the expression on his face. The backround is perfectly out of focus and there are no distracting elements. Great shot.', '2004-10-02 07:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(936465, 106707, 3306, '<td valign="top">This picture really grabs the viewers attention. The colors and lighting are wonderful. It has an almost eery feeling to it. It seems as if this would be a popular tourist spot and yet you were able to capture it without people around it. I would be interest to know where it is.</td>', 'This picture really grabs the viewers attention. The colors and lighting are wonderful. It has an almost eery feeling to it. It seems as if this would be a popular tourist spot and yet you were able to capture it without people around it. I would be interest to know where it is.', '2004-10-02 07:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(936466, 107969, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is one of those very fun HDYDI (how did you do it) pictures. I am looking forward to reading your description. Very well done. Original and colorful.</td>', 'This is one of those very fun HDYDI (how did you do it) pictures. I am looking forward to reading your description. Very well done. Original and colorful.', '2004-10-02 07:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(936468, 104134, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice subdued and naturally lit portrait of this very pretty young lady with good focus and catchlight on the eyes. Light appears just slightly too strong as you''ve lost some detail in the forehead and cheeks.  Low contrast gives a nice quiet feel. 7</td>', 'Nice subdued and naturally lit portrait of this very pretty young lady with good focus and catchlight on the eyes. Light appears just slightly too strong as you''ve lost some detail in the forehead and cheeks.  Low contrast gives a nice quiet feel. 7', '2004-10-02 07:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(936470, 108122, 3306, '<td valign="top">A wonderful expression on your young models face. Its nice to see one where the face is dirty and not staged! He is all boy. Great capture.</td>', 'A wonderful expression on your young models face. Its nice to see one where the face is dirty and not staged! He is all boy. Great capture.', '2004-10-02 07:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(936472, 104134, 3306, '<td valign="top">A nicely softened simply posed and straight forward portrait and a very pretty young lady.</td>', 'A nicely softened simply posed and straight forward portrait and a very pretty young lady.', '2004-10-02 07:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(936475, 106931, 3306, '<td valign="top">This just simply just a beautiful landscape shot. The DOF, positioning and nature''s elements come together to make a picture that is a pleasure to look at. Well done.</td>', 'This just simply just a beautiful landscape shot. The DOF, positioning and nature''s elements come together to make a picture that is a pleasure to look at. Well done.', '2004-10-02 07:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(936478, 107902, 3306, '<td valign="top">What a wonderfully cluttered and interesting shot of americana. I can just imagine riding down the street and seeing this. I would have to stop the car, get out, and just look at it for a while until I had taken it all in. The lighting, placement and subject matter is excellent. Great capture</td>', 'What a wonderfully cluttered and interesting shot of americana. I can just imagine riding down the street and seeing this. I would have to stop the car, get out, and just look at it for a while until I had taken it all in. The lighting, placement and subject matter is excellent. Great capture', '2004-10-02 07:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(936480, 105647, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a good picture but its not special. The building is not very sharp. I think I would have liked it better if you had gotten closer so the viewer could see more detail and this extraordinary building was more of the picture. The rest of the backround and foreground are interesting from a negative space point of view, but IMHO it takes away from the picture.</td>', 'This is a good picture but its not special. The building is not very sharp. I think I would have liked it better if you had gotten closer so the viewer could see more detail and this extraordinary building was more of the picture. The rest of the backround and foreground are interesting from a negative space point of view, but IMHO it takes away from the picture.', '2004-10-02 07:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(936482, 108924, 5822, '<td valign="top">Looks to me to be a special place where heaven touches earth.  Really like the contrasts here of color and how the luminance of the sky is brough out even more with the silhouette and low-key tonality of the image in general.  I do wish the hill had some undulating shapes for variation and I would have also liked to have seen the person standing off center.  Other than that, a very dramatic image. Well done.  8</td>', 'Looks to me to be a special place where heaven touches earth.  Really like the contrasts here of color and how the luminance of the sky is brough out even more with the silhouette and low-key tonality of the image in general.  I do wish the hill had some undulating shapes for variation and I would have also liked to have seen the person standing off center.  Other than that, a very dramatic image. Well done.  8', '2004-10-02 07:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(936484, 108269, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a good picture but I feel it could have been composed a little differently to make it more interesting. Maybe if the subject was off to the side instead of the middle. Aside from that congratulations on winning 2 ribbons. That speaks alot to your talent as a photographer. I will look forward to seeing your other pictures.</td>', 'This is a good picture but I feel it could have been composed a little differently to make it more interesting. Maybe if the subject was off to the side instead of the middle. Aside from that congratulations on winning 2 ribbons. That speaks alot to your talent as a photographer. I will look forward to seeing your other pictures.', '2004-10-02 07:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(936490, 103615, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful creamy skin and nice focus on the eyes with good catchlight. Looks to me like there is some slight tint of green to her left chin and under her neck.  I like the behind the tree composition and DOF too. 7</td>', 'Beautiful creamy skin and nice focus on the eyes with good catchlight. Looks to me like there is some slight tint of green to her left chin and under her neck.  I like the behind the tree composition and DOF too. 7', '2004-10-02 08:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(936492, 107902, 26930, '<td valign="top">Holy crap, one of the best compositions I have ever seen using desaturation.... :)</td>', 'Holy crap, one of the best compositions I have ever seen using desaturation.... :)', '2004-10-02 08:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(936494, 108991, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love the mysterious and mystical feel of this image. The tones are great and it''s coloring looks like an old style tinted picture.  8</td>', 'I love the mysterious and mystical feel of this image. The tones are great and it''s coloring looks like an old style tinted picture.  8', '2004-10-02 08:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(936504, 108984, 15920, '<td valign="top">I never know what to think about the highlights at 100%.  The one at the top is a little distracting and the others seem fine to me.  Everything else is perfect.</td>', 'I never know what to think about the highlights at 100%.  The one at the top is a little distracting and the others seem fine to me.  Everything else is perfect.', '2004-10-02 08:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(936505, 108872, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great balance and colors.  The subject might not capture the interest as some of the other shots.</td>', 'Great balance and colors.  The subject might not capture the interest as some of the other shots.', '2004-10-02 08:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(936506, 103619, 15920, '<td valign="top">Truly a great example of what can be done in editing.  I also think that the concept is fablous.  Toss in nearly perfect lighting, and my bet is that this is a very strong entry.</td>', 'Truly a great example of what can be done in editing.  I also think that the concept is fablous.  Toss in nearly perfect lighting, and my bet is that this is a very strong entry.', '2004-10-02 08:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
