(936530, 108454, 25347, '<td valign="top">I love the vibrant blue color of the sky.  If really does a good jub contrasting with the totems.  I also like the bushes to the left of the shorter one.  7</td>', 'I love the vibrant blue color of the sky.  If really does a good jub contrasting with the totems.  I also like the bushes to the left of the shorter one.  7', '2004-10-02 09:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
