(936604, 107995, 20364, '<td valign="top">I gave you a ten.  Very well executed photo.  More importantly you thought about what you wanted to do and it was setup and composed perfectly.  I have only been into photography since May of this year, and its photos like this that keep me inspired.  A 10!</td>', 'I gave you a ten.  Very well executed photo.  More importantly you thought about what you wanted to do and it was setup and composed perfectly.  I have only been into photography since May of this year, and its photos like this that keep me inspired.  A 10!', '2004-10-02 10:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(936605, 106707, 26115, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!<br/>you have gr8 balance and contrast throughout and it would be sheer nitpicking to try point something out that is really wrong with this photo...       <br/>so just for the sake of it the nitpicking would most probably be with the horizon... IMHO it rather strange towards the far right of the photo to see the gap so different in that small section... the horizon being rather dark and light creates a large contrast so possibly look at cloning some of the horizon out or something of the sort.... but as i said overall ur photo is amazing and it would be real nitpicking to go to such depths</td>', 'I love this photo!you have gr8 balance and contrast throughout and it would be sheer nitpicking to try point something out that is really wrong with this photo...       so just for the sake of it the nitpicking would most probably be with the horizon... IMHO it rather strange towards the far right of the photo to see the gap so different in that small section... the horizon being rather dark and light creates a large contrast so possibly look at cloning some of the horizon out or something of the sort.... but as i said overall ur photo is amazing and it would be real nitpicking to go to such depths', '2004-10-02 10:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
