(936613, 107300, 26115, '<td valign="top">i love the title and the positioning of your subject, composition is also stunning however there is alot of white within this photo and IMHO i feel that there is too much white....       it would provide a greater contrast and create a focus on your subject if the trees remain their deep shades however being of a dreamy nature i can understand the use... i just feel both the border the dress, poles, floor and sky provide enough for that ... and if increasing the tone in the trees it would create a much more vivid image<br/>gr8 photo overall though and wonderful execution... congratulations on a gr8 shot</td>', 'i love the title and the positioning of your subject, composition is also stunning however there is alot of white within this photo and IMHO i feel that there is too much white....       it would provide a greater contrast and create a focus on your subject if the trees remain their deep shades however being of a dreamy nature i can understand the use... i just feel both the border the dress, poles, floor and sky provide enough for that ... and if increasing the tone in the trees it would create a much more vivid imagegr8 photo overall though and wonderful execution... congratulations on a gr8 shot', '2004-10-02 10:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
