(936626, 107901, 26115, '<td valign="top">i love this photo, love the focus and the way it changes through the varying depths and there really isnt much that i would change on this in general... if i was to be nitpicking i may look at cloning out the light reflecting off the eye of the dragonfly however thats being nitpicking and im not all too sure that that would actually improve the image....       aside from that the last green pettle on the left of the image seems to be doubled up... it has a ghosting image and you may want to consider sharpening that area up just a tad so focus is not drawn off the dragonfly but gr8 shot overall and gr8 work <br/>congrats on a wonderful image</td>', 'i love this photo, love the focus and the way it changes through the varying depths and there really isnt much that i would change on this in general... if i was to be nitpicking i may look at cloning out the light reflecting off the eye of the dragonfly however thats being nitpicking and im not all too sure that that would actually improve the image....       aside from that the last green pettle on the left of the image seems to be doubled up... it has a ghosting image and you may want to consider sharpening that area up just a tad so focus is not drawn off the dragonfly but gr8 shot overall and gr8 work congrats on a wonderful image', '2004-10-02 10:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(936627, 107397, 22689, '<td valign="top">Hard to give an helpful comment ... Superb photo ! I like the green tones full of life (maybe a litlle , little bit dark in case to have to find "something" ).</td>', 'Hard to give an helpful comment ... Superb photo ! I like the green tones full of life (maybe a litlle , little bit dark in case to have to find "something" ).', '2004-10-02 10:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(936632, 103619, 26115, '<td valign="top">interesting idea and rather gr8 execution the only thing i would change if i was being pedantic is some of the shadows that have been cast.... aside from that there is the polarisation effect coming through on the image on the plain background and is somewhat bugging...      the areas where you cloned out the image are the areas worst affected however that is easily changeable and that doesnt change the principle of the image whatsoever...<br/>gr8 photo just a few areas of possible improvement though gr8 photo over all :)</td>', 'interesting idea and rather gr8 execution the only thing i would change if i was being pedantic is some of the shadows that have been cast.... aside from that there is the polarisation effect coming through on the image on the plain background and is somewhat bugging...      the areas where you cloned out the image are the areas worst affected however that is easily changeable and that doesnt change the principle of the image whatsoever...gr8 photo just a few areas of possible improvement though gr8 photo over all :)', '2004-10-02 10:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(936638, 108537, 26115, '<td valign="top">very nice photo, i love the soft blur on the image and believe it does really enhance the image over all, my only issue with this photo is the light patch just over the shoulder on the right hand side... it comes up as a polarised area and draws attention away from the subject... IMHO i would have liked to see that area the same consistant darkness as the rest of the image however this is one gr8 photo overall!</td>', 'very nice photo, i love the soft blur on the image and believe it does really enhance the image over all, my only issue with this photo is the light patch just over the shoulder on the right hand side... it comes up as a polarised area and draws attention away from the subject... IMHO i would have liked to see that area the same consistant darkness as the rest of the image however this is one gr8 photo overall!', '2004-10-02 10:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(936647, 103788, 26115, '<td valign="top">gr8 image, i love the play on the sails with the light, i believe that it gives a gr8 effect overall to this image :) it looks so surreal and the clouds are wonderful... the only possible change possible and thats after looking really hard at this image is toning down the brightness in the bottom left corner....    though overall this is an amazing image that i believe should be very well placed....</td>', 'gr8 image, i love the play on the sails with the light, i believe that it gives a gr8 effect overall to this image :) it looks so surreal and the clouds are wonderful... the only possible change possible and thats after looking really hard at this image is toning down the brightness in the bottom left corner....    though overall this is an amazing image that i believe should be very well placed....', '2004-10-02 10:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(936651, 109031, 26115, '<td valign="top">this is a lovely photo, its just slightly off putting with the colour on the arms on the left hand side of this statue...     i love the details on the water droplets and my only concern comes with the colour which unfortunately is unavoidable...   gr8 photo though overall</td>', 'this is a lovely photo, its just slightly off putting with the colour on the arms on the left hand side of this statue...     i love the details on the water droplets and my only concern comes with the colour which unfortunately is unavoidable...   gr8 photo though overall', '2004-10-02 10:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(936654, 107902, 26115, '<td valign="top">this is a wonderful photo and although i believe the desaturation provides alot (and maybe too much) of a contrast i love the image as a whole. It is a very full on image and provides alot of interesting sections to look at. Overall possibly this image is slightly to compacted though but its still a fascinating look and lovely execution for giving it that added edge... so congratulations on a wonderful image...</td>', 'this is a wonderful photo and although i believe the desaturation provides alot (and maybe too much) of a contrast i love the image as a whole. It is a very full on image and provides alot of interesting sections to look at. Overall possibly this image is slightly to compacted though but its still a fascinating look and lovely execution for giving it that added edge... so congratulations on a wonderful image...', '2004-10-02 10:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(936656, 107397, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the foreboding and dramatic light and dark colors. Crisp focus really adds too. Interesting subject matter as well.  Good job. 8</td>', 'I like the foreboding and dramatic light and dark colors. Crisp focus really adds too. Interesting subject matter as well.  Good job. 8', '2004-10-02 10:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
