(936662, 108940, 26115, '<td valign="top">i love this photo i love the contrasts i love the use of light and i love the focus.... it has such a warm atmosphere to it and i really wouldnt change anything to this photo though i do notice that you have a slight small border....   personally i wouldnt like to see it there though the photo is just too good for me to focus on that aspect of the photo...         i really wish for this photo to be rated highly and highly commend you on your wonderful photo :D   deff might look into it being a favourite</td>', 'i love this photo i love the contrasts i love the use of light and i love the focus.... it has such a warm atmosphere to it and i really wouldnt change anything to this photo though i do notice that you have a slight small border....   personally i wouldnt like to see it there though the photo is just too good for me to focus on that aspect of the photo...         i really wish for this photo to be rated highly and highly commend you on your wonderful photo :D   deff might look into it being a favourite', '2004-10-02 11:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
