(936668, 108276, 26115, '<td valign="top">wow this is deffinitely a touching image ! <br/>gr8 use of colour and focus... composition is exquisite as well however its a shame to have the amount of shaddowing in the foreground as is present... it would IMHO have a gr8r effect if it was in its original tones of colour however that is not something that you could possibly control... i highly commend you on such a wonderful photo and look forward to seeing more of your work :)</td>', 'wow this is deffinitely a touching image ! gr8 use of colour and focus... composition is exquisite as well however its a shame to have the amount of shaddowing in the foreground as is present... it would IMHO have a gr8r effect if it was in its original tones of colour however that is not something that you could possibly control... i highly commend you on such a wonderful photo and look forward to seeing more of your work :)', '2004-10-02 11:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(936669, 108843, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful classic seascape shot. Blue color and visible moon really gives it mood.  Though the horizon line is midline and gives a static feel, that''s fine with this tranquil moment. Good job.  7</td>', 'Beautiful classic seascape shot. Blue color and visible moon really gives it mood.  Though the horizon line is midline and gives a static feel, that''s fine with this tranquil moment. Good job.  7', '2004-10-02 11:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
