(936682, 102660, 26115, '<td valign="top">this is a gr8 photo! i love the effect created by the hair and the earing though the only thing i may want to change is the colour of the eyes... they seem too surreal to me by their colour... though reflection wise and all that i highly commend you on the fact that they are some of the most perfect eyes that i have seen for a long time....   just yeah possibly look at changing the hue / saturation as they seem very eary though i guess it depends on what effect your after</td>', 'this is a gr8 photo! i love the effect created by the hair and the earing though the only thing i may want to change is the colour of the eyes... they seem too surreal to me by their colour... though reflection wise and all that i highly commend you on the fact that they are some of the most perfect eyes that i have seen for a long time....   just yeah possibly look at changing the hue / saturation as they seem very eary though i guess it depends on what effect your after', '2004-10-02 11:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(936686, 108875, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful scene, very artistic capture.  Good work. 9</td>', 'This is a wonderful scene, very artistic capture.  Good work. 9', '2004-10-02 11:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
