(936698, 108832, 1202, '<td valign="top">Very nice sunset shot with perfect exposure.  I read pictures from left to right so that puts the beach curve backwards leading me out of the picture instead of into it. Just my opinion.  9</td>', 'Very nice sunset shot with perfect exposure.  I read pictures from left to right so that puts the beach curve backwards leading me out of the picture instead of into it. Just my opinion.  9', '2004-10-02 11:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(936722, 108940, 6870, '<td valign="top">The use of light here is fantastic to give depth and interest to these flowers. The background is made more interesting by the folds of the cloth. Very well done! 9</td>', 'The use of light here is fantastic to give depth and interest to these flowers. The background is made more interesting by the folds of the cloth. Very well done! 9', '2004-10-02 11:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(936726, 102742, 6870, '<td valign="top">Touching and effective image! Your limited pallette and light tones add much to this.Marvelous wall too before the photo took place there. Simply a very good photo. 9</td>', 'Touching and effective image! Your limited pallette and light tones add much to this.Marvelous wall too before the photo took place there. Simply a very good photo. 9', '2004-10-02 11:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(936731, 103105, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very soft, but you manage to get some excellent details here, too, so it''s a  nice mix for me. The light is very lovely, and the subject captivating. My eye tends to go to those very bright spots, so even though I like the effect, it might be nice to experiment a little with using those attention getting areas to better frame the faces or something. Anyway, a very  nice photo. 8</td>', 'Very soft, but you manage to get some excellent details here, too, so it''s a  nice mix for me. The light is very lovely, and the subject captivating. My eye tends to go to those very bright spots, so even though I like the effect, it might be nice to experiment a little with using those attention getting areas to better frame the faces or something. Anyway, a very  nice photo. 8', '2004-10-02 11:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(936732, 108843, 6870, '<td valign="top">Simplicity at its best. Textures of beach and clouds works nicely together. Fun colors and effective radical composition. 9</td>', 'Simplicity at its best. Textures of beach and clouds works nicely together. Fun colors and effective radical composition. 9', '2004-10-02 11:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(936788, 107902, 3724, '<td valign="top">Careful, seamless and subtle (+ &amp; -  ?) saturation at luscious levels of intensity.    A 1950''s superrealistic view - a " Route 66" like roadside impression from the seat of H.G. Wells Time Machine.   Tinged with nostolgia an icon of "Americana" - made real.....  Accurate artifacts placed in a historical renovation - a Smithsonian exhibit - antique store - museum exhibit - where ever this display is located, it is unusuall -and the visual intrepretation wonderful.</td>', 'Careful, seamless and subtle (+ & -  ?) saturation at luscious levels of intensity.    A 1950''s superrealistic view - a " Route 66" like roadside impression from the seat of H.G. Wells Time Machine.   Tinged with nostolgia an icon of "Americana" - made real.....  Accurate artifacts placed in a historical renovation - a Smithsonian exhibit - antique store - museum exhibit - where ever this display is located, it is unusuall -and the visual intrepretation wonderful.', '2004-10-02 12:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(936791, 107586, 5044, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. The lighting is perfect, as are the skin tones. His expression also tells quite a story.</td>', 'Excellent shot. The lighting is perfect, as are the skin tones. His expression also tells quite a story.', '2004-10-02 12:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(936792, 107995, 18958, '<td valign="top">really good idea, well done !</td>', 'really good idea, well done !', '2004-10-02 12:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(936794, 108897, 5044, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. The lighting is very good, as is the pose, props and composition. The border also works very well with this image.</td>', 'Great portrait. The lighting is very good, as is the pose, props and composition. The border also works very well with this image.', '2004-10-02 12:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(936796, 107902, 5044, '<td valign="top">Good use of selective desaturation to turn this into an excellent scene. Is this a prop scene? Seems almost too perfect of a setup.</td>', 'Good use of selective desaturation to turn this into an excellent scene. Is this a prop scene? Seems almost too perfect of a setup.', '2004-10-02 12:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(936799, 108992, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice use of repeating subjects in both the foreground and background. I also like the use of an out of frame vanishing point. Lighting is interesting. Is it morning or afternoon? A bit more of the sky could have been cropped out. 7</td>', 'Nice use of repeating subjects in both the foreground and background. I also like the use of an out of frame vanishing point. Lighting is interesting. Is it morning or afternoon? A bit more of the sky could have been cropped out. 7', '2004-10-02 12:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(936804, 107609, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very nice sepia, but I don''t care for the large shadow covering his forehead and right shoulder.</td>', 'Very nice sepia, but I don''t care for the large shadow covering his forehead and right shoulder.', '2004-10-02 12:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(936806, 106488, 17103, '<td valign="top">Wow, absolutely gorgeous!  Upon first glance, I thought everything was covered with snow.  The only small nitpick I have with this is the placement of the flag, but it still gets a 10 from me.  Good luck!</td>', 'Wow, absolutely gorgeous!  Upon first glance, I thought everything was covered with snow.  The only small nitpick I have with this is the placement of the flag, but it still gets a 10 from me.  Good luck!', '2004-10-02 12:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(936808, 108897, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait study. Skin tones are very even and warm (to go along with your title).  I think the headband is a bit distracting especially with the black and white pattern on it. Make it scream for attention. A neutral gray color might have been more appropriate if you really wanted her to wear something. I would have cropped a bit more off the right side but maybe not. It''s very good in it''s current state. I also like this border even though its very thick. It gives the photo a mounted on a wall feel. 8</td>', 'Excellent portrait study. Skin tones are very even and warm (to go along with your title).  I think the headband is a bit distracting especially with the black and white pattern on it. Make it scream for attention. A neutral gray color might have been more appropriate if you really wanted her to wear something. I would have cropped a bit more off the right side but maybe not. It''s very good in it''s current state. I also like this border even though its very thick. It gives the photo a mounted on a wall feel. 8', '2004-10-02 12:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(936809, 104134, 5044, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I think I would like to see this with just a little more contrast, but that''s just me. Great pose, perfect look,and you have captured the eyes VERY well. A great portrait. I really like the wispy hair strands coming down around her face. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful. I think I would like to see this with just a little more contrast, but that''s just me. Great pose, perfect look,and you have captured the eyes VERY well. A great portrait. I really like the wispy hair strands coming down around her face. Well done.', '2004-10-02 12:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(936811, 106953, 5044, '<td valign="top">Spectacular. The only thing I don''t like is the hair across her face, especially the strands crossing her pupil and nose.</td>', 'Spectacular. The only thing I don''t like is the hair across her face, especially the strands crossing her pupil and nose.', '2004-10-02 12:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(936813, 108924, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very good capture.</td>', 'Very good capture.', '2004-10-02 12:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(936814, 107020, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great sunrise/sunset photo. Love the patterns created by the clouds. Cropping could use a bit of work on the left side as I see what appears to be a boat. 8</td>', 'Great sunrise/sunset photo. Love the patterns created by the clouds. Cropping could use a bit of work on the left side as I see what appears to be a boat. 8', '2004-10-02 12:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(936817, 107365, 5044, '<td valign="top">I hope you had a long zoom. LOL! <br/>Excellent shot. Love the green BG, the reflection, the crop. Awesome.</td>', 'I hope you had a long zoom. LOL! Excellent shot. Love the green BG, the reflection, the crop. Awesome.', '2004-10-02 12:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(936820, 109014, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very good wildlife study. Crisp details of the feathers and bird in general. Nice earth toned background to match the bird''s colors. Border feels a bit too thick to me. 9</td>', 'Very good wildlife study. Crisp details of the feathers and bird in general. Nice earth toned background to match the bird''s colors. Border feels a bit too thick to me. 9', '2004-10-02 12:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(936822, 109013, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of an afternoon (or morning) walk of a father and his sons. The duotone and soft focus are also very nice touches. The telephone pole stands out and I feel it should have been cropped out (or cloned out). 8</td>', 'Nice capture of an afternoon (or morning) walk of a father and his sons. The duotone and soft focus are also very nice touches. The telephone pole stands out and I feel it should have been cropped out (or cloned out). 8', '2004-10-02 12:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(936824, 107969, 17103, '<td valign="top">Perfect and beautiful!</td>', 'Perfect and beautiful!', '2004-10-02 12:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(936826, 103189, 5044, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure my monitor is properly calibrated, but I find that the detail in the sky is almost not there. I had to pump up the brightness to see that it was not just a blotch in the dark sky. Not sure if you were going for total darkness, or if you meant to have detail there. Anyhow, excellent capture of lightning, and well reflected in the lake. Just a little too much neg. space for my taste.</td>', 'I''m pretty sure my monitor is properly calibrated, but I find that the detail in the sky is almost not there. I had to pump up the brightness to see that it was not just a blotch in the dark sky. Not sure if you were going for total darkness, or if you meant to have detail there. Anyhow, excellent capture of lightning, and well reflected in the lake. Just a little too much neg. space for my taste.', '2004-10-02 12:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(936827, 108949, 8054, '<td valign="top">I think this would have had more impact if the tiger was looking directly at the camera vs out of frame. The bamboo in front of the tiger is also distracting. Although I haven''t seen a tiger in a while, the colors seem a bit muted to me. You did capture excellent details, however. 6</td>', 'I think this would have had more impact if the tiger was looking directly at the camera vs out of frame. The bamboo in front of the tiger is also distracting. Although I haven''t seen a tiger in a while, the colors seem a bit muted to me. You did capture excellent details, however. 6', '2004-10-02 12:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(936831, 107397, 17103, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors and light, beautiful subject and sky.  I aspire to photograph landscapes like this someday... 10</td>', 'Gorgeous colors and light, beautiful subject and sky.  I aspire to photograph landscapes like this someday... 10', '2004-10-02 12:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(936834, 107202, 5044, '<td valign="top">Martin, you are truely the master of this type of photography. Excellent lighting. I also like the difference in contrast between your subject and the BG. She is very high contrast, yet your BG is very high key, with a soft focus kind of feel.</td>', 'Martin, you are truely the master of this type of photography. Excellent lighting. I also like the difference in contrast between your subject and the BG. She is very high contrast, yet your BG is very high key, with a soft focus kind of feel.', '2004-10-02 12:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(936835, 103788, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good choice to go with b/w for a tall ship photo as it lends to the age of the ship. Sharp details of the clouds and the ship sails, masts and riggings. Border is a bit too thick, in my opinion, but it seems to fit in fairly well here and match the overall tone of the photo. 9</td>', 'Good choice to go with b/w for a tall ship photo as it lends to the age of the ship. Sharp details of the clouds and the ship sails, masts and riggings. Border is a bit too thick, in my opinion, but it seems to fit in fairly well here and match the overall tone of the photo. 9', '2004-10-02 12:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(936836, 107091, 5044, '<td valign="top">I think your use of negative space here is a little extreme. Perhaps croping the shot to landscape format could help relieve that excess space. Other than that, I like the silouhette and it is a very good capture of a great moment.</td>', 'I think your use of negative space here is a little extreme. Perhaps croping the shot to landscape format could help relieve that excess space. Other than that, I like the silouhette and it is a very good capture of a great moment.', '2004-10-02 12:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(936839, 108173, 8054, '<td valign="top">Feels slightly overexposed and oversharpened (second leg from right). But i really like the pose and how the hornet is looking directly at the camera. 7</td>', 'Feels slightly overexposed and oversharpened (second leg from right). But i really like the pose and how the hornet is looking directly at the camera. 7', '2004-10-02 12:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(936846, 109014, 21362, '<td valign="top">Great photo! I absolutely love the color palette. The tones in the background and blurred DOF technique really compliments the color and texture of the bird nicely, but without making it too boring monotone or too contrasty, if that makes sense. It just works. Love the personality from the bird too, though cloning that feather stuck his beak might be good... Going in my favorites. :) Great work! 10<br/> <br/>...and that song will be in my head the rest of the day.</td>', 'Great photo! I absolutely love the color palette. The tones in the background and blurred DOF technique really compliments the color and texture of the bird nicely, but without making it too boring monotone or too contrasty, if that makes sense. It just works. Love the personality from the bird too, though cloning that feather stuck his beak might be good... Going in my favorites. :) Great work! 10 ...and that song will be in my head the rest of the day.', '2004-10-02 12:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(936848, 106953, 17103, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nice.  Just love the tones and deep shadows.... 10</td>', 'Wow, very nice.  Just love the tones and deep shadows.... 10', '2004-10-02 13:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(936851, 106931, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good use of leading lines with the edges of the plants to point me towards the center of the photo. Then I see the mountain and the sky with the fluffy clouds. I also like the pattern of the water and how it reflects the sky and clouds. Overall, it looks like there is some CA or oversharpening. If it''s CA, then it can''t be helped. I notice it especially in the clouds in the upper left near the bright area and in the lower left corner of the water. Very nice landscape study! 7</td>', 'Good use of leading lines with the edges of the plants to point me towards the center of the photo. Then I see the mountain and the sky with the fluffy clouds. I also like the pattern of the water and how it reflects the sky and clouds. Overall, it looks like there is some CA or oversharpening. If it''s CA, then it can''t be helped. I notice it especially in the clouds in the upper left near the bright area and in the lower left corner of the water. Very nice landscape study! 7', '2004-10-02 13:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(936853, 103105, 21362, '<td valign="top">Wow! Absolutely incredible wildlife photo! It moves me on a number of levels and what amazing light you had to shot it! Going in my favorites! 10</td>', 'Wow! Absolutely incredible wildlife photo! It moves me on a number of levels and what amazing light you had to shot it! Going in my favorites! 10', '2004-10-02 13:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(936854, 107969, 5475, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried to figure out how you got this, but I give up.  I''m kind of thinking you dropped one object, followed by  the kiwi.  However you got this shot, it is pretty amazing.  The only thing that bothers me is the small section of blue at the bottom left.  I would have changed its hue to match the background green.  This is still my highest rated shot in the challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'I''ve tried to figure out how you got this, but I give up.  I''m kind of thinking you dropped one object, followed by  the kiwi.  However you got this shot, it is pretty amazing.  The only thing that bothers me is the small section of blue at the bottom left.  I would have changed its hue to match the background green.  This is still my highest rated shot in the challenge.  Good luck!', '2004-10-02 13:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(936856, 103189, 8054, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t know what I was looking at then I saw the lightning! I think it would be even more impressive if it were the sole light source in the photo (clone out the lights near the water). The big dark clouds contribute to the stormy feel of the photo. 9</td>', 'At first I didn''t know what I was looking at then I saw the lightning! I think it would be even more impressive if it were the sole light source in the photo (clone out the lights near the water). The big dark clouds contribute to the stormy feel of the photo. 9', '2004-10-02 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(936863, 108843, 17103, '<td valign="top">Stunning, and I especially like the texture in the water foreground.... 10</td>', 'Stunning, and I especially like the texture in the water foreground.... 10', '2004-10-02 13:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(936864, 108897, 21362, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait, beautiful model. Her skin is flawless in that light. Not entirely sure that country-looking prop agrees with her urban-looking outfit... <br/> <br/>Very well done though!!</td>', 'Beautiful portrait, beautiful model. Her skin is flawless in that light. Not entirely sure that country-looking prop agrees with her urban-looking outfit...  Very well done though!!', '2004-10-02 13:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(936866, 107599, 509, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and exposure.  The composition leads my eye around the scene.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and exposure.  The composition leads my eye around the scene.', '2004-10-02 13:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(936868, 106707, 9576, '<td valign="top">10+++ this is just great</td>', '10+++ this is just great', '2004-10-02 13:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(936869, 108832, 509, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset, but you already knew that ; )<br/>I''m not sure, but it might need rotated 1/2 degree clockwise to get the horizon completely horizontal.  I could be wrong.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset, but you already knew that ; )I''m not sure, but it might need rotated 1/2 degree clockwise to get the horizon completely horizontal.  I could be wrong.', '2004-10-02 13:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(936872, 108979, 509, '<td valign="top">A nice subject, but a little dizzying to look at with the checked background.</td>', 'A nice subject, but a little dizzying to look at with the checked background.', '2004-10-02 13:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(936873, 105647, 9576, '<td valign="top">To much black 8</td>', 'To much black 8', '2004-10-02 13:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(936874, 107397, 8054, '<td valign="top">At first I thought the contrasting sky colors were distracting but then I thought that they gave dark feel to the shot to emphasize the fact that the buildings have been in ruin for a long time. Composition is also good. 8</td>', 'At first I thought the contrasting sky colors were distracting but then I thought that they gave dark feel to the shot to emphasize the fact that the buildings have been in ruin for a long time. Composition is also good. 8', '2004-10-02 13:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(936875, 107902, 17103, '<td valign="top">This is so good!  Where is this place?  10</td>', 'This is so good!  Where is this place?  10', '2004-10-02 13:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(936877, 108897, 9576, '<td valign="top">good lightning 10</td>', 'good lightning 10', '2004-10-02 13:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(936878, 108984, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the colors chosen (the blue background is a nice compliment to the red).  Excellent focus and composition.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the colors chosen (the blue background is a nice compliment to the red).  Excellent focus and composition.  Well done.', '2004-10-02 13:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(936879, 108897, 19978, '<td valign="top">There are some outstanding portrait entries in this challenge, but this one may be the best. Your model is beautiful, her expression is natural and mysterious, the composition is wonderful and the lighting is perfect.</td>', 'There are some outstanding portrait entries in this challenge, but this one may be the best. Your model is beautiful, her expression is natural and mysterious, the composition is wonderful and the lighting is perfect.', '2004-10-02 13:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(936882, 105190, 9576, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites10</td>', 'One of my favorites10', '2004-10-02 13:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(936884, 108875, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of the grass and the scene overall.  It gives the feeling that this could be an oil painting as well as a photograph.  The positioning of the sun (ie, the timing of the shot) is very well done.</td>', 'I like the softness of the grass and the scene overall.  It gives the feeling that this could be an oil painting as well as a photograph.  The positioning of the sun (ie, the timing of the shot) is very well done.', '2004-10-02 13:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(936885, 103189, 9576, '<td valign="top">Great capture 9</td>', 'Great capture 9', '2004-10-02 13:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(936886, 108984, 19978, '<td valign="top">Magnificent capture. The blue background is a perfect choice. The pepper looks almost as if you had waxed it. Not a speck of dust or any other distracting elements. A beautiful, simple, and very profound shot. One of my top picks for this challenge.</td>', 'Magnificent capture. The blue background is a perfect choice. The pepper looks almost as if you had waxed it. Not a speck of dust or any other distracting elements. A beautiful, simple, and very profound shot. One of my top picks for this challenge.', '2004-10-02 13:11:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(936887, 108979, 8054, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this photo but somehow the execution seems to lack punch and wow factor. Contrast is excellent as one can see the subtle grays in the background pattern. 5</td>', 'I like the idea behind this photo but somehow the execution seems to lack punch and wow factor. Contrast is excellent as one can see the subtle grays in the background pattern. 5', '2004-10-02 13:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(936888, 108537, 509, '<td valign="top">A nice throw back to 40''s era cop dramas</td>', 'A nice throw back to 40''s era cop dramas', '2004-10-02 13:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(936890, 107609, 19978, '<td valign="top">A truly sensational portrait, but I wonder if the shadows are just a bit too deep. His face is clearly the most expressive element in the composition and it may be just a bit too indistinct.</td>', 'A truly sensational portrait, but I wonder if the shadows are just a bit too deep. His face is clearly the most expressive element in the composition and it may be just a bit too indistinct.', '2004-10-02 13:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(936891, 108173, 9576, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and clear 10+</td>', 'Very crisp and clear 10+', '2004-10-02 13:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(936893, 108454, 509, '<td valign="top">The composition and exposure are very nice.  Still, the rocks don''t hold a lot of interest to my eye, though I do like the diagonal presentation.</td>', 'The composition and exposure are very nice.  Still, the rocks don''t hold a lot of interest to my eye, though I do like the diagonal presentation.', '2004-10-02 13:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(936894, 105966, 8054, '<td valign="top">This shot really impressed me. I really like how the flame lights up the balloon and immediate area on the ground. Then you move to the background and see the other flames doing the same thing, although without seeing the illuminated balloon and ground. I do see slight signs of noise in the sky. 9</td>', 'This shot really impressed me. I really like how the flame lights up the balloon and immediate area on the ground. Then you move to the background and see the other flames doing the same thing, although without seeing the illuminated balloon and ground. I do see slight signs of noise in the sky. 9', '2004-10-02 13:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(936895, 106953, 19978, '<td valign="top">Simply gorgeous. The model is stunning, the pose is beautiful and the lighting/shadows/contrast are striking. The eye is naturally drawn to her face and wants to linger over every detail. A brilliant capture and surely will be in the running for the top 10 in this challenge.</td>', 'Simply gorgeous. The model is stunning, the pose is beautiful and the lighting/shadows/contrast are striking. The eye is naturally drawn to her face and wants to linger over every detail. A brilliant capture and surely will be in the running for the top 10 in this challenge.', '2004-10-02 13:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(936897, 106953, 9576, '<td valign="top">There is something disturbing with her shoulder? but otherwise it is a good one 9</td>', 'There is something disturbing with her shoulder? but otherwise it is a good one 9', '2004-10-02 13:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(936899, 107995, 19978, '<td valign="top">Brilliant in composition and execution. I wish that the girl on the front cover had been hidden or cropped though. Her face competes for attention and detracts a little from the somewhat startling impact of the main subject. However, the thought and work that went into this shot are very evident and will surely make it a top scorer.</td>', 'Brilliant in composition and execution. I wish that the girl on the front cover had been hidden or cropped though. Her face competes for attention and detracts a little from the somewhat startling impact of the main subject. However, the thought and work that went into this shot are very evident and will surely make it a top scorer.', '2004-10-02 13:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(936901, 108897, 17103, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait......</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait......', '2004-10-02 13:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(936903, 107995, 17103, '<td valign="top">Great idea and very well executed, just wish the background at the top was a bit more uniform and in keeping with the rest of the shot....8</td>', 'Great idea and very well executed, just wish the background at the top was a bit more uniform and in keeping with the rest of the shot....8', '2004-10-02 13:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(936904, 107202, 9576, '<td valign="top">Is she free next week? ;-) 10+</td>', 'Is she free next week? ;-) 10+', '2004-10-02 13:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(936907, 103619, 19978, '<td valign="top">While I have absolutely no idea how you might have pulled this off, it is certainly a striking image and a top photo in this challenge. The concept is wonderful and very thought provoking. Great entry!</td>', 'While I have absolutely no idea how you might have pulled this off, it is certainly a striking image and a top photo in this challenge. The concept is wonderful and very thought provoking. Great entry!', '2004-10-02 13:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(936908, 106488, 3306, '<td valign="top">An interesting approach in looking at the game of golf. It looks like snow. I have played on days like that. Photography and golf are both obsessions! Very nice shot.</td>', 'An interesting approach in looking at the game of golf. It looks like snow. I have played on days like that. Photography and golf are both obsessions! Very nice shot.', '2004-10-02 13:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(936909, 108767, 9576, '<td valign="top">I always like these sunrise or sunset pictures  and the title is always very important</td>', 'I always like these sunrise or sunset pictures  and the title is always very important', '2004-10-02 13:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(936910, 108537, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/> <br/>This is a glamour shot which is very well done with great attention to detail. The sepia treatment is great and the zone representation is on the money. Cute model, playful pose and great outfit and props. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments. This is a glamour shot which is very well done with great attention to detail. The sepia treatment is great and the zone representation is on the money. Cute model, playful pose and great outfit and props. Bumping up.', '2004-10-02 13:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(936914, 107995, 9576, '<td valign="top">you get 10 just for this idea</td>', 'you get 10 just for this idea', '2004-10-02 13:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(936915, 109019, 19978, '<td valign="top">Simply incredible. What a moment. This image has everything going for it. Children are so intriguing but so difficult to capture in the perfect moment, but you have accomplished it here. In a tough field, I give you a good chance of a ribbon.</td>', 'Simply incredible. What a moment. This image has everything going for it. Children are so intriguing but so difficult to capture in the perfect moment, but you have accomplished it here. In a tough field, I give you a good chance of a ribbon.', '2004-10-02 13:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(936918, 107397, 5112, '<td valign="top">I love the beautiful, dreamlike quality of this shot.  It looks so soft, without being blurred.  Lovely shot.</td>', 'I love the beautiful, dreamlike quality of this shot.  It looks so soft, without being blurred.  Lovely shot.', '2004-10-02 13:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(936919, 106707, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, the colours are spectacular!  I''m wondering, was this picture made with one of those blue/gold polarizer filters?  Or is it post-processing?  It looks almost unreal, and very, very beautiful.</td>', 'Wow, the colours are spectacular!  I''m wondering, was this picture made with one of those blue/gold polarizer filters?  Or is it post-processing?  It looks almost unreal, and very, very beautiful.', '2004-10-02 13:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(936922, 104030, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good job of using a slow shutter to capture the waterfall. Looks great with the soft feel. The use of the trees and other assorted greenery to frame the rock face and waterfall was also excellent. 9</td>', 'Good job of using a slow shutter to capture the waterfall. Looks great with the soft feel. The use of the trees and other assorted greenery to frame the rock face and waterfall was also excellent. 9', '2004-10-02 13:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(936927, 102742, 26464, '<td valign="top">interesting processing techniques.<br/></td>', 'interesting processing techniques.', '2004-10-02 13:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(936928, 108173, 26464, '<td valign="top">wow.. holy macro!<br/></td>', 'wow.. holy macro!', '2004-10-02 13:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(936929, 109032, 26464, '<td valign="top">great idea.. would have liked to see a bit more sharpness on the main subject, but this is an 8 to me.<br/></td>', 'great idea.. would have liked to see a bit more sharpness on the main subject, but this is an 8 to me.', '2004-10-02 13:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(936930, 108767, 26464, '<td valign="top">i love the top 70% of this photo. the foreground detracts a bit for me and I dont like the metal pole sticking out of the ground. <br/></td>', 'i love the top 70% of this photo. the foreground detracts a bit for me and I dont like the metal pole sticking out of the ground. ', '2004-10-02 13:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(936933, 109014, 19978, '<td valign="top">All I can say is ''wow.'' OK, I have more to say. You''ve brought this striking bird to life, with an almost human expression on its little face. Quite an image!</td>', 'All I can say is ''wow.'' OK, I have more to say. You''ve brought this striking bird to life, with an almost human expression on its little face. Quite an image!', '2004-10-02 13:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(936945, 106707, 7743, '<td valign="top">Lighting - highlights the tower perfectly - my guess is early am - very nice gold glow<br/>Colour - The palette is perfect - all colours complement each other and are natural looking<br/>Exposure - good detail in the tower while avoiding any blown out areas in the sky<br/>Composition - good placement of the tower and low perspective - different angles may have shown more of the landscape (if there is more to show)<br/> <br/>10</td>', 'Lighting - highlights the tower perfectly - my guess is early am - very nice gold glowColour - The palette is perfect - all colours complement each other and are natural lookingExposure - good detail in the tower while avoiding any blown out areas in the skyComposition - good placement of the tower and low perspective - different angles may have shown more of the landscape (if there is more to show) 10', '2004-10-02 14:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(936946, 107365, 7743, '<td valign="top">Lighting - subject is well lit in the right spots<br/>Colour - good contrast between the main subject and the background, wonderful palette of green for the background.<br/>Composition - good placement , draws the viewer to the main focal point - maybe just a little too tight a crop on the right.  Good use of depth of field, <br/>Exposure -  There seems to be some bright spots on the head and around the eye - 1/3 of a stop (or even less) less exposure would probably tone this down a bit<br/>Focus seems to be a bit soft. 8</td>', 'Lighting - subject is well lit in the right spotsColour - good contrast between the main subject and the background, wonderful palette of green for the background.Composition - good placement , draws the viewer to the main focal point - maybe just a little too tight a crop on the right.  Good use of depth of field, Exposure -  There seems to be some bright spots on the head and around the eye - 1/3 of a stop (or even less) less exposure would probably tone this down a bitFocus seems to be a bit soft. 8', '2004-10-02 14:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(936951, 107387, 19035, '<td valign="top">I wanted to critique this photo and point out anything that I dont like, but I cant. I simply cant find anything wrong with it, I love the look on his face, I am wonedring what he is looking at.  The clarity is great and the choice of B &amp; W was a good one.  Well Done. 10</td>', 'I wanted to critique this photo and point out anything that I dont like, but I cant. I simply cant find anything wrong with it, I love the look on his face, I am wonedring what he is looking at.  The clarity is great and the choice of B & W was a good one.  Well Done. 10', '2004-10-02 14:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(936953, 103615, 19035, '<td valign="top">Your model has stuning eyes and a great smile, they completely draw me into this portrait.  If possible I would have liked to see a little less focus of the trees on the right side of the photo.  I love this shot.  9</td>', 'Your model has stuning eyes and a great smile, they completely draw me into this portrait.  If possible I would have liked to see a little less focus of the trees on the right side of the photo.  I love this shot.  9', '2004-10-02 14:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(936954, 109014, 19035, '<td valign="top">Im my top 10 as winners.  I give you a ten.  Nice earthy tones to this shot and such detail on the feathers, amazing.</td>', 'Im my top 10 as winners.  I give you a ten.  Nice earthy tones to this shot and such detail on the feathers, amazing.', '2004-10-02 14:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(936955, 107995, 22748, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! I don''t think I''ve ever seen this exact technique before. Her skin, especially her left hand and arm really match the back-cover girl''s face perfectly. Did you have to do any postprocessing to match them this well?</td>', 'Brilliant! I don''t think I''ve ever seen this exact technique before. Her skin, especially her left hand and arm really match the back-cover girl''s face perfectly. Did you have to do any postprocessing to match them this well?', '2004-10-02 14:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(936957, 102742, 19035, '<td valign="top">Great concept and desaturation.  Very original.  The photo was a little bright for my taste, but the overall shot was wonderful.  A 9.</td>', 'Great concept and desaturation.  Very original.  The photo was a little bright for my taste, but the overall shot was wonderful.  A 9.', '2004-10-02 14:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(936959, 108454, 22748, '<td valign="top">A nice image, but it doesn''t have a wow factor for me.</td>', 'A nice image, but it doesn''t have a wow factor for me.', '2004-10-02 14:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(936960, 103788, 19035, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail in the sails and rigging.  The cloud formations and their direction really draw you into the mail subject.  I lthink I would have liked to see this in color, but thats just me.  fantastic work.  9.</td>', 'Amazing detail in the sails and rigging.  The cloud formations and their direction really draw you into the mail subject.  I lthink I would have liked to see this in color, but thats just me.  fantastic work.  9.', '2004-10-02 14:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(936962, 105984, 19035, '<td valign="top">Extremely soft, almost mystical feel to tis shot, nicely done.  8</td>', 'Extremely soft, almost mystical feel to tis shot, nicely done.  8', '2004-10-02 14:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(936964, 107969, 19035, '<td valign="top">My absolute favorite - 10 -   I cant wait to see how this was done.  The combination of colors and the crisp deatil amaze me.</td>', 'My absolute favorite - 10 -   I cant wait to see how this was done.  The combination of colors and the crisp deatil amaze me.', '2004-10-02 14:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(936967, 103619, 19035, '<td valign="top">Does this guy sell portable grills?  Just kidding, very inventive and unique.  9.</td>', 'Does this guy sell portable grills?  Just kidding, very inventive and unique.  9.', '2004-10-02 14:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(936969, 106953, 19035, '<td valign="top">Very passionate photo.  Ive come back to look at this one several times, I think its the look in her eyes.  A well deserved 9 from me.</td>', 'Very passionate photo.  Ive come back to look at this one several times, I think its the look in her eyes.  A well deserved 9 from me.', '2004-10-02 14:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(936970, 105966, 19035, '<td valign="top">I find night shots almost impossible, you pull this one off extremly well, love the silouhettes,  9.</td>', 'I find night shots almost impossible, you pull this one off extremly well, love the silouhettes,  9.', '2004-10-02 14:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(936974, 103788, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a very powerful photograph.  Nice choice for black and white.</td>', 'This is a very powerful photograph.  Nice choice for black and white.', '2004-10-02 14:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(936976, 106931, 22748, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous colors! I love the blue sky and its reflection in the way. Fantastic sharpness and detail.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous colors! I love the blue sky and its reflection in the way. Fantastic sharpness and detail.', '2004-10-02 14:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(936979, 107397, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow, this almost feels like a painting. The textures in this image are fantastic. The building is really interesting, but the weather REALLY makes it perfect. <br/> <br/>I really am interested to see what kind of postprocessing you did. Did you dodge and burn? Vignetting? I just love the ''feel'' of the image but can''t quite nail down why.<br/> <br/>Just goes to show that it pays to go out in the so-called ''nasty'' weather when most photogs stay home!</td>', 'Wow, this almost feels like a painting. The textures in this image are fantastic. The building is really interesting, but the weather REALLY makes it perfect.  I really am interested to see what kind of postprocessing you did. Did you dodge and burn? Vignetting? I just love the ''feel'' of the image but can''t quite nail down why. Just goes to show that it pays to go out in the so-called ''nasty'' weather when most photogs stay home!', '2004-10-02 14:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(936984, 104134, 22748, '<td valign="top">Just a little blown out on her right side of her face, but I''m sure you''ll get plenty of commenters telling you that. :)  I love the B&amp;W processing here. Great contrast and textures. Perfect focus, the eyes are alive and intense.</td>', 'Just a little blown out on her right side of her face, but I''m sure you''ll get plenty of commenters telling you that. :)  I love the B&W processing here. Great contrast and textures. Perfect focus, the eyes are alive and intense.', '2004-10-02 14:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(936988, 108995, 15497, '<td valign="top">Is that grain I see? Funky bass, I like the sticker on the right bottom side, seems to be slapping the strings. Cool</td>', 'Is that grain I see? Funky bass, I like the sticker on the right bottom side, seems to be slapping the strings. Cool', '2004-10-02 14:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(936992, 105966, 15497, '<td valign="top">I like this image. It''s in top10 of my picks. good luck.<br/></td>', 'I like this image. It''s in top10 of my picks. good luck.', '2004-10-02 14:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(936996, 108979, 15497, '<td valign="top">Complicated setup?</td>', 'Complicated setup?', '2004-10-02 14:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(936998, 108122, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool image with a bit of a wow factor, the sharp eyes and high contrast catch your attention. But the eyes are significantly oversharpened, IMO, or maybe the whites are just too white, and it throws off the balance a little.<br/> <br/>Nice B&amp;W though, it really feels like an image from the 1920s or something.</td>', 'Cool image with a bit of a wow factor, the sharp eyes and high contrast catch your attention. But the eyes are significantly oversharpened, IMO, or maybe the whites are just too white, and it throws off the balance a little. Nice B&W though, it really feels like an image from the 1920s or something.', '2004-10-02 14:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(937000, 108949, 22748, '<td valign="top">A nice picture, but no wow factor and the composition isn''t too exciting to me. Unless this was taken in the jungle, it''s a shot that anyone with a camera could take.</td>', 'A nice picture, but no wow factor and the composition isn''t too exciting to me. Unless this was taken in the jungle, it''s a shot that anyone with a camera could take.', '2004-10-02 14:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(937001, 107091, 772, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing... excellent mood as well.  I like the negative space here and the way it supports the ''theme'' of this image.  "All we are is dust in the wind" :)  We do have grand ideas and aspirations to be more :)  Great work... = 10</td>', 'Very intriguing... excellent mood as well.  I like the negative space here and the way it supports the ''theme'' of this image.  "All we are is dust in the wind" :)  We do have grand ideas and aspirations to be more :)  Great work... = 10', '2004-10-02 14:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(937004, 102742, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool! Simple composition, good contrast and textures. Nice even space around the elements of the image provide a nice balance.</td>', 'Cool! Simple composition, good contrast and textures. Nice even space around the elements of the image provide a nice balance.', '2004-10-02 14:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(937008, 107091, 22748, '<td valign="top">Heh, had to look up that word. <br/> <br/>meg·a·lo·ma·ni·a   <br/>   1. A psychopathological condition characterized by delusional fantasies of wealth, power, or omnipotence.<br/>   2. An obsession with grandiose or extravagant things or actions.<br/> <br/> <br/>Cool image, it feels very 1900s. The huge space above the people really gives some perspective that a tight crop wouldn''t give.</td>', 'Heh, had to look up that word.  meg·a·lo·ma·ni·a      1. A psychopathological condition characterized by delusional fantasies of wealth, power, or omnipotence.   2. An obsession with grandiose or extravagant things or actions.  Cool image, it feels very 1900s. The huge space above the people really gives some perspective that a tight crop wouldn''t give.', '2004-10-02 14:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(937040, 108843, 10047, '<td valign="top">Moody and tranquil. I might have tried cropping off more of the foreground (lower the horizon), but I don''t know what you had to work with. Very nice.</td>', 'Moody and tranquil. I might have tried cropping off more of the foreground (lower the horizon), but I don''t know what you had to work with. Very nice.', '2004-10-02 15:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
