(937044, 108276, 10047, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and tones. Can''t make up my mind about the shadow in the foreground. Guess I would have tried cropping with and without the shadow to see what the effect was. Excellent landscape.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and tones. Can''t make up my mind about the shadow in the foreground. Guess I would have tried cropping with and without the shadow to see what the effect was. Excellent landscape.', '2004-10-02 15:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
