(937046, 106171, 8522, '<td valign="top">Unbelievably sharp, and a great subject. You''ve got one great lens there. The green background is very effective. Perfect exposure... not easy given the range of tones. Not quite sure about your crop though... I''d have thought a little more about rule of thirds here. Still, 10.</td>', 'Unbelievably sharp, and a great subject. You''ve got one great lens there. The green background is very effective. Perfect exposure... not easy given the range of tones. Not quite sure about your crop though... I''d have thought a little more about rule of thirds here. Still, 10.', '2004-10-02 15:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(937049, 103615, 22748, '<td valign="top">Good, but the little highlights in the center of her pupils is kind of distracting.</td>', 'Good, but the little highlights in the center of her pupils is kind of distracting.', '2004-10-02 15:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
