(937154, 108949, 8624, '<td valign="top">A nice enough shot of a beautiful animal, but nothing really jumps out at me that makes this anything but an average image. Your focus and tonal range is good, but some things that bothers me include the foreground wall, cutting off the tiger''s feet, the bamboo trunk in front of the tiger, dividing up the frame awkwardly, the barrel or cut off stump behind the tiger makes it clear that this is a zoo cage and the other small stump by his front paw that looks like a tin can.</td>', 'A nice enough shot of a beautiful animal, but nothing really jumps out at me that makes this anything but an average image. Your focus and tonal range is good, but some things that bothers me include the foreground wall, cutting off the tiger''s feet, the bamboo trunk in front of the tiger, dividing up the frame awkwardly, the barrel or cut off stump behind the tiger makes it clear that this is a zoo cage and the other small stump by his front paw that looks like a tin can.', '2004-10-02 15:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(937156, 106171, 10047, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clean, and clear. The top of the head might be a little washed, but the eye and beak are very good.</td>', 'Crisp, clean, and clear. The top of the head might be a little washed, but the eye and beak are very good.', '2004-10-02 15:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(937158, 108979, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here. The use of the vases to refract the background pattern is fun and black and white is a good choice. However, I think there is too much clutter going on in the image, especially with the small vase where the pattern is all mushed together. I think this might have worked better had the camera angle been lower and strit on so that you wouldn''t see the pattern on the tabletop, just the wall background.</td>', 'I like the idea here. The use of the vases to refract the background pattern is fun and black and white is a good choice. However, I think there is too much clutter going on in the image, especially with the small vase where the pattern is all mushed together. I think this might have worked better had the camera angle been lower and strit on so that you wouldn''t see the pattern on the tabletop, just the wall background.', '2004-10-02 15:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(937160, 107397, 14603, '<td valign="top">There`s a sort of "haloing effect" in play here which highlights the ruins and subdues the rest of the image.<br/>I think that it does it`s job well. <br/>Nice work</td>', 'There`s a sort of "haloing effect" in play here which highlights the ruins and subdues the rest of the image.I think that it does it`s job well. Nice work', '2004-10-02 16:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(937161, 108979, 14603, '<td valign="top">Unusual..original and very appealing.</td>', 'Unusual..original and very appealing.', '2004-10-02 16:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(937164, 103619, 8624, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to say about this image. I like it, but it doesn''t wow me. I admire the time and creativity that it took to create it and the compositional elements are well photographed but the post processing is uneven. You did a nice job masking out on the shoes gloves and headpiece where you have very crisp edges, but the trunks of both boxer you used feathered edges so it looks confusing to me. I think the scene is crowded in the frame too with the butts of both boxers edging to close to either side. A pretty good effort overall.</td>', 'I''m not sure what to say about this image. I like it, but it doesn''t wow me. I admire the time and creativity that it took to create it and the compositional elements are well photographed but the post processing is uneven. You did a nice job masking out on the shoes gloves and headpiece where you have very crisp edges, but the trunks of both boxer you used feathered edges so it looks confusing to me. I think the scene is crowded in the frame too with the butts of both boxers edging to close to either side. A pretty good effort overall.', '2004-10-02 16:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(937168, 108276, 8624, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors, great sky and great lighting. a well captured fall scene.</td>', 'beautiful colors, great sky and great lighting. a well captured fall scene.', '2004-10-02 16:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(937171, 107902, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like this. In another image all the elements might appear to be too cluttered, but the overall impact here works well. I love the lighting and whatever processing you did to get the colors and tones is very pleasing. nice job.</td>', 'I like this. In another image all the elements might appear to be too cluttered, but the overall impact here works well. I love the lighting and whatever processing you did to get the colors and tones is very pleasing. nice job.', '2004-10-02 16:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(937172, 103788, 6900, '<td valign="top">Wow.  One of the best of the best.  10  Top 2 for sure.  The tones in this picture are very familiar.  What an amazing structure in this.</td>', 'Wow.  One of the best of the best.  10  Top 2 for sure.  The tones in this picture are very familiar.  What an amazing structure in this.', '2004-10-02 16:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(937174, 108924, 8624, '<td valign="top">great sky. I really can''t tell what the silouette on the hill is however, even with your title.</td>', 'great sky. I really can''t tell what the silouette on the hill is however, even with your title.', '2004-10-02 16:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(937175, 107300, 6900, '<td valign="top">The borders are great.  You may hear they aren''t, but those people couldn''t be more wrong.  This could ribbon.  One of my top 5 of the challenge.  EXCELLENT shot.</td>', 'The borders are great.  You may hear they aren''t, but those people couldn''t be more wrong.  This could ribbon.  One of my top 5 of the challenge.  EXCELLENT shot.', '2004-10-02 16:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(937178, 107397, 6900, '<td valign="top">This is a sweet shot.  I like the muted colors - nothing oversaturated.  The sky is great too.  I''m not as excited about the composition, but I''m not sure what I would have changed.</td>', 'This is a sweet shot.  I like the muted colors - nothing oversaturated.  The sky is great too.  I''m not as excited about the composition, but I''m not sure what I would have changed.', '2004-10-02 16:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(937180, 103788, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very nices tones, but I find the image to be very busy.</td>', 'Very nices tones, but I find the image to be very busy.', '2004-10-02 16:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(937181, 108986, 6900, '<td valign="top">Wow!  That''s a great closeup.  Looks a tad blurry on the left.  I''m not sure I like the DoF, but a 9.</td>', 'Wow!  That''s a great closeup.  Looks a tad blurry on the left.  I''m not sure I like the DoF, but a 9.', '2004-10-02 16:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(937183, 107202, 8624, '<td valign="top">I assume I know who took this image, but it doesn''t matter as I can rate it objectively as an excellent shot. The model is beautiful (as always)  and your lighting wonderful on her flawless skin. I think the glass bottles are a little distracting and I would have liked to have seen a hint of her eyes or have her otherwise engaged in some action, but it is a very sexy, well photographed image, none the less.</td>', 'I assume I know who took this image, but it doesn''t matter as I can rate it objectively as an excellent shot. The model is beautiful (as always)  and your lighting wonderful on her flawless skin. I think the glass bottles are a little distracting and I would have liked to have seen a hint of her eyes or have her otherwise engaged in some action, but it is a very sexy, well photographed image, none the less.', '2004-10-02 16:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(937185, 108269, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors.  The light looks a tad overexposed, but I can''t imagine this shot any other way.</td>', 'Interesting colors.  The light looks a tad overexposed, but I can''t imagine this shot any other way.', '2004-10-02 16:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(937186, 106953, 6900, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Love the look, love the composition.  Nice choice of b/w.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Love the look, love the composition.  Nice choice of b/w.', '2004-10-02 16:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(937187, 107901, 25571, '<td valign="top">Very good use of colours. The Crop could''ve been a little tighter around the insect. I would''ve also wish for a clearer depth of view around the flower, seeing it as a whole.</td>', 'Very good use of colours. The Crop could''ve been a little tighter around the insect. I would''ve also wish for a clearer depth of view around the flower, seeing it as a whole.', '2004-10-02 16:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(937188, 107969, 6900, '<td valign="top">Great image, but the top looks fake-blurred.  I love the water and the color is amazing.  8</td>', 'Great image, but the top looks fake-blurred.  I love the water and the color is amazing.  8', '2004-10-02 16:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(937189, 109013, 8624, '<td valign="top">a wonderful momenet captured here.  good choice with the toning. I wish dad'' shirt wasn;t so dark compared to the other elements in the photo but it  tells a good story and is presented well.</td>', 'a wonderful momenet captured here.  good choice with the toning. I wish dad'' shirt wasn;t so dark compared to the other elements in the photo but it  tells a good story and is presented well.', '2004-10-02 16:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(937191, 108991, 6900, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot.  One of my favorites.  I like the little bit of land on the far right.  Not much to change with this one except maybe lowering the viewpoint closer to the ground for the leading line.  8.</td>', 'Fantastic shot.  One of my favorites.  I like the little bit of land on the far right.  Not much to change with this one except maybe lowering the viewpoint closer to the ground for the leading line.  8.', '2004-10-02 16:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(937192, 109008, 25571, '<td valign="top">Nice composition of the picture (Central). For some reason, i feel like the picture is slightly overexposed, perharps due to the white contrast on the bird''s face. Also, perharps a themed colour for the frame would''ve brought more punch to the picture (yellow or green?)</td>', 'Nice composition of the picture (Central). For some reason, i feel like the picture is slightly overexposed, perharps due to the white contrast on the bird''s face. Also, perharps a themed colour for the frame would''ve brought more punch to the picture (yellow or green?)', '2004-10-02 16:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(937193, 107969, 20375, '<td valign="top">Good timing! Looks like a kiwi dropped into tank of water. Love the mix of colours and the texture of the water. Curious as to how you got the kiwi so sharply in focus. Excellent job.</td>', 'Good timing! Looks like a kiwi dropped into tank of water. Love the mix of colours and the texture of the water. Curious as to how you got the kiwi so sharply in focus. Excellent job.', '2004-10-02 16:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(937196, 108832, 8624, '<td valign="top">A nice enough sunset with beautiful colors on the clouds and water, but other than that, there is nothing to provide any context to this image or draw me into it.</td>', 'A nice enough sunset with beautiful colors on the clouds and water, but other than that, there is nothing to provide any context to this image or draw me into it.', '2004-10-02 16:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(937197, 107365, 20375, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Almost creepy..feels like he''s watching me and waiting!<br/></td>', 'Very nice shot. Almost creepy..feels like he''s watching me and waiting!', '2004-10-02 16:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(937199, 108210, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like lighthouse images and this looks like an interesting place. I think though, that this shot has too much foreground in it and I wish the main subject wasn''t occluded by the trre in front of it.</td>', 'I like lighthouse images and this looks like an interesting place. I think though, that this shot has too much foreground in it and I wish the main subject wasn''t occluded by the trre in front of it.', '2004-10-02 16:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(937205, 108924, 20375, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm..Icelandic terrain??<br/>Very strong delivery of "Solitude"</td>', 'Hmmmm..Icelandic terrain??Very strong delivery of "Solitude"', '2004-10-02 16:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(937207, 109031, 20375, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focus...pinpoint sharpness.<br/>Colours and tones are wonderful.<br/></td>', 'Beautiful focus...pinpoint sharpness.Colours and tones are wonderful.', '2004-10-02 16:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(937208, 103615, 8624, '<td valign="top">a beautiful girl with a warm, friendly expression. Her eyes are full of life, but I don''t really like the pinpoint catchlights so dead on and close to her pupils. The one finger on the tree is also a little distracting. I would have rather her been posed with more of her hand showing or none at all.</td>', 'a beautiful girl with a warm, friendly expression. Her eyes are full of life, but I don''t really like the pinpoint catchlights so dead on and close to her pupils. The one finger on the tree is also a little distracting. I would have rather her been posed with more of her hand showing or none at all.', '2004-10-02 16:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(937210, 108979, 5044, '<td valign="top">My eyes hurt! LOL! Very well seen. Cool abstract. My only problem is that it does not seem very crisp. The focus looks soft, especially on the middle vase.</td>', 'My eyes hurt! LOL! Very well seen. Cool abstract. My only problem is that it does not seem very crisp. The focus looks soft, especially on the middle vase.', '2004-10-02 16:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(937211, 108275, 20375, '<td valign="top">I love the shot! His face is so full of thought and the viewer does wonder what he<br/>would be thinking. I must say, he appears somewhat sad.</td>', 'I love the shot! His face is so full of thought and the viewer does wonder what hewould be thinking. I must say, he appears somewhat sad.', '2004-10-02 16:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(937215, 107995, 8624, '<td valign="top">a very clever pose, well composed and well lit. I think the setting could have been better owever. The chair is too big for the scene and the vertical blinds clutter things up. I think a tighter crop of this shot emphasizing her head, hand and tthe magazine would be terrific.</td>', 'a very clever pose, well composed and well lit. I think the setting could have been better owever. The chair is too big for the scene and the vertical blinds clutter things up. I think a tighter crop of this shot emphasizing her head, hand and tthe magazine would be terrific.', '2004-10-02 16:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(937216, 109013, 20375, '<td valign="top">A dad and his two boys out for a walk. Very emotive, excellently presented.<br/>The duotone creates a nostalgic feel to this wonderful image. <br/>Well done.</td>', 'A dad and his two boys out for a walk. Very emotive, excellently presented.The duotone creates a nostalgic feel to this wonderful image. Well done.', '2004-10-02 16:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(937218, 107387, 20375, '<td valign="top">I love candid shots and this is awesome!</td>', 'I love candid shots and this is awesome!', '2004-10-02 16:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(937219, 107995, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very interresting. I like what you''ve done, but find that the inclusion of the front cover of the magazine takes away from the overall look of the photo. It gives it a kind of snapshot feel.</td>', 'Very interresting. I like what you''ve done, but find that the inclusion of the front cover of the magazine takes away from the overall look of the photo. It gives it a kind of snapshot feel.', '2004-10-02 16:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(937221, 107609, 20364, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo a 9.  Great lighting.  Wonderful composition.</td>', 'I gave this photo a 9.  Great lighting.  Wonderful composition.', '2004-10-02 16:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(937222, 108897, 10047, '<td valign="top">Attractive model and nicely composed portrait. I might have tried a darker border.</td>', 'Attractive model and nicely composed portrait. I might have tried a darker border.', '2004-10-02 16:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(937224, 108537, 8624, '<td valign="top">fun lighting. has a George Hurrel, old Hollywood look to it. I''m not creazy about the way she is holding the gun. It looks forced and her hands are cut off in the bottom of the frame. Also, on my monitor, there is considerable banding in the lighting gradient on the background with a big visible blob at the brightest point that lines up with the gun barrel. The resulting effect, to me looks a little off because it seems that she should be looking at that spot rather than off to the side as she is. I will look at this on another monitor, but as this was my initial impression, it will be hard to overcome.</td>', 'fun lighting. has a George Hurrel, old Hollywood look to it. I''m not creazy about the way she is holding the gun. It looks forced and her hands are cut off in the bottom of the frame. Also, on my monitor, there is considerable banding in the lighting gradient on the background with a big visible blob at the brightest point that lines up with the gun barrel. The resulting effect, to me looks a little off because it seems that she should be looking at that spot rather than off to the side as she is. I will look at this on another monitor, but as this was my initial impression, it will be hard to overcome.', '2004-10-02 16:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(937227, 106707, 8624, '<td valign="top">outtanding lighting. This is what some of the other sunset entries are lacking - you show the fantastic colors of the sunset, but also have an iteresting subject being bathed in this light. well composed and well balanced.</td>', 'outtanding lighting. This is what some of the other sunset entries are lacking - you show the fantastic colors of the sunset, but also have an iteresting subject being bathed in this light. well composed and well balanced.', '2004-10-02 16:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(937228, 108173, 10047, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and clean. The spot in the right foreground is sort of odd, but not distracting.</td>', 'Very crisp and clean. The spot in the right foreground is sort of odd, but not distracting.', '2004-10-02 16:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(937229, 108875, 20364, '<td valign="top">I like the photo a lot.  What keeps it from getting a 9 or 10 from me is that I expected quite a wow factor from those in the master''s challenge.  I like the photo and I gave you an 8.  Nice texture on the water and good colors.</td>', 'I like the photo a lot.  What keeps it from getting a 9 or 10 from me is that I expected quite a wow factor from those in the master''s challenge.  I like the photo and I gave you an 8.  Nice texture on the water and good colors.', '2004-10-02 16:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(937232, 108843, 20375, '<td valign="top">Canon beach.........do we ever get tired of seeing pictures of this place?<br/>Not as long as they are this good! The blue tone of this picture, the vastness of the beach, the still water,  and undisturbed sand all lend to the creation of "solitude"<br/>Excellent image.</td>', 'Canon beach.........do we ever get tired of seeing pictures of this place?Not as long as they are this good! The blue tone of this picture, the vastness of the beach, the still water,  and undisturbed sand all lend to the creation of "solitude"Excellent image.', '2004-10-02 16:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(937233, 108940, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice backlighting and beautiful soft colors. I might have experimented with lightening the right side.</td>', 'Nice backlighting and beautiful soft colors. I might have experimented with lightening the right side.', '2004-10-02 16:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(937235, 109013, 20364, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot.  The only thing that stops me from giving it a 9 or 10 is the telephone pole on the right hand side.  My eyes drfit.   Other than that I say great use of the lighting.  Great composition and I like the sepia tone to the photo.  Beautiful work.</td>', 'I like this photo a lot.  The only thing that stops me from giving it a 9 or 10 is the telephone pole on the right hand side.  My eyes drfit.   Other than that I say great use of the lighting.  Great composition and I like the sepia tone to the photo.  Beautiful work.', '2004-10-02 16:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(937237, 107969, 8624, '<td valign="top">This is visually interesting to me but I''m not really sure what I am observing. Is the kiwi sitting on an ice pedestal? The top of the kiwi looks very feathered as if hasty masking was done in Photoshop. An interesting image.</td>', 'This is visually interesting to me but I''m not really sure what I am observing. Is the kiwi sitting on an ice pedestal? The top of the kiwi looks very feathered as if hasty masking was done in Photoshop. An interesting image.', '2004-10-02 16:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(937238, 107091, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space.  Reminds me of the old movie, Those Amazing Men and their Flying Machines.</td>', 'Great use of negative space.  Reminds me of the old movie, Those Amazing Men and their Flying Machines.', '2004-10-02 16:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(937239, 103105, 10047, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more of the adult face, butit might have ruined the effect of the backlighting.</td>', 'I''d like to see more of the adult face, butit might have ruined the effect of the backlighting.', '2004-10-02 16:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(937241, 108949, 20375, '<td valign="top">What a majestic creature! Great capture. His position...stepping around the bamboo his eyes scanning area out of frame create great tension.<br/>Beautiful image.</td>', 'What a majestic creature! Great capture. His position...stepping around the bamboo his eyes scanning area out of frame create great tension.Beautiful image.', '2004-10-02 16:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(937242, 108949, 3280, '<td valign="top">Seems just a bit dark, but a great shot.  I love the look on his face.</td>', 'Seems just a bit dark, but a great shot.  I love the look on his face.', '2004-10-02 16:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(937243, 108173, 8624, '<td valign="top">great details on the eyes and manibles. excellent color and texture captured on the front of the face. looks oversharpened to me though, especially by the second leg on the right side.</td>', 'great details on the eyes and manibles. excellent color and texture captured on the front of the face. looks oversharpened to me though, especially by the second leg on the right side.', '2004-10-02 16:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(937244, 108122, 10047, '<td valign="top">Very striking eyes, and the face shows a lot of character. Not sure if I would have changed anything.</td>', 'Very striking eyes, and the face shows a lot of character. Not sure if I would have changed anything.', '2004-10-02 16:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(937245, 106171, 8624, '<td valign="top">wonderful profile of a noble bird. excellent details captured in the feather, beak and eye. highlights are blown out on the top of the head, though.</td>', 'wonderful profile of a noble bird. excellent details captured in the feather, beak and eye. highlights are blown out on the top of the head, though.', '2004-10-02 16:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(937246, 107488, 3280, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, very solitary feel.  I love the way you composed it and the chair really makes it.  Probably would have been better with the light off.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, very solitary feel.  I love the way you composed it and the chair really makes it.  Probably would have been better with the light off.', '2004-10-02 16:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(937247, 103105, 20364, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8 the first time around.  But then I came back to comment and I bumped it to a 10.  Now, I cannot recall or find any reason to have given an 8 to begin with.  The lighting is superior to anything in this challenge. Considering the coloring of the subject the lighting is perfect.  What a soft glow on the hair.  Then consider the emotion presented.  What an awesome choice of subject and great setup.  All I can say is wow.</td>', 'I gave this an 8 the first time around.  But then I came back to comment and I bumped it to a 10.  Now, I cannot recall or find any reason to have given an 8 to begin with.  The lighting is superior to anything in this challenge. Considering the coloring of the subject the lighting is perfect.  What a soft glow on the hair.  Then consider the emotion presented.  What an awesome choice of subject and great setup.  All I can say is wow.', '2004-10-02 16:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(937248, 105190, 8624, '<td valign="top">prefect exposure and great colors. I like the foreground rock as a balancing element to the background hill.</td>', 'prefect exposure and great colors. I like the foreground rock as a balancing element to the background hill.', '2004-10-02 16:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(937249, 102660, 10047, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a little more contrast to bring out the jaw line at the rear. Otherwise a fine portrait of an attractive model.</td>', 'I''d like to see a little more contrast to bring out the jaw line at the rear. Otherwise a fine portrait of an attractive model.', '2004-10-02 16:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(937251, 104134, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice set up, I like the way her eyes are looking left.  Great focus and clarity.  Seft side of her face seems a wee bit too bright but a really nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice set up, I like the way her eyes are looking left.  Great focus and clarity.  Seft side of her face seems a wee bit too bright but a really nice shot.', '2004-10-02 16:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(937252, 107300, 20364, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of the composition.  Great idea placing the subject between the white pillars.  The rest of the background acts as a great backdrop to cause me to focus on the subject.  Great job.  I gave you an 8.</td>', 'I like the softness of the composition.  Great idea placing the subject between the white pillars.  The rest of the background acts as a great backdrop to cause me to focus on the subject.  Great job.  I gave you an 8.', '2004-10-02 16:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(937253, 108940, 8624, '<td valign="top">very pretty and well lit. the composition is off to me however, by having the left most flower cut off in the frame. I''d either rather see it entirely like the other blooms or have you crop in closer on all of them.</td>', 'very pretty and well lit. the composition is off to me however, by having the left most flower cut off in the frame. I''d either rather see it entirely like the other blooms or have you crop in closer on all of them.', '2004-10-02 16:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(937255, 109014, 3280, '<td valign="top">I always wondered what a Kookaburra looked like, now through the magic of DPC, I know.  Or at least take your word for it!!  Super focus and composition.  The feather hanging from the bottom is a bit of distraction.  Background DOF is perfect.  Really nice shot.</td>', 'I always wondered what a Kookaburra looked like, now through the magic of DPC, I know.  Or at least take your word for it!!  Super focus and composition.  The feather hanging from the bottom is a bit of distraction.  Background DOF is perfect.  Really nice shot.', '2004-10-02 16:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(937256, 107902, 20364, '<td valign="top">I love the retro feel of this photo.  Great choice of subject.  Composed well.  I am not sure if I like the desaturation, however.  I gave you an 8.</td>', 'I love the retro feel of this photo.  Great choice of subject.  Composed well.  I am not sure if I like the desaturation, however.  I gave you an 8.', '2004-10-02 16:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(937257, 108875, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, though I wonder what it would look like a few minutes later.  A bit darker with a more colorful sky perhaps.</td>', 'Very nice shot, though I wonder what it would look like a few minutes later.  A bit darker with a more colorful sky perhaps.', '2004-10-02 16:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(937258, 108537, 20364, '<td valign="top">blondes always look great in black and white as long as the lighting is correct.  this one is perfect.  I like this photo a lot.  Very nice idea and subject.  Shot very nicely.  An 8.</td>', 'blondes always look great in black and white as long as the lighting is correct.  this one is perfect.  I like this photo a lot.  Very nice idea and subject.  Shot very nicely.  An 8.', '2004-10-02 16:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(937259, 108569, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great angle and B &amp; W seems the correct choice. The bottom building seems a bit out of focus, especially on the right edge.  Great shot.</td>', 'Great angle and B & W seems the correct choice. The bottom building seems a bit out of focus, especially on the right edge.  Great shot.', '2004-10-02 16:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(937260, 107488, 8624, '<td valign="top">beautifully lit and well composed. I like how the symmetry of the 3 windows is offset by having a contrasting element (chair, chandelier, nothing) within them.  very nice.</td>', 'beautifully lit and well composed. I like how the symmetry of the 3 windows is offset by having a contrasting element (chair, chandelier, nothing) within them.  very nice.', '2004-10-02 16:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(937261, 107969, 20364, '<td valign="top">I love the detail.  But I am not sure what I am looking at and this keeps me from giving it a 10.  But the color and texture are fantastic!  An 8.</td>', 'I love the detail.  But I am not sure what I am looking at and this keeps me from giving it a 10.  But the color and texture are fantastic!  An 8.', '2004-10-02 16:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(937262, 108642, 3280, '<td valign="top">I am assuming that you used fill in flash to capture the details on her face, and yet it doesn''t seem to be on the trees.  Looks great though.  I feel as if I am peering into a dream on childhood, a very emotive shot. Good job.</td>', 'I am assuming that you used fill in flash to capture the details on her face, and yet it doesn''t seem to be on the trees.  Looks great though.  I feel as if I am peering into a dream on childhood, a very emotive shot. Good job.', '2004-10-02 16:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(937263, 107397, 20364, '<td valign="top">I like the wizard of oz feel of this photo.  The colors are such that it looks like it was a set built in a studio and then a matte painting behind.  Very unique.  Great photo.  An 8.</td>', 'I like the wizard of oz feel of this photo.  The colors are such that it looks like it was a set built in a studio and then a matte painting behind.  Very unique.  Great photo.  An 8.', '2004-10-02 16:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(937264, 107609, 8624, '<td valign="top">a great character study. excellent light with a very wide tonal range. the highlights a blown on the cup and his collar, but I think it still works very well in this shot because it is composed so well otherwise.</td>', 'a great character study. excellent light with a very wide tonal range. the highlights a blown on the cup and his collar, but I think it still works very well in this shot because it is composed so well otherwise.', '2004-10-02 16:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(937266, 109014, 20364, '<td valign="top">I like the detail of this photo a lot.  Makes me feel like I can reach right out and pet the bird.  Nice photo.  Clear, clean and crisp.</td>', 'I like the detail of this photo a lot.  Makes me feel like I can reach right out and pet the bird.  Nice photo.  Clear, clean and crisp.', '2004-10-02 16:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(937267, 109031, 3280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focus and lighting.  Composition right on as well.  Good shot.</td>', 'Beautiful focus and lighting.  Composition right on as well.  Good shot.', '2004-10-02 16:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(937269, 109014, 8624, '<td valign="top">an excellent nature image. perfectly composed and very detailed. I particularly like how the bird''s beak is slightly open.</td>', 'an excellent nature image. perfectly composed and very detailed. I particularly like how the bird''s beak is slightly open.', '2004-10-02 16:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(937272, 108832, 20364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color.  I like the choice of subject and how you angled the shot.  Very nice, indeed.</td>', 'Beautiful color.  I like the choice of subject and how you angled the shot.  Very nice, indeed.', '2004-10-02 16:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(937273, 103105, 12802, '<td valign="top">Really good shot here!  The different tones in this are briliant, really brings out a lot of detail! 9</td>', 'Really good shot here!  The different tones in this are briliant, really brings out a lot of detail! 9', '2004-10-02 16:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(937274, 108832, 25571, '<td valign="top">Rather plain idea. It feels like the colours tones are missing, perharps not bright enought.  A good Orange filter would''ve greatly improved on the depth too. Throught PS, i was able to bring out the colours better and intensify the sky greatly.</td>', 'Rather plain idea. It feels like the colours tones are missing, perharps not bright enought.  A good Orange filter would''ve greatly improved on the depth too. Throught PS, i was able to bring out the colours better and intensify the sky greatly.', '2004-10-02 16:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(937275, 108897, 3280, '<td valign="top">Super shot, as a matter of fact I just bumped it another point.  Great look on the models face and I like the added splash ov color from the dried plants.  Nice job.</td>', 'Super shot, as a matter of fact I just bumped it another point.  Great look on the models face and I like the added splash ov color from the dried plants.  Nice job.', '2004-10-02 16:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(937276, 108991, 20364, '<td valign="top">I can almost see a little orange color in the mist to the right on my monitor.  I gave this an 8, and the little hint of color is what kept me from giving it a 10.  This is an awesomely textured and yet soft photo.  Wow.</td>', 'I can almost see a little orange color in the mist to the right on my monitor.  I gave this an 8, and the little hint of color is what kept me from giving it a 10.  This is an awesomely textured and yet soft photo.  Wow.', '2004-10-02 16:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(937277, 102660, 8624, '<td valign="top">beautiful image with good use of shallow depth of field. The fillagree earring adds some nice ornamentation to her beautiful face. great eyes, although they seem a bit flat without catchlights. The hair lighting is excellent. since we can''t see her whole necklace, what is visible around her neck is distracting, but this is a lovely portrait.</td>', 'beautiful image with good use of shallow depth of field. The fillagree earring adds some nice ornamentation to her beautiful face. great eyes, although they seem a bit flat without catchlights. The hair lighting is excellent. since we can''t see her whole necklace, what is visible around her neck is distracting, but this is a lovely portrait.', '2004-10-02 16:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(937278, 106171, 25571, '<td valign="top">Very nice image composition. The background feels somewhat plain, unfortunatly, which in turn, seems to down-tone all the colours of the picture. The usage of a Frame does help with the overall feel of the picture.</td>', 'Very nice image composition. The background feels somewhat plain, unfortunatly, which in turn, seems to down-tone all the colours of the picture. The usage of a Frame does help with the overall feel of the picture.', '2004-10-02 16:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(937279, 108979, 20364, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I like the differences in the pattern due to the different vases.  Great photo, great lighting.</td>', 'Great idea.  I like the differences in the pattern due to the different vases.  Great photo, great lighting.', '2004-10-02 16:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(937280, 107901, 8624, '<td valign="top">great pose with the dragonfly perfectly mirroring the profile of the flower. colors and strong and vibrant. depth of field is too shallow though for a shot pulled back this much an I don''t like the hotspot on the fly''s eye.</td>', 'great pose with the dragonfly perfectly mirroring the profile of the flower. colors and strong and vibrant. depth of field is too shallow though for a shot pulled back this much an I don''t like the hotspot on the fly''s eye.', '2004-10-02 16:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(937282, 108276, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very detailed, something to keep looking at time after time. I can really make out the different textures here.  Only gripe is the cloud on the LHS, seems a little overexposed. 8</td>', 'Very detailed, something to keep looking at time after time. I can really make out the different textures here.  Only gripe is the cloud on the LHS, seems a little overexposed. 8', '2004-10-02 16:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(937283, 106707, 20364, '<td valign="top">When I back around to comment I bumped this to a 10.  I had it at an 8 but this far too good to ignore.  What great color and detail.  Beautiful lighting and composition.  Excellent!</td>', 'When I back around to comment I bumped this to a 10.  I had it at an 8 but this far too good to ignore.  What great color and detail.  Beautiful lighting and composition.  Excellent!', '2004-10-02 16:40:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(937285, 109014, 25571, '<td valign="top">Intriging colours, especially in the background, which brings out the ''fall'' mood out of the picture. Nice usage of shadows and highlights for the very dim colours of the picture. Its too bad for the blurry tail of the bird, which would''ve been more interesting "in-focus".</td>', 'Intriging colours, especially in the background, which brings out the ''fall'' mood out of the picture. Nice usage of shadows and highlights for the very dim colours of the picture. Its too bad for the blurry tail of the bird, which would''ve been more interesting "in-focus".', '2004-10-02 16:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(937286, 107599, 20364, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I like the texture on the beach.  Good color</td>', 'Nice photo.  I like the texture on the beach.  Good color', '2004-10-02 16:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(937287, 108924, 3280, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, though I think I may have liked it better if the subject wasn''t dead center.  It might even have bigger feel to it.  Clouds are awesome.</td>', 'Excellent shot, though I think I may have liked it better if the subject wasn''t dead center.  It might even have bigger feel to it.  Clouds are awesome.', '2004-10-02 16:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(937289, 107202, 25571, '<td valign="top">Very nice Colour theme (Hair and background). The model"s movement is nice and fluid, but could''ve been slightly accentuated but a better stretch of the right leg. The slight fuzyness of the background set gives the image a good warmth dreamy look.</td>', 'Very nice Colour theme (Hair and background). The model"s movement is nice and fluid, but could''ve been slightly accentuated but a better stretch of the right leg. The slight fuzyness of the background set gives the image a good warmth dreamy look.', '2004-10-02 16:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(937290, 108897, 8624, '<td valign="top">outstanding portrait. she has a gorgeous face with beatutiful lips and skin tone and sparkling eyes. I like the relaxed pose and the cool headband. I think it could have been slightly improved with more modern or minimalist props to compliment her simple black shirt and the geometric pattern on the headband, but tis works great as is as well. a fantastic portrait.</td>', 'outstanding portrait. she has a gorgeous face with beatutiful lips and skin tone and sparkling eyes. I like the relaxed pose and the cool headband. I think it could have been slightly improved with more modern or minimalist props to compliment her simple black shirt and the geometric pattern on the headband, but tis works great as is as well. a fantastic portrait.', '2004-10-02 16:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(937291, 106931, 20364, '<td valign="top">The clouds look 3 dimensional.  Great photo.  The water looks a little brown on the left, though.  Other than that, wonderful!</td>', 'The clouds look 3 dimensional.  Great photo.  The water looks a little brown on the left, though.  Other than that, wonderful!', '2004-10-02 16:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(937292, 108276, 3280, '<td valign="top">Wow, is it that time of year already somewhere?? I''m not ready.  Good color and the sunlight hitting the white trunks works well.  Seem like you could have cropped out that one burned out area in the clouds on the left.  Great shot.</td>', 'Wow, is it that time of year already somewhere?? I''m not ready.  Good color and the sunlight hitting the white trunks works well.  Seem like you could have cropped out that one burned out area in the clouds on the left.  Great shot.', '2004-10-02 16:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(937293, 108122, 20364, '<td valign="top">Great candid photo.  I can almost see the silouhette of the photographer in his eyes.  Nice B&amp;W photo.</td>', 'Great candid photo.  I can almost see the silouhette of the photographer in his eyes.  Nice B&W photo.', '2004-10-02 16:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(937294, 106171, 20364, '<td valign="top">Very nicely detailed.  I love the subject and color.</td>', 'Very nicely detailed.  I love the subject and color.', '2004-10-02 16:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(937295, 107901, 3280, '<td valign="top">Really nice but it is almost as if there are too many things to look at that are splayed out.  The petals, the wings, the body all seem to go from focus and back again.  Great color and I love the background.</td>', 'Really nice but it is almost as if there are too many things to look at that are splayed out.  The petals, the wings, the body all seem to go from focus and back again.  Great color and I love the background.', '2004-10-02 16:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(937296, 108233, 12802, '<td valign="top">Great shot, like the goalkeepers expression, pitty the other guys aren''t looking at the ball.<br/> <br/>Good DOF, pin sharp shot too!  Like the little tuft of grass on the RHS!! :-) 8</td>', 'Great shot, like the goalkeepers expression, pitty the other guys aren''t looking at the ball. Good DOF, pin sharp shot too!  Like the little tuft of grass on the RHS!! :-) 8', '2004-10-02 16:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(937298, 109031, 8624, '<td valign="top">There are probably some people who will knock you for submitting a photo of someone else''s art but I think you have captured something interesting about the fountain sculpture. I like the low point of view shooting up and the fast exposure freezing the water drops into little jewels. great color, exposure and sharpness.</td>', 'There are probably some people who will knock you for submitting a photo of someone else''s art but I think you have captured something interesting about the fountain sculpture. I like the low point of view shooting up and the fast exposure freezing the water drops into little jewels. great color, exposure and sharpness.', '2004-10-02 16:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(937300, 108122, 8624, '<td valign="top">I''m very mixed on this portrait. I love the overall composition and toning. His eyes alone are simply amazing. The dirt and grime on the face though turns me off. It just doesn''t fot the look of the image. I could see his grimey look in a candid, but this has such a great casual portrait feel to it and the dirt  just blows it for me. Not entirely though, cause I still rank it an 8 just for his eyes.</td>', 'I''m very mixed on this portrait. I love the overall composition and toning. His eyes alone are simply amazing. The dirt and grime on the face though turns me off. It just doesn''t fot the look of the image. I could see his grimey look in a candid, but this has such a great casual portrait feel to it and the dirt  just blows it for me. Not entirely though, cause I still rank it an 8 just for his eyes.', '2004-10-02 16:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(937301, 102660, 3280, '<td valign="top">Vicki is beautiful and has fantasic eyes.  I like the crop and composition but feel like the jewelry is a distraction. Especially the necklace.  It would give a more "model" type feel without them. Nice shot.</td>', 'Vicki is beautiful and has fantasic eyes.  I like the crop and composition but feel like the jewelry is a distraction. Especially the necklace.  It would give a more "model" type feel without them. Nice shot.', '2004-10-02 16:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(937302, 108940, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice but I wish the left flower wasn''t cut off.  I feel as if I''m drawn to it and then it isn''t even totally there.  Composition feels just a bit off for that reason</td>', 'Very nice but I wish the left flower wasn''t cut off.  I feel as if I''m drawn to it and then it isn''t even totally there.  Composition feels just a bit off for that reason', '2004-10-02 16:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(937303, 108233, 8624, '<td valign="top">definitely an action filled sport shot - the horizontal line of the four players is excellent with each of them in motion in a different direction. The small chunk of turf flying out of frame on the left is a nice detail.</td>', 'definitely an action filled sport shot - the horizontal line of the four players is excellent with each of them in motion in a different direction. The small chunk of turf flying out of frame on the left is a nice detail.', '2004-10-02 16:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(937305, 107901, 4493, '<td valign="top">Jacko? This is a decent little shot :-p Could use a bit more DOF though, maybe try closing down the aperture some :-))<br/> <br/>Actually the centered composition and the overall brightness of the shot are 2 things I would have adjusted. It seems just over saturated or something. -danny</td>', 'Jacko? This is a decent little shot :-p Could use a bit more DOF though, maybe try closing down the aperture some :-)) Actually the centered composition and the overall brightness of the shot are 2 things I would have adjusted. It seems just over saturated or something. -danny', '2004-10-02 16:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(937306, 106931, 8624, '<td valign="top">great exposure and color. some of the foreground water could have been cropped out to better balance the image, but overall, this is a lovely landscape.</td>', 'great exposure and color. some of the foreground water could have been cropped out to better balance the image, but overall, this is a lovely landscape.', '2004-10-02 16:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(937307, 107020, 3280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky and the reflection is nice.  Too bad you couldn''t get any of the orange sky in the reflection.  Feels like it could have been cropped a bit tighter on the left side and taken out a couple of distractions.</td>', 'Beautiful sky and the reflection is nice.  Too bad you couldn''t get any of the orange sky in the reflection.  Feels like it could have been cropped a bit tighter on the left side and taken out a couple of distractions.', '2004-10-02 16:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(937309, 108986, 8624, '<td valign="top">great closeup. terrific eyes and feather details. seems a little oversharpened.</td>', 'great closeup. terrific eyes and feather details. seems a little oversharpened.', '2004-10-02 16:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(937310, 107202, 3280, '<td valign="top">Looks familiar and the lighting and focus are very nice. Perhaps a bit "too" flaunting in feel though.</td>', 'Looks familiar and the lighting and focus are very nice. Perhaps a bit "too" flaunting in feel though.', '2004-10-02 16:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(937313, 109008, 8624, '<td valign="top">another beautiful bird closeup profile. terrific feather details and beak textures. white areas in the face are blown out a bit.</td>', 'another beautiful bird closeup profile. terrific feather details and beak textures. white areas in the face are blown out a bit.', '2004-10-02 16:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(937315, 109008, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice color and focus.  Reflection in the beak is a bit disttracting.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice color and focus.  Reflection in the beak is a bit disttracting.  Good job.', '2004-10-02 16:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(937317, 108233, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and color.  The players head with the long hair looks almost missing as he blends in with the crowd so much.  Don''t know if you could do anything about that.</td>', 'Nice focus and color.  The players head with the long hair looks almost missing as he blends in with the crowd so much.  Don''t know if you could do anything about that.', '2004-10-02 16:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(937319, 107300, 8624, '<td valign="top">very nice high key bridal shot. I love the toning of the plants and trees behind her and the way she is holding her veil. The pillars compete somewhat with the bride as main focal point ratyher than framing elements but the image is nicely balanced overall.</td>', 'very nice high key bridal shot. I love the toning of the plants and trees behind her and the way she is holding her veil. The pillars compete somewhat with the bride as main focal point ratyher than framing elements but the image is nicely balanced overall.', '2004-10-02 16:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(937320, 107488, 5044, '<td valign="top">The composition and subject for this image is great. Well done. Focus is a little soft, though.</td>', 'The composition and subject for this image is great. Well done. Focus is a little soft, though.', '2004-10-02 16:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(937322, 108072, 8624, '<td valign="top">excellent character portrait. great color in his short and pants. excellent focus and depth of field. well done overall.</td>', 'excellent character portrait. great color in his short and pants. excellent focus and depth of field. well done overall.', '2004-10-02 16:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(937325, 108843, 8624, '<td valign="top">I have knocked other images for having the horizon so slose to the center of the image but it works very well here creating an artificial symmetry that has interesting compositional elements that balance one another in both halves of the frame. the clouds offset the water ripples and the rock provides the focal point. well exposed and great colors!</td>', 'I have knocked other images for having the horizon so slose to the center of the image but it works very well here creating an artificial symmetry that has interesting compositional elements that balance one another in both halves of the frame. the clouds offset the water ripples and the rock provides the focal point. well exposed and great colors!', '2004-10-02 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(937326, 102660, 5044, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of her eyes. I find the desaturation of all but her eyes leaves the image a little unbalanced. I think you also left some colour in the lips, but not enough to balance it out. An excellent photo, nonetheless.</td>', 'Excellent capture of her eyes. I find the desaturation of all but her eyes leaves the image a little unbalanced. I think you also left some colour in the lips, but not enough to balance it out. An excellent photo, nonetheless.', '2004-10-02 16:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(937327, 107969, 5044, '<td valign="top">Freaky! Looks like an A-Bomb mushroom cloud.</td>', 'Freaky! Looks like an A-Bomb mushroom cloud.', '2004-10-02 16:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(937331, 107020, 12802, '<td valign="top">I do like this shot, but I''m afraid it doesn''t really jump out at me.  It''s a good silhouette shot, nice clear waters etc but it doesn''t grab my attention.  (Picky bugger I know...) 7</td>', 'I do like this shot, but I''m afraid it doesn''t really jump out at me.  It''s a good silhouette shot, nice clear waters etc but it doesn''t grab my attention.  (Picky bugger I know...) 7', '2004-10-02 17:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(937334, 108275, 25464, '<td valign="top">Very nice. You dont really get the eyes in this shot.  I wonder what an even closer crop that showed only the facial features would look like.  I see a very nice picture of a gorilla, but without the eye expression I don''t really wander what he is thinking. 8.</td>', 'Very nice. You dont really get the eyes in this shot.  I wonder what an even closer crop that showed only the facial features would look like.  I see a very nice picture of a gorilla, but without the eye expression I don''t really wander what he is thinking. 8.', '2004-10-02 17:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(937336, 107202, 12802, '<td valign="top">I really like this (apart from the obvious reasons...)<br/> <br/>Nice and clear shot here, the DOF is brilliant, the smooth background really suits the shot!  Full marks! 10</td>', 'I really like this (apart from the obvious reasons...) Nice and clear shot here, the DOF is brilliant, the smooth background really suits the shot!  Full marks! 10', '2004-10-02 17:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(937341, 105984, 12802, '<td valign="top">Good macro shot here, nice and detailed, very crisp! I liike the details in it''s wings!  8</td>', 'Good macro shot here, nice and detailed, very crisp! I liike the details in it''s wings!  8', '2004-10-02 17:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(937342, 107397, 25464, '<td valign="top">Beautiful but not real interesting.  I think I would have liked a wider angle, maybe less centered.   Very nice color. 8.</td>', 'Beautiful but not real interesting.  I think I would have liked a wider angle, maybe less centered.   Very nice color. 8.', '2004-10-02 17:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(937344, 108275, 12802, '<td valign="top">Looks like a really sad gorilla here, as you''ve said in your title, I wish I knew what it was thinking.<br/> <br/>Good choice of B&amp;W, just below it''s ear seems a little hot though. 8</td>', 'Looks like a really sad gorilla here, as you''ve said in your title, I wish I knew what it was thinking. Good choice of B&W, just below it''s ear seems a little hot though. 8', '2004-10-02 17:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(937346, 106707, 12802, '<td valign="top">Simply amazing!!  The colours in this shot are brilliant!  Full marks! 10</td>', 'Simply amazing!!  The colours in this shot are brilliant!  Full marks! 10', '2004-10-02 17:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(937349, 103619, 5044, '<td valign="top">I look forward to seeing how it was done. Very cool photo.</td>', 'I look forward to seeing how it was done. Very cool photo.', '2004-10-02 17:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(937351, 108642, 5044, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the big shadow in front of the little girl. Very nice natural framing, though.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the big shadow in front of the little girl. Very nice natural framing, though.', '2004-10-02 17:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(937352, 108767, 24962, '<td valign="top">Dismissed first time round with a six...just another misty sunrise! Back again and again due to the intriguing foreground. Well executed, sky is a bit washed, shame there wasn''t more cloud to add emphasis. 6 first, upped to 8</td>', 'Dismissed first time round with a six...just another misty sunrise! Back again and again due to the intriguing foreground. Well executed, sky is a bit washed, shame there wasn''t more cloud to add emphasis. 6 first, upped to 8', '2004-10-02 17:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(937353, 108940, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very nice, soft image. Well done. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Very nice, soft image. Well done. Nice lighting.', '2004-10-02 17:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(937355, 109031, 12802, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this that I really like!  I am trying to imagine what the whole statue looks like, this may be what it is, making me think more about the whole image.<br/> <br/>Good shutter speed to get the water and good lighting! 8</td>', 'There''s something about this that I really like!  I am trying to imagine what the whole statue looks like, this may be what it is, making me think more about the whole image. Good shutter speed to get the water and good lighting! 8', '2004-10-02 17:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(937356, 103615, 24962, '<td valign="top">Show mercy to me! It''s the eyes. Lovely use of natural light with fill in flash. Her hair looks great with the backlighting, just wish the background had been slightly darker to highlight Mercy. Started it at 6 first look...drawn back by the green eyes and had to bump it to an 8</td>', 'Show mercy to me! It''s the eyes. Lovely use of natural light with fill in flash. Her hair looks great with the backlighting, just wish the background had been slightly darker to highlight Mercy. Started it at 6 first look...drawn back by the green eyes and had to bump it to an 8', '2004-10-02 17:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(937357, 106953, 12802, '<td valign="top">I like this sharpness, clarity and tones of this shot.  Not too sure about so much space on the RHS though, my eyes are drawn to the light area instead of her face. 8</td>', 'I like this sharpness, clarity and tones of this shot.  Not too sure about so much space on the RHS though, my eyes are drawn to the light area instead of her face. 8', '2004-10-02 17:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
