(937360, 107902, 24962, '<td valign="top">I like the almost cartoon effect. Must admit I was not over impressed first time and voted a 5. However on the second trawl thru, it slapped me in the face and bumped it to 7, maybe third time thru it will go higher</td>', 'I like the almost cartoon effect. Must admit I was not over impressed first time and voted a 5. However on the second trawl thru, it slapped me in the face and bumped it to 7, maybe third time thru it will go higher', '2004-10-02 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(937361, 105647, 12802, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette of the buildings and trees. I think maybe less black space at the bottom would have been good.  7</td>', 'Great silhouette of the buildings and trees. I think maybe less black space at the bottom would have been good.  7', '2004-10-02 17:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(937365, 108843, 5044, '<td valign="top">Awesome view. I find it a little too blue, for my taste. I''m not crazy about the very centerered horizon, either. Perhaps croping just above the moon, leaving more of the textured beach below could work. Just a thought.</td>', 'Awesome view. I find it a little too blue, for my taste. I''m not crazy about the very centerered horizon, either. Perhaps croping just above the moon, leaving more of the textured beach below could work. Just a thought.', '2004-10-02 17:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(937366, 106488, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I really like IR photography. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice. I really like IR photography. Well done.', '2004-10-02 17:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(937368, 107091, 25464, '<td valign="top">I really like the empty space, subject, simplicity.  I bet this would have been breathtaking in color. 9.</td>', 'I really like the empty space, subject, simplicity.  I bet this would have been breathtaking in color. 9.', '2004-10-02 17:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(937369, 109032, 5044, '<td valign="top">Ouch! Very cool.</td>', 'Ouch! Very cool.', '2004-10-02 17:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(937370, 108984, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful detail study with poor timing after allt he food in the wacky food challenge.  It really seems too simplistic for the masters challenge in my opinion, but very well taken, and beautiful color. 7.</td>', 'This is a wonderful detail study with poor timing after allt he food in the wacky food challenge.  It really seems too simplistic for the masters challenge in my opinion, but very well taken, and beautiful color. 7.', '2004-10-02 17:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(937373, 108991, 24962, '<td valign="top">Okay, just another arty farty B&amp;W, give it 5. That was my first thought, 2nd and 3rd visits didn''t change my opinion much, but this time I have noted the subtle almost blended from out of focus with the mist to the clear focus of the shore line. Bumped to 7 for now</td>', 'Okay, just another arty farty B&W, give it 5. That was my first thought, 2nd and 3rd visits didn''t change my opinion much, but this time I have noted the subtle almost blended from out of focus with the mist to the clear focus of the shore line. Bumped to 7 for now', '2004-10-02 17:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(937374, 107969, 25464, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, interesting, flawless.  Colors are wonderful. composition is great.  I have no idea how you did it. Ttruely a masters shot.  The only thing missing for me is the desire to hang it on my wall - purely personal preference and nothing to do with the shot.  Maybe if someone had a bar in their home with these vibrant colors . . . maybe a kitchen?  10.</td>', 'Beautiful, interesting, flawless.  Colors are wonderful. composition is great.  I have no idea how you did it. Ttruely a masters shot.  The only thing missing for me is the desire to hang it on my wall - purely personal preference and nothing to do with the shot.  Maybe if someone had a bar in their home with these vibrant colors . . . maybe a kitchen?  10.', '2004-10-02 17:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(937376, 108991, 12802, '<td valign="top">Really good shot here, nice and calming to look at. The DOF is interesting, not sure if I''d have liked to have seen more things in detail, but I do like the trees not being perfectly in focus. A great shot! 9</td>', 'Really good shot here, nice and calming to look at. The DOF is interesting, not sure if I''d have liked to have seen more things in detail, but I do like the trees not being perfectly in focus. A great shot! 9', '2004-10-02 17:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(937377, 109008, 25464, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  He''s a bit scuffed up.  I would have tried for a more original title.  Gorgeous color.  9.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  He''s a bit scuffed up.  I would have tried for a more original title.  Gorgeous color.  9.', '2004-10-02 17:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(937378, 107091, 12802, '<td valign="top">I like the use of negative space here, think the B&amp;W option is good but I don''t feel the shot really grabs my attention. 6</td>', 'I like the use of negative space here, think the B&W option is good but I don''t feel the shot really grabs my attention. 6', '2004-10-02 17:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(937380, 106171, 12802, '<td valign="top">Really good DOF here, excellent clarity in the bird here, can make out so much detail in the feathers.  The eye is the most important thing here, that is in perfect focus!  Well done, full marks! 10</td>', 'Really good DOF here, excellent clarity in the bird here, can make out so much detail in the feathers.  The eye is the most important thing here, that is in perfect focus!  Well done, full marks! 10', '2004-10-02 17:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(937382, 108843, 12802, '<td valign="top">Brilliant DOF here, good clarity throughout the whole shot.  I think it''s mist in front of the rocks on the left, takes a wee bit away from the shot as I think it makes it look a little hazy. 8</td>', 'Brilliant DOF here, good clarity throughout the whole shot.  I think it''s mist in front of the rocks on the left, takes a wee bit away from the shot as I think it makes it look a little hazy. 8', '2004-10-02 17:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(937383, 108897, 24962, '<td valign="top">A well lit shot and an attractive model, but there is something lacking, could well be the white background. Oe, perhaps it is the floral arrangement...yep, cropped out it looks so much better. Started with a 6, bumped to 7</td>', 'A well lit shot and an attractive model, but there is something lacking, could well be the white background. Oe, perhaps it is the floral arrangement...yep, cropped out it looks so much better. Started with a 6, bumped to 7', '2004-10-02 17:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(937387, 106953, 24962, '<td valign="top">I love this composition, but just too dark for me. Love the blurred background and her eyes are superb. first vote was a 5, but the more I look the more it captures me, bumped to 8</td>', 'I love this composition, but just too dark for me. Love the blurred background and her eyes are superb. first vote was a 5, but the more I look the more it captures me, bumped to 8', '2004-10-02 17:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(937391, 107586, 24962, '<td valign="top">Like this a lot, but didn''t feel drawn at first. It got a 5, the blurred hand was quite distracting. However, on 3rd visit I was so taken with the face that I bumped it to 8</td>', 'Like this a lot, but didn''t feel drawn at first. It got a 5, the blurred hand was quite distracting. However, on 3rd visit I was so taken with the face that I bumped it to 8', '2004-10-02 17:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(937392, 102742, 7743, '<td valign="top">Lighting - I think the lighting is very subtle and helps with the mood of the image<br/>Composition - good placement of the girl and the message on the wall with the girl looking into the image<br/>Exposure - seems right for the mood<br/>The focus seems a bit soft .  I think this image could benefit from having everything sharp. 9<br/></td>', 'Lighting - I think the lighting is very subtle and helps with the mood of the imageComposition - good placement of the girl and the message on the wall with the girl looking into the imageExposure - seems right for the moodThe focus seems a bit soft .  I think this image could benefit from having everything sharp. 9', '2004-10-02 17:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(937396, 108173, 7743, '<td valign="top">Colours and texture are wonderful and the exposure seems bang on, however the DOF seems a tad too shallow.  What is in focus is very sharp.   With the angle of the photo I think more DOF would help balance the image between in and out of focus elements. 8</td>', 'Colours and texture are wonderful and the exposure seems bang on, however the DOF seems a tad too shallow.  What is in focus is very sharp.   With the angle of the photo I think more DOF would help balance the image between in and out of focus elements. 8', '2004-10-02 17:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(937399, 109019, 6388, '<td valign="top">Magic.  Love the muted colours, and particularly the subtleties...the burned background, the slight dodging in the face to bring out the finer point of this cuties face.  Alecia pointed out the most significant part of this whole pic - you can see her reflection in the bubble - awesome.  Great pic - 9</td>', 'Magic.  Love the muted colours, and particularly the subtleties...the burned background, the slight dodging in the face to bring out the finer point of this cuties face.  Alecia pointed out the most significant part of this whole pic - you can see her reflection in the bubble - awesome.  Great pic - 9', '2004-10-02 17:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(937401, 107599, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice relaxing shot here, good DOF and clarity throughout the whole picture.  Might have liked to have seen the footprints in more detail though. 8</td>', 'Nice relaxing shot here, good DOF and clarity throughout the whole picture.  Might have liked to have seen the footprints in more detail though. 8', '2004-10-02 17:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(937402, 107586, 6388, '<td valign="top">remeniscent of one of my favourite DPC fotogs.  beautiful toning; love the DOF.  The decision to include the shadows (in fact highlight them through the title) was nothing short of brilliant.  wonderful theme and a very moving image.</td>', 'remeniscent of one of my favourite DPC fotogs.  beautiful toning; love the DOF.  The decision to include the shadows (in fact highlight them through the title) was nothing short of brilliant.  wonderful theme and a very moving image.', '2004-10-02 17:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(937404, 107609, 12962, '<td valign="top">Ten. To me, this is perfect.  I have been trying to shoot a photo like this but have had no success.  But at least I can find a good example to emulate.  This is just so beautiful - very distinguished-looking model, beautiful contrasts, lighting, diagonals, shadows ... I can go on and on.</td>', 'Ten. To me, this is perfect.  I have been trying to shoot a photo like this but have had no success.  But at least I can find a good example to emulate.  This is just so beautiful - very distinguished-looking model, beautiful contrasts, lighting, diagonals, shadows ... I can go on and on.', '2004-10-02 17:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(937406, 108979, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice monochromatic patterns.  The two large vases show the pattern very well and it appears to be quite sharp, however the pattern in the small vase seems a bit dim and the focus seems soft.  This could be related to the quality of the glass or the distance from the vertical pattern.    The exposure seems right though. 6</td>', 'Nice monochromatic patterns.  The two large vases show the pattern very well and it appears to be quite sharp, however the pattern in the small vase seems a bit dim and the focus seems soft.  This could be related to the quality of the glass or the distance from the vertical pattern.    The exposure seems right though. 6', '2004-10-02 17:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(937407, 107488, 12802, '<td valign="top">Can see what you''ve tried to do here, but I think there are a few things that I personally don''t like.  The lights are still on in the room, it looks like there is enoughlight coming in through the window. The shot seems a little soft, I''d have liked a DOF that makes everything crystal clear.  6</td>', 'Can see what you''ve tried to do here, but I think there are a few things that I personally don''t like.  The lights are still on in the room, it looks like there is enoughlight coming in through the window. The shot seems a little soft, I''d have liked a DOF that makes everything crystal clear.  6', '2004-10-02 17:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(937408, 103189, 24962, '<td valign="top">Well done for catching the lightning flsah, just too much dark sky. Wish I could have voted it higher, but can''t. Sorry.</td>', 'Well done for catching the lightning flsah, just too much dark sky. Wish I could have voted it higher, but can''t. Sorry.', '2004-10-02 17:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(937409, 109008, 12802, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot here, great portrait of the parrot!  Nice and clear shot, I can feel the texture in the feathers. 9</td>', 'Excellent shot here, great portrait of the parrot!  Nice and clear shot, I can feel the texture in the feathers. 9', '2004-10-02 17:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(937412, 108984, 24962, '<td valign="top">It''s a good absract photo, colours are good, focus is sharp, but not what I would expect from a month long challenge. Gave it 5 at start, bumping to 6</td>', 'It''s a good absract photo, colours are good, focus is sharp, but not what I would expect from a month long challenge. Gave it 5 at start, bumping to 6', '2004-10-02 17:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(937413, 108537, 12802, '<td valign="top">Good nostalgic shot here. The smooth, smokey feel really adds that little something to the shot! Only gripe is that the part of the gun she''s holding looks like it''s reflecting the light a little too much.  Just me being picky though!Well done!  9</td>', 'Good nostalgic shot here. The smooth, smokey feel really adds that little something to the shot! Only gripe is that the part of the gun she''s holding looks like it''s reflecting the light a little too much.  Just me being picky though!Well done!  9', '2004-10-02 17:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(937429, 103105, 18349, '<td valign="top">Honestly one of the most captivating and beautiful entries of the challenge... well done!</td>', 'Honestly one of the most captivating and beautiful entries of the challenge... well done!', '2004-10-02 18:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
