(937457, 108767, 16301, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors you''ve captured, the fog is what makes this shot. Nice, very atmospheric...<br/> <br/>Another good idea is to have the path as a major element in the composition.</td>', 'Beautiful colors you''ve captured, the fog is what makes this shot. Nice, very atmospheric... Another good idea is to have the path as a major element in the composition.', '2004-10-02 18:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(937458, 103219, 19978, '<td valign="top">Lovely interpretation. A very unusual crop, betraying a good eye and vision behind it. It''s stuff like this that I appreciate about DPC - I learn from looking at photos like this. The expanse of skin with the lips and material of the dress framing the corners is exquisite.</td>', 'Lovely interpretation. A very unusual crop, betraying a good eye and vision behind it. It''s stuff like this that I appreciate about DPC - I learn from looking at photos like this. The expanse of skin with the lips and material of the dress framing the corners is exquisite.', '2004-10-02 18:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
