(937575, 108843, 6458, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for these type of shots. The blue hue works well here, and I love the texture of the sand. The hints of mist around the rocks really catch my eye.. but there''s something very subtle missing. I can''t really put my finger on it though. <br/> <br/>When working with water reflections, I tend to brighten up the reflection a bit.. perhaps that''s what I''m looking for here?  Sorry. Wish I could give a more concrete suggestion. Still, this is a solid 9.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for these type of shots. The blue hue works well here, and I love the texture of the sand. The hints of mist around the rocks really catch my eye.. but there''s something very subtle missing. I can''t really put my finger on it though.  When working with water reflections, I tend to brighten up the reflection a bit.. perhaps that''s what I''m looking for here?  Sorry. Wish I could give a more concrete suggestion. Still, this is a solid 9.', '2004-10-02 20:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(937578, 108949, 489, '<td valign="top">It''s a good capture of a tiger., but it is just too obvious that it is a zoo, with the sawed off bamboo. Maybe a tighter shot to make it look more "in the wild".</td>', 'It''s a good capture of a tiger., but it is just too obvious that it is a zoo, with the sawed off bamboo. Maybe a tighter shot to make it look more "in the wild".', '2004-10-02 20:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
