(937620, 102742, 12253, '<td valign="top">Well balanced photo with great color contrast to the desaturated girl.  Lovely tones in the B&amp;W too, perfect pose, and a good message.  I am not sure, however, what the second message is besides peace.  What''s the L for? Excellent work.  10.</td>', 'Well balanced photo with great color contrast to the desaturated girl.  Lovely tones in the B&W too, perfect pose, and a good message.  I am not sure, however, what the second message is besides peace.  What''s the L for? Excellent work.  10.', '2004-10-02 20:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(937622, 104134, 22046, '<td valign="top">I really like Rachel''s direct look toward the camera. I feel that the photo  could have had more depth - a wider contrast between the darkest black and the whitest white.</td>', 'I really like Rachel''s direct look toward the camera. I feel that the photo  could have had more depth - a wider contrast between the darkest black and the whitest white.', '2004-10-02 20:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(937624, 107300, 12253, '<td valign="top">Whoever''s wedding you shot this for must be thrilled for this wonderful photo.  I love the vignette effect here, which works very well with the high key posts and sky.  It ooks like she may be slightly underexposed and could use a little more light on her, but it''s hard to tell because she''s presented so small here.  Overall, excellent, in my top 5 list for this challenge.</td>', 'Whoever''s wedding you shot this for must be thrilled for this wonderful photo.  I love the vignette effect here, which works very well with the high key posts and sky.  It ooks like she may be slightly underexposed and could use a little more light on her, but it''s hard to tell because she''s presented so small here.  Overall, excellent, in my top 5 list for this challenge.', '2004-10-02 20:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(937625, 107599, 489, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  I love the leading line and the soft colors.</td>', 'Very well done.  I love the leading line and the soft colors.', '2004-10-02 20:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
