(937664, 105984, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice close up of this interesting butterfly. Almost looks like its face is turned toward the camera with a frown on it! Nature shots are never boring.</td>', 'Nice close up of this interesting butterfly. Almost looks like its face is turned toward the camera with a frown on it! Nature shots are never boring.', '2004-10-02 21:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
