(938065, 103615, 8054, '<td valign="top">I like the composition for most part. The tree trunk to help frame the subject''s face is a good idea. Areas that might need to be addressed are the bright highlights of the model''s hair and the background still has too much detail. The model''s skin is slightly red, too, almost sunburned. 5</td>', 'I like the composition for most part. The tree trunk to help frame the subject''s face is a good idea. Areas that might need to be addressed are the bright highlights of the model''s hair and the background still has too much detail. The model''s skin is slightly red, too, almost sunburned. 5', '2004-10-03 05:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(938066, 107397, 4008, '<td valign="top">Beautiful atmosphere, great scene, I love it how the light (vignetting, burning, whatever) concentrates the view on the ruin itself. The sky adds more drama to it. I am not sure whether a more centered view would have improved it, but would have liked a bit warmer colors, especially on the ruin and the grass.</td>', 'Beautiful atmosphere, great scene, I love it how the light (vignetting, burning, whatever) concentrates the view on the ruin itself. The sky adds more drama to it. I am not sure whether a more centered view would have improved it, but would have liked a bit warmer colors, especially on the ruin and the grass.', '2004-10-03 05:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(938067, 107902, 8054, '<td valign="top">Is this real or a diorama/model? If this is a model, I am VERY impressed with the level of detail captured in the photo but the composition feels a bit busy. I like the soft colors and focus. 7</td>', 'Is this real or a diorama/model? If this is a model, I am VERY impressed with the level of detail captured in the photo but the composition feels a bit busy. I like the soft colors and focus. 7', '2004-10-03 05:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(938068, 108992, 4008, '<td valign="top">That is a special shape of haystacks, never seen it before. Haystack images like this are done so often they don''t create any excitement with me and neither does yours. It is a nice scene, with o.k. composition, and nice warm evening light, but no wow factor for me.</td>', 'That is a special shape of haystacks, never seen it before. Haystack images like this are done so often they don''t create any excitement with me and neither does yours. It is a nice scene, with o.k. composition, and nice warm evening light, but no wow factor for me.', '2004-10-03 05:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(938069, 108872, 8054, '<td valign="top">Separately, I think the two elements of this photo would be very good but I don''t think they work well as a combination. They each are fighting for attention and, worse yet, they are in opposite corners. The colors are nicely saturated and focus appears to be nice and sharp. 5</td>', 'Separately, I think the two elements of this photo would be very good but I don''t think they work well as a combination. They each are fighting for attention and, worse yet, they are in opposite corners. The colors are nicely saturated and focus appears to be nice and sharp. 5', '2004-10-03 05:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(938097, 107300, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow wow wow, she must be very pleased with this shot. Almost heavenly! Great composition, I like your PS treatment on the edges. Perfect exposure, you hardly burnt any highlights. Thanks! 10</td>', 'Wow wow wow, she must be very pleased with this shot. Almost heavenly! Great composition, I like your PS treatment on the edges. Perfect exposure, you hardly burnt any highlights. Thanks! 10', '2004-10-03 07:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(938100, 109014, 27524, '<td valign="top">Good catch :) and nice bacground colors.</td>', 'Good catch :) and nice bacground colors.', '2004-10-03 07:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(938101, 103619, 8522, '<td valign="top">Woa, I''m floored!! Thanks for your PM, an amazing result you''ve got here. This really raises the bar for us all. This has to be one of the most technically accomplished shots on DPC. 10</td>', 'Woa, I''m floored!! Thanks for your PM, an amazing result you''ve got here. This really raises the bar for us all. This has to be one of the most technically accomplished shots on DPC. 10', '2004-10-03 07:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(938102, 108843, 8522, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful, one of my favourites this challenge. The central horizon works well here. The rocks are what makes this shot work so well. The textures in the sand are breathtaking. I love the reflection of the moon in the water, but the moon itself doesn''t quite work for me. Gorgeous colours. 10</td>', 'This is just beautiful, one of my favourites this challenge. The central horizon works well here. The rocks are what makes this shot work so well. The textures in the sand are breathtaking. I love the reflection of the moon in the water, but the moon itself doesn''t quite work for me. Gorgeous colours. 10', '2004-10-03 07:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(938103, 103189, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely, very bold composition. Lots of impact. Great colour and PS work. An inspired location to patiently wait for a strike from, great dedication! One of the most original shots I''ve seen here for quite some time. Thankyou! 10</td>', 'Lovely, very bold composition. Lots of impact. Great colour and PS work. An inspired location to patiently wait for a strike from, great dedication! One of the most original shots I''ve seen here for quite some time. Thankyou! 10', '2004-10-03 07:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(938104, 108537, 8522, '<td valign="top">This shot hit me straight away, the quality is incredible. Great model, great lighting, great clothes and props, great PS work, great expression, great background, great hair (is it a wig?), great composition. Superb. 10</td>', 'This shot hit me straight away, the quality is incredible. Great model, great lighting, great clothes and props, great PS work, great expression, great background, great hair (is it a wig?), great composition. Superb. 10', '2004-10-03 07:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(938105, 102742, 8522, '<td valign="top">This is without a shadow of a doubt my favourite photo this challenge. Everything is just perfect. The level of detail is breathtaking. I love it''s emotiveness, and your model is brilliant. I love the tones here. The composition is perfect. Great idea. Works on so many levels. A+++++ (10)</td>', 'This is without a shadow of a doubt my favourite photo this challenge. Everything is just perfect. The level of detail is breathtaking. I love it''s emotiveness, and your model is brilliant. I love the tones here. The composition is perfect. Great idea. Works on so many levels. A+++++ (10)', '2004-10-03 07:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(938106, 108897, 8522, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, very nice! Superb lighting, well posed, good composition, great colours and skin tone, effective background, good model... this portrait has quality written all over it. I like the fact that her pose adds the top-left to bottom-right diagonal. Great expression, the catchlights work well. The edge of her right arm doesn''t quite work for me... it''s either haloed from oversharpening, or you''ve tried to remove it, but this is nitpicking. 10</td>', 'Oh yes, very nice! Superb lighting, well posed, good composition, great colours and skin tone, effective background, good model... this portrait has quality written all over it. I like the fact that her pose adds the top-left to bottom-right diagonal. Great expression, the catchlights work well. The edge of her right arm doesn''t quite work for me... it''s either haloed from oversharpening, or you''ve tried to remove it, but this is nitpicking. 10', '2004-10-03 07:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(938107, 107488, 8522, '<td valign="top">VERY nice shot, the composition is just superb. My eye is led around the various elements, but never wants to leave the frame. There is a sense of real perfection about the ratios here. The chair is the element that really makes this shot. The frame balances the photo perfectly. Exposure is spot on. I think I''d have liked a tad more sharpness... the blurriness here doesn''t quite look deliberate enough. Nonetheless, this is one of my favourites this challenge. Thanks! 10</td>', 'VERY nice shot, the composition is just superb. My eye is led around the various elements, but never wants to leave the frame. There is a sense of real perfection about the ratios here. The chair is the element that really makes this shot. The frame balances the photo perfectly. Exposure is spot on. I think I''d have liked a tad more sharpness... the blurriness here doesn''t quite look deliberate enough. Nonetheless, this is one of my favourites this challenge. Thanks! 10', '2004-10-03 07:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(938108, 106488, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, thought it was snow at first. What a great application of IR... one of the best I''ve ever seen. The clouds and the tree are what make this shot so ''wow''. Love the scale of the golfer. Nice duotone, the blue really complements the effect. The background trees add a diagonal element, nice touch. Superb! 10</td>', 'Wow, thought it was snow at first. What a great application of IR... one of the best I''ve ever seen. The clouds and the tree are what make this shot so ''wow''. Love the scale of the golfer. Nice duotone, the blue really complements the effect. The background trees add a diagonal element, nice touch. Superb! 10', '2004-10-03 07:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(938109, 108979, 8522, '<td valign="top">Love this shot, very high impact. I wish the lines were straighter and more level though. I think this will end up being one of my favourites this challenge. 9</td>', 'Love this shot, very high impact. I wish the lines were straighter and more level though. I think this will end up being one of my favourites this challenge. 9', '2004-10-03 07:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(938110, 107902, 8522, '<td valign="top">I love this shot... but I''m not really a fan of centered compositions. I can''t help wishing you''d gone for something more imaginative. Everything else is perfect... the pastel colours, sharpness, subject matter, light, PS work, just superb. I wonder if you could have fixed the distortion from your wide angle (or the converging verticles from looking up slightly) which is evident by the signs at the top of the frame. 9</td>', 'I love this shot... but I''m not really a fan of centered compositions. I can''t help wishing you''d gone for something more imaginative. Everything else is perfect... the pastel colours, sharpness, subject matter, light, PS work, just superb. I wonder if you could have fixed the distortion from your wide angle (or the converging verticles from looking up slightly) which is evident by the signs at the top of the frame. 9', '2004-10-03 07:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(938111, 107397, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, nice PP. I love the mixtures of blues and greens. The soft-focus effect works really well here. Good composition, your subject has lots of character. 9</td>', 'Wonderful shot, nice PP. I love the mixtures of blues and greens. The soft-focus effect works really well here. Good composition, your subject has lots of character. 9', '2004-10-03 07:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(938112, 106953, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful model, lovely big eyes. The face seems a bit too Photoshopped though... the shadows around the face look as though too much dodging and burning has been carried out.  Everything looks a bit too NeatImaged as well. The background to the right is a bit distracting... I think it would have worked better without the white patch. Great makeup and hair. The glossy lips are very effective. Black and white works well here. 8</td>', 'Wonderful model, lovely big eyes. The face seems a bit too Photoshopped though... the shadows around the face look as though too much dodging and burning has been carried out.  Everything looks a bit too NeatImaged as well. The background to the right is a bit distracting... I think it would have worked better without the white patch. Great makeup and hair. The glossy lips are very effective. Black and white works well here. 8', '2004-10-03 07:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(938113, 102660, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, the earrings are wonderul and are the icing on the cake for me. You''ve captured her complexion really well... no-one can have a complexion that flawless, so you''ve done an amazing job of flattering her skin tone while keeping plenty of detail. The lighting is nice and smooth everywhere, and the hair is nicely backlit. The shallow dof is perfect. My only criticism is that I''m not that fond of her expression, she looks like she hasn''t quite dropped her defenses enough. 8</td>', 'Nice portrait, the earrings are wonderul and are the icing on the cake for me. You''ve captured her complexion really well... no-one can have a complexion that flawless, so you''ve done an amazing job of flattering her skin tone while keeping plenty of detail. The lighting is nice and smooth everywhere, and the hair is nicely backlit. The shallow dof is perfect. My only criticism is that I''m not that fond of her expression, she looks like she hasn''t quite dropped her defenses enough. 8', '2004-10-03 07:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(938114, 108940, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful assortment of colours, extremely well lit. The background at the top left of the frame doesn''t quite work for me, and I feel that the composition doesn''t really do this magnificent lighting justice. 8</td>', 'Beautiful assortment of colours, extremely well lit. The background at the top left of the frame doesn''t quite work for me, and I feel that the composition doesn''t really do this magnificent lighting justice. 8', '2004-10-03 07:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(938115, 105190, 8522, '<td valign="top">This shot stood out straightaway in the thumbnails, and is just fantastic... wonderful composition, colours and PS work (or filters). Reminds me of a Joe Cornish (high praise). However, the quality lets this down a bit... it''s been horribly oversharpened, look at the beach on the right below the cliffs... and there''s artifacting everywhere. The edge of the cliffs shows bad haloing from sharpening. A huge shame. 8</td>', 'This shot stood out straightaway in the thumbnails, and is just fantastic... wonderful composition, colours and PS work (or filters). Reminds me of a Joe Cornish (high praise). However, the quality lets this down a bit... it''s been horribly oversharpened, look at the beach on the right below the cliffs... and there''s artifacting everywhere. The edge of the cliffs shows bad haloing from sharpening. A huge shame. 8', '2004-10-03 07:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(938116, 108767, 8522, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking... I wish I was an early person so I at least had a chance of ever capturing a photo like this. Not quite sure why you went for an almost square crop... I''d have preferred the traditional dimensions. 8</td>', 'Breathtaking... I wish I was an early person so I at least had a chance of ever capturing a photo like this. Not quite sure why you went for an almost square crop... I''d have preferred the traditional dimensions. 8', '2004-10-03 07:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(938117, 103788, 8522, '<td valign="top">Superb b&amp;w, works very well with this sky. Great detail and sharpness. The composition is a little too cluttered for me to give this top marks though. 8</td>', 'Superb b&w, works very well with this sky. Great detail and sharpness. The composition is a little too cluttered for me to give this top marks though. 8', '2004-10-03 07:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(938118, 107020, 8522, '<td valign="top">Stunning sky, good composition. Effective range of colours. Not quite enough to stop my eye from wandering out of the frame though. 8</td>', 'Stunning sky, good composition. Effective range of colours. Not quite enough to stop my eye from wandering out of the frame though. 8', '2004-10-03 07:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(938119, 105966, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot... I''d like it much more with the gamma raised and the highlights boosted so the outlines of the balloons in the background is clearer, and the sky is a little more blue. I don''t feel your border works... it looks like you''ve accidentally left some black at the edge of the frame from PS work. Great colours, good exposure, wonderful mood. 8</td>', 'Wonderful shot... I''d like it much more with the gamma raised and the highlights boosted so the outlines of the balloons in the background is clearer, and the sky is a little more blue. I don''t feel your border works... it looks like you''ve accidentally left some black at the edge of the frame from PS work. Great colours, good exposure, wonderful mood. 8', '2004-10-03 07:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(938120, 107969, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow... stopped motion water shots are always a good bet. Initially looks nice and sharp, but on closer inspection looks oversharpened... I suspect because the dof may not have been deep enough. Great assortment of colours. Looks a little like too much time was spent in PS tinkering... beyond the point of no return! A beautiful image though. 8</td>', 'Wow... stopped motion water shots are always a good bet. Initially looks nice and sharp, but on closer inspection looks oversharpened... I suspect because the dof may not have been deep enough. Great assortment of colours. Looks a little like too much time was spent in PS tinkering... beyond the point of no return! A beautiful image though. 8', '2004-10-03 07:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(938121, 107609, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, but I wish the face was as sharp as the suit, the texture you''ve captured is great! I''m not really sure a square crop works for me here... I think your idea may have been to have the cup as the pof using rule of thirds, but it is the face that I focus on, and it seems awkwadly placed in the frame. I would have liked the face just a bit better lit... the brightness in the rest of the frame is quite distracting. A nice moment captured though. 7</td>', 'Very nice shot, but I wish the face was as sharp as the suit, the texture you''ve captured is great! I''m not really sure a square crop works for me here... I think your idea may have been to have the cup as the pof using rule of thirds, but it is the face that I focus on, and it seems awkwadly placed in the frame. I would have liked the face just a bit better lit... the brightness in the rest of the frame is quite distracting. A nice moment captured though. 7', '2004-10-03 07:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(938122, 109014, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, nice and clear. I would have liked the eye to be a lot clearer though... it seems a bit dark here. I love the texture of the feathers. Nicely exposed, effective blurred background. Shame the tail isn''t in focus. 7</td>', 'Lovely shot, nice and clear. I would have liked the eye to be a lot clearer though... it seems a bit dark here. I love the texture of the feathers. Nicely exposed, effective blurred background. Shame the tail isn''t in focus. 7', '2004-10-03 07:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(938123, 108986, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot... I really wish both eyes were in focus though. My eye doesn''t want to settle on one eye only. Great clarity and detail, the feathers add loads of character. Good crop. 7</td>', 'Wonderful shot... I really wish both eyes were in focus though. My eye doesn''t want to settle on one eye only. Great clarity and detail, the feathers add loads of character. Good crop. 7', '2004-10-03 07:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(938124, 109019, 8522, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot, great expression and colours. The composition doesn''t quite work for me, I''m wondering why a square format was used? Everything seems awkwadly placed within the frame. I REALLY wish she was looking at the bubble in the shot, rather than off-frame. Although NeatImage could kill this shot, I can''t help thinking just a little would help reduce the very large amount of noise in this shot. 7</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot, great expression and colours. The composition doesn''t quite work for me, I''m wondering why a square format was used? Everything seems awkwadly placed within the frame. I REALLY wish she was looking at the bubble in the shot, rather than off-frame. Although NeatImage could kill this shot, I can''t help thinking just a little would help reduce the very large amount of noise in this shot. 7', '2004-10-03 07:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(938125, 107365, 8522, '<td valign="top">Reminds me very much of Kiwiness'' shot, and I''m afraid this one doesn''t have quite the same impact. I wish more of the snout were visible, as it takes a little while to work out what is facing which direction. Just a little more dof would have been great. Love the blurred green. 7</td>', 'Reminds me very much of Kiwiness'' shot, and I''m afraid this one doesn''t have quite the same impact. I wish more of the snout were visible, as it takes a little while to work out what is facing which direction. Just a little more dof would have been great. Love the blurred green. 7', '2004-10-03 07:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(938126, 103105, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo... it''s a shame that the main pof (the main monkey''s face) is so dark... I wish this was a lot lighter. Everything else is wonderful, although the texture of the hairs seems a bit soft. I love the baby''s expression. 7</td>', 'Wonderful photo... it''s a shame that the main pof (the main monkey''s face) is so dark... I wish this was a lot lighter. Everything else is wonderful, although the texture of the hairs seems a bit soft. I love the baby''s expression. 7', '2004-10-03 07:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(938127, 108642, 8522, '<td valign="top">Good backlighting, interesting composition which is nicely framed by the foliage and shadow. The greens are a bit too yellow here for this shot to really ''wow'' me, but it would be really hard in PS to liven up the colour of the grass. Lovely, emotive shot. 7</td>', 'Good backlighting, interesting composition which is nicely framed by the foliage and shadow. The greens are a bit too yellow here for this shot to really ''wow'' me, but it would be really hard in PS to liven up the colour of the grass. Lovely, emotive shot. 7', '2004-10-03 07:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(938128, 108875, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset, but I can''t work out why you have such bad jpeg artifacting for a 120kb file. It''s all over the shot, and the texture of the foreground grass looks really strange. It looks like something in PS has gone a bit wrong. I can''t help thinking that something a little more striking could have been achieved with this view and light. The sky seems a tad overexposed. 7</td>', 'Nice sunset, but I can''t work out why you have such bad jpeg artifacting for a 120kb file. It''s all over the shot, and the texture of the foreground grass looks really strange. It looks like something in PS has gone a bit wrong. I can''t help thinking that something a little more striking could have been achieved with this view and light. The sky seems a tad overexposed. 7', '2004-10-03 07:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(938129, 108984, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, very striking. I love the blue and red, the green could do with being a bit more vibrant. The thing that really puts me off is the glare... could you have sorted this with a polariser? Wonderful composition. 7</td>', 'Wow, very striking. I love the blue and red, the green could do with being a bit more vibrant. The thing that really puts me off is the glare... could you have sorted this with a polariser? Wonderful composition. 7', '2004-10-03 07:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(938130, 108872, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great Mediterrenean colours, reminds me of Andalucia. Nice and sharp. Good composition. Not quite enough to keep me captivated though. 7</td>', 'Great Mediterrenean colours, reminds me of Andalucia. Nice and sharp. Good composition. Not quite enough to keep me captivated though. 7', '2004-10-03 07:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(938131, 108991, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, but the foreground is too oversharpened for my taste. I feel this has taken away from the power of the shot. Great composition. I''m not quite sure about the colours chosen for your duotone... I think some different tones could really have maximised the impact of this photo. 7</td>', 'Wonderful shot, but the foreground is too oversharpened for my taste. I feel this has taken away from the power of the shot. Great composition. I''m not quite sure about the colours chosen for your duotone... I think some different tones could really have maximised the impact of this photo. 7', '2004-10-03 07:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(938132, 109032, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great idea, you seem to have gone to a lot of effort for this one! I think I''d have liked more sharpness here, especially your model''s face. By your shallow dof, you intended the pof to be on the shadow, but my eye rests on the boxer first... so I would have increased the dof. 7</td>', 'Great idea, you seem to have gone to a lot of effort for this one! I think I''d have liked more sharpness here, especially your model''s face. By your shallow dof, you intended the pof to be on the shadow, but my eye rests on the boxer first... so I would have increased the dof. 7', '2004-10-03 07:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(938133, 108122, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait, the limited dof works well here. Superb expression, lots of detail. Great eyes. The composition lets it down for me though. Is it trying to be centered, or off centre? This looks in-between like the photographer couldn''t make up their mind as to where to place him in the frame. I''d have cropped closer and lost more of the forehead. 7</td>', 'Wonderful portrait, the limited dof works well here. Superb expression, lots of detail. Great eyes. The composition lets it down for me though. Is it trying to be centered, or off centre? This looks in-between like the photographer couldn''t make up their mind as to where to place him in the frame. I''d have cropped closer and lost more of the forehead. 7', '2004-10-03 07:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(938134, 108949, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, the head is nice and sharp. Shame the dof couldn''t include the reast of the body. I love the bamboo. I''d definitely have gone for a tighter crop... the head is too far to the left for my taste in this shot. The foreground concrete thing really needs to go as well, it shouts ''zoo''! The perfect shot for me would have been a longer lens, with the head, upper legs and bamboo in portrait orientation. 7</td>', 'Wonderful shot, the head is nice and sharp. Shame the dof couldn''t include the reast of the body. I love the bamboo. I''d definitely have gone for a tighter crop... the head is too far to the left for my taste in this shot. The foreground concrete thing really needs to go as well, it shouts ''zoo''! The perfect shot for me would have been a longer lens, with the head, upper legs and bamboo in portrait orientation. 7', '2004-10-03 07:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(938135, 107901, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great composition, well timed capture. I normally don''t mind limited dof in a macro, but here I would have liked much more, especially on the wings. The greens could have used a bit of PS work, not quite vibrant enough here for my taste. The focus is slightly out... the eyes should be tack sharp, instead only a portion of some wings is really sharp. Not an easy shot though. 7</td>', 'Wow. Great composition, well timed capture. I normally don''t mind limited dof in a macro, but here I would have liked much more, especially on the wings. The greens could have used a bit of PS work, not quite vibrant enough here for my taste. The focus is slightly out... the eyes should be tack sharp, instead only a portion of some wings is really sharp. Not an easy shot though. 7', '2004-10-03 07:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(938136, 108233, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great capture, not really sure what''s happening here though. There''s a really distracting diagonal grey element in your background which doesn''t help. Incredibly sharp shot. Well exposed, great colours.  7</td>', 'Great capture, not really sure what''s happening here though. There''s a really distracting diagonal grey element in your background which doesn''t help. Incredibly sharp shot. Well exposed, great colours.  7', '2004-10-03 07:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(938137, 109008, 8522, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for parrot portraits, and this one''s a cracker(!). The feathers aren''t quite as defined as I''ve seen on other shots here, and it seems ever so slightly overexposed but the main thing that would have improved this in my eyes would have been to have nothing behind his beak. Above and to the right of his eye looks very blurred... did something go wrong in PS? 7</td>', 'I''m a sucker for parrot portraits, and this one''s a cracker(!). The feathers aren''t quite as defined as I''ve seen on other shots here, and it seems ever so slightly overexposed but the main thing that would have improved this in my eyes would have been to have nothing behind his beak. Above and to the right of his eye looks very blurred... did something go wrong in PS? 7', '2004-10-03 07:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(938138, 108173, 8522, '<td valign="top">Spectacular macro... the background doesn''t quite work for me, it''s too distracting especially as the change of colour cuts the hornet in half. Amazingly sharp, very deep dof for a macro such as this. It looks like you selectively blurred the foreground, and it looks a bit odd. 7</td>', 'Spectacular macro... the background doesn''t quite work for me, it''s too distracting especially as the change of colour cuts the hornet in half. Amazingly sharp, very deep dof for a macro such as this. It looks like you selectively blurred the foreground, and it looks a bit odd. 7', '2004-10-03 07:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(938139, 104027, 8522, '<td valign="top">This is a great architectural view, I think I would have liked it if you had zoomed in further and made it a bit more abstract. Also, the texture is to ''bitty'' for my taste. Great ratios and proportions in the composition, almost like golden mean. 7</td>', 'This is a great architectural view, I think I would have liked it if you had zoomed in further and made it a bit more abstract. Also, the texture is to ''bitty'' for my taste. Great ratios and proportions in the composition, almost like golden mean. 7', '2004-10-03 07:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(938140, 107202, 8522, '<td valign="top">I think I can guess who this is, and I REALLY want to like this... but I just don''t think this ranks up with your best shots. There''s nothing wrong with it, but it just doesn''t really do it for me. I know we''re not supposed to be looking at her face(!), but this would work for me better if she was looking to her left so I could see her face as well. I think it''s the lack of a clear pof here that bothers me... the background is quite busy, and lovely though her bottom is, I find my eye being drawn away by everything else without somewhere to settle. 7</td>', 'I think I can guess who this is, and I REALLY want to like this... but I just don''t think this ranks up with your best shots. There''s nothing wrong with it, but it just doesn''t really do it for me. I know we''re not supposed to be looking at her face(!), but this would work for me better if she was looking to her left so I could see her face as well. I think it''s the lack of a clear pof here that bothers me... the background is quite busy, and lovely though her bottom is, I find my eye being drawn away by everything else without somewhere to settle. 7', '2004-10-03 07:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(938141, 108072, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, good subject. I wish the background were completely green, I find the white element a bit distracting, especially as it''s the same colour as the shirt. This was a really tough exposure, and it''s a shame some of the shirt is overexposed. My overwhelming impression though is that I''m waiting for him to look more dynamic... my imagination feels that we''ve just missed or are about to see him looking much more interesting. I feel we''re missing action! 7</td>', 'Great portrait, good subject. I wish the background were completely green, I find the white element a bit distracting, especially as it''s the same colour as the shirt. This was a really tough exposure, and it''s a shame some of the shirt is overexposed. My overwhelming impression though is that I''m waiting for him to look more dynamic... my imagination feels that we''ve just missed or are about to see him looking much more interesting. I feel we''re missing action! 7', '2004-10-03 07:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(938142, 107091, 8522, '<td valign="top">An intriguing shot... I don''t quite understand what''s happening. Is this a man attached to a kite? Is this a hanglider being flown as a kite? Why is this megalomania? Great composition, but I wish there was more detail in the sky.  7</td>', 'An intriguing shot... I don''t quite understand what''s happening. Is this a man attached to a kite? Is this a hanglider being flown as a kite? Why is this megalomania? Great composition, but I wish there was more detail in the sky.  7', '2004-10-03 07:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(938143, 105984, 8522, '<td valign="top">Attractive shot, nice and sharp. Not sure about the composition though... it looks like you were trying to centre the head but didn''t quite manage it. The background is too cluttered to make this a really ''wow'' shot. It would be great if all the wing was in focus. Great colours. I would have gone for a much tighter crop. 7</td>', 'Attractive shot, nice and sharp. Not sure about the composition though... it looks like you were trying to centre the head but didn''t quite manage it. The background is too cluttered to make this a really ''wow'' shot. It would be great if all the wing was in focus. Great colours. I would have gone for a much tighter crop. 7', '2004-10-03 07:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(938144, 107387, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice street candid, shot looks way oversharpened though, there''s bad haloing around the instrument. B&amp;W a good choice here. Not quite sure about your crop. I''d have him right against the right hand edge of the frame without the wall, and include more of the case.  7</td>', 'Nice street candid, shot looks way oversharpened though, there''s bad haloing around the instrument. B&W a good choice here. Not quite sure about your crop. I''d have him right against the right hand edge of the frame without the wall, and include more of the case.  7', '2004-10-03 07:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(938145, 104134, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait, the light on the right of her face is a bit too bright for my taste, we lose all the details of her complexion. Beautifully posed. I think I may have flipped this horizontally... I''m not sure I like her facing to the left in this shot. I think a closer crop may have been more effective... there seems too much negative space in the frame, especially above her. The skin tones in the shadow areas are perfect. Very effective dof, but I would have liked her right eye as sharp as the left eye. 7</td>', 'Very nice portrait, the light on the right of her face is a bit too bright for my taste, we lose all the details of her complexion. Beautifully posed. I think I may have flipped this horizontally... I''m not sure I like her facing to the left in this shot. I think a closer crop may have been more effective... there seems too much negative space in the frame, especially above her. The skin tones in the shadow areas are perfect. Very effective dof, but I would have liked her right eye as sharp as the left eye. 7', '2004-10-03 07:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(938146, 108924, 8522, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colours, it''s a shame that the figure on the hill isn''t clear enough. The silhouettes look oversharpened. I think the figure is looking to the left, I would have prefered them further to the right looking into the frame. Centered doesn''t quite work for me. Great atmosphere evoked here though. 6</td>', 'Gorgeous colours, it''s a shame that the figure on the hill isn''t clear enough. The silhouettes look oversharpened. I think the figure is looking to the left, I would have prefered them further to the right looking into the frame. Centered doesn''t quite work for me. Great atmosphere evoked here though. 6', '2004-10-03 07:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(938147, 106931, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great view, and nice sky, but there''s not enough detail to keep my eye in the frame for long. The shot needs something else to keep the interest. 6</td>', 'Great view, and nice sky, but there''s not enough detail to keep my eye in the frame for long. The shot needs something else to keep the interest. 6', '2004-10-03 07:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(938148, 105647, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice colours here, and an interesting building, but the overall composition and use of silhouettes is not quite ''clean'' enough for my taste. Perhaps a panoramic crop might have suited this better. It''s a shame the treeline in front of the college isn''t more simple. 6</td>', 'Nice colours here, and an interesting building, but the overall composition and use of silhouettes is not quite ''clean'' enough for my taste. Perhaps a panoramic crop might have suited this better. It''s a shame the treeline in front of the college isn''t more simple. 6', '2004-10-03 07:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(938149, 107586, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, good choice of subject. The face is much too high contrast for my taste though, and I don''t think the out-of-focus hand works in the foreground. Great expression captured. 6</td>', 'Great portrait, good choice of subject. The face is much too high contrast for my taste though, and I don''t think the out-of-focus hand works in the foreground. Great expression captured. 6', '2004-10-03 07:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(938150, 107876, 8522, '<td valign="top">This shot doesn''t really do a lot for me, but is well taken, evenly lit, effective background, good use of dof. There''s a bit too much glare on the strawberry which you could have removed with a polariser. 6</td>', 'This shot doesn''t really do a lot for me, but is well taken, evenly lit, effective background, good use of dof. There''s a bit too much glare on the strawberry which you could have removed with a polariser. 6', '2004-10-03 07:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(938151, 104030, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice waterfall shot, but rather oversharpened. There''s a plant to the left of the frame in front of the waterfall which is a bit distracting. Shame the waterfall itself is a little overexposed. 6</td>', 'Nice waterfall shot, but rather oversharpened. There''s a plant to the left of the frame in front of the waterfall which is a bit distracting. Shame the waterfall itself is a little overexposed. 6', '2004-10-03 07:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(938152, 103219, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot, unusual composition. The bones around the neck look a little awkward to me though, rather than graceful which is what I think you were going for. The top seems a little to bright compared to the rest of the frame and becomes too much of a distracting element. I noticed some artifacting, and can''t believe how small you''ve made this file (about 28k). Why not save at 150k? 6</td>', 'Very interesting shot, unusual composition. The bones around the neck look a little awkward to me though, rather than graceful which is what I think you were going for. The top seems a little to bright compared to the rest of the frame and becomes too much of a distracting element. I noticed some artifacting, and can''t believe how small you''ve made this file (about 28k). Why not save at 150k? 6', '2004-10-03 07:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(938153, 108275, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great capture, the eyes are extremely expressive here. The composition/crop seems a bit of an afterthought though, the eyes look oversharpened and the dof is too shallow. The white background element on the left of the frame should have been cloned out, it''s quite distracting. The overall gamma seems very high, the photo looks a bit washed out. I''d lower the gamma and increase the contrast. 6</td>', 'Great capture, the eyes are extremely expressive here. The composition/crop seems a bit of an afterthought though, the eyes look oversharpened and the dof is too shallow. The white background element on the left of the frame should have been cloned out, it''s quite distracting. The overall gamma seems very high, the photo looks a bit washed out. I''d lower the gamma and increase the contrast. 6', '2004-10-03 07:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(938154, 108832, 8522, '<td valign="top">A very nice sunset, and some great colours, but there''s not really enough here to sustain my interest. You have some bad vignetting in your corners. 6</td>', 'A very nice sunset, and some great colours, but there''s not really enough here to sustain my interest. You have some bad vignetting in your corners. 6', '2004-10-03 07:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(938155, 109013, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... conjures up an emotive sense of ennui. I wish the man didn''t blend so much into the background though. Not quite sure about the composition... too much room on the left of the frame and the boy on the right is too centered for my taste. It feels like it was an arbitrary decision to frame it like this because you didn''t want to be unimaginative and place everything dead centre. The pylons on the right are a bit distracting. 6</td>', 'Nice shot... conjures up an emotive sense of ennui. I wish the man didn''t blend so much into the background though. Not quite sure about the composition... too much room on the left of the frame and the boy on the right is too centered for my taste. It feels like it was an arbitrary decision to frame it like this because you didn''t want to be unimaginative and place everything dead centre. The pylons on the right are a bit distracting. 6', '2004-10-03 07:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(938156, 108276, 8522, '<td valign="top">Some beautiful light, and I like the neatimaged clouds but the composition here is a bit chaotic to me. I''m not really sure what the pof is here. The trees and hills look way oversharpened... to the point of actually losing detail. 6</td>', 'Some beautiful light, and I like the neatimaged clouds but the composition here is a bit chaotic to me. I''m not really sure what the pof is here. The trees and hills look way oversharpened... to the point of actually losing detail. 6', '2004-10-03 07:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(938157, 103615, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice, sensitive portrait. The green eyes have been overdone here though. Shame the backlighting on the hair is overexposed. I find the background a bit too distracting. Great model... but there''s something about her expression and her mouth that seems a bit awkward. Good composition, but perhaps a tighter crop could have worked better... do you really need space at the top of her head? 6</td>', 'Nice, sensitive portrait. The green eyes have been overdone here though. Shame the backlighting on the hair is overexposed. I find the background a bit too distracting. Great model... but there''s something about her expression and her mouth that seems a bit awkward. Good composition, but perhaps a tighter crop could have worked better... do you really need space at the top of her head? 6', '2004-10-03 07:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(938158, 108569, 8522, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but not enough sharpness in the shot to keep my interest. This duotone doesn''t quite work for me. 5</td>', 'Good composition, but not enough sharpness in the shot to keep my interest. This duotone doesn''t quite work for me. 5', '2004-10-03 07:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(938159, 108210, 8522, '<td valign="top">This shot doesn''t really do a lot for me... it''s the composition that I feel really lets this down. The Beacon looks like it just happened to end up somewhere near the middle of the frame, and there is no clear pof... there are too many cluttered distracting elements here. The foliage looks oversharpened. I like the fact that it looks like you used a polariser. 5</td>', 'This shot doesn''t really do a lot for me... it''s the composition that I feel really lets this down. The Beacon looks like it just happened to end up somewhere near the middle of the frame, and there is no clear pof... there are too many cluttered distracting elements here. The foliage looks oversharpened. I like the fact that it looks like you used a polariser. 5', '2004-10-03 07:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(938160, 107599, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, reminds me of one of my shots from Scotland(!). Horizon well placed, breaking the frame into 3rds. Left hand edge of frame is too burnt out for my taste, and I don''t like foreground diagonal leading my eye out of the right hand side of the frame. The foreground textures look a little soft... some sharp sand textures could have added some ''wow'' to the shot, if you''re using a DSLR you probably would have needed a tripod for the dof. Horizon on the right of the shot looks a bit cluttered. The footsteps are a nice touch, but are a bit too subtle. Some dodging and burning could have cured this. The sky could have done with a polariser, which may have solved your burnt out highlights. 5</td>', 'Nice shot, reminds me of one of my shots from Scotland(!). Horizon well placed, breaking the frame into 3rds. Left hand edge of frame is too burnt out for my taste, and I don''t like foreground diagonal leading my eye out of the right hand side of the frame. The foreground textures look a little soft... some sharp sand textures could have added some ''wow'' to the shot, if you''re using a DSLR you probably would have needed a tripod for the dof. Horizon on the right of the shot looks a bit cluttered. The footsteps are a nice touch, but are a bit too subtle. Some dodging and burning could have cured this. The sky could have done with a polariser, which may have solved your burnt out highlights. 5', '2004-10-03 07:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(938161, 107995, 8522, '<td valign="top">This must have taken you a few goes to integrate the magazine with your model so flawlessly. I have to say though that this photo doesn''t really do a lot for me... I see a well taken snapshot. I don''t know why, but the edge of her left arm is grey... what did you do in PS that resulted in this?! 4</td>', 'This must have taken you a few goes to integrate the magazine with your model so flawlessly. I have to say though that this photo doesn''t really do a lot for me... I see a well taken snapshot. I don''t know why, but the edge of her left arm is grey... what did you do in PS that resulted in this?! 4', '2004-10-03 07:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(938162, 108992, 8522, '<td valign="top">I''m not really a fan of Monet''s haystacks... maybe this is why when I look at this photo and admire the long shadows and rich colours I wish I were there to point my camera at something else! The haystacks don''t really stand out enough against the ground for the composition to really ''wow'' me, and it''s a shame the wispy clouds on the left don''t really add much interest to the sky. The greens in this photo are a bit dull... I''d have livened them up a tad in PS. I think the main problem with the composition is that there is no clear POF... my eye doesn''t really know where to settle and where to flow to. 4</td>', 'I''m not really a fan of Monet''s haystacks... maybe this is why when I look at this photo and admire the long shadows and rich colours I wish I were there to point my camera at something else! The haystacks don''t really stand out enough against the ground for the composition to really ''wow'' me, and it''s a shame the wispy clouds on the left don''t really add much interest to the sky. The greens in this photo are a bit dull... I''d have livened them up a tad in PS. I think the main problem with the composition is that there is no clear POF... my eye doesn''t really know where to settle and where to flow to. 4', '2004-10-03 07:48:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(938163, 108269, 8522, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured some nice light, but the PS work looks very unconvincing. If the sky were really that dark, there''s no way the sea and land would look that light. I also think the shafts of light are too overexposed to work well here. The colour of the sea is a bit dull... I''d have fixed that in PS. 4</td>', 'You''ve captured some nice light, but the PS work looks very unconvincing. If the sky were really that dark, there''s no way the sea and land would look that light. I also think the shafts of light are too overexposed to work well here. The colour of the sea is a bit dull... I''d have fixed that in PS. 4', '2004-10-03 07:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(938164, 108454, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nicely polarised sky... not much here to keep my interest though. Looks like it was composed with rule of thirds in mind... but other than that I''m not quite sure what you were wanting to achieve with this. Some VERY bad JPEG artifacting... the photo is only about 90k, you could have saved a 150k file. 4</td>', 'Nicely polarised sky... not much here to keep my interest though. Looks like it was composed with rule of thirds in mind... but other than that I''m not quite sure what you were wanting to achieve with this. Some VERY bad JPEG artifacting... the photo is only about 90k, you could have saved a 150k file. 4', '2004-10-03 07:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(938165, 108995, 8522, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any guitarists here. I''m not into your crop, I''m not sure where you intended the pof to be. Grain in b&amp;w gig shots can work very well, but it hasn''t done it for me here, maybe because there isn''t enough tonal contrast here for my liking. There is loads of contrast on the arm though, but this stands out too much against the rest of the picture. I feel that the face is where I want to rest, and it''s just not clear enough here. I think that the bass player would have looked like this throughout the entire gig, and you haven''t captured him at a key moment. 4</td>', 'I don''t see any guitarists here. I''m not into your crop, I''m not sure where you intended the pof to be. Grain in b&w gig shots can work very well, but it hasn''t done it for me here, maybe because there isn''t enough tonal contrast here for my liking. There is loads of contrast on the arm though, but this stands out too much against the rest of the picture. I feel that the face is where I want to rest, and it''s just not clear enough here. I think that the bass player would have looked like this throughout the entire gig, and you haven''t captured him at a key moment. 4', '2004-10-03 07:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(938166, 109031, 8522, '<td valign="top">This shot doesn''t do much for me, the stopped water droplets are nice but I don''t think you''ve made the most of them. I think the main problem for me is that in major cities you can see statues like this everywhere, and there''s nothing in this photo that makes me see them in a new way. To me, this is a bit of a snapshot photo. I don''t think the grimy colours and textures on the arms help. 4</td>', 'This shot doesn''t do much for me, the stopped water droplets are nice but I don''t think you''ve made the most of them. I think the main problem for me is that in major cities you can see statues like this everywhere, and there''s nothing in this photo that makes me see them in a new way. To me, this is a bit of a snapshot photo. I don''t think the grimy colours and textures on the arms help. 4', '2004-10-03 07:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(938172, 108569, 7263, '<td valign="top">A very well thought out angle to shoot from. When your shooting such a popular subject it makes it hard to create something that stands out.<br/> <br/>However, there isn''t much of a focal point here - the top is very nice nd takes your eye, but to me the bottom is just a little bit too messy with what looks like a person, a building, a bush and the bottom of the tower.<br/></td>', 'A very well thought out angle to shoot from. When your shooting such a popular subject it makes it hard to create something that stands out. However, there isn''t much of a focal point here - the top is very nice nd takes your eye, but to me the bottom is just a little bit too messy with what looks like a person, a building, a bush and the bottom of the tower.', '2004-10-03 08:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(938173, 106707, 24764, '<td valign="top">Out of a dream. Nice work</td>', 'Out of a dream. Nice work', '2004-10-03 08:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(938175, 108986, 7263, '<td valign="top">Whilst I think you have done a good job of snapping an interesting animal I don''t think this has much going for it apart from that. As a record of an animal it works well, but for an artistic photograph it is lacking.<br/> <br/>The bird isn''t looking at the camera and the DOF is too shallow which throws his left eye out of focus. I am fine with the grain - i am sure a lot of people will not like that (preferring Neat image no doubt) but I presume you had to shoot some pretty high ISO in these conditions.<br/> <br/> <br/>Overall a very good shot - just nothing fantastic.<br/></td>', 'Whilst I think you have done a good job of snapping an interesting animal I don''t think this has much going for it apart from that. As a record of an animal it works well, but for an artistic photograph it is lacking. The bird isn''t looking at the camera and the DOF is too shallow which throws his left eye out of focus. I am fine with the grain - i am sure a lot of people will not like that (preferring Neat image no doubt) but I presume you had to shoot some pretty high ISO in these conditions.  Overall a very good shot - just nothing fantastic.', '2004-10-03 08:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(938176, 107609, 24764, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, really amazing black &amp; white.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, really amazing black & white.', '2004-10-03 08:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(938177, 108875, 7263, '<td valign="top">As far as quality of light goes - this has been taken at a nice time of day so full marks on that front.<br/> <br/>That aside I feel with a little bit more thought one could have made this quite good. I really like to see people use some foreground element to give their landscapes depth but you have decided against this here. Even by using a path or natural trail can add some depth but here this seems to have been neglected.<br/> <br/>This results in quite a flat looking scene.</td>', 'As far as quality of light goes - this has been taken at a nice time of day so full marks on that front. That aside I feel with a little bit more thought one could have made this quite good. I really like to see people use some foreground element to give their landscapes depth but you have decided against this here. Even by using a path or natural trail can add some depth but here this seems to have been neglected. This results in quite a flat looking scene.', '2004-10-03 08:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(938178, 103219, 7263, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what this photo is trying to convey - having that much body seems to create a flat feeling - being that she is straight on and there is no ''form'' to the human shape.<br/> <br/>Also the background is very mottled which I find quite distracting. It looks like finger prints on my screen :D<br/></td>', 'Not really sure what this photo is trying to convey - having that much body seems to create a flat feeling - being that she is straight on and there is no ''form'' to the human shape. Also the background is very mottled which I find quite distracting. It looks like finger prints on my screen :D', '2004-10-03 08:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(938179, 108875, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice soft light, very peaceful atmosphere. The grass in the foreground could do with a lillte desaturation in my opinion, it has much more color than the rest of the scene.</td>', 'Nice soft light, very peaceful atmosphere. The grass in the foreground could do with a lillte desaturation in my opinion, it has much more color than the rest of the scene.', '2004-10-03 08:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(938180, 106171, 4008, '<td valign="top">Perfect bird portrait with great detail and colors, good neutral background as well.</td>', 'Perfect bird portrait with great detail and colors, good neutral background as well.', '2004-10-03 08:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(938181, 103619, 7263, '<td valign="top">Very good idea indeed - at last some creativity.<br/> <br/>lighting etc is all good - my only beef is the faded line - I really think if would have cut that sharp it would have added a lot more impact. That aside a very good effot.<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Very good idea indeed - at last some creativity. lighting etc is all good - my only beef is the faded line - I really think if would have cut that sharp it would have added a lot more impact. That aside a very good effot.  ', '2004-10-03 08:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(938182, 104134, 4008, '<td valign="top">Very nice natural portrait, good confident expression. It looks just a little bit too soft, could do with some sharpening in the face in my opinion.</td>', 'Very nice natural portrait, good confident expression. It looks just a little bit too soft, could do with some sharpening in the face in my opinion.', '2004-10-03 08:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(938183, 106953, 7263, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot here I like the dark brooding color and her slightly off pose.<br/>She is very well lit too.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like is the lack of detail on her face - almost looks like she is just about to start melting. not sure if this is makeup neat image or lighting but it looks very tonal and soft/</td>', 'A very nice shot here I like the dark brooding color and her slightly off pose.She is very well lit too. What I don''t like is the lack of detail on her face - almost looks like she is just about to start melting. not sure if this is makeup neat image or lighting but it looks very tonal and soft/', '2004-10-03 08:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(938184, 108767, 7263, '<td valign="top">I have gotten up many morning s at 5:00am to find a scen like this and have never managed to catch it. Rolling hill fog is a photographers dream and you have ca[ptured it very well. My only beefs are the format doesn''t work to me (square) and if possible I would have gotten higher to look down on the fog.<br/> <br/>Still a uniqe and well timed photo.</td>', 'I have gotten up many morning s at 5:00am to find a scen like this and have never managed to catch it. Rolling hill fog is a photographers dream and you have ca[ptured it very well. My only beefs are the format doesn''t work to me (square) and if possible I would have gotten higher to look down on the fog. Still a uniqe and well timed photo.', '2004-10-03 08:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(938186, 106488, 24764, '<td valign="top">This seems very new to me, but what you have done here is really beautiful. Wonderful depth of field and the human figure together with the dog in the background does turn this whole picture into a charming piece of art.</td>', 'This seems very new to me, but what you have done here is really beautiful. Wonderful depth of field and the human figure together with the dog in the background does turn this whole picture into a charming piece of art.', '2004-10-03 08:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(938189, 106953, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love the low-key tones and high contrast.  She certainly looks like she''s some native woman from one of the pacific islands, or S. America.  8</td>', 'Love the low-key tones and high contrast.  She certainly looks like she''s some native woman from one of the pacific islands, or S. America.  8', '2004-10-03 08:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
