(938193, 108210, 10047, '<td valign="top">To much foreground for me, and I think I might have tried darkening it a little. We had our first frost this morning, and I wish I was in this picture. It has a warm and breezy feel.  Nicely done.</td>', 'To much foreground for me, and I think I might have tried darkening it a little. We had our first frost this morning, and I wish I was in this picture. It has a warm and breezy feel.  Nicely done.', '2004-10-03 08:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(938195, 108924, 10047, '<td valign="top">Mystical and maybe little haunting. Nice array of colors and cloud patterns.</td>', 'Mystical and maybe little haunting. Nice array of colors and cloud patterns.', '2004-10-03 08:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(938196, 107202, 7263, '<td valign="top">focus on this is 100% spot on. The girl really stands out from her background without  throwing it into a deep blur.<br/> <br/>Lighting etc is all perfect too so technically a very good shot in my opinion.<br/> <br/>Subject amateur to me is very tacky so that doesn''t get my goat - also the background is maybe a little to rickety cluttered&gt; Not sure.<br/> <br/>Overall a very well taken photo.</td>', 'focus on this is 100% spot on. The girl really stands out from her background without  throwing it into a deep blur. Lighting etc is all perfect too so technically a very good shot in my opinion. Subject amateur to me is very tacky so that doesn''t get my goat - also the background is maybe a little to rickety cluttered> Not sure. Overall a very well taken photo.', '2004-10-03 08:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
