(938200, 104134, 10047, '<td valign="top">Miss Attitude? Attractive model and good capture on the expression. I think I''d like a little more contrast.</td>', 'Miss Attitude? Attractive model and good capture on the expression. I think I''d like a little more contrast.', '2004-10-03 08:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
