(938220, 108832, 7263, '<td valign="top">a nice sunset, but nothign else. No foreground, no detail, no shapes and textures.<br/> <br/>One of the things I have learnt is not to rely on one element for your photo. So many people see a good sky and shoot it without thinking about anythign esle. Others ee an interesting person or bird for example, and shoot that giving 100&amp; of thought on the main subject.<br/> <br/></td>', 'a nice sunset, but nothign else. No foreground, no detail, no shapes and textures. One of the things I have learnt is not to rely on one element for your photo. So many people see a good sky and shoot it without thinking about anythign esle. Others ee an interesting person or bird for example, and shoot that giving 100& of thought on the main subject. ', '2004-10-03 08:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
