(938416, 105984, 714, '<td valign="top">A purtiful butterfly.  I have never seen one this color.  Awesome macro.</td>', 'A purtiful butterfly.  I have never seen one this color.  Awesome macro.', '2004-10-03 11:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(938417, 109019, 714, '<td valign="top">I love her expression.  She is a doll.  The color tones are awesome.  What ever you did, it gave it a painted look.  Awesome!</td>', 'I love her expression.  She is a doll.  The color tones are awesome.  What ever you did, it gave it a painted look.  Awesome!', '2004-10-03 11:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(938418, 108122, 1202, '<td valign="top">I like this with the exception of the extra bright eyes and soft focus. I think sharp focus would bring out the startled look, if that is what you were after.   5</td>', 'I like this with the exception of the extra bright eyes and soft focus. I think sharp focus would bring out the startled look, if that is what you were after.   5', '2004-10-03 11:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(938421, 108949, 714, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  You captured the personality of the tiger well here.</td>', 'Great shot.  You captured the personality of the tiger well here.', '2004-10-03 11:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(938422, 109032, 714, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot to look at.  Not sure I like the blurred forground though.  Is there a way you could have put it behind her?   Her face is also a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Interesting shot to look at.  Not sure I like the blurred forground though.  Is there a way you could have put it behind her?   Her face is also a bit out of focus.', '2004-10-03 11:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(938423, 106953, 27524, '<td valign="top">Beatiful! Maybe im wrong but would like to see it without hair on her face.</td>', 'Beatiful! Maybe im wrong but would like to see it without hair on her face.', '2004-10-03 11:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(938424, 106707, 1202, '<td valign="top">As I look at this I have to wonder, were the clouds really that color?  If so what a wonderful capture of the moment.  I would like to see more detail in the castle. 8</td>', 'As I look at this I have to wonder, were the clouds really that color?  If so what a wonderful capture of the moment.  I would like to see more detail in the castle. 8', '2004-10-03 11:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(938425, 108897, 714, '<td valign="top">It wouldn''t matter what props you had she is so beautiful that it would look good no matter what. LOL...great shot!  <br/> <br/>To much shadow on the left side.</td>', 'It wouldn''t matter what props you had she is so beautiful that it would look good no matter what. LOL...great shot!   To much shadow on the left side.', '2004-10-03 11:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(938426, 104134, 714, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but it is to grey for me.  I would like to see more contrast to make the darker areas darker.</td>', 'Great shot, but it is to grey for me.  I would like to see more contrast to make the darker areas darker.', '2004-10-03 11:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(938427, 108986, 714, '<td valign="top">Owls have to be the kewlest looking animal.  I love there eyes.  Awesome shot!</td>', 'Owls have to be the kewlest looking animal.  I love there eyes.  Awesome shot!', '2004-10-03 11:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(938429, 107365, 27524, '<td valign="top">Stunning green reflections.</td>', 'Stunning green reflections.', '2004-10-03 11:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(938430, 108991, 1202, '<td valign="top">A very thought provoking scene. One where a person could get their thoughts together. Good choice of desaturation.  DOF could have been greater to bring near trees into focus to give viewer a clear picture after being drawn in by the shoreline.  8</td>', 'A very thought provoking scene. One where a person could get their thoughts together. Good choice of desaturation.  DOF could have been greater to bring near trees into focus to give viewer a clear picture after being drawn in by the shoreline.  8', '2004-10-03 11:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(938432, 108210, 1202, '<td valign="top">Great setting but with just too much sand.  If you could have given more sky and cropped the beach just behind the first abrupt rise, I think it would POP.  IMO the sand overpowers the beacon and wonderfully clear sky.  6</td>', 'Great setting but with just too much sand.  If you could have given more sky and cropped the beach just behind the first abrupt rise, I think it would POP.  IMO the sand overpowers the beacon and wonderfully clear sky.  6', '2004-10-03 11:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(938434, 108986, 1202, '<td valign="top">IMO the DOF should have been deeper on this shot, with a bit more in focus.  They are great eyes but the texture of the feathers are needed to set this shot off.  6</td>', 'IMO the DOF should have been deeper on this shot, with a bit more in focus.  They are great eyes but the texture of the feathers are needed to set this shot off.  6', '2004-10-03 11:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(938436, 108843, 1202, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, Wonderful shot. If anything I would like the rock a little more into the picture and a little lower.  It looks like the sun is high in the sky, but yet the horizon shows the color of either a sunset or sunrise, seems odd to me. Or is that the moon up there?  9</td>', 'Wonderful, Wonderful shot. If anything I would like the rock a little more into the picture and a little lower.  It looks like the sun is high in the sky, but yet the horizon shows the color of either a sunset or sunrise, seems odd to me. Or is that the moon up there?  9', '2004-10-03 11:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(938439, 107397, 1202, '<td valign="top">If this isn''t by Heida, then you should be proud I made the mistake.  Great style keep it up.  Your post processing is a little too noticeable for me but still great. 9</td>', 'If this isn''t by Heida, then you should be proud I made the mistake.  Great style keep it up.  Your post processing is a little too noticeable for me but still great. 9', '2004-10-03 11:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(938444, 105966, 1202, '<td valign="top">Excellent !  Perfect timming and exposure.  10</td>', 'Excellent !  Perfect timming and exposure.  10', '2004-10-03 12:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(938446, 105984, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice close up.  Too bad your depth of field wasn''t deeper to bring the back wing into focus.  I think I would have tried to get more legs in the shot with just two being prominant the butterfly looks a littl odd.  5</td>', 'Nice close up.  Too bad your depth of field wasn''t deeper to bring the back wing into focus.  I think I would have tried to get more legs in the shot with just two being prominant the butterfly looks a littl odd.  5', '2004-10-03 12:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(938447, 107387, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is so much a candid shot, his direct look at the camera really spoils it for me.  I visualize him kacing the left, head tilted back, and eyes closed in completeconcentration of his music. Still a super shot.  8</td>', 'This is so much a candid shot, his direct look at the camera really spoils it for me.  I visualize him kacing the left, head tilted back, and eyes closed in completeconcentration of his music. Still a super shot.  8', '2004-10-03 12:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(938448, 107609, 8139, '<td valign="top">J.J.Beguin style. I like the great amount of shadow negative space.<br/>Shame the "glass" seems to be a plastic goblet. The title explain the action, I wonder if you could maintain the great qualities of the photo with a composition showing the cider press?</td>', 'J.J.Beguin style. I like the great amount of shadow negative space.Shame the "glass" seems to be a plastic goblet. The title explain the action, I wonder if you could maintain the great qualities of the photo with a composition showing the cider press?', '2004-10-03 12:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(938449, 103219, 15920, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  On this monitor, the clothing lacks a little detail, and the lip looks a little over exposed.  The crop is great</td>', 'Nicely done.  On this monitor, the clothing lacks a little detail, and the lip looks a little over exposed.  The crop is great', '2004-10-03 12:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(938450, 107969, 15920, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to make of this.  It is incredibly well lit, the background is almost perfectly blurred, but I don''t understand the overall message.</td>', 'Not sure what to make of this.  It is incredibly well lit, the background is almost perfectly blurred, but I don''t understand the overall message.', '2004-10-03 12:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(938451, 109019, 1202, '<td valign="top">A beauty. I sure want to see more of her eyes.  It looks like you cropped it from the center of a distant shot and it is starting to break up.  If not I would like less of a soft focus.  6</td>', 'A beauty. I sure want to see more of her eyes.  It looks like you cropped it from the center of a distant shot and it is starting to break up.  If not I would like less of a soft focus.  6', '2004-10-03 12:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(938453, 103189, 15920, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing.  This is personal taste, but more detail on the shoreline would have made this more interesting for me.</td>', 'Perfect timing.  This is personal taste, but more detail on the shoreline would have made this more interesting for me.', '2004-10-03 12:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(938454, 106707, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is great.  I''m sure the red isn''t natural, but it works perfectly here.  The lighting on the castle is awesome.</td>', 'This is great.  I''m sure the red isn''t natural, but it works perfectly here.  The lighting on the castle is awesome.', '2004-10-03 12:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(938455, 107969, 8139, '<td valign="top">spectacular one :)</td>', 'spectacular one :)', '2004-10-03 12:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(938458, 108949, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a good image, but the background looks a bit staged.  It also looks like you didn''t have as much control of the lighting as you would like.  That said, I love the expression capture on the tiger.  I would not want to be on the other end of that stare.</td>', 'This is a good image, but the background looks a bit staged.  It also looks like you didn''t have as much control of the lighting as you would like.  That said, I love the expression capture on the tiger.  I would not want to be on the other end of that stare.', '2004-10-03 12:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(938459, 105984, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a decent bug shot, but in this competition, I think there are one or two that are stronger.  Hope you do OK in the voting.</td>', 'This is a decent bug shot, but in this competition, I think there are one or two that are stronger.  Hope you do OK in the voting.', '2004-10-03 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(938460, 108569, 15920, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the highlights being as strong as they are, but that is a personal taste comment, not a comment on your technique.</td>', 'Not sure I like the highlights being as strong as they are, but that is a personal taste comment, not a comment on your technique.', '2004-10-03 12:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(938461, 106931, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a great landscape.  I like almost everything about this, especially the long sightlines with noe smoke, haze, or humidity.  Look forward to reading your notes.</td>', 'This is a great landscape.  I like almost everything about this, especially the long sightlines with noe smoke, haze, or humidity.  Look forward to reading your notes.', '2004-10-03 12:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(938462, 108122, 15920, '<td valign="top">Certainly captures the spirit of the moment.  It will be interesting to see how this fares against some of the other entries.</td>', 'Certainly captures the spirit of the moment.  It will be interesting to see how this fares against some of the other entries.', '2004-10-03 12:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(938463, 105647, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excellent night shot and the College is illuminated quite nicely. I rather liked the silhouette in the right half of the image but not sure if the lights in the buildings were cloned out if it would look better or not. As negative space goes, your image closely adheres to the rule of thirds but I think it would look better with more sky vs empty black. 7</td>', 'Excellent night shot and the College is illuminated quite nicely. I rather liked the silhouette in the right half of the image but not sure if the lights in the buildings were cloned out if it would look better or not. As negative space goes, your image closely adheres to the rule of thirds but I think it would look better with more sky vs empty black. 7', '2004-10-03 12:33:14.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(938470, 108984, 8054, '<td valign="top">Amazing details! One can almost feel the smooth texture of the pepper. Lighting is also very good with nice tones and gradations in color and light. 10</td>', 'Amazing details! One can almost feel the smooth texture of the pepper. Lighting is also very good with nice tones and gradations in color and light. 10', '2004-10-03 12:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(938471, 107995, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Some small mismatches between the magazine and the model''s face are the issue.  The hair curling into the neck is probably the thing I noticed first.  Other than that, this is incredibly well done.</td>', 'Great idea.  Some small mismatches between the magazine and the model''s face are the issue.  The hair curling into the neck is probably the thing I noticed first.  Other than that, this is incredibly well done.', '2004-10-03 12:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(938473, 108767, 15920, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  In a normal competition, this would be tops.  I hope you do well in the voting, but there are some really great landscapes competing.</td>', 'Nice shot.  In a normal competition, this would be tops.  I hope you do well in the voting, but there are some really great landscapes competing.', '2004-10-03 12:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(938474, 103788, 8624, '<td valign="top">great point of view. makes you feel slike you are sailing on the ship. I love the tones and the shadows cast by hte lines on the sails. well done!</td>', 'great point of view. makes you feel slike you are sailing on the ship. I love the tones and the shadows cast by hte lines on the sails. well done!', '2004-10-03 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(938475, 109014, 15920, '<td valign="top">Best bird shot I have seen so far.  I love the detail in the feathers.</td>', 'Best bird shot I have seen so far.  I love the detail in the feathers.', '2004-10-03 12:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(938476, 108872, 8624, '<td valign="top">simple and effective with great bold colors. I wish there was a little more of the background wall at the bottom of the frame - the sun and the garlands look a little crowded in the lower corner.</td>', 'simple and effective with great bold colors. I wish there was a little more of the background wall at the bottom of the frame - the sun and the garlands look a little crowded in the lower corner.', '2004-10-03 12:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(938477, 108875, 15920, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  In a normal competition, this would be tops.  I hope you do well in the voting, but there are some really great landscapes competing.</td>', 'Nice shot.  In a normal competition, this would be tops.  I hope you do well in the voting, but there are some really great landscapes competing.', '2004-10-03 12:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(938478, 107586, 8624, '<td valign="top">very dramatic lighting. I like the far off gaze of the child. the out of focus hand is somewhat of a distraction.</td>', 'very dramatic lighting. I like the far off gaze of the child. the out of focus hand is somewhat of a distraction.', '2004-10-03 12:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(938480, 106953, 8624, '<td valign="top">very pretty girl with beautiful dark eyes. I like the off center placement of the subject. the wisp of hair across her face doesn''t look natural to me though. It looks too stiff.</td>', 'very pretty girl with beautiful dark eyes. I like the off center placement of the subject. the wisp of hair across her face doesn''t look natural to me though. It looks too stiff.', '2004-10-03 12:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(938481, 107091, 8624, '<td valign="top">great moment captured. it has almost a Wright Brothers feel to it. I like the mount of sky you included to enhance the sense of scale but it might have worked a little better with less.</td>', 'great moment captured. it has almost a Wright Brothers feel to it. I like the mount of sky you included to enhance the sense of scale but it might have worked a little better with less.', '2004-10-03 12:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(938482, 107599, 8624, '<td valign="top">a well composed landcsape shot. it''s a little dark on the sand - waiting a bit longer might have thrown more light there which would give you  chance to better emphasize the footprints. the prints, to me, give more compositional interest to the shot, so I would have liked them to be more apparent.</td>', 'a well composed landcsape shot. it''s a little dark on the sand - waiting a bit longer might have thrown more light there which would give you  chance to better emphasize the footprints. the prints, to me, give more compositional interest to the shot, so I would have liked them to be more apparent.', '2004-10-03 12:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(938483, 107397, 15920, '<td valign="top">Just not sure about the crop.  The space on the right seems to either want to be smaller or bigger.  Not sure because I don''t know what else is there.</td>', 'Just not sure about the crop.  The space on the right seems to either want to be smaller or bigger.  Not sure because I don''t know what else is there.', '2004-10-03 12:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(938484, 108991, 8624, '<td valign="top">beautifully tones. the square crop works for me here. I like how the complex nature scene just fades off into the fog.</td>', 'beautifully tones. the square crop works for me here. I like how the complex nature scene just fades off into the fog.', '2004-10-03 12:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(938485, 108832, 15920, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  In a normal competition, this would be tops.  I hope you do well in the voting, but there are some really great horizons competing.</td>', 'Nice shot.  In a normal competition, this would be tops.  I hope you do well in the voting, but there are some really great horizons competing.', '2004-10-03 12:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(938486, 107397, 8624, '<td valign="top">fantastic lighting, interesting textures and a great sky. the building seem crowded to the left of the frame though.</td>', 'fantastic lighting, interesting textures and a great sky. the building seem crowded to the left of the frame though.', '2004-10-03 12:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(938487, 104027, 8054, '<td valign="top">An amazing use of leading lines (curves)!  My eyes just flow all over the curves and circles very smoothly. Very interesting building, as well. To be very nit picky, I would have cropped the left side a tad to meet the corner where the large arc meets the circle from the glass ceiling frame (left edge of the frame). That way your eye is forced to choose that line and flow back to the right. 9</td>', 'An amazing use of leading lines (curves)!  My eyes just flow all over the curves and circles very smoothly. Very interesting building, as well. To be very nit picky, I would have cropped the left side a tad to meet the corner where the large arc meets the circle from the glass ceiling frame (left edge of the frame). That way your eye is forced to choose that line and flow back to the right. 9', '2004-10-03 12:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(938489, 108276, 15920, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The weather and dark clouds didn''t help you.  I hope you do well in the voting, but there are some really great landscapes competing.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The weather and dark clouds didn''t help you.  I hope you do well in the voting, but there are some really great landscapes competing.', '2004-10-03 12:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(938490, 103189, 8624, '<td valign="top">looks like an interesting storm. the clouds and foreground are very dark. I would have like to see a longer exposure that could have added additional details.</td>', 'looks like an interesting storm. the clouds and foreground are very dark. I would have like to see a longer exposure that could have added additional details.', '2004-10-03 12:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(938491, 105984, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice depth of field on the butterfly. I wish there was a little more space between the insect and the leaf in the lower corner.</td>', 'nice depth of field on the butterfly. I wish there was a little more space between the insect and the leaf in the lower corner.', '2004-10-03 12:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(938492, 108991, 15920, '<td valign="top">Good photo, but doesn''t grab my attention.  In a normal competition, I think this might be among the top entries, but there are some really stron entries.</td>', 'Good photo, but doesn''t grab my attention.  In a normal competition, I think this might be among the top entries, but there are some really stron entries.', '2004-10-03 12:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(938493, 108924, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette.  I''ll be interested to read your notes on the cloud colors.</td>', 'Great silhouette.  I''ll be interested to read your notes on the cloud colors.', '2004-10-03 12:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(938494, 107387, 8624, '<td valign="top">very nice street scene. good use of depth of field. great tones and sharpness. I can''t really decide if the musician is looking at you or if you just caught him in a moment where he looked away from his instrument. I would have preferred seeing him concentrating on his music.</td>', 'very nice street scene. good use of depth of field. great tones and sharpness. I can''t really decide if the musician is looking at you or if you just caught him in a moment where he looked away from his instrument. I would have preferred seeing him concentrating on his music.', '2004-10-03 12:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(938495, 105647, 15920, '<td valign="top">Now this is great use of negative space.  Not my favorite in the challenge, but this a shot that could be a postcard.  Very well done.</td>', 'Now this is great use of negative space.  Not my favorite in the challenge, but this a shot that could be a postcard.  Very well done.', '2004-10-03 12:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(938496, 108875, 8624, '<td valign="top">beautiful light and a well balanced composition. a nice technical image, but it doesn''t really excite me beyond that</td>', 'beautiful light and a well balanced composition. a nice technical image, but it doesn''t really excite me beyond that', '2004-10-03 12:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(938499, 105190, 15920, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The sea, air, land combination is one of my favorite styles of water shot.  Love the colors here.</td>', 'Nicely done.  The sea, air, land combination is one of my favorite styles of water shot.  Love the colors here.', '2004-10-03 12:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(938500, 102742, 15920, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but it faces some really stiff competition.  For me, desats aren''t usually my favorite kind of photo, so I''m probably not the best one to give you feedback.</td>', 'Interesting, but it faces some really stiff competition.  For me, desats aren''t usually my favorite kind of photo, so I''m probably not the best one to give you feedback.', '2004-10-03 12:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(938503, 108979, 15920, '<td valign="top">I might have preferred some colors that really popped.</td>', 'I might have preferred some colors that really popped.', '2004-10-03 12:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(938504, 104030, 15920, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  In a normal competition, this would be a top entry.  I hope you do well in the voting, but there are some really great scenes competing.</td>', 'Nice shot.  In a normal competition, this would be a top entry.  I hope you do well in the voting, but there are some really great scenes competing.', '2004-10-03 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(938511, 107387, 8139, '<td valign="top">Great snapshot (I suppose it is). Tells a story. Expressive. Good DOF,contrast and sharpness.</td>', 'Great snapshot (I suppose it is). Tells a story. Expressive. Good DOF,contrast and sharpness.', '2004-10-03 13:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(938513, 104027, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a great architectural shot.  I''ve looked at it several times, and the only thing I can think of is that the dark upper left is a little distracting.  Not sure if you could have cropped this differently, but even as is, this is very strong.</td>', 'This is a great architectural shot.  I''ve looked at it several times, and the only thing I can think of is that the dark upper left is a little distracting.  Not sure if you could have cropped this differently, but even as is, this is very strong.', '2004-10-03 13:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(938515, 107599, 15920, '<td valign="top">The foot steps are an excellent touch.</td>', 'The foot steps are an excellent touch.', '2004-10-03 13:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(938516, 109013, 15920, '<td valign="top">A great family moment that has some stiff competition in this challenge.  I hope you do OK in the voting.</td>', 'A great family moment that has some stiff competition in this challenge.  I hope you do OK in the voting.', '2004-10-03 13:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(938519, 107202, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a little too straight forward.  I think the skirt lower in the back would have added a touch more mystery.</td>', 'This is a little too straight forward.  I think the skirt lower in the back would have added a touch more mystery.', '2004-10-03 13:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(938522, 108843, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great scene.  Not sure about how blue this is, but, you probably captured this exactly as it appeared.</td>', 'Great scene.  Not sure about how blue this is, but, you probably captured this exactly as it appeared.', '2004-10-03 13:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(938523, 105966, 15920, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the excellent use of darker background.</td>', 'I like the colors and the excellent use of darker background.', '2004-10-03 13:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(938524, 107488, 15920, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but up against some very strong competition.</td>', 'Interesting, but up against some very strong competition.', '2004-10-03 13:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(938525, 102742, 8139, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. I love it :)</td>', 'One of my favorites. I love it :)', '2004-10-03 13:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(938528, 106953, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great portrait.  Hopefullly your details section contains conditions and post processing steps.   The only thing I am not sure of is the hair.  Seems like one group of strands might be enough, but that is a small comment.  But, my guess is that this places well.</td>', 'Great portrait.  Hopefullly your details section contains conditions and post processing steps.   The only thing I am not sure of is the hair.  Seems like one group of strands might be enough, but that is a small comment.  But, my guess is that this places well.', '2004-10-03 13:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
