(938550, 106931, 22734, '<td valign="top">A lovely and striking image with vibrant color. The blue reflection carries its charm even further. Of course, such images are more appreciated in print form because there is a limitation and many fine nuances are lost in the cyber space. This is a bright scene and possibly the best landscape in this challenge because it imparts a sense of serenity and peace. Bumping up.</td>', 'A lovely and striking image with vibrant color. The blue reflection carries its charm even further. Of course, such images are more appreciated in print form because there is a limitation and many fine nuances are lost in the cyber space. This is a bright scene and possibly the best landscape in this challenge because it imparts a sense of serenity and peace. Bumping up.', '2004-10-03 13:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(938551, 109013, 7485, '<td valign="top">Beautiful soft focus effect, and over-all quality of lighting in a difficult harsh-light situation</td>', 'Beautiful soft focus effect, and over-all quality of lighting in a difficult harsh-light situation', '2004-10-03 13:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(938552, 103189, 4008, '<td valign="top">This image fails to touch me. While it is a good capture of the bolt of lighting, I find the composition confusing. I would have liked to see more detail in the big part of the sky or have it left out.</td>', 'This image fails to touch me. While it is a good capture of the bolt of lighting, I find the composition confusing. I would have liked to see more detail in the big part of the sky or have it left out.', '2004-10-03 13:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(938556, 105647, 4008, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the cathedral (?), nice silhouette as well on the left. Both together, I find confusing and the big black empty space does not enhance it, in my opinion.</td>', 'Good capture of the cathedral (?), nice silhouette as well on the left. Both together, I find confusing and the big black empty space does not enhance it, in my opinion.', '2004-10-03 13:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(938561, 107586, 4008, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the inclusion of the hand, but otherwise a very nice child portrait with great natural light. I like the play of highlights and shadows and the thoughtful expression.</td>', 'Not sure about the inclusion of the hand, but otherwise a very nice child portrait with great natural light. I like the play of highlights and shadows and the thoughtful expression.', '2004-10-03 13:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(938563, 105190, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I really like the movement in the water. I also really like the balance of the water, beach, sky and mountains.</td>', 'Very well done. I really like the movement in the water. I also really like the balance of the water, beach, sky and mountains.', '2004-10-03 13:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(938564, 108276, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful but I would have prefered a different time of day to avoid the harsh shadows against such delicate foliage coloring. Yet, the composition has great strenght and beauty but the viewer feels he wants to see more of the dark backland. Despite all this the coloration invites the eyes back again. Bumping up.</td>', 'This is beautiful but I would have prefered a different time of day to avoid the harsh shadows against such delicate foliage coloring. Yet, the composition has great strenght and beauty but the viewer feels he wants to see more of the dark backland. Despite all this the coloration invites the eyes back again. Bumping up.', '2004-10-03 13:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(938565, 108924, 7485, '<td valign="top">The layering of the clouds and color contrast is excellent, to focus the eye more on that I''d crop the bottom right up to the base of the hill</td>', 'The layering of the clouds and color contrast is excellent, to focus the eye more on that I''d crop the bottom right up to the base of the hill', '2004-10-03 13:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
