(938580, 107300, 5044, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition. A beautiful memory for the bride. I''m not crazy about the white faded border though. A little too much for my taste. Otherwise, and excellent image.</td>', 'Lovely composition. A beautiful memory for the bride. I''m not crazy about the white faded border though. A little too much for my taste. Otherwise, and excellent image.', '2004-10-03 13:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
