(938612, 108832, 10686, '<td valign="top">Beatiful light and rays - 6</td>', 'Beatiful light and rays - 6', '2004-10-03 14:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(938613, 107397, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very charming image but the treatment makes it hard to determine the overall strenght of the light. It appears that the delapidated houses are in a spot light and while such treatment is useful, I  think the structures are strong enough to speak for themselves, hence I do not like the darkened edges on the front left and right. This is the type of image which lends itself to a pristine presentation rather than stylized.<br/> <br/>However, this is not to take away from the very subject of which this photograph is about. The colors are just beautiful and the very shades of the structures with their almost crumbling state. The angle is very effective and as my eyes go beyond them,  there is nothing distracting to bring the eyes right back. The composition gives off that loved sense of nostalgia like of better days gone by.  Bumping up to 7<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-08 23:57:05.</i></td>', 'A very charming image but the treatment makes it hard to determine the overall strenght of the light. It appears that the delapidated houses are in a spot light and while such treatment is useful, I  think the structures are strong enough to speak for themselves, hence I do not like the darkened edges on the front left and right. This is the type of image which lends itself to a pristine presentation rather than stylized. However, this is not to take away from the very subject of which this photograph is about. The colors are just beautiful and the very shades of the structures with their almost crumbling state. The angle is very effective and as my eyes go beyond them,  there is nothing distracting to bring the eyes right back. The composition gives off that loved sense of nostalgia like of better days gone by.  Bumping up to 7', '2004-10-03 14:10:12.000000', '2004-10-09 00:57:05.000000', 1),
(938614, 108210, 10686, '<td valign="top">Wonderful subject, but maybe a different POV would be better -4</td>', 'Wonderful subject, but maybe a different POV would be better -4', '2004-10-03 14:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(938617, 107902, 1368, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful! composition is great and you have made the colors magical! perfect</td>', 'this is beautiful! composition is great and you have made the colors magical! perfect', '2004-10-03 14:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(938618, 108269, 10686, '<td valign="top">Beautiful moment, looks almost too dramatic -6</td>', 'Beautiful moment, looks almost too dramatic -6', '2004-10-03 14:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(938621, 109031, 10686, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the POV, but I find the frozen waterdrops look a bit out of place. I wonder if a long exposure would have helped. -5</td>', 'I like the subject and the POV, but I find the frozen waterdrops look a bit out of place. I wonder if a long exposure would have helped. -5', '2004-10-03 14:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(938624, 107387, 10686, '<td valign="top">Very cool street shot. I have no idea what that instrument is, but that doesn''t matter. The musician''s expression is what makes this shot. -9</td>', 'Very cool street shot. I have no idea what that instrument is, but that doesn''t matter. The musician''s expression is what makes this shot. -9', '2004-10-03 14:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(938626, 103189, 22734, '<td valign="top">Now, this is more of an impressionistic image but it fails to render its full strenght due to the high ceiling which fails to capture my interest. Now, this may be due to the cyber space presentation which hampers a lot of detail. This is an image which I would love to see in print because the pixel limitation keeps it from shinning. However, the general effect is strong enough to get bumped to 6</td>', 'Now, this is more of an impressionistic image but it fails to render its full strenght due to the high ceiling which fails to capture my interest. Now, this may be due to the cyber space presentation which hampers a lot of detail. This is an image which I would love to see in print because the pixel limitation keeps it from shinning. However, the general effect is strong enough to get bumped to 6', '2004-10-03 14:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(938627, 105190, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice light and use of long exposure. That looks sort of like a bottle in the foreground - 8</td>', 'Nice light and use of long exposure. That looks sort of like a bottle in the foreground - 8', '2004-10-03 14:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(938628, 108984, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice RGB image. Is this a neo-Weston tribute? -7</td>', 'Nice RGB image. Is this a neo-Weston tribute? -7', '2004-10-03 14:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
