(938641, 108843, 22734, '<td valign="top">There is an unquenchable thirst by many people to embrace blue monochromatic images. This capture will satisfy the urge in many and in myself. The touches of dusk orange, being the opposite color of blue enhance the  welding of the horizon.<br/> <br/>Bumping up.</td>', 'There is an unquenchable thirst by many people to embrace blue monochromatic images. This capture will satisfy the urge in many and in myself. The touches of dusk orange, being the opposite color of blue enhance the  welding of the horizon. Bumping up.', '2004-10-03 14:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(938644, 108986, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is charming with a deftly gaze and acutr detail to satisfy searching eyes. the post processing is true to the study and as such my congratulations on a very good execution. Bumping up.</td>', 'This is charming with a deftly gaze and acutr detail to satisfy searching eyes. the post processing is true to the study and as such my congratulations on a very good execution. Bumping up.', '2004-10-03 14:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(938646, 108269, 17033, '<td valign="top">First off, let me say I like this a lot and have scored accordingly. One comment though: the foreground doesn''t look to be in the same photo as the subject-this may be the result of heavy post-proc. at the top.</td>', 'First off, let me say I like this a lot and have scored accordingly. One comment though: the foreground doesn''t look to be in the same photo as the subject-this may be the result of heavy post-proc. at the top.', '2004-10-03 14:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(938648, 105190, 22734, '<td valign="top">There is so much magic in this image. expertly executed to allow the water to silken in the dusk. Magic, magic and so very well articulated. Bumping up.</td>', 'There is so much magic in this image. expertly executed to allow the water to silken in the dusk. Magic, magic and so very well articulated. Bumping up.', '2004-10-03 14:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(938654, 107387, 22734, '<td valign="top">A strong study. I have seen this gentleman perform in the NY subways. Bur, this capture is excellent and yes, I can hear the haunting music from this exotic instrument. A great character study in a very natural environment. great dof. Bumping up.</td>', 'A strong study. I have seen this gentleman perform in the NY subways. Bur, this capture is excellent and yes, I can hear the haunting music from this exotic instrument. A great character study in a very natural environment. great dof. Bumping up.', '2004-10-03 14:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(938656, 108233, 17033, '<td valign="top">Not sure this really stands out as a defining ''sporting instant''.</td>', 'Not sure this really stands out as a defining ''sporting instant''.', '2004-10-03 14:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(938659, 108122, 17033, '<td valign="top">One of the best portraits I''ve seen at DPC...a real eye-slapper of clarity and rich tones (tri/quad?). I like it because of it''s timeless quality and because the boy has  such an emotive yet UNFORCED expression. You may retire now, your work is done!!!</td>', 'One of the best portraits I''ve seen at DPC...a real eye-slapper of clarity and rich tones (tri/quad?). I like it because of it''s timeless quality and because the boy has  such an emotive yet UNFORCED expression. You may retire now, your work is done!!!', '2004-10-03 14:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(938664, 109008, 22734, '<td valign="top">this is just simply unabashed beauty. The texture bristles and I hear the grating of his beak. Great tonal values and thank you for for not over processing this image. This is the temptation to make it more beautiful. Excellent job and you have my admiration. Bumping up.</td>', 'this is just simply unabashed beauty. The texture bristles and I hear the grating of his beak. Great tonal values and thank you for for not over processing this image. This is the temptation to make it more beautiful. Excellent job and you have my admiration. Bumping up.', '2004-10-03 14:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(938669, 108843, 3306, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scene. The blue tones give your picture an added sense of serenity. The glare in the water towards the foreground is slightly distracting but otherwise a near perfect picture. Great job.</td>', 'A beautiful scene. The blue tones give your picture an added sense of serenity. The glare in the water towards the foreground is slightly distracting but otherwise a near perfect picture. Great job.', '2004-10-03 14:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(938670, 108872, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is like a moden art interpretation but the sun figure does not win my entire interest. I love the colors and the window frame and of course the color of the ajar window doors. This is a great vibrant feast for the eyes and as such it gets bumped higher.</td>', 'This is like a moden art interpretation but the sun figure does not win my entire interest. I love the colors and the window frame and of course the color of the ajar window doors. This is a great vibrant feast for the eyes and as such it gets bumped higher.', '2004-10-03 14:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
