(938687, 103619, 22964, '<td valign="top">Good idea and inventive<br/> <br/>HEy!! As I just cant figure out how you took and proccesed this image, and you made me spent some minutes thinking of it.......I''m giving you a 10.:-)<br/></td>', 'Good idea and inventive HEy!! As I just cant figure out how you took and proccesed this image, and you made me spent some minutes thinking of it.......I''m giving you a 10.:-)', '2004-10-03 14:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(938692, 107397, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very interesting use of soft focus on the grass and in other areas. I like the effect very much. Your tones and colors are fabulous,too.The structures themselves may be slightly oversharpened and look like they have a few digital noise floating about, but the effect is minor and the print, I''m sure, will be fabulous. Very nice work! 8</td>', 'Very interesting use of soft focus on the grass and in other areas. I like the effect very much. Your tones and colors are fabulous,too.The structures themselves may be slightly oversharpened and look like they have a few digital noise floating about, but the effect is minor and the print, I''m sure, will be fabulous. Very nice work! 8', '2004-10-03 14:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(938693, 107902, 14620, '<td valign="top">What a great find!  It''s busy, but in a good way.  I like the desat treatment you used, it brings a lot of interest to the photo yet tones down some of the "clutter" of the shot.  Very interesting and one of my favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'What a great find!  It''s busy, but in a good way.  I like the desat treatment you used, it brings a lot of interest to the photo yet tones down some of the "clutter" of the shot.  Very interesting and one of my favorites of the challenge.', '2004-10-03 15:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(938694, 108949, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice tiger image! The bamboo really helps, and your patience at waiting until the cat was behind one of them paid off nicely. I don''t know if it was possible, but the zoo-structure of concrete/stone does ruin the illusion of wildness, though this is important only insomuch that you were aiming for that, if you were at all. Lovely tones, colors and focus. 8</td>', 'Very nice tiger image! The bamboo really helps, and your patience at waiting until the cat was behind one of them paid off nicely. I don''t know if it was possible, but the zoo-structure of concrete/stone does ruin the illusion of wildness, though this is important only insomuch that you were aiming for that, if you were at all. Lovely tones, colors and focus. 8', '2004-10-03 15:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(938695, 108122, 22964, '<td valign="top">Incredible skin texture and iris detail. Beautiful face expression</td>', 'Incredible skin texture and iris detail. Beautiful face expression', '2004-10-03 15:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(938696, 107488, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is an amazingly beautiful shot and without even looking at the title, this is exactly the feel I got from this image.  I like the softness of it and the b&amp;w treatment is very nice.</td>', 'This is an amazingly beautiful shot and without even looking at the title, this is exactly the feel I got from this image.  I like the softness of it and the b&w treatment is very nice.', '2004-10-03 15:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(938697, 107020, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very pleasant and delightful sunset image. The reflection is so lovely, and the use of sillhouette effective. Your composition is also pleasing. It might be fun to experiment to see whether you could get any detail out of some of those shadows. Nice work. 8</td>', 'Very pleasant and delightful sunset image. The reflection is so lovely, and the use of sillhouette effective. Your composition is also pleasing. It might be fun to experiment to see whether you could get any detail out of some of those shadows. Nice work. 8', '2004-10-03 15:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(938699, 106707, 14620, '<td valign="top">One of the the most beautiful sunset shots I think I''ve seen.  I really like the sharpness of the building in contrast to the softness of the clouds.  Very nicely done and the colors are just amazing.</td>', 'One of the the most beautiful sunset shots I think I''ve seen.  I really like the sharpness of the building in contrast to the softness of the clouds.  Very nicely done and the colors are just amazing.', '2004-10-03 15:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(938700, 109013, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very  nice tones! The leading lines of the road, though mostly implied, still work to bring my eyes into the photo. I love the softness of the surrounding vegetation while having nice, sharp focus on the figures. An emotive and lovely image. 8</td>', 'Very  nice tones! The leading lines of the road, though mostly implied, still work to bring my eyes into the photo. I love the softness of the surrounding vegetation while having nice, sharp focus on the figures. An emotive and lovely image. 8', '2004-10-03 15:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(938703, 103788, 6870, '<td valign="top">I sure love the drama here. Moody sky, diagonal lines, lovely tones. Though the focus is on the sail, I still find myself wanting to see more of the ship, so you may consider cropping more so I don''t have that desire, or including more of the ship, or ignoring me and congratulating yourself for a marvelous photo!</td>', 'I sure love the drama here. Moody sky, diagonal lines, lovely tones. Though the focus is on the sail, I still find myself wanting to see more of the ship, so you may consider cropping more so I don''t have that desire, or including more of the ship, or ignoring me and congratulating yourself for a marvelous photo!', '2004-10-03 15:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(938705, 107387, 14620, '<td valign="top">Wonderful candid shot.  Very crisp in details and excellent color treatment.  Makes me wonder what he''s thinking about.</td>', 'Wonderful candid shot.  Very crisp in details and excellent color treatment.  Makes me wonder what he''s thinking about.', '2004-10-03 15:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
