(938875, 103615, 2223, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait! Great lighting and framing. 9</td>', 'Beautiful portrait! Great lighting and framing. 9', '2004-10-03 17:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(938878, 103105, 2223, '<td valign="top">Love the color the light brought out here. Like a dream or a movie. Awesome job! 10</td>', 'Love the color the light brought out here. Like a dream or a movie. Awesome job! 10', '2004-10-03 17:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(938879, 108642, 12611, '<td valign="top">The lighting, the composition, the pukey color green the shadows the bench placement, the girl in the back, the expression of the girl in front, the shape of the photo and the large dead area of grass on the bottom right all add up to make this shot truly unappealing. This is a higher standard, this is a "Masters'' challenge."  I wouldn''t really want a print of this even if I liked little kid shots running around in formal dress.  I''m sorry to be so critical, but I have to be honest.</td>', 'The lighting, the composition, the pukey color green the shadows the bench placement, the girl in the back, the expression of the girl in front, the shape of the photo and the large dead area of grass on the bottom right all add up to make this shot truly unappealing. This is a higher standard, this is a "Masters'' challenge."  I wouldn''t really want a print of this even if I liked little kid shots running around in formal dress.  I''m sorry to be so critical, but I have to be honest.', '2004-10-03 17:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(938883, 102742, 24911, '<td valign="top">A perfect photo. Loved the colors. Loved the composition. Interesting subject. Great idea. 10.</td>', 'A perfect photo. Loved the colors. Loved the composition. Interesting subject. Great idea. 10.', '2004-10-03 17:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(938884, 108995, 2223, '<td valign="top">Cool band pic. Lighting might have been a little harsh, a tad to much grain, or lack of contrast. 6</td>', 'Cool band pic. Lighting might have been a little harsh, a tad to much grain, or lack of contrast. 6', '2004-10-03 17:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(938886, 107488, 24911, '<td valign="top">Haunting indeed. One can almost feel the shudder. Great composition. Nice idea. 10.</td>', 'Haunting indeed. One can almost feel the shudder. Great composition. Nice idea. 10.', '2004-10-03 17:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(938888, 107202, 2223, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Dr. Jones?7</td>', 'Very nice. Dr. Jones?7', '2004-10-03 17:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(938889, 109019, 24911, '<td valign="top">A great photo. Good use of DOF. Nice subject. Good colors. 9.</td>', 'A great photo. Good use of DOF. Nice subject. Good colors. 9.', '2004-10-03 17:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(938890, 107397, 2223, '<td valign="top">Looks like Heida''s work. This is my favorite pic in the challenge, i love everything about it. Good luck! 10</td>', 'Looks like Heida''s work. This is my favorite pic in the challenge, i love everything about it. Good luck! 10', '2004-10-03 17:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(938892, 106707, 24911, '<td valign="top">A great shot. Loved the composition and the subject. Good colors. 9.</td>', 'A great shot. Loved the composition and the subject. Good colors. 9.', '2004-10-03 17:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(938894, 108767, 8643, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene but maybe I would have cropped the bottom sixth?</td>', 'Beautiful scene but maybe I would have cropped the bottom sixth?', '2004-10-03 17:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(938902, 108276, 8643, '<td valign="top">This is just so beautiful  - I wish I could emulate it - masterful!</td>', 'This is just so beautiful  - I wish I could emulate it - masterful!', '2004-10-03 17:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(938905, 109019, 8643, '<td valign="top">Very captivating - lovely gentle tones but delightfully crisp - masterful!</td>', 'Very captivating - lovely gentle tones but delightfully crisp - masterful!', '2004-10-03 17:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(938919, 108924, 26045, '<td valign="top">What a great moment to capture...and a striking sunset (rise? heh)... at first I was confused...is that a tree, a person, is this an anthill, is that a twig ahaha, but then I just decided it''s a person breathing in the day, much more satisfying for me that way. Very nice! Thanks!</td>', 'What a great moment to capture...and a striking sunset (rise? heh)... at first I was confused...is that a tree, a person, is this an anthill, is that a twig ahaha, but then I just decided it''s a person breathing in the day, much more satisfying for me that way. Very nice! Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(938920, 106488, 26045, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know Ansel was a golfer!! That tree and sky is so superbly captured. I would love to shake Nature''s hand...and yours, too, okay, sorry hahah. I''m very impressed with this...I wish I was wherever this was taken. I''m waiting, impatiently, for the snow. Thanks for a taste...tease!</td>', 'I didn''t know Ansel was a golfer!! That tree and sky is so superbly captured. I would love to shake Nature''s hand...and yours, too, okay, sorry hahah. I''m very impressed with this...I wish I was wherever this was taken. I''m waiting, impatiently, for the snow. Thanks for a taste...tease!', '2004-10-03 17:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(938921, 108949, 26045, '<td valign="top">God, what a beautiful animal! Nice capture here, even with the bamboo (which at first I found annoying, now I dig it)... great sharpness in the face. Very NatGeo :)</td>', 'God, what a beautiful animal! Nice capture here, even with the bamboo (which at first I found annoying, now I dig it)... great sharpness in the face. Very NatGeo :)', '2004-10-03 17:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(938924, 108569, 26045, '<td valign="top">Well good thing I love funky angles and purposefully crooked shots. This is a nice composition! I like the contrast of tree lights to big bright parisan lights. I have got to get to Vegas, jeez. I personally would''ve cropped the bottom more, as I''ve spent so much time wondering if that''s a person and a car...or what...I can''t quite tell...anyway, just a minor distraction. I really like this! Thanks!</td>', 'Well good thing I love funky angles and purposefully crooked shots. This is a nice composition! I like the contrast of tree lights to big bright parisan lights. I have got to get to Vegas, jeez. I personally would''ve cropped the bottom more, as I''ve spent so much time wondering if that''s a person and a car...or what...I can''t quite tell...anyway, just a minor distraction. I really like this! Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(938925, 108897, 26045, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the title on this one...nor the extraneous objects (those leaves are distracting, as is the wicker)... but SHE is divine! Lovely skin tones, great shadowing, and her expression and pose is perfect. I would''ve cropped the bit of skin showing in the lower right corner, but that''s just me. I guess it''s kinda making my eye wanna wander outside the shot ahaha...which isn''t a BAD thing, no no. The first thing my eyes gravitate towards is her eyes...she''s a beauty, and this is a beautiful shot. Thanks!!</td>', 'I''m not sure about the title on this one...nor the extraneous objects (those leaves are distracting, as is the wicker)... but SHE is divine! Lovely skin tones, great shadowing, and her expression and pose is perfect. I would''ve cropped the bit of skin showing in the lower right corner, but that''s just me. I guess it''s kinda making my eye wanna wander outside the shot ahaha...which isn''t a BAD thing, no no. The first thing my eyes gravitate towards is her eyes...she''s a beauty, and this is a beautiful shot. Thanks!!', '2004-10-03 17:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(938926, 109031, 26045, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, good capture of the water, but maybe it''d be best in BW? Great statue, though, and a nice photo! Thanks!</td>', 'Very nice shot, good capture of the water, but maybe it''d be best in BW? Great statue, though, and a nice photo! Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:52:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(938927, 107902, 26045, '<td valign="top">OH, what classic Americana! This...is...a wonderful shot! I''m really impressed with it. It''s so overboard, and in such a good way! Great shadows, great color, very clever and unique! I really dig this and damn if I could vote on this challenge, it''d be waaay up there. Thanks!<br/></td>', 'OH, what classic Americana! This...is...a wonderful shot! I''m really impressed with it. It''s so overboard, and in such a good way! Great shadows, great color, very clever and unique! I really dig this and damn if I could vote on this challenge, it''d be waaay up there. Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(938928, 107969, 26045, '<td valign="top">My, what details on the kiwi! This is a superb shot... love the shadows and details of the water. Only suggestion would be to do something about that slice of blue in the background... I love the golden haze of the kiwi skin. the lighting is excellent! ... very nice! Thanks!</td>', 'My, what details on the kiwi! This is a superb shot... love the shadows and details of the water. Only suggestion would be to do something about that slice of blue in the background... I love the golden haze of the kiwi skin. the lighting is excellent! ... very nice! Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(938929, 103189, 26045, '<td valign="top">WOW. What a great shot! I wonder if you''ve considered cropping out the vast amount of negative space above, making this entirely even-steven? My eye was distracted a bit by the not-quite blackness above, I was looking for patterns in the clouds when I should''ve been looking strictly at the reflections in the water... also the red light in the center...a home, i''m assuming, was a tad distracting. But overall, it''s really a great photo! Thanks!<br/></td>', 'WOW. What a great shot! I wonder if you''ve considered cropping out the vast amount of negative space above, making this entirely even-steven? My eye was distracted a bit by the not-quite blackness above, I was looking for patterns in the clouds when I should''ve been looking strictly at the reflections in the water... also the red light in the center...a home, i''m assuming, was a tad distracting. But overall, it''s really a great photo! Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(938930, 108537, 26045, '<td valign="top">hahaha, great shot! Love the expression on her face, and the softness of her features is such a great contrast to the weapon in her hand... The necklace is a bit too "big" for this shot, imo...I''d''ve liked to see something more simple, so as not to distract from her face and hair, which really should take center stage here. Also, the smoke like "puff" on the right looks too much like it could be post-gunshot, but then also like it could be a background flaw...regardless of all that, it''s a great shot, and she''s a great model! Thank you!</td>', 'hahaha, great shot! Love the expression on her face, and the softness of her features is such a great contrast to the weapon in her hand... The necklace is a bit too "big" for this shot, imo...I''d''ve liked to see something more simple, so as not to distract from her face and hair, which really should take center stage here. Also, the smoke like "puff" on the right looks too much like it could be post-gunshot, but then also like it could be a background flaw...regardless of all that, it''s a great shot, and she''s a great model! Thank you!', '2004-10-03 17:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(938931, 108642, 26045, '<td valign="top">ahahah, what a joyful photo! Love the softness of it, the skip-to-my-lou sweetness...very nice! Only suggestion would be to give the green a bit more oomph, it seems a bit washed out. Other than that, excellent! Thank you!</td>', 'ahahah, what a joyful photo! Love the softness of it, the skip-to-my-lou sweetness...very nice! Only suggestion would be to give the green a bit more oomph, it seems a bit washed out. Other than that, excellent! Thank you!', '2004-10-03 17:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(938932, 108122, 26045, '<td valign="top">What a great look of surprise! His features are crisp, his eyes are astounding...and yes, dirty face and all, he''s adorable. Great contrast here, great shot. Thanks!</td>', 'What a great look of surprise! His features are crisp, his eyes are astounding...and yes, dirty face and all, he''s adorable. Great contrast here, great shot. Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(938933, 108210, 26045, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...this might be more interesting in BW, get some more contrast in the tones. As it stands, it''s a tad flat for me. If you were more to the right, maybe to get more of the lighthouse, more of a straight shot of the sand and less of the trees...it could be better...but it''s very nice, I enjoyed! Thanks!</td>', 'Hmmm...this might be more interesting in BW, get some more contrast in the tones. As it stands, it''s a tad flat for me. If you were more to the right, maybe to get more of the lighthouse, more of a straight shot of the sand and less of the trees...it could be better...but it''s very nice, I enjoyed! Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(938934, 107397, 26045, '<td valign="top">Ah, modern ruins! Wonderful on the softness....I love the smooth greens and almost ethereal quality here... just lovely! Thank you...</td>', 'Ah, modern ruins! Wonderful on the softness....I love the smooth greens and almost ethereal quality here... just lovely! Thank you...', '2004-10-03 17:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(938935, 107995, 26045, '<td valign="top">Oh, clever! Great alignment, btw. And a great shot!</td>', 'Oh, clever! Great alignment, btw. And a great shot!', '2004-10-03 17:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(938936, 109019, 26045, '<td valign="top">!!!!!!!!!! This is so great !!!!!!!!!! Listen, if this was a greeting card I''d send it to my mom, ok?? hahaha, what a FACE, my god. She reminds me of me as a kid...I too was captivated by the bubbles...though it seems like she''s looking at something out of frame (as if someone''s coming to pop that bubble...) I am totally sold by her expression, and that you captured that bubble so perfectly. The softness of the photo is great, her polka dots are perfect, and the background is cool too. Love this, thanks!</td>', '!!!!!!!!!! This is so great !!!!!!!!!! Listen, if this was a greeting card I''d send it to my mom, ok?? hahaha, what a FACE, my god. She reminds me of me as a kid...I too was captivated by the bubbles...though it seems like she''s looking at something out of frame (as if someone''s coming to pop that bubble...) I am totally sold by her expression, and that you captured that bubble so perfectly. The softness of the photo is great, her polka dots are perfect, and the background is cool too. Love this, thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(938937, 108843, 26045, '<td valign="top">Oh joy! I love this! (Pacific Northwest US, right?) I love the blues here, the small shades of pink...really beautiful coloring...excellent composition! Striking photograph, thank you!</td>', 'Oh joy! I love this! (Pacific Northwest US, right?) I love the blues here, the small shades of pink...really beautiful coloring...excellent composition! Striking photograph, thank you!', '2004-10-03 17:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(938938, 102660, 26045, '<td valign="top">She''s a beautiful model, and I love the earring, but the necklace is distracting. I love the crispness of her blue eyes, and her freckles, too, but there is a "pinkness" to her hair and lips that I can''t tell if it''s my eyes or your intentions...I don''t know if it''s working or not, honestly... but overall it''s... lovely! Thank you!</td>', 'She''s a beautiful model, and I love the earring, but the necklace is distracting. I love the crispness of her blue eyes, and her freckles, too, but there is a "pinkness" to her hair and lips that I can''t tell if it''s my eyes or your intentions...I don''t know if it''s working or not, honestly... but overall it''s... lovely! Thank you!', '2004-10-03 17:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(938939, 107091, 26045, '<td valign="top">It''s a good photo, but not that interesting. I like the expanse of sky, but the gray tones are a bit much. I wonder what this looks like in color...  Anyway, I like it, but not very high on the WOW factor... Thanks, though!</td>', 'It''s a good photo, but not that interesting. I like the expanse of sky, but the gray tones are a bit much. I wonder what this looks like in color...  Anyway, I like it, but not very high on the WOW factor... Thanks, though!', '2004-10-03 17:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(938940, 107300, 26045, '<td valign="top">Oh, she came out wonderful, and the columns are framing her perfectly, but the too-white borders make this overkill, in my humble and inexperienced opinion! To be frank (no, that''s not my name!) it looks like a white poison gas cloud coming in...ha, sorry! I love HER though, the implied movement, the joy, it''s a lovely shot! Thanks!</td>', 'Oh, she came out wonderful, and the columns are framing her perfectly, but the too-white borders make this overkill, in my humble and inexperienced opinion! To be frank (no, that''s not my name!) it looks like a white poison gas cloud coming in...ha, sorry! I love HER though, the implied movement, the joy, it''s a lovely shot! Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(938941, 102742, 26045, '<td valign="top">This is another shot that popped out at me. It''s clever and surprising, unique and emotional... and she is adorable! I love her outfit, love the handprint! My only qualm is that it''s a touch crooked (so minor, I know, but i''m reaching here ahah)...All in all, it''s an excellent shot, love the selective coloring,  really dig the texture of the wall with it''s paintbrush markings...and SHE is just too cute. Thanks!</td>', 'This is another shot that popped out at me. It''s clever and surprising, unique and emotional... and she is adorable! I love her outfit, love the handprint! My only qualm is that it''s a touch crooked (so minor, I know, but i''m reaching here ahah)...All in all, it''s an excellent shot, love the selective coloring,  really dig the texture of the wall with it''s paintbrush markings...and SHE is just too cute. Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(938942, 106707, 26045, '<td valign="top">Oh, BEAUTIFUL! This is a wonderful photo, poster quality, framed and on my wall (please? ahaha)...excellent detail on the tower...what a sky, too! Gracias!</td>', 'Oh, BEAUTIFUL! This is a wonderful photo, poster quality, framed and on my wall (please? ahaha)...excellent detail on the tower...what a sky, too! Gracias!', '2004-10-03 17:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(938943, 107488, 26045, '<td valign="top">Very nice softness, though a little on the bbbbbright side...I''d like to actually see the chair more...but great on symmetry and contrast...enjoyed! Thanks!</td>', 'Very nice softness, though a little on the bbbbbright side...I''d like to actually see the chair more...but great on symmetry and contrast...enjoyed! Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(938944, 107202, 26045, '<td valign="top">Whooopp!!! Wowzers...Her buttsky looks great, but I''ve got two issues here: her legs look soooo awkward. Her knee poking out is very strange looking. And her face...the nose...again, very awkward...it probably would''ve looked better had she completely looked straight ahead, or even towards the camera. BUTT (heh), regardless of all that, her skin looks fabulous...and did I mention her BUTT? Thanks!</td>', 'Whooopp!!! Wowzers...Her buttsky looks great, but I''ve got two issues here: her legs look soooo awkward. Her knee poking out is very strange looking. And her face...the nose...again, very awkward...it probably would''ve looked better had she completely looked straight ahead, or even towards the camera. BUTT (heh), regardless of all that, her skin looks fabulous...and did I mention her BUTT? Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(938946, 108995, 26045, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the grainiess is intentional, but I can''t say I like it... the SHOT is good, the lighting is good, I like the shadows on his arm, but the photo overall doesn''t have that smack in the face WOW... it''s a good shot, though... Thanks!</td>', 'I''m not sure if the grainiess is intentional, but I can''t say I like it... the SHOT is good, the lighting is good, I like the shadows on his arm, but the photo overall doesn''t have that smack in the face WOW... it''s a good shot, though... Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(938947, 106931, 26045, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot, and I love the sky and reflections in the water, but it isn''t very high on my WOW factor...which doesn''t say very much ahaha. I do like it, so thank you!</td>', 'It''s a nice shot, and I love the sky and reflections in the water, but it isn''t very high on my WOW factor...which doesn''t say very much ahaha. I do like it, so thank you!', '2004-10-03 17:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(938948, 103615, 26045, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure of the title, unless it''s her name haha. I think she has beautiful eyes, and I love the details of the tree in the foreground, and the background is excellent. My only qualms are with the little bit of her finger showing (I''d like more...zoom out!) and the sweepy strands of her hair...for some reason it looks more like static than windswept...but regardless of all that, her eyes make it a winner. Thanks!</td>', 'I''m not sure of the title, unless it''s her name haha. I think she has beautiful eyes, and I love the details of the tree in the foreground, and the background is excellent. My only qualms are with the little bit of her finger showing (I''d like more...zoom out!) and the sweepy strands of her hair...for some reason it looks more like static than windswept...but regardless of all that, her eyes make it a winner. Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(938949, 109013, 26045, '<td valign="top">Very Andy Griffith! I mean that as a compliment, too! The older gent is a bit dark, he doesn''t stand out well from the darkness of the trees in front of him (er...behind him?)... also too bad the boy''s arm didn''t get in the shot, because it looks a tad odd. Personally, I would''ve cropped out the telephone wires on the upper right, as my eye kept getting pulled over there... otherwise, great shot! Thank you!</td>', 'Very Andy Griffith! I mean that as a compliment, too! The older gent is a bit dark, he doesn''t stand out well from the darkness of the trees in front of him (er...behind him?)... also too bad the boy''s arm didn''t get in the shot, because it looks a tad odd. Personally, I would''ve cropped out the telephone wires on the upper right, as my eye kept getting pulled over there... otherwise, great shot! Thank you!', '2004-10-03 17:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(938951, 107586, 26045, '<td valign="top">Striking!! This is natgeo quality, in my opinion. Love the texture of his face, the shadows are excellent, his eyes are profound...everything about it is right on...except, maybe, for the blurry hand in the foreground. I think maybe you could crop it out and still have an excellent photograph...but that''s my only qualm and I''m really reachin''...overall, I love it. Thanks!</td>', 'Striking!! This is natgeo quality, in my opinion. Love the texture of his face, the shadows are excellent, his eyes are profound...everything about it is right on...except, maybe, for the blurry hand in the foreground. I think maybe you could crop it out and still have an excellent photograph...but that''s my only qualm and I''m really reachin''...overall, I love it. Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(938952, 107387, 26045, '<td valign="top">Excellent candid...the tones, contrast, capture is just spectacular. Only suggestion would''ve been to get more of the case and less of the lightpost...but that''s it! It''s a great shot, thanks!</td>', 'Excellent candid...the tones, contrast, capture is just spectacular. Only suggestion would''ve been to get more of the case and less of the lightpost...but that''s it! It''s a great shot, thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(938953, 104030, 26045, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Not much else to say, ahaha, it''s one of those perfect shots. The greens are mega-green, the water is perfectly smooth, the composition is excellent. Shoot. I''m sold. Thanks!</td>', 'Beautiful. Not much else to say, ahaha, it''s one of those perfect shots. The greens are mega-green, the water is perfectly smooth, the composition is excellent. Shoot. I''m sold. Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(938954, 107599, 26045, '<td valign="top">Lovely...though I do wish the sands were brighter, I''m totally sold by the waters. The extreme brightness of the "first light" is a tad much for ME, but I understand that it''s the point of the shot ahaha. Overall, I dig!!</td>', 'Lovely...though I do wish the sands were brighter, I''m totally sold by the waters. The extreme brightness of the "first light" is a tad much for ME, but I understand that it''s the point of the shot ahaha. Overall, I dig!!', '2004-10-03 17:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(938955, 107901, 26045, '<td valign="top">Too bad the wings and tail aren''t in focus, but since I can''t manage a shot like this I shouldn''t really be talking! I love that there''s nothing distracting here, it''s just bug''n''flower, that''s it. It''s a nice shot, thanks!</td>', 'Too bad the wings and tail aren''t in focus, but since I can''t manage a shot like this I shouldn''t really be talking! I love that there''s nothing distracting here, it''s just bug''n''flower, that''s it. It''s a nice shot, thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(938956, 104027, 26045, '<td valign="top">Ah, I have two very presumptuous and obviously obnoxious suggestions for this great photo: 1) crop it. Remove everything from the right of the tower. 2) do it in black and white. I really think this would pack more of a punch if it was a study in curves, the far right curving walls and the steel structure are just wonderful, but the tower in the center breaks up the lines and, for me, ruins the amazing structure. Ah, don''t worry, I''ll just take it up with the architect! Thanks for the great shot!</td>', 'Ah, I have two very presumptuous and obviously obnoxious suggestions for this great photo: 1) crop it. Remove everything from the right of the tower. 2) do it in black and white. I really think this would pack more of a punch if it was a study in curves, the far right curving walls and the steel structure are just wonderful, but the tower in the center breaks up the lines and, for me, ruins the amazing structure. Ah, don''t worry, I''ll just take it up with the architect! Thanks for the great shot!', '2004-10-03 17:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(938957, 108940, 26045, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and lighting, but they don''t seem as crisp as they could be... I do love the shift from light pink to that burnt orange... very nice! Thanks!</td>', 'Very nice color and lighting, but they don''t seem as crisp as they could be... I do love the shift from light pink to that burnt orange... very nice! Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(938958, 103105, 26045, '<td valign="top">OH MAN this is excellent! This is real quality stuff, magazine quality, natgeo style, I love this... the colors are beautiful, and that baby, my god...so adorable! Thanks!</td>', 'OH MAN this is excellent! This is real quality stuff, magazine quality, natgeo style, I love this... the colors are beautiful, and that baby, my god...so adorable! Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
