(938960, 108269, 26045, '<td valign="top">I love that every aspect of this shot is crisp and clear...no detail is washed out, no area is too dark or too light. The colors are honest, the browns are brown, the sea is green, the sky is angry...it''s really a great photo! Thank you!</td>', 'I love that every aspect of this shot is crisp and clear...no detail is washed out, no area is too dark or too light. The colors are honest, the browns are brown, the sea is green, the sky is angry...it''s really a great photo! Thank you!', '2004-10-03 17:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(938961, 108991, 26045, '<td valign="top">Oh, a classic nature shot! Excellent details on the shoreline, slowly fading with the trees, and then completely absorbed by the fog. Lovely photograph! Thanks!</td>', 'Oh, a classic nature shot! Excellent details on the shoreline, slowly fading with the trees, and then completely absorbed by the fog. Lovely photograph! Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(938962, 108984, 26045, '<td valign="top">To be honest,  this falls flat for me... I think it might be the lighting and the blue background...but there isn''t real contrast here, though it''s GOOD, it just doesn''t have that oommppph. Thanks, though!</td>', 'To be honest,  this falls flat for me... I think it might be the lighting and the blue background...but there isn''t real contrast here, though it''s GOOD, it just doesn''t have that oommppph. Thanks, though!', '2004-10-03 17:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(938963, 108832, 26045, '<td valign="top">Sunsets never get old. I''m serious, too, there''s just nothing as beautiful. And this one does not disappoint. I do wish for a little bit more brightness in the foreground, though, but overall I really like!! Thanks!</td>', 'Sunsets never get old. I''m serious, too, there''s just nothing as beautiful. And this one does not disappoint. I do wish for a little bit more brightness in the foreground, though, but overall I really like!! Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
