(938966, 108767, 26045, '<td valign="top">Oooh, is this in the Smokey Mountains? Very nice shot...though when I scroll up a tad and basically cut off the bottom (grass and trail) and make like the misty trees and sunsoaked sky is all that''s shown in the photo...well, I like it better! So, my only suggestion would be to crop... I enjoyed, though, thanks!</td>', 'Oooh, is this in the Smokey Mountains? Very nice shot...though when I scroll up a tad and basically cut off the bottom (grass and trail) and make like the misty trees and sunsoaked sky is all that''s shown in the photo...well, I like it better! So, my only suggestion would be to crop... I enjoyed, though, thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
