(938972, 107020, 26045, '<td valign="top">Ooooh. Ahhhh. Lovely reflections, and what a sky! Very nice composition...I assume this is a sunrise, yes? It seems more subdued than the magnificence of a sunset. Sadly, I''m not "around" for sunrises...I should really start waking up at 4am! Ha! Great shot, thanks!</td>', 'Ooooh. Ahhhh. Lovely reflections, and what a sky! Very nice composition...I assume this is a sunrise, yes? It seems more subdued than the magnificence of a sunset. Sadly, I''m not "around" for sunrises...I should really start waking up at 4am! Ha! Great shot, thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(938973, 109032, 26045, '<td valign="top">hahaha, very clever shot! And a great title :)</td>', 'hahaha, very clever shot! And a great title :)', '2004-10-03 17:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(938975, 103788, 26045, '<td valign="top">This shot immmmmmediately caught my eye. It is excellent. EXCELLENT! I''m excited about this photo...it''s surprising, you know, it pops out of the screen. The shadows and lighting are perfect, the lines are dramatic and complex, and the sky is astounding. One of those days where the sky is a 1st place photo, you know what i mean? Just the texture of it, the shifts in color and tone...oh, I''m gushing, I know. But I love this photo. Thank you!</td>', 'This shot immmmmmediately caught my eye. It is excellent. EXCELLENT! I''m excited about this photo...it''s surprising, you know, it pops out of the screen. The shadows and lighting are perfect, the lines are dramatic and complex, and the sky is astounding. One of those days where the sky is a 1st place photo, you know what i mean? Just the texture of it, the shifts in color and tone...oh, I''m gushing, I know. But I love this photo. Thank you!', '2004-10-03 17:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(938976, 108875, 26045, '<td valign="top">Mmm...very nice shot. I was hoping for either a little more brightness or darkness in the foreground... I''d like to either see the details or not see them at all. As it stands, I can kinda make some out, so I spend alot of time trying to decipher the details when I should just be eyeing the reflections... The water is beautiful, btw. The bright light above is like an aura, the shifts in color very obvious. Lovely! Thank you!</td>', 'Mmm...very nice shot. I was hoping for either a little more brightness or darkness in the foreground... I''d like to either see the details or not see them at all. As it stands, I can kinda make some out, so I spend alot of time trying to decipher the details when I should just be eyeing the reflections... The water is beautiful, btw. The bright light above is like an aura, the shifts in color very obvious. Lovely! Thank you!', '2004-10-03 17:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(938977, 106171, 26045, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, crisp, colorful - and wonderful that there''s no distractions in the background. Indeed, eagles have such composure and fierceness. Excellent shot, thank you!</td>', 'Very sharp, crisp, colorful - and wonderful that there''s no distractions in the background. Indeed, eagles have such composure and fierceness. Excellent shot, thank you!', '2004-10-03 17:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(938978, 105966, 26045, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea for a shot...I like how the colors of the balloon are illuminated, but some other bright spots in the shot tend to distract... I do like the faint light in the sky coming in from behind...thanks!</td>', 'This is a good idea for a shot...I like how the colors of the balloon are illuminated, but some other bright spots in the shot tend to distract... I do like the faint light in the sky coming in from behind...thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(938979, 104134, 26045, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Crisp, great tones, love the tshirt and shells color, very complimentary. She''s a cutie! This is a very laid back, honest portrait, and she''s got on a great expression. Thanks!</td>', 'Very nice! Crisp, great tones, love the tshirt and shells color, very complimentary. She''s a cutie! This is a very laid back, honest portrait, and she''s got on a great expression. Thanks!', '2004-10-03 17:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(938980, 108872, 26045, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors, but very little texture... I guess that means the painter did a good job on the walls ahaha... anyway, I really like it! It''s this style of architecture I miss in my urban environment...we don''t get much of these hues in NYC, sadly. Thanks for this, I enjoyed the eyecandy!</td>', 'Wonderful colors, but very little texture... I guess that means the painter did a good job on the walls ahaha... anyway, I really like it! It''s this style of architecture I miss in my urban environment...we don''t get much of these hues in NYC, sadly. Thanks for this, I enjoyed the eyecandy!', '2004-10-03 17:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(938981, 103219, 26045, '<td valign="top">Very nice study, but the high gloss on her lip is very distracting...there could be more shadow play on the collar bone, and maybe the slip of hair on her neck could go...but overall I think it''s great, and I love the small show of fabric on the bottom. Nice contrast. Thankee!</td>', 'Very nice study, but the high gloss on her lip is very distracting...there could be more shadow play on the collar bone, and maybe the slip of hair on her neck could go...but overall I think it''s great, and I love the small show of fabric on the bottom. Nice contrast. Thankee!', '2004-10-03 17:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
