(939221, 103788, 22975, '<td valign="top">10!  Stunning view, and the sepia tones are great for this subject.  The composition''s perfect too.  Great job!</td>', '10!  Stunning view, and the sepia tones are great for this subject.  The composition''s perfect too.  Great job!', '2004-10-03 21:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(939224, 108872, 22975, '<td valign="top">10!  I''m a sucker for cool, saturated color blocks, and you''ve done it.  Another work of art in this master''s challenge.  Me personally, I would have liked it better without the ornamental thing in the bottom left corner, but it''s nothing I''m going to deduct for.</td>', '10!  I''m a sucker for cool, saturated color blocks, and you''ve done it.  Another work of art in this master''s challenge.  Me personally, I would have liked it better without the ornamental thing in the bottom left corner, but it''s nothing I''m going to deduct for.', '2004-10-03 21:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(939229, 107202, 22975, '<td valign="top">9.  The colors are so perfect in this shot, and the pose is very striking.  This website is really teaching me how to see this type of subject matter as a form of art.  When I first joined, I probably would have stuck my nose up at it because it''s not something I''d typically like, but this is just a wonderful shot.  I only wish I could see a little more of her profile...</td>', '9.  The colors are so perfect in this shot, and the pose is very striking.  This website is really teaching me how to see this type of subject matter as a form of art.  When I first joined, I probably would have stuck my nose up at it because it''s not something I''d typically like, but this is just a wonderful shot.  I only wish I could see a little more of her profile...', '2004-10-03 21:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(939231, 108843, 22975, '<td valign="top">9 The blue is so soothing in this, it just looks so cold and isolated.  Excellent job in capturing this moment.</td>', '9 The blue is so soothing in this, it just looks so cold and isolated.  Excellent job in capturing this moment.', '2004-10-03 21:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(939234, 106488, 22975, '<td valign="top">9.  I am really fascinated with infrared photography... I just ordered a lens online and should get it this week.  I can''t wait to try it out... I can only hope that my photos will be as nice as this one.</td>', '9.  I am really fascinated with infrared photography... I just ordered a lens online and should get it this week.  I can''t wait to try it out... I can only hope that my photos will be as nice as this one.', '2004-10-03 21:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(939244, 107387, 22975, '<td valign="top">Bumpiing this to a 10.  I just don''t know how you great photographers use all the ranges in your b/w photography, but you''ve done it masterfully.  Excellent photo!!</td>', 'Bumpiing this to a 10.  I just don''t know how you great photographers use all the ranges in your b/w photography, but you''ve done it masterfully.  Excellent photo!!', '2004-10-03 21:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(939245, 103788, 7711, '<td valign="top">i hope you make this a print. I will order it. I love it. The shapes, the lines, the sky, there isn''t a thing I would change. I had hoped to think of something to offer in "critique" but I can not fault anything, from your choice of composition, crop or conversion. well done! 10</td>', 'i hope you make this a print. I will order it. I love it. The shapes, the lines, the sky, there isn''t a thing I would change. I had hoped to think of something to offer in "critique" but I can not fault anything, from your choice of composition, crop or conversion. well done! 10', '2004-10-03 21:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(939247, 108173, 22975, '<td valign="top">9.  Still not a fan of the bug shots, but every once in a while one will jump out at me (and give me the chills).  This one did just that.  Having been stung by one of these as a child, they''ve always had that menacing feel about them.  You''ve captured that perfectly.</td>', '9.  Still not a fan of the bug shots, but every once in a while one will jump out at me (and give me the chills).  This one did just that.  Having been stung by one of these as a child, they''ve always had that menacing feel about them.  You''ve captured that perfectly.', '2004-10-03 21:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(939249, 107901, 22975, '<td valign="top">8.  I love the clarity on this.  I''ll be interested to see your lens and settings.</td>', '8.  I love the clarity on this.  I''ll be interested to see your lens and settings.', '2004-10-03 21:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(939251, 106931, 22975, '<td valign="top">Sigh... 9.  I''d love to be sitting amid a view like this.  Everything seems so peaceful.  :)</td>', 'Sigh... 9.  I''d love to be sitting amid a view like this.  Everything seems so peaceful.  :)', '2004-10-03 21:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(939255, 108537, 22975, '<td valign="top">9.  Great theme shot with wonderful lighting and textures.  Love it!!</td>', '9.  Great theme shot with wonderful lighting and textures.  Love it!!', '2004-10-03 21:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(939264, 108979, 19608, '<td valign="top">Strong points:  It''s an exceptionally graphic image.  There is a lot of visual mystery because of the orientation of the lines in the vases - it doesn''t male "visual sense."  There are strong blacks and whites - but a very narrow pallette of grays.<br/> <br/>Suggestions for improvement: Certainly an artist who could create and shoot this image could find a better title.</td>', 'Strong points:  It''s an exceptionally graphic image.  There is a lot of visual mystery because of the orientation of the lines in the vases - it doesn''t male "visual sense."  There are strong blacks and whites - but a very narrow pallette of grays. Suggestions for improvement: Certainly an artist who could create and shoot this image could find a better title.', '2004-10-03 22:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(939268, 108984, 19608, '<td valign="top">Strong points:  Simple yet effective combination of colors.  Exposure right on.  Excellent DoF.  Lighting handled well.<br/> <br/>Suggestions for improvement: Composition is pretty static - consider more diagonal placement. Crowded on the left.  White border ok, but not needed.</td>', 'Strong points:  Simple yet effective combination of colors.  Exposure right on.  Excellent DoF.  Lighting handled well. Suggestions for improvement: Composition is pretty static - consider more diagonal placement. Crowded on the left.  White border ok, but not needed.', '2004-10-03 22:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
