(939379, 107397, 509, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot, but could be improved by a slight increase in contrast, maybe saturation too.  Was burning used on the grass or is that shade from the clouds?  Either way, I like the effect.  It looks to me that a lot of nice shots could be taken of this structure.  Some abstracts might be interesting as well.</td>', 'I think this is a great shot, but could be improved by a slight increase in contrast, maybe saturation too.  Was burning used on the grass or is that shade from the clouds?  Either way, I like the effect.  It looks to me that a lot of nice shots could be taken of this structure.  Some abstracts might be interesting as well.', '2004-10-03 23:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
