(939390, 107902, 1202, '<td valign="top">Quite a collection.  Nice job of mixing color and desaturation.  Only problem is that it is quite flat and has very little dimension to the viewer.  The WOW factor is just lacking.  I like it otherwise.  6</td>', 'Quite a collection.  Nice job of mixing color and desaturation.  Only problem is that it is quite flat and has very little dimension to the viewer.  The WOW factor is just lacking.  I like it otherwise.  6', '2004-10-03 23:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
