(939394, 108872, 1202, '<td valign="top">This more like a painting than a photograph.  very artisitc.  Not exactly my cup uf tea but a great job.  9</td>', 'This more like a painting than a photograph.  very artisitc.  Not exactly my cup uf tea but a great job.  9', '2004-10-03 23:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(939405, 107902, 22734, '<td valign="top">A great image stamped by the style of the miniture because it instantly entrains the mind to consider is it real, is it miniture..or better am I dreaming. yes, this is a dream of nostalgia. Yes, the scene is real but I am ina dream. Wow! my warm congratulations for adding this lucid dream into the challenge. Bumping up to 7</td>', 'A great image stamped by the style of the miniture because it instantly entrains the mind to consider is it real, is it miniture..or better am I dreaming. yes, this is a dream of nostalgia. Yes, the scene is real but I am ina dream. Wow! my warm congratulations for adding this lucid dream into the challenge. Bumping up to 7', '2004-10-03 23:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(939407, 109013, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think this looks too snapshot-ish.  The dark colors of the mans clothing, hair, hat, all kind of blend in with the dark tree background. OK. 6.</td>', 'I think this looks too snapshot-ish.  The dark colors of the mans clothing, hair, hat, all kind of blend in with the dark tree background. OK. 6.', '2004-10-03 23:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(939408, 108276, 25464, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for fall colors, and you picked my favorite trees.  I really like the light and the sky in this one as well.  Not quite a wow, but very good.  I could see this hanging on my wall. 8.</td>', 'I am a sucker for fall colors, and you picked my favorite trees.  I really like the light and the sky in this one as well.  Not quite a wow, but very good.  I could see this hanging on my wall. 8.', '2004-10-03 23:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(939409, 102742, 25464, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Not really what I was expecting in this challenge.  No wow for me, but cute. 6.</td>', 'Very cute.  Not really what I was expecting in this challenge.  No wow for me, but cute. 6.', '2004-10-03 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(939410, 109014, 22734, '<td valign="top">I love these entries because they introduce the magnifent in natures designl very well captured with clossic dof. The texture is just grand and its subdued colors adds character. This will look beautiful in any wall. Bumping up to a well deserved 7</td>', 'I love these entries because they introduce the magnifent in natures designl very well captured with clossic dof. The texture is just grand and its subdued colors adds character. This will look beautiful in any wall. Bumping up to a well deserved 7', '2004-10-03 23:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(939412, 103615, 25464, '<td valign="top">Nice, but looks like a really good snapshot too me.  The background is a bit too bright and distracting for my taste.  Nice color on the face, and good composition otherwise.  I like the backlight on the hair. 6.</td>', 'Nice, but looks like a really good snapshot too me.  The background is a bit too bright and distracting for my taste.  Nice color on the face, and good composition otherwise.  I like the backlight on the hair. 6.', '2004-10-03 23:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(939415, 107202, 25464, '<td valign="top">Completely not my taste; however, very nicely taken.  Great use of the colors. Different.  I think the composition could have been stronger if the line of the bar were not so centered. 8.</td>', 'Completely not my taste; however, very nicely taken.  Great use of the colors. Different.  I think the composition could have been stronger if the line of the bar were not so centered. 8.', '2004-10-03 23:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(939416, 108875, 25464, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but a bit boring.  That lake needs a boat. 8.</td>', 'Beautiful, but a bit boring.  That lake needs a boat. 8.', '2004-10-03 23:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(939419, 108875, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is just too mystical and magical to be absorbed in one glance. It is the kind of image that can hang in a room to give it ambience, peace and serenity. Bumping up.</td>', 'This is just too mystical and magical to be absorbed in one glance. It is the kind of image that can hang in a room to give it ambience, peace and serenity. Bumping up.', '2004-10-03 23:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(939420, 108569, 25464, '<td valign="top">I love the composition.  Interesting angles really capture my attention.  Very well taken.  The lights in the tree balance it out very well. 9.</td>', 'I love the composition.  Interesting angles really capture my attention.  Very well taken.  The lights in the tree balance it out very well. 9.', '2004-10-03 23:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(939422, 108072, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great color, expression, and light.  I think this would have been much stronger if the horse''s head had been included.  That would have made your subject less centered as well.  Still very good. 8.</td>', 'Great color, expression, and light.  I think this would have been much stronger if the horse''s head had been included.  That would have made your subject less centered as well.  Still very good. 8.', '2004-10-03 23:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(939424, 103189, 25464, '<td valign="top">Very interesting capture, but too dark to be very appealing to my eye.  Still I don''t know how you caught this.  Amazing. 8.</td>', 'Very interesting capture, but too dark to be very appealing to my eye.  Still I don''t know how you caught this.  Amazing. 8.', '2004-10-03 23:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(939426, 107202, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing Dr. JOnes :)<br/> <br/>If not, you have done a wonderful job of imitating his style.  This is a great shot, good color, great contrast and great composition.  I give this a 10, based on the wonderful work, the only thing that would put it over the top if she was looking for her shoulder just a bit ;)</td>', 'I''m guessing Dr. JOnes :) If not, you have done a wonderful job of imitating his style.  This is a great shot, good color, great contrast and great composition.  I give this a 10, based on the wonderful work, the only thing that would put it over the top if she was looking for her shoulder just a bit ;)', '2004-10-04 00:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(939428, 107969, 12448, '<td valign="top">I would have called it a Kiwi Jellyfish!  That is what it reminds me of.  I love the color, the look, the wonderful clarity of the overall shot.  There is a touch of over brightness on the right side in the water but it doesn''t really hurt the overall shot.  A 10</td>', 'I would have called it a Kiwi Jellyfish!  That is what it reminds me of.  I love the color, the look, the wonderful clarity of the overall shot.  There is a touch of over brightness on the right side in the water but it doesn''t really hurt the overall shot.  A 10', '2004-10-04 00:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(939430, 108991, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful!  The mist to the right is so perfect, a wonderful way to be lead out of the shot.  Leading in with the clarity of the beach, leading around to the misty water.  The black and white is well chosen for this shot but I have to wonder what the color looks like.  No matter, a 10, no question</td>', 'This is so beautiful!  The mist to the right is so perfect, a wonderful way to be lead out of the shot.  Leading in with the clarity of the beach, leading around to the misty water.  The black and white is well chosen for this shot but I have to wonder what the color looks like.  No matter, a 10, no question', '2004-10-04 00:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(939432, 108537, 12448, '<td valign="top">How fun!  The look, the soft focus around the girl, the clairity on the gun, so perfect, the black and white works so well, just a slightly tighter crop on the right, just a touch would make it beyond perfect.  A 10</td>', 'How fun!  The look, the soft focus around the girl, the clairity on the gun, so perfect, the black and white works so well, just a slightly tighter crop on the right, just a touch would make it beyond perfect.  A 10', '2004-10-04 00:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(939433, 103788, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love this shot,  It reminds me of a picture that was in my parents living room while I was growing up, only it was a full ship, that is my only complaint, it got cut off on both ends, top and bottom.  But the shot itself, I can''t complain, a 10</td>', 'I love this shot,  It reminds me of a picture that was in my parents living room while I was growing up, only it was a full ship, that is my only complaint, it got cut off on both ends, top and bottom.  But the shot itself, I can''t complain, a 10', '2004-10-04 00:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(939435, 109008, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love Macaws and this one is no exception.  Almost any animal shot will automatically get extra points from me. I''m going to have trouble in the wildlife challenge, LOL!<br/> <br/>But for this shot, wonderful expression on the macaw but the light is bit bright and the shadow behind his eye is just every so slightly distracting but not enough to make me lower the score from the original 10 I have given it!</td>', 'I love Macaws and this one is no exception.  Almost any animal shot will automatically get extra points from me. I''m going to have trouble in the wildlife challenge, LOL! But for this shot, wonderful expression on the macaw but the light is bit bright and the shadow behind his eye is just every so slightly distracting but not enough to make me lower the score from the original 10 I have given it!', '2004-10-04 00:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(939436, 108072, 19608, '<td valign="top">Strong points:  Great exposure and composition.  The costume looks fairly authentic.  Suggestions for improvement:   The whitish area of the background is ok - but make one wonder what it is.  b) If you are taliking about modern English - the word is Cossack - although I believe there is a Polish spelling Kozak.</td>', 'Strong points:  Great exposure and composition.  The costume looks fairly authentic.  Suggestions for improvement:   The whitish area of the background is ok - but make one wonder what it is.  b) If you are taliking about modern English - the word is Cossack - although I believe there is a Polish spelling Kozak.', '2004-10-04 00:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(939437, 108072, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  The expression, the look of being captured without being posed.  I love the candid looks.  I would have liked to seen the horses head as I love horses but this shot does very well without that.  a 10</td>', 'This is a great shot.  The expression, the look of being captured without being posed.  I love the candid looks.  I would have liked to seen the horses head as I love horses but this shot does very well without that.  a 10', '2004-10-04 00:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(939440, 108986, 12448, '<td valign="top">Awwwww, he''s all wet!  Did he just get a bath or was it raining?  I love the expression in his eyes, looks just a touch sad.  The crop seems just a touch tight but otherwise a wonderfully perfect shot.  A 10</td>', 'Awwwww, he''s all wet!  Did he just get a bath or was it raining?  I love the expression in his eyes, looks just a touch sad.  The crop seems just a touch tight but otherwise a wonderfully perfect shot.  A 10', '2004-10-04 00:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(939442, 103105, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful shot.  I love animal shots to begin with and you really captured a feeling here.  The motherly warmth and the innocent child.  The light is a bit harsh on the right but the soft focus works so well with it, helps diffuse it so it doesn''t really hurt.  A 10</td>', 'What a wonderful shot.  I love animal shots to begin with and you really captured a feeling here.  The motherly warmth and the innocent child.  The light is a bit harsh on the right but the soft focus works so well with it, helps diffuse it so it doesn''t really hurt.  A 10', '2004-10-04 00:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(939443, 106953, 12448, '<td valign="top">How beautiful!  The look, the graytones, the crop.  So well done, the only thing I would like to see is just a bit higher crop on her head, bring the whole hairline in.  The use of negative space is wonderful.  I can''t really fault the cropping because the overall shot is so well done.  A 10</td>', 'How beautiful!  The look, the graytones, the crop.  So well done, the only thing I would like to see is just a bit higher crop on her head, bring the whole hairline in.  The use of negative space is wonderful.  I can''t really fault the cropping because the overall shot is so well done.  A 10', '2004-10-04 00:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(939446, 102742, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot this must have been to shoot.  I love the use of desautration in this shot and the focus is well done also.  The soft focus is show in some spots and the clarity in others. The ony thing that really gets to me is her feet.  I don''t know what it is, it''s not the placing of them, my kids stand like that all the time, but they look almost undefined, no toes or something, can''t tell if she''s wearing stockings or they were just blurred out, but it really takes away for me.  A 9</td>', 'What a fun shot this must have been to shoot.  I love the use of desautration in this shot and the focus is well done also.  The soft focus is show in some spots and the clarity in others. The ony thing that really gets to me is her feet.  I don''t know what it is, it''s not the placing of them, my kids stand like that all the time, but they look almost undefined, no toes or something, can''t tell if she''s wearing stockings or they were just blurred out, but it really takes away for me.  A 9', '2004-10-04 00:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(939450, 109013, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a nice shot, so emotive and touching.  I love the boys walking with dad idea and the use of the sepia is well chosen.  The only thing that bothers me is the balance, it seems a bit heavy on the left with the cropping.  I put up my magic envelope and I really like this shot centered better, taking out the pole in the upper right corner.  A 9</td>', 'What a nice shot, so emotive and touching.  I love the boys walking with dad idea and the use of the sepia is well chosen.  The only thing that bothers me is the balance, it seems a bit heavy on the left with the cropping.  I put up my magic envelope and I really like this shot centered better, taking out the pole in the upper right corner.  A 9', '2004-10-04 00:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(939455, 109019, 12448, '<td valign="top">How fun.  I wonder how many bubbles she had to blow to get your shot?  You captured her look perfectly and the post processing is very well done.  But the coloration, I''m guessing you did a bit of desaturation seems just a bit off to me, not sure why.  I guess I''m thinking the dress should be a bit brighter for some reason, not sure why.  And is that you in the reflection of the bubble?  A 9</td>', 'How fun.  I wonder how many bubbles she had to blow to get your shot?  You captured her look perfectly and the post processing is very well done.  But the coloration, I''m guessing you did a bit of desaturation seems just a bit off to me, not sure why.  I guess I''m thinking the dress should be a bit brighter for some reason, not sure why.  And is that you in the reflection of the bubble?  A 9', '2004-10-04 00:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(939457, 109014, 12448, '<td valign="top">Kookaburra sits in the old gum tree...........  LOL!  Sorry, couldn''t help myself.<br/> <br/>I love this shot, well done, the cropping, the centering the overall composition.  Just seems a bit dull, just a touch overall.  Maybe just a bit more contrast?  A 9</td>', 'Kookaburra sits in the old gum tree...........  LOL!  Sorry, couldn''t help myself. I love this shot, well done, the cropping, the centering the overall composition.  Just seems a bit dull, just a touch overall.  Maybe just a bit more contrast?  A 9', '2004-10-04 00:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(939462, 106171, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes they are a proud bird, so stern looking, so regal!  And to think we almost had the turkey for our national bird?  LOL!  I love eagle shots and this one is no exception.  It''s well done, centered, overall composition, just lacking a real pop factor, maybe a bit more contrast to bring out the colors?  A 9</td>', 'Yes they are a proud bird, so stern looking, so regal!  And to think we almost had the turkey for our national bird?  LOL!  I love eagle shots and this one is no exception.  It''s well done, centered, overall composition, just lacking a real pop factor, maybe a bit more contrast to bring out the colors?  A 9', '2004-10-04 00:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(939463, 108275, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oh, he looks so sad :(  The poor baby, he''s probably thinking, "Won''t you get me out of here?"  This is a wonderful shot, overall composition is well don, just seems to be lacking definitive black and white points and yes, my monitor is calibrated.  A 9</td>', 'Oh, he looks so sad :(  The poor baby, he''s probably thinking, "Won''t you get me out of here?"  This is a wonderful shot, overall composition is well don, just seems to be lacking definitive black and white points and yes, my monitor is calibrated.  A 9', '2004-10-04 00:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(939464, 108843, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot, so serene, so calm, so blue!  This is well done and the rocks on the left offer just a bit of break in the horizon to keep it interesting.  My only complaint, and believe me, I feel silly giving it, is it lacks a final POP factor, something to really make it jump off the screen at me.    The over all colors are lacking just a touch, a 9</td>', 'What a beautiful shot, so serene, so calm, so blue!  This is well done and the rocks on the left offer just a bit of break in the horizon to keep it interesting.  My only complaint, and believe me, I feel silly giving it, is it lacks a final POP factor, something to really make it jump off the screen at me.    The over all colors are lacking just a touch, a 9', '2004-10-04 00:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(939471, 107091, 12448, '<td valign="top">The use of negative space on this shot is very well done and I love the subject matter,  are they people flying?  It looks like fun!  The overall shot seems to lack just a touch of contrast to me though, a 9</td>', 'The use of negative space on this shot is very well done and I love the subject matter,  are they people flying?  It looks like fun!  The overall shot seems to lack just a touch of contrast to me though, a 9', '2004-10-04 00:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(939472, 107365, 12448, '<td valign="top">That is spooky, seriously!  I''m hoping this was taken in a zoo, LOL!<br/> <br/>This is a wonderful shot, I wonder how long you waited for it.  The clairty of the eyes and such, if the nose was also clear I would have not hesitated to give this a 10, but the nose is a bit distracting to me, sorry, a 9</td>', 'That is spooky, seriously!  I''m hoping this was taken in a zoo, LOL! This is a wonderful shot, I wonder how long you waited for it.  The clairty of the eyes and such, if the nose was also clear I would have not hesitated to give this a 10, but the nose is a bit distracting to me, sorry, a 9', '2004-10-04 00:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(939474, 106707, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot, the balance, the colors, the overall look is very captivating.  The only thing that bothers me a bit is the left side seems too dark, I can see how the sky is darkening as it goes to the left but it seems just a bit too dark towards the land.  A 9</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot, the balance, the colors, the overall look is very captivating.  The only thing that bothers me a bit is the left side seems too dark, I can see how the sky is darkening as it goes to the left but it seems just a bit too dark towards the land.  A 9', '2004-10-04 00:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(939477, 109032, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot, but the shadow on the front of her is more distracting to me.  I see what you are going for and it''s very well done but the proportions seems off a bit, the shadow should be a little smaller to me, jut a bit and the way it falls across her body is distracting.  And there is no real sharpness in any of the shot, if the actual boxer was in better focus I would score this higher.  I started at a 6 on this, first glance and upon further examination I''m raising it to a 7</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot, but the shadow on the front of her is more distracting to me.  I see what you are going for and it''s very well done but the proportions seems off a bit, the shadow should be a little smaller to me, jut a bit and the way it falls across her body is distracting.  And there is no real sharpness in any of the shot, if the actual boxer was in better focus I would score this higher.  I started at a 6 on this, first glance and upon further examination I''m raising it to a 7', '2004-10-04 00:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(939480, 108924, 12448, '<td valign="top">The colors in this shot are wonderful, the orange and reds and yellows but the clouds on the right seem over saturated and the person (? can''t really tell) on top of the hill gets lost in the shot.  A beautiful shot but not overall captivating, sorry a 6</td>', 'The colors in this shot are wonderful, the orange and reds and yellows but the clouds on the right seem over saturated and the person (? can''t really tell) on top of the hill gets lost in the shot.  A beautiful shot but not overall captivating, sorry a 6', '2004-10-04 00:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(939484, 109032, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a creative effort with great visual powerThe choice of the blur adds the illusion of movement to compliment the punch. Will place it at 6 and will return for final evaluation. <br/> <br/>back; fitsy O never questioned the validity since this can be accomplished several ways. But who are these members who are so green in this industry that they suspect ps. Remember, hollywood and trick photography existed way before ps ever entered the picture.<br/> <br/>I am bumping this image to 10 because it is a creative effort of which there are not as many as I expected. It has remain a rather safe ground entry contest.</td>', 'This is a creative effort with great visual powerThe choice of the blur adds the illusion of movement to compliment the punch. Will place it at 6 and will return for final evaluation.  back; fitsy O never questioned the validity since this can be accomplished several ways. But who are these members who are so green in this industry that they suspect ps. Remember, hollywood and trick photography existed way before ps ever entered the picture. I am bumping this image to 10 because it is a creative effort of which there are not as many as I expected. It has remain a rather safe ground entry contest.', '2004-10-04 00:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(939487, 108122, 6008, '<td valign="top">The first thing I notice are of course the eyes, and they say so much. Very bright and demanding of attention. The toning is also excellent and suits the image perfectly. The dof is also perfect for this type of portrait and it puts emphasis back on those eyes. The expression is very cheeky. A wonderful portrait shot.</td>', 'The first thing I notice are of course the eyes, and they say so much. Very bright and demanding of attention. The toning is also excellent and suits the image perfectly. The dof is also perfect for this type of portrait and it puts emphasis back on those eyes. The expression is very cheeky. A wonderful portrait shot.', '2004-10-04 00:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(939488, 105647, 12448, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot but the negative space on the bottom hurts this shot more than helps it to me.  Too much black for a dark night shot to start with.  I would have liked to have seen the building take more of the shot , it looks like a wonderful subject.  A 6</td>', 'A very nice shot but the negative space on the bottom hurts this shot more than helps it to me.  Too much black for a dark night shot to start with.  I would have liked to have seen the building take more of the shot , it looks like a wonderful subject.  A 6', '2004-10-04 00:46:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(939491, 105966, 12448, '<td valign="top">Do they actually balloon at night?  I think it would be dangerous!  But what do I know?  This is a nice shot but the lacke of clarity on the main subject hurts it to me. I understand longer exposures to get the light but the basket is just to fuzzy for my taste and the balloons on the right are more distracting to me. Started at a 6, am raising to a 7</td>', 'Do they actually balloon at night?  I think it would be dangerous!  But what do I know?  This is a nice shot but the lacke of clarity on the main subject hurts it to me. I understand longer exposures to get the light but the basket is just to fuzzy for my taste and the balloons on the right are more distracting to me. Started at a 6, am raising to a 7', '2004-10-04 00:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(939493, 103219, 12448, '<td valign="top">A wonderful, understated shot.  Nothing of great interest in the shot but for some reason the compositon and the set up hold my attention longer than it should.  The lines of the cloth, her shoulder, leading me around the shot is very well done.  Just a touch more contrast would make this perfect.  Seems just a tad dull, just a tad. a9</td>', 'A wonderful, understated shot.  Nothing of great interest in the shot but for some reason the compositon and the set up hold my attention longer than it should.  The lines of the cloth, her shoulder, leading me around the shot is very well done.  Just a touch more contrast would make this perfect.  Seems just a tad dull, just a tad. a9', '2004-10-04 00:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(939517, 107995, 12448, '<td valign="top">How fun was this shot to shoot?  It really caught me of guard at first, I was trying to figure out just what you did and then I saw it, the way the eyebrows line up so perfectly, well done.  The only thing that could have made this perfect is if her hair and the models hair was the same color or if you at least pulled her hair back to match the hairstyle on the magazine.  A 9</td>', 'How fun was this shot to shoot?  It really caught me of guard at first, I was trying to figure out just what you did and then I saw it, the way the eyebrows line up so perfectly, well done.  The only thing that could have made this perfect is if her hair and the models hair was the same color or if you at least pulled her hair back to match the hairstyle on the magazine.  A 9', '2004-10-04 00:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(939519, 105190, 19608, '<td valign="top">Strong points:  Time of day (lighting) is perfect.  Shutter speed is exactly right for the texture in the water.  Composition could not be better, the s-curve of the waters''s edge is wowzer..  Exposure is spot on.  Suggestions for improvement.  The only minor suggestion I have is to re-evaluate the need for such a large border.</td>', 'Strong points:  Time of day (lighting) is perfect.  Shutter speed is exactly right for the texture in the water.  Composition could not be better, the s-curve of the waters''s edge is wowzer..  Exposure is spot on.  Suggestions for improvement.  The only minor suggestion I have is to re-evaluate the need for such a large border.', '2004-10-04 00:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(939524, 107300, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a pretty shot, the framing of the bride, the pose, the lighting.  The way you lightened around the edges is well done but around her head is just a bit too light, she almost ends up blending into the background there.  A 9</td>', 'What a pretty shot, the framing of the bride, the pose, the lighting.  The way you lightened around the edges is well done but around her head is just a bit too light, she almost ends up blending into the background there.  A 9', '2004-10-04 00:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(939770, 107609, 8054, '<td valign="top">I hate being this picky but I try to relate the photo to the title in some manner and I just can''t do that with this one. I see the man looking at something and I expect to see the cider press somewhere and I do not see it. Maybe I need to infer that it''s there because of the type of cup he''s holding but I am not sure. All I see are his eyes looking out of frame at something and it makes me want to see what''s there. The composition, duotone and strong contrast are this photo''s strongest points and they are used to their utmost. 6</td>', 'I hate being this picky but I try to relate the photo to the title in some manner and I just can''t do that with this one. I see the man looking at something and I expect to see the cider press somewhere and I do not see it. Maybe I need to infer that it''s there because of the type of cup he''s holding but I am not sure. All I see are his eyes looking out of frame at something and it makes me want to see what''s there. The composition, duotone and strong contrast are this photo''s strongest points and they are used to their utmost. 6', '2004-10-04 02:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(939831, 108537, 8054, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a great photo! Soft focus really makes the picture in this case. B/W gives it a retro feel about it which I like. However, her facial expression, although nothing really wrong with it from a technical standpoint, doesn''t really fit the fact she''s wielding a gun. 8</td>', 'Wow, this is a great photo! Soft focus really makes the picture in this case. B/W gives it a retro feel about it which I like. However, her facial expression, although nothing really wrong with it from a technical standpoint, doesn''t really fit the fact she''s wielding a gun. 8', '2004-10-04 02:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(939845, 107876, 8054, '<td valign="top">Oh that looks yummy and makes me want to go find something in the kitchen to eat. Very good application of DOF to emphasize the three main textures: puff pastry, cream filling and the strawberry. Lighting seems a bit bright to me and contrast is a bit weak and undefined. 7</td>', 'Oh that looks yummy and makes me want to go find something in the kitchen to eat. Very good application of DOF to emphasize the three main textures: puff pastry, cream filling and the strawberry. Lighting seems a bit bright to me and contrast is a bit weak and undefined. 7', '2004-10-04 02:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
