(940139, 106931, 18058, '<td valign="top">Beautiful view</td>', 'Beautiful view', '2004-10-04 07:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(940152, 104027, 18450, '<td valign="top">wonderful perspective!</td>', 'wonderful perspective!', '2004-10-04 07:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(940154, 108275, 18450, '<td valign="top">Just wonderful! Very emotive, moving portrait of a gorilla.</td>', 'Just wonderful! Very emotive, moving portrait of a gorilla.', '2004-10-04 07:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(940155, 107091, 4008, '<td valign="top">I am sorry I find this image not particularly appealing. The large empty space does not work for me because it is just a flat and dull grey, I would have understood it better if it emphasised the enormous spcae around us, for example by using colors and having some great clouds in there. Then I also would have understood the title, which does not seem to fit at the moment. And finally I find the distance to the persons too big. A shot closer and more from underneath would have emphased the height, the ambition to fly. etc.</td>', 'I am sorry I find this image not particularly appealing. The large empty space does not work for me because it is just a flat and dull grey, I would have understood it better if it emphasised the enormous spcae around us, for example by using colors and having some great clouds in there. Then I also would have understood the title, which does not seem to fit at the moment. And finally I find the distance to the persons too big. A shot closer and more from underneath would have emphased the height, the ambition to fly. etc.', '2004-10-04 07:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(940157, 104134, 18450, '<td valign="top">Lovely light, pose, expression. I really like this portrait.</td>', 'Lovely light, pose, expression. I really like this portrait.', '2004-10-04 07:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(940185, 105966, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the night time atmosphere with all the balloon enthusiasts getting together, the warm glow in the front and the silhouettes and small lights at the back. I probably would have cropped a significant part of the top (without hurting the silhouettes) and a bit of the left, to get a bit more concentrated view.</td>', 'I like the night time atmosphere with all the balloon enthusiasts getting together, the warm glow in the front and the silhouettes and small lights at the back. I probably would have cropped a significant part of the top (without hurting the silhouettes) and a bit of the left, to get a bit more concentrated view.', '2004-10-04 08:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(940188, 107020, 4008, '<td valign="top">Very nice atmosphere, great clouds and reflection. I am missing some focal point and find the left edge distracting. It looks like a small boat is coming into the picture at the edge, cropping that away, up to the middle of the first large tree, would have improved the image in my opinion.</td>', 'Very nice atmosphere, great clouds and reflection. I am missing some focal point and find the left edge distracting. It looks like a small boat is coming into the picture at the edge, cropping that away, up to the middle of the first large tree, would have improved the image in my opinion.', '2004-10-04 08:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(940190, 108984, 4008, '<td valign="top">A technically perfect image with great primary colors, composition and lighting. A good specimen as well.  It unfortunately fails to touch me emotionally like some other good images in this challenge do, which is why it ends up a bit lower in my ranking.</td>', 'A technically perfect image with great primary colors, composition and lighting. A good specimen as well.  It unfortunately fails to touch me emotionally like some other good images in this challenge do, which is why it ends up a bit lower in my ranking.', '2004-10-04 08:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(940195, 108269, 4008, '<td valign="top">The sunshine part looks totally burned out, no detail left, and also the clouds above it look strange to me, a pale yellow colors as if extensive dodging was done. Looks rather unnatural. You have some great elements here for an impressive picture, but the issues mentioned, plus the fact I have no real other focal point, make this score lower.</td>', 'The sunshine part looks totally burned out, no detail left, and also the clouds above it look strange to me, a pale yellow colors as if extensive dodging was done. Looks rather unnatural. You have some great elements here for an impressive picture, but the issues mentioned, plus the fact I have no real other focal point, make this score lower.', '2004-10-04 08:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(940213, 103619, 24925, '<td valign="top">Great idea, neat image...but it doesn''t appeal to me a whole lot.  I know this must have been difficult to pull off, but the payout isn''t there for me personally although I''m sure it will appeal to others...Great work, overall, though!<br/> <br/>Edit: I''m scoring this a 6, because it''s a neat idea but it just doesn''t do a lot for me...</td>', 'Great idea, neat image...but it doesn''t appeal to me a whole lot.  I know this must have been difficult to pull off, but the payout isn''t there for me personally although I''m sure it will appeal to others...Great work, overall, though! Edit: I''m scoring this a 6, because it''s a neat idea but it just doesn''t do a lot for me...', '2004-10-04 08:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(940220, 103105, 3306, '<td valign="top">The soft lighting and pose of the monkeys almost looks like a painting. The mother looks like she is looking with a knowing gaze while the baby has somewhat of a quizzical look. Excellent setup and interesting picture. Good job.</td>', 'The soft lighting and pose of the monkeys almost looks like a painting. The mother looks like she is looking with a knowing gaze while the baby has somewhat of a quizzical look. Excellent setup and interesting picture. Good job.', '2004-10-04 08:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(940221, 108767, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunrise shot. Seems like a nice quiet place to take a morning stroll. I really like the low defined fog hanging withing the trees.</td>', 'Beautiful sunrise shot. Seems like a nice quiet place to take a morning stroll. I really like the low defined fog hanging withing the trees.', '2004-10-04 08:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(940224, 109013, 3306, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. A father with his sons. Strikes to the heart as I have 2 sons also. A father can really feel the emotion of this picture. Only one criticism. I would have cropped out the electrical pole and wires on the right side. Otherwise a charming shot.</td>', 'I really like this shot. A father with his sons. Strikes to the heart as I have 2 sons also. A father can really feel the emotion of this picture. Only one criticism. I would have cropped out the electrical pole and wires on the right side. Otherwise a charming shot.', '2004-10-04 09:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(940226, 107397, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a neat picture. Looks like a painting. I like the soft colors and the slightly out of focus appearence. I could definitely see this hanging on the wall. Nice shot and post processing.</td>', 'This is a neat picture. Looks like a painting. I like the soft colors and the slightly out of focus appearence. I could definitely see this hanging on the wall. Nice shot and post processing.', '2004-10-04 09:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(940229, 108642, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. It almost has a dreamy feel to it. I like the way the shadow have framed the shot. Very nice</td>', 'Interesting picture. It almost has a dreamy feel to it. I like the way the shadow have framed the shot. Very nice', '2004-10-04 09:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(940232, 108832, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset shot. I am sure the colors are even more amazing in person. I like the casting shadows within the clouds. Very serene.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset shot. I am sure the colors are even more amazing in person. I like the casting shadows within the clouds. Very serene.', '2004-10-04 09:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(940238, 108984, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is simply a well taken still life. Colors, sharpness, positioning, lighting and DOF are right on. The only negative in comparison with some of the other shots is that it is not terribly original or interesting but I don''t think you were going for that. I think you were just trying to take the best technically possible shot you could and you have succeeded.</td>', 'This is simply a well taken still life. Colors, sharpness, positioning, lighting and DOF are right on. The only negative in comparison with some of the other shots is that it is not terribly original or interesting but I don''t think you were going for that. I think you were just trying to take the best technically possible shot you could and you have succeeded.', '2004-10-04 09:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(940243, 107091, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the negative space and the feeling of action in your picture. All that room above the subject makes me feel that is where he wants to be. Good shot</td>', 'I like the negative space and the feeling of action in your picture. All that room above the subject makes me feel that is where he wants to be. Good shot', '2004-10-04 09:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(940244, 106931, 4008, '<td valign="top">very nice wide view, very peaceful scene, great reflection</td>', 'very nice wide view, very peaceful scene, great reflection', '2004-10-04 09:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(940247, 108569, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of view and coloring of this image. Some parts look to loose some detail as result of overexposure, especially towards the top of the tower.</td>', 'I like the angle of view and coloring of this image. Some parts look to loose some detail as result of overexposure, especially towards the top of the tower.', '2004-10-04 09:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(940250, 108924, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice minimalistic approach, good to have that person as focal point. Maybe even more balanced without the red clouds in front, but I realise you can''t just blown them away, have to catch the moment.</td>', 'Nice minimalistic approach, good to have that person as focal point. Maybe even more balanced without the red clouds in front, but I realise you can''t just blown them away, have to catch the moment.', '2004-10-04 09:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(940255, 109031, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice isolation of a detail of a larger part, I wonder how big this statue is.  The water drops around it add some context.</td>', 'Nice isolation of a detail of a larger part, I wonder how big this statue is.  The water drops around it add some context.', '2004-10-04 09:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(940259, 103219, 4008, '<td valign="top">Me eyes keep moving around from her lips, to her shoulder, to the shadow of her breast. It might have been your intention, also considering the title. I wonder how it would have looked with a nice piece of jewelry as focal point.</td>', 'Me eyes keep moving around from her lips, to her shoulder, to the shadow of her breast. It might have been your intention, also considering the title. I wonder how it would have looked with a nice piece of jewelry as focal point.', '2004-10-04 09:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(940328, 105647, 6458, '<td valign="top">I really like the blue sky vs the lit college. But I think you''ve got too much negative space on the bottom, it overpowers the rest of the image. Taking off about an inch of the black space makes this a much stronger shot, imo.</td>', 'I really like the blue sky vs the lit college. But I think you''ve got too much negative space on the bottom, it overpowers the rest of the image. Taking off about an inch of the black space makes this a much stronger shot, imo.', '2004-10-04 09:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(940357, 108995, 6458, '<td valign="top">The energy is what I like about this shot. I''m not quite as big of a fan of the grain, but I can see your intent. The close crop lends itself to this energy, but distracts from the movement of his fingers and strings -- which is where I want to focus my attention, rather than the words on his tshirt.</td>', 'The energy is what I like about this shot. I''m not quite as big of a fan of the grain, but I can see your intent. The close crop lends itself to this energy, but distracts from the movement of his fingers and strings -- which is where I want to focus my attention, rather than the words on his tshirt.', '2004-10-04 10:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(940389, 107202, 18911, '<td valign="top">Good day Dr. Jones . . . <br/> <br/>It''s hard to by anonymous with a recognized style and redhead such as your muse.<br/> <br/>Overall picture, very nice<br/> <br/>Other comments:<br/>I feel that the pose lacks of involvement with her enviroment.  If she was dusting or making the bed or something, it would have been better in my opinion.<br/>The background looks like a projected background . . . but. . . I Think this is not the case because the sahows are consistent with the lighting setup and I think that I see the lighting prop on the right side of the mirror, but it could be a flook . . .<br/> <br/>I like your style, I would love to see you in action.<br/> <br/>Fred</td>', 'Good day Dr. Jones . . .  It''s hard to by anonymous with a recognized style and redhead such as your muse. Overall picture, very nice Other comments:I feel that the pose lacks of involvement with her enviroment.  If she was dusting or making the bed or something, it would have been better in my opinion.The background looks like a projected background . . . but. . . I Think this is not the case because the sahows are consistent with the lighting setup and I think that I see the lighting prop on the right side of the mirror, but it could be a flook . . . I like your style, I would love to see you in action. Fred', '2004-10-04 10:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(940402, 109031, 18911, '<td valign="top">Nice but I think it might have looked nicer if the speed was longer and have the sensation of water movement instead of freezing the water.  Sorry not a winner</td>', 'Nice but I think it might have looked nicer if the speed was longer and have the sensation of water movement instead of freezing the water.  Sorry not a winner', '2004-10-04 10:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(940408, 108843, 18911, '<td valign="top">Very nice with the moon and all</td>', 'Very nice with the moon and all', '2004-10-04 10:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(940460, 106171, 19608, '<td valign="top">Strong Points:  The superb Dof on the bird along with the nice soft background make this an exceptional image.  Exposure is right on, including the white feathers - plenty of detail in the white.  Suggestions for improvement:  A catchlight in the eye would really add more wow to a great image.  The white border is ok, but I''d like it better at about 1/2 the size - or even less.</td>', 'Strong Points:  The superb Dof on the bird along with the nice soft background make this an exceptional image.  Exposure is right on, including the white feathers - plenty of detail in the white.  Suggestions for improvement:  A catchlight in the eye would really add more wow to a great image.  The white border is ok, but I''d like it better at about 1/2 the size - or even less.', '2004-10-04 11:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(940461, 108872, 12802, '<td valign="top">Such a simple yet very effective shot!<br/> <br/>The colours here are brilliant, perfectly captured, nice and sharp. Well done! 9</td>', 'Such a simple yet very effective shot! The colours here are brilliant, perfectly captured, nice and sharp. Well done! 9', '2004-10-04 11:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(940463, 103619, 12802, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this one a few times and skipped to the next shot. Still trying to decide on it.<br/> <br/>I like the idea, but don''t know how it was done other than using PS or similar a little too much. Will be good to see how it''s done! 8</td>', 'I''ve looked at this one a few times and skipped to the next shot. Still trying to decide on it. I like the idea, but don''t know how it was done other than using PS or similar a little too much. Will be good to see how it''s done! 8', '2004-10-04 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(940466, 107020, 19608, '<td valign="top">Strong points:  The scene is excellent with a great range of colors. Taken at a opportune moment.  Suggestions for improvement:  It''s rather centered and would be fine to remove some of the bottom.  The heavey 2-toned border could be downsized a bit.</td>', 'Strong points:  The scene is excellent with a great range of colors. Taken at a opportune moment.  Suggestions for improvement:  It''s rather centered and would be fine to remove some of the bottom.  The heavey 2-toned border could be downsized a bit.', '2004-10-04 11:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(940467, 109013, 12802, '<td valign="top">:-) I love shots like this! Rather than focusing on the face etc, we have a shot that makes us think about what the three guys are talking about and doind walking down the lane.<br/> <br/>Good choice of sepia, nice and clear with just the right DOF.  9</td>', ':-) I love shots like this! Rather than focusing on the face etc, we have a shot that makes us think about what the three guys are talking about and doind walking down the lane. Good choice of sepia, nice and clear with just the right DOF.  9', '2004-10-04 11:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(940469, 105190, 12802, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! From the moment I saw it I really liked it!<br/> <br/>The long exposure is brilliant, the smooth water looks amazing here!  The sun setting in the background gives this an excellent background.  Well done!!  Full marks! 10</td>', 'I love this shot! From the moment I saw it I really liked it! The long exposure is brilliant, the smooth water looks amazing here!  The sun setting in the background gives this an excellent background.  Well done!!  Full marks! 10', '2004-10-04 11:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(940471, 108924, 12802, '<td valign="top">I love the sky in this shot! The colours in the clouds are brilliant.  I can see that it''s a person on the top of the hill, for me it''s a little small though. Still, a very nice shot! 8</td>', 'I love the sky in this shot! The colours in the clouds are brilliant.  I can see that it''s a person on the top of the hill, for me it''s a little small though. Still, a very nice shot! 8', '2004-10-04 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(940472, 109031, 19608, '<td valign="top">Strong points:  Composition is nice as is the exposure.  The shutter speed was fast enogh to freeze action in the water.  Suggestions for improvement: Although it''s technically an excellent image, it doesn''t have much wow for me.  Perhaps a different subject?</td>', 'Strong points:  Composition is nice as is the exposure.  The shutter speed was fast enogh to freeze action in the water.  Suggestions for improvement: Although it''s technically an excellent image, it doesn''t have much wow for me.  Perhaps a different subject?', '2004-10-04 11:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(940474, 103788, 12802, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot here, the sky is amazing! The DOF you''ve used to get the details in the sail and rigging is so good!  Well done! 9</td>', 'Brilliant shot here, the sky is amazing! The DOF you''ve used to get the details in the sail and rigging is so good!  Well done! 9', '2004-10-04 11:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(940477, 108072, 12802, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait shot here, the exposure and DOF is spot on!  Did he know this was being taken?  Well done! 8</td>', 'Excellent portrait shot here, the exposure and DOF is spot on!  Did he know this was being taken?  Well done! 8', '2004-10-04 11:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(940479, 108979, 12802, '<td valign="top">Certainly a shot to stand out amongst the rest!!  Kind of hurts the eyes a bit...  Only gripe is the cloth on the bottom RHS is a little rumpled, it''s the little things that count.  8</td>', 'Certainly a shot to stand out amongst the rest!!  Kind of hurts the eyes a bit...  Only gripe is the cloth on the bottom RHS is a little rumpled, it''s the little things that count.  8', '2004-10-04 11:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(940481, 106707, 19608, '<td valign="top">Strong points:  Lighting, lighting!  You found great lighting and then an excellent subject as well.  The golden glow of the tower complements the orangy clouds perfectly.  The hint of white clouds  and blue sky at the top is an added bonus.  Composition could not be better with the perfect amount of nice green for a base. Suggestions for improvement:  Downsize the border.  Overall:  Listen for the whistle of the ribbon train - it''s on the way.</td>', 'Strong points:  Lighting, lighting!  You found great lighting and then an excellent subject as well.  The golden glow of the tower complements the orangy clouds perfectly.  The hint of white clouds  and blue sky at the top is an added bonus.  Composition could not be better with the perfect amount of nice green for a base. Suggestions for improvement:  Downsize the border.  Overall:  Listen for the whistle of the ribbon train - it''s on the way.', '2004-10-04 11:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(940482, 108454, 12802, '<td valign="top">Good textures in the rocks, maybe a little oversharpened i.e. the edges look as if they have a little halo. The exposure is great, nice even blue in the sky. 7</td>', 'Good textures in the rocks, maybe a little oversharpened i.e. the edges look as if they have a little halo. The exposure is great, nice even blue in the sky. 7', '2004-10-04 11:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(940484, 103615, 12802, '<td valign="top">Great portrait shot! The DOF here is brilliant, really like shots like this. Her face looks soft too, glad there was no oversharpening done here! 9</td>', 'Great portrait shot! The DOF here is brilliant, really like shots like this. Her face looks soft too, glad there was no oversharpening done here! 9', '2004-10-04 11:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(940485, 109019, 12802, '<td valign="top">:-) Really good shot here!  I love the expression on the little girls face!  Can''t see if she''s looking directly at the bubble though. 9</td>', ':-) Really good shot here!  I love the expression on the little girls face!  Can''t see if she''s looking directly at the bubble though. 9', '2004-10-04 11:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(940487, 108872, 19608, '<td valign="top">Strong Points:  Superb composition using colors that really sing together.  Exposure is dead on - and the flat lighting really helps.  Suggestions for improvement:  I really don''t see anything you could have done any better!</td>', 'Strong Points:  Superb composition using colors that really sing together.  Exposure is dead on - and the flat lighting really helps.  Suggestions for improvement:  I really don''t see anything you could have done any better!', '2004-10-04 11:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(940488, 106488, 12802, '<td valign="top">I like the negative space at the top, the solitary golfer on the course is good too. Not too sure about the IR though. 7</td>', 'I like the negative space at the top, the solitary golfer on the course is good too. Not too sure about the IR though. 7', '2004-10-04 11:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(940494, 102742, 19608, '<td valign="top">Strong points:  The emotions evoked by the image - both empathy and humor - are powerful.  The technical stuff is all perfect including composition, exposure and the desat.  The purple really works as the  conterpoint.  Suggestions for improvement:  for me the border is a bit larger than it needs to be.</td>', 'Strong points:  The emotions evoked by the image - both empathy and humor - are powerful.  The technical stuff is all perfect including composition, exposure and the desat.  The purple really works as the  conterpoint.  Suggestions for improvement:  for me the border is a bit larger than it needs to be.', '2004-10-04 11:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(940497, 108642, 12802, '<td valign="top">Great childhood shot here, lots of fun showing through! Think the framing of the shot lets it down a little, not too sure about the trees on either side, maybe a tighter cropping? 7</td>', 'Great childhood shot here, lots of fun showing through! Think the framing of the shot lets it down a little, not too sure about the trees on either side, maybe a tighter cropping? 7', '2004-10-04 11:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(940500, 104027, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice and clear shot!  Great DOF to get all of the detail in the framework! Can''t say it really jumps out at me though i''m afraid... 7</td>', 'Nice and clear shot!  Great DOF to get all of the detail in the framework! Can''t say it really jumps out at me though i''m afraid... 7', '2004-10-04 11:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(940504, 107876, 12802, '<td valign="top">Yum!!  Very nice shot here, excellent lighting and DOF used to get an all white background. Might have liked the strawberry to have been rotated 180 degrees to make it look more like a loveheart. 9</td>', 'Yum!!  Very nice shot here, excellent lighting and DOF used to get an all white background. Might have liked the strawberry to have been rotated 180 degrees to make it look more like a loveheart. 9', '2004-10-04 11:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(940505, 108832, 12802, '<td valign="top">A nice calming shot here. I like the lines coming out of the clouds from the sun. 8</td>', 'A nice calming shot here. I like the lines coming out of the clouds from the sun. 8', '2004-10-04 11:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(940509, 107901, 12802, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot here!!  If possible, a DOF to get the wings in detail may have been nice, but I know these wee things probably wouldn''t have stayed still for that long!!  8</td>', 'Great macro shot here!!  If possible, a DOF to get the wings in detail may have been nice, but I know these wee things probably wouldn''t have stayed still for that long!!  8', '2004-10-04 11:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(940510, 108897, 12802, '<td valign="top">A great portrait type shot here!  Like the pose and setup you''ve used here. Not too keen on the border though... 8</td>', 'A great portrait type shot here!  Like the pose and setup you''ve used here. Not too keen on the border though... 8', '2004-10-04 11:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(940512, 108949, 12802, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this doesn''t jump out at me too much.  The colours don''t jump out at me that much, and above it''s eyes are a little overexposed. I know it''s not easy to get this right though, don''t seem to manage it myself.<br/> <br/>It doesn''t seem like a natural shot, too enclosed in the reeds.  Sorry for being too negative here :-) 6</td>', 'I''m afraid this doesn''t jump out at me too much.  The colours don''t jump out at me that much, and above it''s eyes are a little overexposed. I know it''s not easy to get this right though, don''t seem to manage it myself. It doesn''t seem like a natural shot, too enclosed in the reeds.  Sorry for being too negative here :-) 6', '2004-10-04 11:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(940515, 108995, 1202, '<td valign="top">nice effect, fits image well.</td>', 'nice effect, fits image well.', '2004-10-04 11:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(940516, 109014, 12802, '<td valign="top">Great shot here, DOF is brilliant!!  Loads of detail in the feathers, nice and clear eyes! 9</td>', 'Great shot here, DOF is brilliant!!  Loads of detail in the feathers, nice and clear eyes! 9', '2004-10-04 11:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(940520, 108233, 1202, '<td valign="top">IMO it would have much more impact if the subjects didn''t blend in with the background. Great action shot though.  6</td>', 'IMO it would have much more impact if the subjects didn''t blend in with the background. Great action shot though.  6', '2004-10-04 11:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(940524, 107365, 12802, '<td valign="top">Wow, great shot here!!!  The detail in this is brilliant, the DOF getting it is amazing!  There''s some wee spots that could have been removed maybe?  Well done! 10</td>', 'Wow, great shot here!!!  The detail in this is brilliant, the DOF getting it is amazing!  There''s some wee spots that could have been removed maybe?  Well done! 10', '2004-10-04 11:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(940527, 109032, 12802, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to see how this one was done!<br/> <br/>Really good shot here, the expression on her faces is brilliant!  Really like this effect too... 9</td>', 'Can''t wait to see how this one was done! Really good shot here, the expression on her faces is brilliant!  Really like this effect too... 9', '2004-10-04 11:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(940529, 105190, 1202, '<td valign="top">I really like long exposure shots of moving wate, and yours is very nice.  I think it might be a little too long thoughfor the best effect.  7</td>', 'I really like long exposure shots of moving wate, and yours is very nice.  I think it might be a little too long thoughfor the best effect.  7', '2004-10-04 11:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(940530, 108986, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very clear shot here, well done! The eyes are the most important part and you''ve done a great job in capturing them! I would have liked to have seen all of it''s feathers in focus. 9</td>', 'Very clear shot here, well done! The eyes are the most important part and you''ve done a great job in capturing them! I would have liked to have seen all of it''s feathers in focus. 9', '2004-10-04 11:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(940536, 107365, 1202, '<td valign="top">IMO, cropped a little tightand too centered. 6</td>', 'IMO, cropped a little tightand too centered. 6', '2004-10-04 11:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(940540, 108767, 12802, '<td valign="top">Really good shot here, just trying to work out if I would have liked it more if it was cropped tighter from either the top or cutting out part of the pathway at the bottom.<br/> <br/>I love the mist here, leaves an eerie look to the shot, the colours in the sky are brilliant too! 8</td>', 'Really good shot here, just trying to work out if I would have liked it more if it was cropped tighter from either the top or cutting out part of the pathway at the bottom. I love the mist here, leaves an eerie look to the shot, the colours in the sky are brilliant too! 8', '2004-10-04 11:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(940543, 108984, 12802, '<td valign="top">Really clear colours here, stands out extremely well. Might have liked some droplets of water on the pepper to make it more appealing. 8</td>', 'Really clear colours here, stands out extremely well. Might have liked some droplets of water on the pepper to make it more appealing. 8', '2004-10-04 11:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(940547, 108537, 1202, '<td valign="top">great lighting and composition. She doesn''t look the type, and should be told to be careful, it might go off.  7</td>', 'great lighting and composition. She doesn''t look the type, and should be told to be careful, it might go off.  7', '2004-10-04 11:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(940556, 108072, 1202, '<td valign="top">Good composition and technically correct for the subject. Not much WOW factor for the average viewer.  I think if there were a connection between the viewer and the subject it would be much admired.  7</td>', 'Good composition and technically correct for the subject. Not much WOW factor for the average viewer.  I think if there were a connection between the viewer and the subject it would be much admired.  7', '2004-10-04 12:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(940562, 108992, 1202, '<td valign="top">I would like it more if the shadows were even longer. NIce job. 7</td>', 'I would like it more if the shadows were even longer. NIce job. 7', '2004-10-04 12:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(940568, 108949, 1202, '<td valign="top">Zoo Tiger.Considering the pipes protruding up through the concrete rocks and the fact that his feet are already cut off, I think I would have cropped all of that away, then he would be set free. Thus Jungle Tiger!  6</td>', 'Zoo Tiger.Considering the pipes protruding up through the concrete rocks and the fact that his feet are already cut off, I think I would have cropped all of that away, then he would be set free. Thus Jungle Tiger!  6', '2004-10-04 12:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(940577, 107901, 1202, '<td valign="top">IMO you need more depth of field, simply not enough is in focus.  The extra bright spot on its eye is also distracting.  5</td>', 'IMO you need more depth of field, simply not enough is in focus.  The extra bright spot on its eye is also distracting.  5', '2004-10-04 12:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(940582, 108924, 1202, '<td valign="top">Is that a person or a tree? Great clouds. 5</td>', 'Is that a person or a tree? Great clouds. 5', '2004-10-04 12:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(940586, 108269, 1202, '<td valign="top">Storm clouds are great, Too bad the sun rays are so washed out.  6</td>', 'Storm clouds are great, Too bad the sun rays are so washed out.  6', '2004-10-04 12:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(940589, 102660, 1202, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait, beautiful model. Nice job.  8</td>', 'Wonderful portrait, beautiful model. Nice job.  8', '2004-10-04 12:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(940594, 109032, 1202, '<td valign="top">Very effect use of light and shadows. I would have liked to see her facial features better.  7</td>', 'Very effect use of light and shadows. I would have liked to see her facial features better.  7', '2004-10-04 12:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(940599, 108940, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice backlighting and beautiful flowers.  The shot doesn''t hold my interest very long though, I guess it lacks the WOW factor for me.  5</td>', 'Nice backlighting and beautiful flowers.  The shot doesn''t hold my interest very long though, I guess it lacks the WOW factor for me.  5', '2004-10-04 12:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(940608, 106171, 1202, '<td valign="top">A perfect "Documentary" shot, and the eagle is always nice to see. No particularly long time interest though. 7</td>', 'A perfect "Documentary" shot, and the eagle is always nice to see. No particularly long time interest though. 7', '2004-10-04 12:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(940617, 107609, 1202, '<td valign="top">Interestin use of existing light, I feel a little overexposed though causing los of needed detail. 6</td>', 'Interestin use of existing light, I feel a little overexposed though causing los of needed detail. 6', '2004-10-04 12:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(940619, 107902, 326, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot! Love the colors. Good luck.</td>', 'This is a great shot! Love the colors. Good luck.', '2004-10-04 12:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(940628, 106953, 1202, '<td valign="top">What a beauty, I wish her shoulder were in focus also. nice composition.  7</td>', 'What a beauty, I wish her shoulder were in focus also. nice composition.  7', '2004-10-04 12:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(940636, 106931, 1202, '<td valign="top">Exquisite, all it lacks is a trio of ducks swimming or geese flying. 9</td>', 'Exquisite, all it lacks is a trio of ducks swimming or geese flying. 9', '2004-10-04 12:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(940639, 104134, 1202, '<td valign="top">Suoer portrait, wonderful model.  I think a bit more contrast would make it POP.  7</td>', 'Suoer portrait, wonderful model.  I think a bit more contrast would make it POP.  7', '2004-10-04 12:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(940641, 102742, 1202, '<td valign="top">PIcked this one as a favorite.  Top notch. I feel she would have dripped some paint on the floor though.  10</td>', 'PIcked this one as a favorite.  Top notch. I feel she would have dripped some paint on the floor though.  10', '2004-10-04 12:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(940644, 103619, 1202, '<td valign="top">Very interesting work. i need to know how you did it when all is over. 9</td>', 'Very interesting work. i need to know how you did it when all is over. 9', '2004-10-04 12:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(940649, 108275, 13547, '<td valign="top">This looks a touch over sharpened to me!</td>', 'This looks a touch over sharpened to me!', '2004-10-04 12:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(940656, 103189, 13547, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the negative space here really appeals to me.  The actual subject of the picture doesn''t seem to be emphasized enough, it would perhaps be better  cropped a bit closer.</td>', 'I''m not sure the negative space here really appeals to me.  The actual subject of the picture doesn''t seem to be emphasized enough, it would perhaps be better  cropped a bit closer.', '2004-10-04 12:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(940658, 108767, 13547, '<td valign="top">Simply gorgeous!  The fog looks amzing and spooky at the same time, and DOF is fantastic!  My 4-yr-old sister likes it too!</td>', 'Simply gorgeous!  The fog looks amzing and spooky at the same time, and DOF is fantastic!  My 4-yr-old sister likes it too!', '2004-10-04 12:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(940661, 108924, 13547, '<td valign="top">WOW.  The only thing I can pick out in the this picture as possibly negative is the slight pixellation on the hill, esp. to the right of the figure.  Otherwise, amazing!</td>', 'WOW.  The only thing I can pick out in the this picture as possibly negative is the slight pixellation on the hill, esp. to the right of the figure.  Otherwise, amazing!', '2004-10-04 12:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(940662, 103788, 26542, '<td valign="top">This image is just stricking.  I can''t find ANYTHING to say that I would have done differently.  This is just a remarkable image.  Please make this one available as a print.  I would love to hang this on my wall.</td>', 'This image is just stricking.  I can''t find ANYTHING to say that I would have done differently.  This is just a remarkable image.  Please make this one available as a print.  I would love to hang this on my wall.', '2004-10-04 12:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(940665, 105190, 13547, '<td valign="top">How is it I cannot get my camera to co-operate when I try taking water movement pictures like this?!  Well done, absolutely beautiful, the depth of the shot works excellently.</td>', 'How is it I cannot get my camera to co-operate when I try taking water movement pictures like this?!  Well done, absolutely beautiful, the depth of the shot works excellently.', '2004-10-04 12:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(940666, 103788, 9941, '<td valign="top">My favorite of this challenge.  Interesting lines, I could look at it all day!</td>', 'My favorite of this challenge.  Interesting lines, I could look at it all day!', '2004-10-04 12:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(940669, 106171, 13547, '<td valign="top">Ooo the evil eye!!!  Perfectly crisp and sharp!  How do I type a thumbs up?</td>', 'Ooo the evil eye!!!  Perfectly crisp and sharp!  How do I type a thumbs up?', '2004-10-04 12:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(940671, 106707, 9941, '<td valign="top">I love this shot... the colors are unique, the composition is perfect.  I gave it a 10.</td>', 'I love this shot... the colors are unique, the composition is perfect.  I gave it a 10.', '2004-10-04 12:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(940673, 107202, 13547, '<td valign="top">Ooo kinky...!  This is a really good picture, not just for the quality and crispness but because it stands out from everything else I''ve seen in the challenge so far.  My only niggly point is that the background is a little dark, particularly next to her right shoulder, so you lose the shoulder a bit, but otherwise I cannot fault it!</td>', 'Ooo kinky...!  This is a really good picture, not just for the quality and crispness but because it stands out from everything else I''ve seen in the challenge so far.  My only niggly point is that the background is a little dark, particularly next to her right shoulder, so you lose the shoulder a bit, but otherwise I cannot fault it!', '2004-10-04 12:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(940674, 107202, 26542, '<td valign="top">Excellent photograph...lighting, composition and execution are flawless.  The model is well...flawless.  I wish I could hang something like this on a wall...but my wife would surely beat me.<br/></td>', 'Excellent photograph...lighting, composition and execution are flawless.  The model is well...flawless.  I wish I could hang something like this on a wall...but my wife would surely beat me.', '2004-10-04 12:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(940676, 102660, 13547, '<td valign="top">Nice one Ben!  Have you shown this to her yet?  She''ll probably hate you for it, but never mind!  Such is art!</td>', 'Nice one Ben!  Have you shown this to her yet?  She''ll probably hate you for it, but never mind!  Such is art!', '2004-10-04 12:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(940678, 106707, 26542, '<td valign="top">Talk about wonderful composition coupled with unbelievable lighting.  I would be very curious to see and hear how you processed this or how it was shot to achieve such dramatic lighting and colors.</td>', 'Talk about wonderful composition coupled with unbelievable lighting.  I would be very curious to see and hear how you processed this or how it was shot to achieve such dramatic lighting and colors.', '2004-10-04 12:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(940684, 108995, 13547, '<td valign="top">I think it''s too grainy!  I''m guessing you added the grain yourself, but there''s too much here for me.  And being a guitarist myself, I can''t not mention the fact that technically he''s a bassist... :-)  (don''t worry I won''t mark you down on that!)</td>', 'I think it''s too grainy!  I''m guessing you added the grain yourself, but there''s too much here for me.  And being a guitarist myself, I can''t not mention the fact that technically he''s a bassist... :-)  (don''t worry I won''t mark you down on that!)', '2004-10-04 12:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(940697, 108269, 22734, '<td valign="top">My problem with these images is the zone 10 or the burn out of the sensor. You see in real life the eyes are able to discern detail that the camera can not capture and so 10 zone comes in handy in small doses.  However, this is not to say that this image is inferior with its ecstaric sky, lovely water and warm foreground. So you have my 7 but less 10 zone would have yielded a 9. I would joke that it is lovelu to squint at.</td>', 'My problem with these images is the zone 10 or the burn out of the sensor. You see in real life the eyes are able to discern detail that the camera can not capture and so 10 zone comes in handy in small doses.  However, this is not to say that this image is inferior with its ecstaric sky, lovely water and warm foreground. So you have my 7 but less 10 zone would have yielded a 9. I would joke that it is lovelu to squint at.', '2004-10-04 13:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(940698, 108991, 4008, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scene with a very surreal atmosphere, I like it. Maybe the left side could have had a bit more color to balance the right but a good job anyway.</td>', 'A beautiful scene with a very surreal atmosphere, I like it. Maybe the left side could have had a bit more color to balance the right but a good job anyway.', '2004-10-04 13:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(940701, 109019, 4008, '<td valign="top">Love that look, so much concentration, great catch. The light is nice and soft, the background colors add a special touch. Just a great image.</td>', 'Love that look, so much concentration, great catch. The light is nice and soft, the background colors add a special touch. Just a great image.', '2004-10-04 13:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(940705, 109014, 13547, '<td valign="top">All together now:  "Kookaburra sits in the ol'' gum tree, merry merry king of the bush is he..." etc etc!  Nice shot, a little bit dark at the bottom tho.  Crisp and sharp</td>', 'All together now:  "Kookaburra sits in the ol'' gum tree, merry merry king of the bush is he..." etc etc!  Nice shot, a little bit dark at the bottom tho.  Crisp and sharp', '2004-10-04 13:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(940706, 106953, 4008, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful. The soft light emphasises her very even skin. The hair across her face and her expression are great. I see some very subtle toning. Her lips are slightly purple, the highlights on the right seem to have a different tone than the women, very subtle. I wonder how it looks without the color on the lips and with a very tight crop, making it a portrait format.</td>', 'Just beautiful. The soft light emphasises her very even skin. The hair across her face and her expression are great. I see some very subtle toning. Her lips are slightly purple, the highlights on the right seem to have a different tone than the women, very subtle. I wonder how it looks without the color on the lips and with a very tight crop, making it a portrait format.', '2004-10-04 13:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(940717, 108233, 24454, '<td valign="top">Absolutely terrific sports picture.   I don''t see one thing on this that could be improved on -- except maybe if #8 had lighter hair so there could be a bit more contrast between his head and the background -- but that certainly isn''t a photographer issue!   I''m giving this the perfect 10 it deserves.</td>', 'Absolutely terrific sports picture.   I don''t see one thing on this that could be improved on -- except maybe if #8 had lighter hair so there could be a bit more contrast between his head and the background -- but that certainly isn''t a photographer issue!   I''m giving this the perfect 10 it deserves.', '2004-10-04 13:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(940719, 108897, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness!  This is stunning!   I hope you are doing portraiture for a living, because you certainly have the gift!   The frame really adds to this too!   How could anyone give this anything but a 10!   If I could give a 10+ I would!</td>', 'Oh my goodness!  This is stunning!   I hope you are doing portraiture for a living, because you certainly have the gift!   The frame really adds to this too!   How could anyone give this anything but a 10!   If I could give a 10+ I would!', '2004-10-04 13:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(940731, 107020, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I can really feel the mood of a calm, but stormy looking day.  8</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I can really feel the mood of a calm, but stormy looking day.  8', '2004-10-04 13:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(940732, 107397, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is such an amazing photograph.  It truly looks like art.   The colors are perfect.  The sky adds just the right emotion to it, and it is beautifully clear from front to back, top to bottom.  Easy 10.</td>', 'This is such an amazing photograph.  It truly looks like art.   The colors are perfect.  The sky adds just the right emotion to it, and it is beautifully clear from front to back, top to bottom.  Easy 10.', '2004-10-04 13:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(940735, 105984, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great contrast, and the small depth of field looks perfect with this.   <br/>The colors are great.  7</td>', 'Great contrast, and the small depth of field looks perfect with this.   The colors are great.  7', '2004-10-04 13:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(940740, 108979, 24495, '<td valign="top">Lovely Graphic Study! I like it!</td>', 'Lovely Graphic Study! I like it!', '2004-10-04 13:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(940744, 108984, 24495, '<td valign="top">Red Green and Blue!</td>', 'Red Green and Blue!', '2004-10-04 13:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(940746, 108832, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very pretty sunset.  Feels as if it could have been cropped some though, perhaps too broad.</td>', 'Very pretty sunset.  Feels as if it could have been cropped some though, perhaps too broad.', '2004-10-04 13:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(940747, 107876, 3280, '<td valign="top">The pastry seems a bit lost on the white background, may have been better on something else.  The strawberry shows nice focus but the glare is a little distracting.</td>', 'The pastry seems a bit lost on the white background, may have been better on something else.  The strawberry shows nice focus but the glare is a little distracting.', '2004-10-04 13:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(940750, 103788, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very majestic and great clarity of focus.  I like this and just bumped it up a point.</td>', 'Very majestic and great clarity of focus.  I like this and just bumped it up a point.', '2004-10-04 13:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(940752, 108454, 3280, '<td valign="top">It apperas that they are almost talking to one another.  Wonderful sky and great focus.  They seem to be a little lost against the hill on the left.  I wish there was another angle you could use.  Good shot.</td>', 'It apperas that they are almost talking to one another.  Wonderful sky and great focus.  They seem to be a little lost against the hill on the left.  I wish there was another angle you could use.  Good shot.', '2004-10-04 13:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(940757, 107902, 3280, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one.  It seems a little too busy.  Perhaps the shadows are to much with all of the other focal points.  I can''t seem to find any one thing that I''m drawn to except the red sign on the top left and that leads me out of the photo.  For some reason the sign on the left gas pump is a bit fuzzy too.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one.  It seems a little too busy.  Perhaps the shadows are to much with all of the other focal points.  I can''t seem to find any one thing that I''m drawn to except the red sign on the top left and that leads me out of the photo.  For some reason the sign on the left gas pump is a bit fuzzy too.', '2004-10-04 13:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(940759, 107599, 3280, '<td valign="top">For some reason the angle of the shore seems to move me toward the right horizon of the shot which is the darkest and least appealing focal point.  It just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'For some reason the angle of the shore seems to move me toward the right horizon of the shot which is the darkest and least appealing focal point.  It just doesn''t work for me.', '2004-10-04 13:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(940762, 104134, 6388, '<td valign="top">Beautiful but melancholy portrait.  very nicely lit/exposed.  would have liked to see a little more contrast between she and her background, and maybe a little dodging of the highlights in her eyes.  it makes me sad to look at, which means you''ve captured something very well.</td>', 'Beautiful but melancholy portrait.  very nicely lit/exposed.  would have liked to see a little more contrast between she and her background, and maybe a little dodging of the highlights in her eyes.  it makes me sad to look at, which means you''ve captured something very well.', '2004-10-04 13:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(940763, 106931, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice but lacks that "wow" factor.  Kind of serene in the same way as the girl that stands off by herself at the dance and never gets asked.</td>', 'Very nice but lacks that "wow" factor.  Kind of serene in the same way as the girl that stands off by herself at the dance and never gets asked.', '2004-10-04 13:43:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(940766, 109013, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot although I think one child may have worked better.  I would have found a way to get rid of the telephone pole on the right as well.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice shot although I think one child may have worked better.  I would have found a way to get rid of the telephone pole on the right as well.  Good job.', '2004-10-04 13:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(940768, 105966, 3280, '<td valign="top">I love the flame and the bottom of the balloon but the rest of the shot kind of loses me. A little tighter crop may have worked better.  Good clarity of focus.</td>', 'I love the flame and the bottom of the balloon but the rest of the shot kind of loses me. A little tighter crop may have worked better.  Good clarity of focus.', '2004-10-04 13:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(940771, 103189, 3280, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, a little too much sky at the top for my tastes.  Very nice.</td>', 'Neat shot, a little too much sky at the top for my tastes.  Very nice.', '2004-10-04 13:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(940774, 108210, 3280, '<td valign="top">I like this and the colors are excellent.  I think a bit too much sand in the foreground and that tree in front of the lighthouse really needs to go.  Short of a chain saw, perhaps you could have used another angle.  Good job.</td>', 'I like this and the colors are excellent.  I think a bit too much sand in the foreground and that tree in front of the lighthouse really needs to go.  Short of a chain saw, perhaps you could have used another angle.  Good job.', '2004-10-04 13:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(940778, 108897, 6388, '<td valign="top">this is pure pro.  beautifully lit, nicely posed, though maybe a little still or unnatural or something.  the model''s expression is fantastic - she looks comfortable in front of the camera, which speaks volumes about the photographer in my mind.  i could do without the  bevelled inside edge on the border, but that''s not something i''d deduct points for by any means.  well done.</td>', 'this is pure pro.  beautifully lit, nicely posed, though maybe a little still or unnatural or something.  the model''s expression is fantastic - she looks comfortable in front of the camera, which speaks volumes about the photographer in my mind.  i could do without the  bevelled inside edge on the border, but that''s not something i''d deduct points for by any means.  well done.', '2004-10-04 13:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(940780, 107365, 6388, '<td valign="top">great depth and texture.  love the shallow depth...must be one of them sexy F2.8 telphoto lenses, or you''re remarkably brave and got up close. nice shot.</td>', 'great depth and texture.  love the shallow depth...must be one of them sexy F2.8 telphoto lenses, or you''re remarkably brave and got up close. nice shot.', '2004-10-04 13:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(940784, 108537, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice soft focus and B &amp; W is a natural here.  I have looked at this shot umpteen times since the challenge started and something just doesn''t click for me.  I can''t quite put my finger on it.  It feels off balance somehow.  Maybe because everything leads to the right and there is nothing but blankness in the photo.  I know that we have to understand that there is something there out of the frame but it feels off to me. Excellent shot however!</td>', 'Nice soft focus and B & W is a natural here.  I have looked at this shot umpteen times since the challenge started and something just doesn''t click for me.  I can''t quite put my finger on it.  It feels off balance somehow.  Maybe because everything leads to the right and there is nothing but blankness in the photo.  I know that we have to understand that there is something there out of the frame but it feels off to me. Excellent shot however!', '2004-10-04 13:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(940785, 105966, 6388, '<td valign="top">impressive exposure - very difficult conditions to expose correctly.  highlights are pretty sharp, and the light falloff is very smooth.  i might have burned the little catchligts or reflections or whateverthe hotspots on the right are so the pic fell off into complete blackness, but that''s just me.  very unique entry.</td>', 'impressive exposure - very difficult conditions to expose correctly.  highlights are pretty sharp, and the light falloff is very smooth.  i might have burned the little catchligts or reflections or whateverthe hotspots on the right are so the pic fell off into complete blackness, but that''s just me.  very unique entry.', '2004-10-04 13:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(940787, 106488, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.   I love the perspective of the person against that huge tree.  The tones are beautiful.   I''m giving this the 10 it deserves.</td>', 'I love this picture.   I love the perspective of the person against that huge tree.  The tones are beautiful.   I''m giving this the 10 it deserves.', '2004-10-04 13:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(940789, 108843, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!   I love pictures that have a blue tone to them.   The lighting and time of day this was taken make this absolutely gorgeous.  An easy 10</td>', 'Beautiful!   I love pictures that have a blue tone to them.   The lighting and time of day this was taken make this absolutely gorgeous.  An easy 10', '2004-10-04 13:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(940794, 108984, 24454, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  I can definitely see this as wall art in a kitchen, or restaurant.  8</td>', 'I like this a lot.  I can definitely see this as wall art in a kitchen, or restaurant.  8', '2004-10-04 13:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
