(941015, 103189, 12802, '<td valign="top">You''ve done well to capture the lightening. The reuslting light is good over the sea etc but I feel the clouds at the top take my attention too much. Tighter cropping may have looked better?  6</td>', 'You''ve done well to capture the lightening. The reuslting light is good over the sea etc but I feel the clouds at the top take my attention too much. Tighter cropping may have looked better?  6', '2004-10-04 15:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(941017, 102660, 12802, '<td valign="top">I really like this, such a subtle and flattering shot!  The softness of it is great, but you''ve left the eyes nice and sharp! Well done! 9</td>', 'I really like this, such a subtle and flattering shot!  The softness of it is great, but you''ve left the eyes nice and sharp! Well done! 9', '2004-10-04 15:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(941019, 108843, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely landscape.  The texture on the sufrace of the shoreline is a nice point of interest as well as the rock in the discance.  I think that particular element is stronger than the sky in this shot.  It may have been beneficial to shoot this from a very low angle, close to the ground.  You could accent that texture by doing so and include less of the sky.  The centered horizon seems to work ok in this image, but it may be stronger at a higher level with more foreground included...</td>', 'This is a lovely landscape.  The texture on the sufrace of the shoreline is a nice point of interest as well as the rock in the discance.  I think that particular element is stronger than the sky in this shot.  It may have been beneficial to shoot this from a very low angle, close to the ground.  You could accent that texture by doing so and include less of the sky.  The centered horizon seems to work ok in this image, but it may be stronger at a higher level with more foreground included...', '2004-10-04 15:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(941022, 109008, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice bird portrait.. the light seems just a little harsh overall.. there may have been some possible room for improvement there, but the overall detail is nice...</td>', 'Nice bird portrait.. the light seems just a little harsh overall.. there may have been some possible room for improvement there, but the overall detail is nice...', '2004-10-04 15:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(941028, 107020, 772, '<td valign="top">The sky is nice in this photo, as is the reflection.  Other than that, I can''t find a particular focal point.  I like good landscapes, but I usually look for a strong focal point within the image...</td>', 'The sky is nice in this photo, as is the reflection.  Other than that, I can''t find a particular focal point.  I like good landscapes, but I usually look for a strong focal point within the image...', '2004-10-04 15:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(941031, 105966, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent job with the exposure on this photo... I can ''hear'' the sound of the burner... nice work :)</td>', 'Excellent job with the exposure on this photo... I can ''hear'' the sound of the burner... nice work :)', '2004-10-04 15:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(941034, 107365, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot... i love the ''stealth'' nature of the alligators...</td>', 'Excellent shot... i love the ''stealth'' nature of the alligators...', '2004-10-04 15:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(941049, 104134, 12802, '<td valign="top">A really good portrait here!  I like your choise of B&amp;W, adds some nice character to it.  Good DOF, and the whole shot isn''t too sharp (which is a good thing!)  8</td>', 'A really good portrait here!  I like your choise of B&W, adds some nice character to it.  Good DOF, and the whole shot isn''t too sharp (which is a good thing!)  8', '2004-10-04 15:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
