(941062, 105966, 12802, '<td valign="top">This is a really good shot!!  Brilliant colours, the lighting coming through the balloon is great!  I really like the silhouettes of the balloons at the back! 8</td>', 'This is a really good shot!!  Brilliant colours, the lighting coming through the balloon is great!  I really like the silhouettes of the balloons at the back! 8', '2004-10-04 15:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(941063, 102742, 8054, '<td valign="top">The underlying message of this entry is excellent. Also a good idea to use a younger model as a form of inspiration for all people young and old. The desat is also nice but I feel contrast is somewhat flat. The position of her feet looks awkward and uncomfortable but then again kids work in weird positions. 7</td>', 'The underlying message of this entry is excellent. Also a good idea to use a younger model as a form of inspiration for all people young and old. The desat is also nice but I feel contrast is somewhat flat. The position of her feet looks awkward and uncomfortable but then again kids work in weird positions. 7', '2004-10-04 15:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(941070, 107609, 12802, '<td valign="top">Great shot, loads of character in the guys face. Pity we can''t see more of his eye though. Undecided really about how he''s standing...  The angle that he''s at just now kind of tells a story, he may be looking in to somehting. If he was straighter, I may not have thought this.  Well done! 8</td>', 'Great shot, loads of character in the guys face. Pity we can''t see more of his eye though. Undecided really about how he''s standing...  The angle that he''s at just now kind of tells a story, he may be looking in to somehting. If he was straighter, I may not have thought this.  Well done! 8', '2004-10-04 15:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(941076, 108569, 12802, '<td valign="top">I think there are loads of things to look at in this shot, kind of muddles me up to begin with.  The tree on the RHS is a bit distracting, looks as if it shouldn''t be there. 7</td>', 'I think there are loads of things to look at in this shot, kind of muddles me up to begin with.  The tree on the RHS is a bit distracting, looks as if it shouldn''t be there. 7', '2004-10-04 15:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(941082, 103219, 12802, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!  The tones in the skin are perfect, very good use of light!!  The exposure is brilliant too, can feel the texture in her white top.  Good idea not to show her whole face, leaves us thinking about her face more...  9</td>', 'Great shot!!  The tones in the skin are perfect, very good use of light!!  The exposure is brilliant too, can feel the texture in her white top.  Good idea not to show her whole face, leaves us thinking about her face more...  9', '2004-10-04 15:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
