(941129, 105190, 24962, '<td valign="top">Great shot, sky and blurred sea give it a surreal effect. Wasn''t gripped at first, but had to come back a couple more looks. Initial vote was a low 6, upped to 9 on third visit.</td>', 'Great shot, sky and blurred sea give it a surreal effect. Wasn''t gripped at first, but had to come back a couple more looks. Initial vote was a low 6, upped to 9 on third visit.', '2004-10-04 15:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
