(941157, 108173, 12802, '<td valign="top">Excellent marco shot, well done!!!  Brilliant clarity here, the colours in the head are amazing.  Personally I would have liked more DOF, but may not be possible if he was a moving target!  Great shot though!! 9</td>', 'Excellent marco shot, well done!!!  Brilliant clarity here, the colours in the head are amazing.  Personally I would have liked more DOF, but may not be possible if he was a moving target!  Great shot though!! 9', '2004-10-04 15:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(941160, 106931, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice colours here, the different blues in the sky are reflected well in the water below.  Maybe a tighter cropping from the bottom, a little too much water for my liking.  8</td>', 'Nice colours here, the different blues in the sky are reflected well in the water below.  Maybe a tighter cropping from the bottom, a little too much water for my liking.  8', '2004-10-04 15:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(941162, 107397, 12802, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!!  The subtle greens in this are great!!  I like how it''s not right in the centre of the shot.  9</td>', 'Excellent shot!!  The subtle greens in this are great!!  I like how it''s not right in the centre of the shot.  9', '2004-10-04 15:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
