(941168, 108995, 12802, '<td valign="top">I think the grain in this shot really makes it!  The lighting is brilliant, really makes it feel like you''re at the concert.  Maybe a little more light in his face to bring out the right eye area.  8</td>', 'I think the grain in this shot really makes it!  The lighting is brilliant, really makes it feel like you''re at the concert.  Maybe a little more light in his face to bring out the right eye area.  8', '2004-10-04 15:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(941200, 108642, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image has a mid summer''s night dream feel.  There is frolicking and a peek into innocence.  I also look and see a few cyan colored artifacts the first right at the curl of the foreground foliage on the right. The image appears to have a lot of potential but as is it leaves the senses wanting. On charm and candidness bumping up to 6</td>', 'This image has a mid summer''s night dream feel.  There is frolicking and a peek into innocence.  I also look and see a few cyan colored artifacts the first right at the curl of the foreground foliage on the right. The image appears to have a lot of potential but as is it leaves the senses wanting. On charm and candidness bumping up to 6', '2004-10-04 16:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(941201, 107969, 26896, '<td valign="top">so which bombing was that? Hiroshima or Nagasaki?</td>', 'so which bombing was that? Hiroshima or Nagasaki?', '2004-10-04 16:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(941208, 109031, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful fountain study. The texture is well captured and the rust gives it that timeless feel. The frozen in space of the water droplets adds the sense of motion to an otherwise static figure.  Bumping up.</td>', 'This is a wonderful fountain study. The texture is well captured and the rust gives it that timeless feel. The frozen in space of the water droplets adds the sense of motion to an otherwise static figure.  Bumping up.', '2004-10-04 16:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(941235, 109019, 22734, '<td valign="top">Charming beyond words. The facial expression with pouting lips and blown cheeks can not but enthrall the viewer. Now, the post processing is not at its very best. You have here a very good exposure, yet post processing has added a dark brown perimeter around the image followed by a halo of um artifact. This is evident around the shoulders and arms. The harsh crease on the joint of the left shoulder could have been addressed by a transparant clone because about this very area there is a breaking down of the quality of skin tones. <br/> <br/>Yet, the image has enough zap to outsail these minor setbacks. The model carries the day. Bumping up to 6</td>', 'Charming beyond words. The facial expression with pouting lips and blown cheeks can not but enthrall the viewer. Now, the post processing is not at its very best. You have here a very good exposure, yet post processing has added a dark brown perimeter around the image followed by a halo of um artifact. This is evident around the shoulders and arms. The harsh crease on the joint of the left shoulder could have been addressed by a transparant clone because about this very area there is a breaking down of the quality of skin tones.  Yet, the image has enough zap to outsail these minor setbacks. The model carries the day. Bumping up to 6', '2004-10-04 16:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(941253, 107995, 19608, '<td valign="top">Strong points: PERFECT alignment and darn close on color matching.  Your lighting and exposure was right on - her white top has lots of detail and texture.  Great idea well executed.  Suggestions for improvement:  The vertical lines on the wall behind her head are bothersome.</td>', 'Strong points: PERFECT alignment and darn close on color matching.  Your lighting and exposure was right on - her white top has lots of detail and texture.  Great idea well executed.  Suggestions for improvement:  The vertical lines on the wall behind her head are bothersome.', '2004-10-04 16:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(941267, 107300, 19608, '<td valign="top">Strong points:  You''ve done a great job of coping with the bald white sky.  By introducing lots of white from the flloor and the columns - you mitigated the terrible sky.  Pose is excellent.  I''m not much of a fan of the fading borders - but this is one that works well.  Exposure could not be better - a real task with all the white.</td>', 'Strong points:  You''ve done a great job of coping with the bald white sky.  By introducing lots of white from the flloor and the columns - you mitigated the terrible sky.  Pose is excellent.  I''m not much of a fan of the fading borders - but this is one that works well.  Exposure could not be better - a real task with all the white.', '2004-10-04 16:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(941275, 108276, 7263, '<td valign="top">Great Autumn colors and great time to have taken the shot. When I see the sun breaking out of the clouds like this I always look for something to shoot quickly as it never lasts for long.<br/> <br/>I always end up missing it.<br/> <br/>Great colors once again. 9<br/></td>', 'Great Autumn colors and great time to have taken the shot. When I see the sun breaking out of the clouds like this I always look for something to shoot quickly as it never lasts for long. I always end up missing it. Great colors once again. 9', '2004-10-04 16:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(941276, 108767, 19608, '<td valign="top">Strong points:  The layering of color is one of ny favorite ways to compose nature shots.  You''ve done it very well.  Perfect exposure, excellent composition.</td>', 'Strong points:  The layering of color is one of ny favorite ways to compose nature shots.  You''ve done it very well.  Perfect exposure, excellent composition.', '2004-10-04 16:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(941279, 108940, 16230, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Can''t see why anyone would challenge its validity.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Can''t see why anyone would challenge its validity.', '2004-10-04 16:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(941281, 109014, 7263, '<td valign="top">A very very well executed photo of a kook! Exposure focus etc etc is spot on. Well done! Upping to 9 from an 8 ;)</td>', 'A very very well executed photo of a kook! Exposure focus etc etc is spot on. Well done! Upping to 9 from an 8 ;)', '2004-10-04 16:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(941285, 107488, 7263, '<td valign="top">I actual like this a lot, but don''t expect it to be in the top 10. It is a little soft but i think that  adds to the scene. <br/> <br/>This is the only photo in this challenge that makes me stop and think what is behind this photo, where is it, why is the chair there what is the photographer trying to say?<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'I actual like this a lot, but don''t expect it to be in the top 10. It is a little soft but i think that  adds to the scene.  This is the only photo in this challenge that makes me stop and think what is behind this photo, where is it, why is the chair there what is the photographer trying to say?  ', '2004-10-04 16:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(941289, 102742, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is more a political statement than a human aspiration. It opens up a can of worms. If it is an aspiration then the element of evil enters which is the antithesis of peace. This is a sad fact of life and the flux of these good and bad concepts will forever carry on until one vanquishes the other. <br/> <br/>The image then has the effect of humoring the innocent or the innocent relaying to the wise that war is bad. This message is appreciated by out better sentiments and by men of good will...but the world is filled with vaders who hate peace and human contentment.<br/> <br/>The concept is great while the execution leaves a little to be desired becauses it rises the image to more of a poster than a photograpgic study. Bumping up to 6.</td>', 'This is more a political statement than a human aspiration. It opens up a can of worms. If it is an aspiration then the element of evil enters which is the antithesis of peace. This is a sad fact of life and the flux of these good and bad concepts will forever carry on until one vanquishes the other.  The image then has the effect of humoring the innocent or the innocent relaying to the wise that war is bad. This message is appreciated by out better sentiments and by men of good will...but the world is filled with vaders who hate peace and human contentment. The concept is great while the execution leaves a little to be desired becauses it rises the image to more of a poster than a photograpgic study. Bumping up to 6.', '2004-10-04 16:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(941299, 108875, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very soft focus, bit I like the effect it gives to the mood here. Tones and muted colors work well together. 8</td>', 'Very soft focus, bit I like the effect it gives to the mood here. Tones and muted colors work well together. 8', '2004-10-04 16:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(941300, 106171, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is a wondeful photo. For nits, I might pick the dirty feather, a somewhat too bright background, and a few of the feathers on top of the bird''s head seem a bit out of focus. Did you get this shot in the wild, or is this a captive bird?<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is a wondeful photo. For nits, I might pick the dirty feather, a somewhat too bright background, and a few of the feathers on top of the bird''s head seem a bit out of focus. Did you get this shot in the wild, or is this a captive bird? ', '2004-10-04 16:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
