(941846, 108454, 20941, '<td valign="top">really interesting subject colors work well together, might have cloned out the stray shrubbery at the top, but might be best not to fool with Mother Nature.</td>', 'really interesting subject colors work well together, might have cloned out the stray shrubbery at the top, but might be best not to fool with Mother Nature.', '2004-10-04 20:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(941847, 108276, 8860, '<td valign="top">The light here is wonderful. You''ve done what is very difficult and produced an ordinary scene in a very special way. I love it. I''m also a fan of silver birches. Hope you do well. [9]</td>', 'The light here is wonderful. You''ve done what is very difficult and produced an ordinary scene in a very special way. I love it. I''m also a fan of silver birches. Hope you do well. [9]', '2004-10-04 20:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(941849, 107020, 22239, '<td valign="top">Nice cloud and sunset shot... the texture on the clouds is great.  It appears that you wanted to capture the symmetry of the reflection here... either moving the horizon up to the center to enforce the symmetry, or down a bit to get rid of the darker area at the bottom (and bring it down onto a thirds line) might give it a bit more visual appeal.</td>', 'Nice cloud and sunset shot... the texture on the clouds is great.  It appears that you wanted to capture the symmetry of the reflection here... either moving the horizon up to the center to enforce the symmetry, or down a bit to get rid of the darker area at the bottom (and bring it down onto a thirds line) might give it a bit more visual appeal.', '2004-10-04 20:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(941852, 107969, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great focus and lovely detail. The only things I''m not keen on are the glow round the fruit and the slightly busy background. Very nice stock shot though and, with work, could make it into a professional ad or poster.</td>', 'Great focus and lovely detail. The only things I''m not keen on are the glow round the fruit and the slightly busy background. Very nice stock shot though and, with work, could make it into a professional ad or poster.', '2004-10-04 20:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(941853, 107020, 20941, '<td valign="top">Beautiful skyscape and reflection of same.</td>', 'Beautiful skyscape and reflection of same.', '2004-10-04 20:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(941855, 103615, 22239, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, attractive model.  The highlights in her hair are somewhat distracting, and the image looks too smooth (perhaps a byproduct of NeatImage?) ... all of the detail on her irises is gone, which, for a photo so focused on her eyes, makes it lose some appeal.</td>', 'Nice colors, attractive model.  The highlights in her hair are somewhat distracting, and the image looks too smooth (perhaps a byproduct of NeatImage?) ... all of the detail on her irises is gone, which, for a photo so focused on her eyes, makes it lose some appeal.', '2004-10-04 20:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(941858, 107995, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is so clever. One of those "why didn''t I think of that" things. Well done.</td>', 'This is so clever. One of those "why didn''t I think of that" things. Well done.', '2004-10-04 20:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(941859, 106707, 22239, '<td valign="top">Incredible colors in this photo, and the composition is great.  The distant horizon, reaching tower, and grass texture add so much to this image.  Looks like a postcard.</td>', 'Incredible colors in this photo, and the composition is great.  The distant horizon, reaching tower, and grass texture add so much to this image.  Looks like a postcard.', '2004-10-04 20:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(941860, 108269, 22239, '<td valign="top">Tough exposure, well captured.  The colors seem a little strange, mainly the difference in blue hues between the clouds and water, but the textures of the grasses, rocks, and waves are great.</td>', 'Tough exposure, well captured.  The colors seem a little strange, mainly the difference in blue hues between the clouds and water, but the textures of the grasses, rocks, and waves are great.', '2004-10-04 21:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(941867, 103189, 7743, '<td valign="top">Capturing lightning can be challenging due to its random nature.  The bottom half of this image has some nice symetry with the water, lightning and hills, however the darkness at the bottom and large expanse of sky take alot away from your image.  I think this would work very well as a panorama isolating the lit portion of the image to emphasize the lightning. 5</td>', 'Capturing lightning can be challenging due to its random nature.  The bottom half of this image has some nice symetry with the water, lightning and hills, however the darkness at the bottom and large expanse of sky take alot away from your image.  I think this would work very well as a panorama isolating the lit portion of the image to emphasize the lightning. 5', '2004-10-04 21:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(941869, 107365, 22239, '<td valign="top">Great wildlife candid.  The short DOF removes a lot of the ripples and other surface detail of the water, which brings more focus onto the animal, but makes it seem a bit unnatural for such a natural image.  The colors are wonderfully vivid.</td>', 'Great wildlife candid.  The short DOF removes a lot of the ripples and other surface detail of the water, which brings more focus onto the animal, but makes it seem a bit unnatural for such a natural image.  The colors are wonderfully vivid.', '2004-10-04 21:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(941871, 108986, 22239, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  The detail on this guy''s face is sharp and well-defined.  A slightly deeper DOF would have kept the side of his face in better focus.  Tough shot to get!</td>', 'Great photo.  The detail on this guy''s face is sharp and well-defined.  A slightly deeper DOF would have kept the side of his face in better focus.  Tough shot to get!', '2004-10-04 21:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(941873, 107300, 22239, '<td valign="top">Great color, high key, soft focus, and vignette.  It all combines to really capture the bride and the dreamlike sense of joy on the big day.</td>', 'Great color, high key, soft focus, and vignette.  It all combines to really capture the bride and the dreamlike sense of joy on the big day.', '2004-10-04 21:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(941876, 102742, 22239, '<td valign="top">Good job on the selective desaturation, great choice on the costume.  Lighting is great too.</td>', 'Good job on the selective desaturation, great choice on the costume.  Lighting is great too.', '2004-10-04 21:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(941878, 105966, 22239, '<td valign="top">Tough one to capture.  The bright colors of the balloon and the torch, along with the deep blue of twilight, and the dark sky above... the exposure captures all of them.  Composition is balanced, and makes you wonder just how many are out there... it feels very organic.</td>', 'Tough one to capture.  The bright colors of the balloon and the torch, along with the deep blue of twilight, and the dark sky above... the exposure captures all of them.  Composition is balanced, and makes you wonder just how many are out there... it feels very organic.', '2004-10-04 21:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(941885, 107387, 22239, '<td valign="top">Well done... the moment, the player, the surroundings... great lighting, exposure, composition and focus.  Makes me wonder what he''s looking at.</td>', 'Well done... the moment, the player, the surroundings... great lighting, exposure, composition and focus.  Makes me wonder what he''s looking at.', '2004-10-04 21:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(941888, 103189, 22239, '<td valign="top">Rare moment!  Impressive illumination, great reflection, and the color above the clouds is impressive.  The composition is somewhat cluttered, though, so it''s hard to tell what''s going on.</td>', 'Rare moment!  Impressive illumination, great reflection, and the color above the clouds is impressive.  The composition is somewhat cluttered, though, so it''s hard to tell what''s going on.', '2004-10-04 21:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(941891, 108122, 22239, '<td valign="top">Cute shot... but a deeper DOF would have let you keep his ears in focus too.</td>', 'Cute shot... but a deeper DOF would have let you keep his ears in focus too.', '2004-10-04 21:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(941896, 108979, 22239, '<td valign="top">Neat study in contrast and geometry!  Good setup and lighting.</td>', 'Neat study in contrast and geometry!  Good setup and lighting.', '2004-10-04 21:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(941900, 108995, 22239, '<td valign="top">Judging from the subject, I''d assume that this was taken in low light, and the noise is from the low light level.  Very difficult shot to get right, since his face is in shadow, but his hand is brightly lit.  This exposure is a good compromise between his hand getting totally washed out, and his face fading entirely into the shadows.</td>', 'Judging from the subject, I''d assume that this was taken in low light, and the noise is from the low light level.  Very difficult shot to get right, since his face is in shadow, but his hand is brightly lit.  This exposure is a good compromise between his hand getting totally washed out, and his face fading entirely into the shadows.', '2004-10-04 21:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(941906, 108210, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very nicely exposed and contrast is very good. I think there is too much sand in the foreground and could use less (maybe even half of it needs to be cropped). It also appears to be slightly oversharpened. 5</td>', 'Very nicely exposed and contrast is very good. I think there is too much sand in the foreground and could use less (maybe even half of it needs to be cropped). It also appears to be slightly oversharpened. 5', '2004-10-04 21:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(941912, 107876, 22239, '<td valign="top">Tasty!  This shot is simple, but technically well done.  The lighting and focus are good, though a slightly deeper DOF would have kept the left side of the dessert in focus... but that''d be the only change I''d make on it.</td>', 'Tasty!  This shot is simple, but technically well done.  The lighting and focus are good, though a slightly deeper DOF would have kept the left side of the dessert in focus... but that''d be the only change I''d make on it.', '2004-10-04 21:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(941916, 104030, 8624, '<td valign="top">A nicely captured scene with silky smooth water from your long exposure. One thing that bothers me a little is the the water fall hits the ground in the middle of the frame and the stream into which it flows is not as visible as other compositional elements making the waterfall appear to be floating in space.</td>', 'A nicely captured scene with silky smooth water from your long exposure. One thing that bothers me a little is the the water fall hits the ground in the middle of the frame and the stream into which it flows is not as visible as other compositional elements making the waterfall appear to be floating in space.', '2004-10-04 21:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(941918, 102660, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excellent details where they count especially around the eyes which is the main focal point for me. And it looks like you did a selective desat and even desaturated the eyes a bit. Very subtle yet very effective. Amazing details of her hair, as well. Contrast is a bit low but I really like the overall feel of this photo. Very warm although I wish she was smiling or at least not so sad or serious. 8</td>', 'Excellent details where they count especially around the eyes which is the main focal point for me. And it looks like you did a selective desat and even desaturated the eyes a bit. Very subtle yet very effective. Amazing details of her hair, as well. Contrast is a bit low but I really like the overall feel of this photo. Very warm although I wish she was smiling or at least not so sad or serious. 8', '2004-10-04 21:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(941920, 107365, 8624, '<td valign="top">neat symmetry in the reflection. I like the beady marble eye of the reptile. snout looks a bit out of focus, though.</td>', 'neat symmetry in the reflection. I like the beady marble eye of the reptile. snout looks a bit out of focus, though.', '2004-10-04 21:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(941921, 108984, 8624, '<td valign="top">great sharpness and bold color. I like the point of view here too. The hot spots seem too bright but other than that it is a very pleasing still life.</td>', 'great sharpness and bold color. I like the point of view here too. The hot spots seem too bright but other than that it is a very pleasing still life.', '2004-10-04 21:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(941922, 108275, 8624, '<td valign="top">great details and expression. tonal range could be more extensive - the image does have a gray washed out look to it, but it is a very nice animal portrait.</td>', 'great details and expression. tonal range could be more extensive - the image does have a gray washed out look to it, but it is a very nice animal portrait.', '2004-10-04 21:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(941925, 109032, 8054, '<td valign="top">Hey, this is really creative! I''d like to know how you did this one. Great sharp and punchy contrast (no pun intended). Love the facial expression of the model as it really looks like she''s fighting her own shadow. Would have liked to see a bit more detail of the model''s face. 8</td>', 'Hey, this is really creative! I''d like to know how you did this one. Great sharp and punchy contrast (no pun intended). Love the facial expression of the model as it really looks like she''s fighting her own shadow. Would have liked to see a bit more detail of the model''s face. 8', '2004-10-04 21:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(941935, 108995, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and grain here. It has a very griity, live performance feel to it, so you have captured the mood of the event well. Not sure I like how the musician''s head is vut off in the frame, but I generally like tightly cropped shots, so i don''t think it is too much of a distraction.</td>', 'I like the lighting and grain here. It has a very griity, live performance feel to it, so you have captured the mood of the event well. Not sure I like how the musician''s head is vut off in the frame, but I generally like tightly cropped shots, so i don''t think it is too much of a distraction.', '2004-10-04 21:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(941941, 108454, 8624, '<td valign="top">This seems like a nice enough scene but doesn''t really capture my attention in any special way. I think taking the shot in the middle of the day, even given the pretty blue sky, did bring out the interesting textures and details in the rock.</td>', 'This seems like a nice enough scene but doesn''t really capture my attention in any special way. I think taking the shot in the middle of the day, even given the pretty blue sky, did bring out the interesting textures and details in the rock.', '2004-10-04 21:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(941945, 108569, 8624, '<td valign="top">neat point of view and interesting crop.</td>', 'neat point of view and interesting crop.', '2004-10-04 21:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(941947, 105647, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on the building and thre dark, rickly colored night sky. I think you could have cropped out more of the silouetted featureless foreground though.</td>', 'I like the lighting on the building and thre dark, rickly colored night sky. I think you could have cropped out more of the silouetted featureless foreground though.', '2004-10-04 21:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(941950, 108642, 8624, '<td valign="top">cute scene of the girls. I like how they are completely oblivious of one another as they run around a pretty green yard.</td>', 'cute scene of the girls. I like how they are completely oblivious of one another as they run around a pretty green yard.', '2004-10-04 21:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(941952, 107020, 8624, '<td valign="top">great looking sky nicely mirrored in the water below.</td>', 'great looking sky nicely mirrored in the water below.', '2004-10-04 21:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(941959, 108269, 8624, '<td valign="top">although this must have been an interesting sight to see in person, I don''t think it translated very well into an image of interest. The water is pretty featureless, as is the foreground. My eye is certainly led to the setting sun, but I can''t really see any of what I assume were interesting details in the sky.</td>', 'although this must have been an interesting sight to see in person, I don''t think it translated very well into an image of interest. The water is pretty featureless, as is the foreground. My eye is certainly led to the setting sun, but I can''t really see any of what I assume were interesting details in the sky.', '2004-10-04 22:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(941964, 108992, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and the long cast shadows. exposure is right on and makes for a very pleasant pastoral scene. One can image why Monet and others found such haystacks an inspiration as the light and textures are interesting and constantly changing.</td>', 'I like the perspective and the long cast shadows. exposure is right on and makes for a very pleasant pastoral scene. One can image why Monet and others found such haystacks an inspiration as the light and textures are interesting and constantly changing.', '2004-10-04 22:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(942094, 107609, 27626, '<td valign="top">Timeless, love the tone and texture, a great portrait of sensitivity, well done!</td>', 'Timeless, love the tone and texture, a great portrait of sensitivity, well done!', '2004-10-04 23:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(942113, 103788, 20662, '<td valign="top">Love the use of Duotone -- gives the photo a very old world feeling. Half expecting to see a pirates  flag raised.</td>', 'Love the use of Duotone -- gives the photo a very old world feeling. Half expecting to see a pirates  flag raised.', '2004-10-04 23:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(942115, 107599, 20662, '<td valign="top">The color of the sky in the upper left corner sure draws your eye into the photo. Beautiful</td>', 'The color of the sky in the upper left corner sure draws your eye into the photo. Beautiful', '2004-10-04 23:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(942118, 107397, 20662, '<td valign="top">The ruins are quite beautiful. The sky adds to the quality of the photo. What if you dodge the clouds on the side slightly. The draw your eye away form the ruins.</td>', 'The ruins are quite beautiful. The sky adds to the quality of the photo. What if you dodge the clouds on the side slightly. The draw your eye away form the ruins.', '2004-10-04 23:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(942121, 109019, 20662, '<td valign="top">She is so adorable! The expression is priceless. Love the way you''ve chosen to color the photo.</td>', 'She is so adorable! The expression is priceless. Love the way you''ve chosen to color the photo.', '2004-10-04 23:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(942124, 106488, 20662, '<td valign="top">Nice tone on tone -- the blue adds to the chill.</td>', 'Nice tone on tone -- the blue adds to the chill.', '2004-10-04 23:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(942126, 105984, 20662, '<td valign="top">crisp, clean, nice DoF. Might have cropped a little tighter around the butterfly on the left.</td>', 'crisp, clean, nice DoF. Might have cropped a little tighter around the butterfly on the left.', '2004-10-04 23:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(942127, 107995, 20662, '<td valign="top">This is very creative! The most creative in this challenge.</td>', 'This is very creative! The most creative in this challenge.', '2004-10-04 23:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(942135, 108537, 20662, '<td valign="top">Cheesy -- but well done photo. Excellent lighting.</td>', 'Cheesy -- but well done photo. Excellent lighting.', '2004-10-04 23:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(942141, 108843, 20662, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Beautiful colors. Not crazy about the horizon line directly in the center of the photo but it seems to work.</td>', 'Excellent! Beautiful colors. Not crazy about the horizon line directly in the center of the photo but it seems to work.', '2004-10-04 23:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(942143, 103615, 20662, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes you''ve captured here.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes you''ve captured here.', '2004-10-04 23:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(942146, 107969, 6130, '<td valign="top">Great 10</td>', 'Great 10', '2004-10-04 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(942147, 103189, 20662, '<td valign="top">What happens if you crop out more of the darker color at the bottom of the photo? Seems a little bottom heavy</td>', 'What happens if you crop out more of the darker color at the bottom of the photo? Seems a little bottom heavy', '2004-10-04 23:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(942150, 107586, 20662, '<td valign="top">Touching photo. His arm is a bit distracting but not enough to distract from his beautiful face.</td>', 'Touching photo. His arm is a bit distracting but not enough to distract from his beautiful face.', '2004-10-04 23:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(942153, 108875, 20662, '<td valign="top">too bad the water wasn''t smoother to give you a clearer reflection. Lovely colors</td>', 'too bad the water wasn''t smoother to give you a clearer reflection. Lovely colors', '2004-10-04 23:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(942154, 107609, 20662, '<td valign="top">Love the duotone. Wish just slightly more of his face was showing. It would give you just a hint more about this man.</td>', 'Love the duotone. Wish just slightly more of his face was showing. It would give you just a hint more about this man.', '2004-10-05 00:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(942155, 104134, 20662, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl. Might have upped the contrast slightly to add more depth to the photo.</td>', 'Beautiful girl. Might have upped the contrast slightly to add more depth to the photo.', '2004-10-05 00:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(942157, 107969, 20662, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to see how you did this. The colors are stunning and the clarity in the water is perfect.</td>', 'Can''t wait to see how you did this. The colors are stunning and the clarity in the water is perfect.', '2004-10-05 00:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(942159, 108986, 20662, '<td valign="top">Those eyes! Excellent</td>', 'Those eyes! Excellent', '2004-10-05 00:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(942162, 108276, 22239, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... the colors on the leaves are great, and the texture and detail on the tree trunks bring some real depth.  Nice and sharp all the way out to the horizon, and the backlighting really works.</td>', 'Beautiful... the colors on the leaves are great, and the texture and detail on the tree trunks bring some real depth.  Nice and sharp all the way out to the horizon, and the backlighting really works.', '2004-10-05 00:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(942165, 107876, 5822, '<td valign="top">An ''in your face / in your mouth" view?  I don''t think I''m finding this very appealing looking as I don''t like the point of view. It''s got great amount of detail, but for one, the DOF is too narrow and I think you should have gotten all of it in focus. Secondly, I would have preferred some kind of contrasting background, either in color and/or another lesser subject. As it is, all this white just hurts my eyes. 5</td>', 'An ''in your face / in your mouth" view?  I don''t think I''m finding this very appealing looking as I don''t like the point of view. It''s got great amount of detail, but for one, the DOF is too narrow and I think you should have gotten all of it in focus. Secondly, I would have preferred some kind of contrasting background, either in color and/or another lesser subject. As it is, all this white just hurts my eyes. 5', '2004-10-05 00:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(942166, 103105, 20662, '<td valign="top">lovely <br/> <br/>Might have cropped the left side slightly to remove some of the dark area. It tends to hold your eye.</td>', 'lovely  Might have cropped the left side slightly to remove some of the dark area. It tends to hold your eye.', '2004-10-05 00:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(942168, 106953, 22239, '<td valign="top">Attractive model and expression, love the hair across her face, and the focus is perfect.</td>', 'Attractive model and expression, love the hair across her face, and the focus is perfect.', '2004-10-05 00:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(942169, 102742, 20662, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites -- very beautiful. Nice subtle colors</td>', 'This is one of my favorites -- very beautiful. Nice subtle colors', '2004-10-05 00:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(942171, 108940, 22239, '<td valign="top">Nice use of backlighting on the translucent petals.  The blue background contrasts nicely with the colors of the flowers.</td>', 'Nice use of backlighting on the translucent petals.  The blue background contrasts nicely with the colors of the flowers.', '2004-10-05 00:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(942174, 108992, 22239, '<td valign="top">Monet would be proud... very reminiscent of his Wheatstacks (End of Summer) ... very appropriate for a September Free Study.  Exposure and lighting are well done, deep DOF works well to capture the distant landscape along with the detail of the stacks.</td>', 'Monet would be proud... very reminiscent of his Wheatstacks (End of Summer) ... very appropriate for a September Free Study.  Exposure and lighting are well done, deep DOF works well to capture the distant landscape along with the detail of the stacks.', '2004-10-05 00:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(942181, 104027, 22239, '<td valign="top">Great architectural abstract.   Off-center composition is key here, and placement of differing construction materials in the frame really bring out a view that you can take lots of time to explore without changing viewpoint.  Lighting and DOF are well done here to achieve a good capture of the architecture from a unique viewpoint.</td>', 'Great architectural abstract.   Off-center composition is key here, and placement of differing construction materials in the frame really bring out a view that you can take lots of time to explore without changing viewpoint.  Lighting and DOF are well done here to achieve a good capture of the architecture from a unique viewpoint.', '2004-10-05 00:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(942182, 104030, 20662, '<td valign="top">Nice vacation spot! Very well done.</td>', 'Nice vacation spot! Very well done.', '2004-10-05 00:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(942183, 108642, 19608, '<td valign="top">Strong points: You''ve captured a very special moment that will live oon forever.  Lighting was a bit harsh - but you handled the backlight perfectly.  I''m not sure how you git the light in the first girl''s face - but kudos on a great job.  The framing with the dark vegetation adds a nice feel to the image.</td>', 'Strong points: You''ve captured a very special moment that will live oon forever.  Lighting was a bit harsh - but you handled the backlight perfectly.  I''m not sure how you git the light in the first girl''s face - but kudos on a great job.  The framing with the dark vegetation adds a nice feel to the image.', '2004-10-05 00:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(942184, 108275, 22239, '<td valign="top">Detail here seems a little fuzzy, like it''s a sharpened version of a slightly out-of-focus shot.  The captured moment and expression are great, however.</td>', 'Detail here seems a little fuzzy, like it''s a sharpened version of a slightly out-of-focus shot.  The captured moment and expression are great, however.', '2004-10-05 00:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(942186, 107020, 20662, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection. Would have like the horizon line to be somewhere other than directly center.</td>', 'Nice reflection. Would have like the horizon line to be somewhere other than directly center.', '2004-10-05 00:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(942187, 106931, 22239, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors here, and the clouds look great.  The detail on the water''s surface is well captured.  Leadng lines of the photo really pull you off into the mountains in the distance.</td>', 'Beautiful colors here, and the clouds look great.  The detail on the water''s surface is well captured.  Leadng lines of the photo really pull you off into the mountains in the distance.', '2004-10-05 00:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(942188, 108642, 20662, '<td valign="top">Cute -- how long did they stay clean in those white dresses?</td>', 'Cute -- how long did they stay clean in those white dresses?', '2004-10-05 00:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(942190, 104027, 19608, '<td valign="top">Strong points:  Wonderful selection of scene - it''s magical.  I''m not real sure about the top left "circular traingle shape," - but the rest of the composition is pure dynamite.  Perfect xposure.</td>', 'Strong points:  Wonderful selection of scene - it''s magical.  I''m not real sure about the top left "circular traingle shape," - but the rest of the composition is pure dynamite.  Perfect xposure.', '2004-10-05 00:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(942191, 106171, 22239, '<td valign="top">Majestic.  Feather detail and the markings around the eye are great!  Solid nature "portrait."<br/></td>', 'Majestic.  Feather detail and the markings around the eye are great!  Solid nature "portrait."', '2004-10-05 00:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(942192, 108991, 20662, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for duotone photos. This is excellent love how the horizon just fades away.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for duotone photos. This is excellent love how the horizon just fades away.', '2004-10-05 00:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(942194, 108984, 23203, '<td valign="top">I really like the bright colors, but the reflections (flash?) are a bit distracting.<br/></td>', 'I really like the bright colors, but the reflections (flash?) are a bit distracting.', '2004-10-05 00:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(942195, 107969, 23203, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic, a candidate for ''how''d they do that'' series.<br/></td>', 'This is fantastic, a candidate for ''how''d they do that'' series.', '2004-10-05 00:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(942197, 108897, 22239, '<td valign="top">Nice studio shot.  Your model''s expression is hard to read, and doesn''t really seem to convey the "warmth" from the title.  Lighting and exposure are good, and the pose is well done.  A bit more light from the left side would make things seem a bit less stark.</td>', 'Nice studio shot.  Your model''s expression is hard to read, and doesn''t really seem to convey the "warmth" from the title.  Lighting and exposure are good, and the pose is well done.  A bit more light from the left side would make things seem a bit less stark.', '2004-10-05 00:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(942199, 108569, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very interesting composition and rendering of the b&amp;w.  The titled horizon works well for this.  I''m not fond of the border technique and wonder if you really need the lighted trees on the right.</td>', 'A very interesting composition and rendering of the b&w.  The titled horizon works well for this.  I''m not fond of the border technique and wonder if you really need the lighted trees on the right.', '2004-10-05 00:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(942200, 105984, 23203, '<td valign="top">Love this image.. nice colors, good use of DOF, worth framing and hanging on the wall!<br/></td>', 'Love this image.. nice colors, good use of DOF, worth framing and hanging on the wall!', '2004-10-05 00:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(942201, 105190, 20662, '<td valign="top">These colors are beautiful. Personally, I find the framing to be too heavy for this photo. It draws your eye away from the photo.</td>', 'These colors are beautiful. Personally, I find the framing to be too heavy for this photo. It draws your eye away from the photo.', '2004-10-05 00:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(942202, 107902, 20662, '<td valign="top">Great Desat! What a cool place</td>', 'Great Desat! What a cool place', '2004-10-05 00:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(942203, 106488, 22239, '<td valign="top">Looks like near-IR to me... nice shot, good tree detail... I would have liked to see some more detail on the grass, but it''s hard to get that when shooting with such a dark filter.  Cloud pattern is very cool.  I really like the composition with the strong lines of the treeline and cloud patterns.</td>', 'Looks like near-IR to me... nice shot, good tree detail... I would have liked to see some more detail on the grass, but it''s hard to get that when shooting with such a dark filter.  Cloud pattern is very cool.  I really like the composition with the strong lines of the treeline and cloud patterns.', '2004-10-05 00:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(942205, 107586, 19608, '<td valign="top">Stron, strong portrait.  If only we could tell what he was thinking.  The soft hand in the foregound detracts only a bit as the face just draws you in for full attention.  The b&amp;w / sepia was the perfect choice.</td>', 'Stron, strong portrait.  If only we could tell what he was thinking.  The soft hand in the foregound detracts only a bit as the face just draws you in for full attention.  The b&w / sepia was the perfect choice.', '2004-10-05 00:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(942206, 105190, 23203, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.. perfect!<br/></td>', 'Beautiful colors.. perfect!', '2004-10-05 00:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(942208, 107202, 19608, '<td valign="top">Well thought out, set up and shot.</td>', 'Well thought out, set up and shot.', '2004-10-05 00:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(942209, 105647, 22239, '<td valign="top">Really vivid colors on the sky!  Foreground seems quite  dark.  Seems like there are some heavy shadows falling on the building which break up the lines of the architecture.</td>', 'Really vivid colors on the sky!  Foreground seems quite  dark.  Seems like there are some heavy shadows falling on the building which break up the lines of the architecture.', '2004-10-05 00:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(942211, 108276, 10263, '<td valign="top">Spectacular colors. Love the stormy look</td>', 'Spectacular colors. Love the stormy look', '2004-10-05 00:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(942212, 109013, 20662, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I saw this on your web site :-) Nice photo but then I''m a sucker for duotones. -- good luck</td>', 'I''m sure I saw this on your web site :-) Nice photo but then I''m a sucker for duotones. -- good luck', '2004-10-05 00:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
