(942225, 106707, 23203, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. Great colors.. Worth framing and hanging on the wall!<br/></td>', 'Wonderful shot. Great colors.. Worth framing and hanging on the wall!', '2004-10-05 00:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(942227, 105984, 22239, '<td valign="top">Good use of shallow DOF to emphasize the butterfly.  The colors seem a little strange, but it''s hard to tell if that''s because of the subject or because of an artifact of post-processing.  The sharp wing and leaf detail really make this one pop.</td>', 'Good use of shallow DOF to emphasize the butterfly.  The colors seem a little strange, but it''s hard to tell if that''s because of the subject or because of an artifact of post-processing.  The sharp wing and leaf detail really make this one pop.', '2004-10-05 00:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(942229, 108276, 23203, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a contrast between the dark clouds and the well lit trees. great shot!<br/></td>', 'Wow, what a contrast between the dark clouds and the well lit trees. great shot!', '2004-10-05 00:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(942230, 107902, 10263, '<td valign="top">A definate piece of art. The colors and lack of are great.</td>', 'A definate piece of art. The colors and lack of are great.', '2004-10-05 00:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(942232, 107397, 22239, '<td valign="top">Incredible!  Great composition, perfect use of subdued color, and an engaging subject really make this shot work for me.  Looks like Heida''s work!</td>', 'Incredible!  Great composition, perfect use of subdued color, and an engaging subject really make this shot work for me.  Looks like Heida''s work!', '2004-10-05 00:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(942233, 107995, 5822, '<td valign="top">this is such a neat photograph. I can''t believe how well the magazine back cover and the girl''s face are aligned and blend into each other.  I can see a photo like this being used in an advertisement in a woman''s magazine like the one your subject is reading.  Excellent work. 8</td>', 'this is such a neat photograph. I can''t believe how well the magazine back cover and the girl''s face are aligned and blend into each other.  I can see a photo like this being used in an advertisement in a woman''s magazine like the one your subject is reading.  Excellent work. 8', '2004-10-05 00:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(942234, 108872, 22313, '<td valign="top">So simple. Yet I like this shot more than most of the other shots in this contest. It is clear and in focus. Which all of the shots should be in the Master''s Challenge. I love the colors. Very bright and very contrasting. Good job.</td>', 'So simple. Yet I like this shot more than most of the other shots in this contest. It is clear and in focus. Which all of the shots should be in the Master''s Challenge. I love the colors. Very bright and very contrasting. Good job.', '2004-10-05 00:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
