(942243, 108995, 20662, '<td valign="top">I''m convinced there is an unwritten rule that there must be at least one guitar in every challenge. I''m betting you''re getting complaints about the amount of noise -- I like it. It adds to the photo</td>', 'I''m convinced there is an unwritten rule that there must be at least one guitar in every challenge. I''m betting you''re getting complaints about the amount of noise -- I like it. It adds to the photo', '2004-10-05 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
