(942363, 107365, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a trip and an image that leaves a burnt impression in the mind of the viewer. The clarity of the reflection bogles the mind and almost makes this image a transvestite into another photography style. It is both conventional and modern!<br/> <br/>The eye has no choice but to lock right in. It looks about but it can not get enough of the eye. This is by far the most hypnotic image in this challenge expertly captured. Bumping you to 7. This vote is certain to hurt me because I am way below 7. But I rather you receive your due credit for this lovely image. Mind you, it is an image whose beauty may be lost to some voters. Great effort: great study.</td>', 'This is a trip and an image that leaves a burnt impression in the mind of the viewer. The clarity of the reflection bogles the mind and almost makes this image a transvestite into another photography style. It is both conventional and modern! The eye has no choice but to lock right in. It looks about but it can not get enough of the eye. This is by far the most hypnotic image in this challenge expertly captured. Bumping you to 7. This vote is certain to hurt me because I am way below 7. But I rather you receive your due credit for this lovely image. Mind you, it is an image whose beauty may be lost to some voters. Great effort: great study.', '2004-10-05 01:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(942365, 108537, 5044, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Good lighting (seems like a pro setup and BG). Soft focus feel is good on this photo. I don''t like the outfit and props. Not my style. But hey!, That''s just me.</td>', 'Nice image. Good lighting (seems like a pro setup and BG). Soft focus feel is good on this photo. I don''t like the outfit and props. Not my style. But hey!, That''s just me.', '2004-10-05 01:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
