(942373, 105984, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very lovely specimen, however, I want to see both wings sharp and yes, I know that these are very difficult shots, but I would have hung around and come back until I got one with wings closer. This is not to say that your effort is a failure. The colors are great and the foliage has a pastoral feel. The black and orange with white is jyst great. Bumping to 6</td>', 'A very lovely specimen, however, I want to see both wings sharp and yes, I know that these are very difficult shots, but I would have hung around and come back until I got one with wings closer. This is not to say that your effort is a failure. The colors are great and the foliage has a pastoral feel. The black and orange with white is jyst great. Bumping to 6', '2004-10-05 01:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
