(942640, 107202, 19952, '<td valign="top">You did a great job with the lighting in this photo and with establishing a simple color scheme that works well for your subject. Really good shot.</td>', 'You did a great job with the lighting in this photo and with establishing a simple color scheme that works well for your subject. Really good shot.', '2004-10-05 09:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(942641, 106953, 19952, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition of a beautiful subject and the duotone works perfectly for this shot. Really great job.</td>', 'Excellent composition of a beautiful subject and the duotone works perfectly for this shot. Really great job.', '2004-10-05 09:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(942643, 104030, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot and I think the centered composition works well for the subject. The colors are bright and rich and the treatment of the water is among the best I''ve seen in any moving water photo. Really great job.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot and I think the centered composition works well for the subject. The colors are bright and rich and the treatment of the water is among the best I''ve seen in any moving water photo. Really great job.', '2004-10-05 09:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(942648, 108072, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful shot with excellent, consistent lighting. In addition, the subject is interesting and the composition works well. Really great job.</td>', 'This is a really beautiful shot with excellent, consistent lighting. In addition, the subject is interesting and the composition works well. Really great job.', '2004-10-05 09:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(942650, 108984, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is such a beautiful shot that really has a Wow factor going for it. Your setup and colors are absolutely perfect. Great job.</td>', 'This is such a beautiful shot that really has a Wow factor going for it. Your setup and colors are absolutely perfect. Great job.', '2004-10-05 09:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(942653, 103619, 19952, '<td valign="top">You definitely win the award for the most elaborate setup and I think you executed it very nicely. This is just a really outstanding shot.</td>', 'You definitely win the award for the most elaborate setup and I think you executed it very nicely. This is just a really outstanding shot.', '2004-10-05 09:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(942655, 108210, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice natural color and crisp focus. Not all that interesting of a composition though. 5</td>', 'Very nice natural color and crisp focus. Not all that interesting of a composition though. 5', '2004-10-05 09:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(942678, 108642, 8643, '<td valign="top">Charming study of movemen;, the front child is so well lit despite the backlighting, very clever - love the framing too!</td>', 'Charming study of movemen;, the front child is so well lit despite the backlighting, very clever - love the framing too!', '2004-10-05 10:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(942687, 107202, 23912, '<td valign="top">For a respectful site, I thought this, among all the excellent photography was sort of done distastefully. Butt after viewing many of the photos on this site, I can almost "know" who took this shot. So for you, this shot is right up your alley.</td>', 'For a respectful site, I thought this, among all the excellent photography was sort of done distastefully. Butt after viewing many of the photos on this site, I can almost "know" who took this shot. So for you, this shot is right up your alley.', '2004-10-05 10:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(942690, 103788, 23912, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite photo in this challenge! The b/w effect is excellently portrayed in the midst of of a towering sail. Awesome beauty, perfect subject matter, and simply divine in content! Very well done!</td>', 'This is my favorite photo in this challenge! The b/w effect is excellently portrayed in the midst of of a towering sail. Awesome beauty, perfect subject matter, and simply divine in content! Very well done!', '2004-10-05 10:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(942694, 107995, 23912, '<td valign="top">I had to take a double-take on this one! Great job on the subject matter.</td>', 'I had to take a double-take on this one! Great job on the subject matter.', '2004-10-05 10:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(942697, 107488, 23912, '<td valign="top">The b/w effect add to this "haunting" peice. Well portrayed, lighting perfect, and shines in the midst of this challenge. Looking at the photography of the "master''s" you can almost tell who took what shot. Very well done! (congrats on previous ribbons) ;-)</td>', 'The b/w effect add to this "haunting" peice. Well portrayed, lighting perfect, and shines in the midst of this challenge. Looking at the photography of the "master''s" you can almost tell who took what shot. Very well done! (congrats on previous ribbons) ;-)', '2004-10-05 10:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(942700, 108872, 7322, '<td valign="top">Great eye for color and composition. I like the positioning of the window. Unfortunately, I find that the plaque and the surrounding decorative painting detracts from the simplicity. It might be possible to crop out the bottom section and retain some of the vitality of the composition. The tension will be a bit different but it still could work.</td>', 'Great eye for color and composition. I like the positioning of the window. Unfortunately, I find that the plaque and the surrounding decorative painting detracts from the simplicity. It might be possible to crop out the bottom section and retain some of the vitality of the composition. The tension will be a bit different but it still could work.', '2004-10-05 10:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(942701, 107091, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the tension created by positioning the subject so low in a vertical format. However, I find the sky is a bit too ''blah'' to carry so much weight in the composition.</td>', 'I like the tension created by positioning the subject so low in a vertical format. However, I find the sky is a bit too ''blah'' to carry so much weight in the composition.', '2004-10-05 10:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(942702, 107202, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the harmonious color scheme and the exposue is dead on. Her pose is great. I don''t like where you''ve chosen to crop her legs. I would like to see her in full frame.</td>', 'I like the harmonious color scheme and the exposue is dead on. Her pose is great. I don''t like where you''ve chosen to crop her legs. I would like to see her in full frame.', '2004-10-05 10:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(942708, 109013, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a very good photo for a family album. From an objective point of view, I find it kind of boring. Technically it is good but it is a familiar take on a familiar subject. I''m not seeing anything that really pulls me in. I do like the play of light and shadow on the road. It''s just not enough to interest me.</td>', 'This is a very good photo for a family album. From an objective point of view, I find it kind of boring. Technically it is good but it is a familiar take on a familiar subject. I''m not seeing anything that really pulls me in. I do like the play of light and shadow on the road. It''s just not enough to interest me.', '2004-10-05 11:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(942713, 109031, 7322, '<td valign="top">Technically this is very good. The choice of subject matter bores me. It is a very good representation of a work of art---I could see this being in a travel log. I just think it is kind of ''ho-hum'' for this challenge.</td>', 'Technically this is very good. The choice of subject matter bores me. It is a very good representation of a work of art---I could see this being in a travel log. I just think it is kind of ''ho-hum'' for this challenge.', '2004-10-05 11:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(942735, 108122, 24846, '<td valign="top">ice portrait, dirt and all. Like the twinkle in his eyes.</td>', 'ice portrait, dirt and all. Like the twinkle in his eyes.', '2004-10-05 11:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(942738, 108979, 11793, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting photo - though not original.<br/>i like the differences in the refraction of the different vases.<br/>but find the chekerboard BG a bit distracting.<br/> <br/>good luck</td>', 'this is an interesting photo - though not original.i like the differences in the refraction of the different vases.but find the chekerboard BG a bit distracting. good luck', '2004-10-05 11:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(942741, 108173, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb macro.  Your ability to shoot at such magnifications and still maintain great compositions is awesome.  And as usual, your point of focus is spot on where it couts.</td>', 'Superb macro.  Your ability to shoot at such magnifications and still maintain great compositions is awesome.  And as usual, your point of focus is spot on where it couts.', '2004-10-05 11:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(942743, 107901, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great macro. Vivid blue really pops out the dragon and flower</td>', 'Great macro. Vivid blue really pops out the dragon and flower', '2004-10-05 11:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(942747, 108642, 11793, '<td valign="top">this is a good idea, but the whites seem a bit blown out, and the light seems pretty harsh.  it also seems the position of the girls is kind of random.<br/> <br/>good luck</td>', 'this is a good idea, but the whites seem a bit blown out, and the light seems pretty harsh.  it also seems the position of the girls is kind of random. good luck', '2004-10-05 11:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(942751, 107902, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nostalgic image.  The selective desat is excellent, adding to the old-time feel.</td>', 'A very nostalgic image.  The selective desat is excellent, adding to the old-time feel.', '2004-10-05 11:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(942754, 103788, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is excellent, great study in lines and shapes.  Perfect focus and exposure.  I think it actually may work better ion color though.</td>', 'This is excellent, great study in lines and shapes.  Perfect focus and exposure.  I think it actually may work better ion color though.', '2004-10-05 11:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(942756, 107387, 24846, '<td valign="top">I like this the most of all the portraits for its spontaneity. The capture of the street musician''s expression and form is very revealing.</td>', 'I like this the most of all the portraits for its spontaneity. The capture of the street musician''s expression and form is very revealing.', '2004-10-05 11:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(942758, 102660, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, exposure.  The hint of color is very enchanting.</td>', 'Excellent composition, exposure.  The hint of color is very enchanting.', '2004-10-05 11:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(942764, 105966, 19608, '<td valign="top">A great capture - very early in the morning.  The glow from the balloon on the ground and the hint of blue in the sky are great.  The other balloon silhouettes add a bit of mystery.</td>', 'A great capture - very early in the morning.  The glow from the balloon on the ground and the hint of blue in the sky are great.  The other balloon silhouettes add a bit of mystery.', '2004-10-05 11:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(942765, 107397, 19672, '<td valign="top">Okay...I''ve got to know how these almost mystical colorization is done?????</td>', 'Okay...I''ve got to know how these almost mystical colorization is done?????', '2004-10-05 11:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(942771, 107995, 24846, '<td valign="top">I love this ! At first glance of thumbnail I thought "what is this". An excellent idea and statement. I love the match of the brow and hairline. The background gives it the waiting room feel.  I hope we get to see the model after voting. -Back after voting- bumping this study up, agin nice work.</td>', 'I love this ! At first glance of thumbnail I thought "what is this". An excellent idea and statement. I love the match of the brow and hairline. The background gives it the waiting room feel.  I hope we get to see the model after voting. -Back after voting- bumping this study up, agin nice work.', '2004-10-05 11:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(942773, 107609, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb portrait - excellent use of "strage" lighting.  Printing is also superb - very strong blacks and whites.  I''m a little unhappy with the paper cup - don''t know if it''s the color or exactly why.</td>', 'Superb portrait - excellent use of "strage" lighting.  Printing is also superb - very strong blacks and whites.  I''m a little unhappy with the paper cup - don''t know if it''s the color or exactly why.', '2004-10-05 11:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(942776, 109014, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait.  Sure am surprised to see him so dishelveled looking.</td>', 'Excellent portrait.  Sure am surprised to see him so dishelveled looking.', '2004-10-05 11:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(942777, 107969, 24846, '<td valign="top">Very good study. Love the suspended kiwi, the reflection of the inner fruit in the lower water, and the excellent green background. The bit of blue adds a bit of color.</td>', 'Very good study. Love the suspended kiwi, the reflection of the inner fruit in the lower water, and the excellent green background. The bit of blue adds a bit of color.', '2004-10-05 11:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(942779, 109008, 19608, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colors and superb DoF combine to make this a work of art.  Catchlight in the eye is great.</td>', 'Brilliant colors and superb DoF combine to make this a work of art.  Catchlight in the eye is great.', '2004-10-05 11:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(942781, 108924, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette study. Love the colors</td>', 'Great silhouette study. Love the colors', '2004-10-05 11:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(942783, 108275, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wow - what a study in textures.  The exposure is perfect - and the meter was probably not your friend.  The intense look on the face is awesome.  The horizontal white line on the left side detracts just a bit.</td>', 'Wow - what a study in textures.  The exposure is perfect - and the meter was probably not your friend.  The intense look on the face is awesome.  The horizontal white line on the left side detracts just a bit.', '2004-10-05 11:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(942785, 107202, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great colors. Great use of lighting with the shadow casting to the left side of her bottom and thigh.</td>', 'Great colors. Great use of lighting with the shadow casting to the left side of her bottom and thigh.', '2004-10-05 11:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(942789, 105647, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette. The blue sky gradiant accents the College well.</td>', 'Nice silhouette. The blue sky gradiant accents the College well.', '2004-10-05 11:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(942790, 106953, 19608, '<td valign="top">A beautiful model - well portrayed.  There is an air of mystery in this image - which bring emotion.  The one eye is so captivating - and the hair over the other adds some playfullness.  The white blob in the lower right is an attention grabber.  Border on the heavy side.</td>', 'A beautiful model - well portrayed.  There is an air of mystery in this image - which bring emotion.  The one eye is so captivating - and the hair over the other adds some playfullness.  The white blob in the lower right is an attention grabber.  Border on the heavy side.', '2004-10-05 11:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(942791, 108949, 19608, '<td valign="top">The intensity in the cat''s eye is awesome.  The green bamboo is an excellent contrast to the colors of the animal.</td>', 'The intensity in the cat''s eye is awesome.  The green bamboo is an excellent contrast to the colors of the animal.', '2004-10-05 11:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(942792, 108276, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and the marvelous sky make the aspens look like golden torches.  Well done.</td>', 'Great lighting and the marvelous sky make the aspens look like golden torches.  Well done.', '2004-10-05 11:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(942796, 103788, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice study. Forceful image pulling my sight upwards. Like the chioce of a cloudy day as the sky and ship blends well. Like the cast of shadows fronm the rigging aginst the sails.</td>', 'Nice study. Forceful image pulling my sight upwards. Like the chioce of a cloudy day as the sky and ship blends well. Like the cast of shadows fronm the rigging aginst the sails.', '2004-10-05 11:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(942797, 103105, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great study. Wonderful color and lighting.</td>', 'Great study. Wonderful color and lighting.', '2004-10-05 12:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(942799, 103105, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wow - what a moment.  The backlighting really works to bring out the texture.  The baby is stunning.  Mom could use a bit more light on her face - but doubt if you could control that.  Pose is very emotional, lots of aww factor.  Border is way overdone.</td>', 'Wow - what a moment.  The backlighting really works to bring out the texture.  The baby is stunning.  Mom could use a bit more light on her face - but doubt if you could control that.  Pose is very emotional, lots of aww factor.  Border is way overdone.', '2004-10-05 12:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(942801, 105190, 24846, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunrise study. Love the shutter control of the waves.</td>', 'Beautiful sunrise study. Love the shutter control of the waves.', '2004-10-05 12:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(942803, 103189, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the lightning bolt. Looks as if the sky is splitting apart.</td>', 'Great capture of the lightning bolt. Looks as if the sky is splitting apart.', '2004-10-05 12:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(942805, 109032, 19608, '<td valign="top">Unusual, but an interesting technique.  Trying to figure out the water drops with not much luck.  There seems to be an over abundance of gray tones without any pure whites.  Motion blur adds intensity.  NIce job.</td>', 'Unusual, but an interesting technique.  Trying to figure out the water drops with not much luck.  There seems to be an over abundance of gray tones without any pure whites.  Motion blur adds intensity.  NIce job.', '2004-10-05 12:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(942807, 104030, 24846, '<td valign="top">Pretty site. Like the use of the foreground trees for framing.</td>', 'Pretty site. Like the use of the foreground trees for framing.', '2004-10-05 12:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(942810, 108832, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset study. Love the shadows of the last rays . The ripple at the shore adds a touch.</td>', 'Nice sunset study. Love the shadows of the last rays . The ripple at the shore adds a touch.', '2004-10-05 12:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(942812, 107586, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. Like the b/w and use of light and shadows.</td>', 'Nice portrait. Like the b/w and use of light and shadows.', '2004-10-05 12:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(942814, 103189, 19608, '<td valign="top">A nice capture of the lightning - great colors in the bottom sky and the reflection.  The top half of the sky is very dark - can make out the gray/blue at the top - but below the gray/blue area there''s a lot with no detail at all.</td>', 'A nice capture of the lightning - great colors in the bottom sky and the reflection.  The top half of the sky is very dark - can make out the gray/blue at the top - but below the gray/blue area there''s a lot with no detail at all.', '2004-10-05 12:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(942815, 108276, 27503, '<td valign="top">NIce colors but a bit dark in the lover left corner.</td>', 'NIce colors but a bit dark in the lover left corner.', '2004-10-05 12:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(942817, 108979, 27503, '<td valign="top">Clever picture which works really well.</td>', 'Clever picture which works really well.', '2004-10-05 12:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(942819, 106488, 19608, '<td valign="top">Interesting and definitely artistic.  Infared?  This would make an excellnt print hanging on the wall of a pro shop.</td>', 'Interesting and definitely artistic.  Infared?  This would make an excellnt print hanging on the wall of a pro shop.', '2004-10-05 12:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(942820, 108832, 27503, '<td valign="top">A bit dark but the sky is truly beautifull.</td>', 'A bit dark but the sky is truly beautifull.', '2004-10-05 12:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(942821, 107876, 19608, '<td valign="top">Looks yummy!  Nice exposure - expecially given the anout of white in the frame.  Could use a bit more DoF, but maybe not possible.</td>', 'Looks yummy!  Nice exposure - expecially given the anout of white in the frame.  Could use a bit more DoF, but maybe not possible.', '2004-10-05 12:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(942822, 103105, 27503, '<td valign="top">Great picture - I like it a lot.</td>', 'Great picture - I like it a lot.', '2004-10-05 12:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(942823, 109014, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice avian study. Love the color of the background, really accents the feathers.</td>', 'Nice avian study. Love the color of the background, really accents the feathers.', '2004-10-05 12:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(942824, 105647, 19608, '<td valign="top">The blue sky and building are truly superb.  The bottom half of the image has no detail at all.  It may be better with a lot cropped off the bottom, making it into a slim Jim format.</td>', 'The blue sky and building are truly superb.  The bottom half of the image has no detail at all.  It may be better with a lot cropped off the bottom, making it into a slim Jim format.', '2004-10-05 12:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(942825, 108949, 27503, '<td valign="top">Nice to see how the tiger is going around the bambus tree - would have been better if the tiger was looking at the camera but great colors and contrast.</td>', 'Nice to see how the tiger is going around the bambus tree - would have been better if the tiger was looking at the camera but great colors and contrast.', '2004-10-05 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(942826, 106707, 27503, '<td valign="top">Really nice colors and the sky is great looking.</td>', 'Really nice colors and the sky is great looking.', '2004-10-05 12:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(942828, 109031, 27503, '<td valign="top">The water takes this picture from average to good.</td>', 'The water takes this picture from average to good.', '2004-10-05 12:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(942830, 108991, 19608, '<td valign="top">A true study in good composition.  The foreground water line leads the viewer back into the image - but the fogginess at the other end prevent him from leaving. Excellent.  The printing is superb too , love the sepia.</td>', 'A true study in good composition.  The foreground water line leads the viewer back into the image - but the fogginess at the other end prevent him from leaving. Excellent.  The printing is superb too , love the sepia.', '2004-10-05 12:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(942832, 107091, 24846, '<td valign="top">Mans'' delusion of flight</td>', 'Mans'' delusion of flight', '2004-10-05 12:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(942834, 108897, 27503, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and beautifull model - great picture!</td>', 'Good lighting and beautifull model - great picture!', '2004-10-05 12:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(942836, 103619, 27503, '<td valign="top">Interesting :-)</td>', 'Interesting :-)', '2004-10-05 12:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(942839, 108897, 24846, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait of wearm colors. Nice use of lighting.</td>', 'Lovely portrait of wearm colors. Nice use of lighting.', '2004-10-05 12:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(942840, 107020, 27503, '<td valign="top">A bit to dark.</td>', 'A bit to dark.', '2004-10-05 12:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(942841, 108233, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s a great sports shot - loads of action,  superb colors.   It would do exceptionally well in a sports challenge, but has to be an underdog in a free study.</td>', 'It''s a great sports shot - loads of action,  superb colors.   It would do exceptionally well in a sports challenge, but has to be an underdog in a free study.', '2004-10-05 12:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(942844, 108454, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of nature''s sculpting. Like the vivid blue sky.</td>', 'Nice shot of nature''s sculpting. Like the vivid blue sky.', '2004-10-05 12:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(942845, 105647, 27503, '<td valign="top">To much of the picture is dark in my opinion.</td>', 'To much of the picture is dark in my opinion.', '2004-10-05 12:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(942846, 107397, 27503, '<td valign="top">Great colors and sky.</td>', 'Great colors and sky.', '2004-10-05 12:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(942849, 107365, 27503, '<td valign="top">Very sharp.</td>', 'Very sharp.', '2004-10-05 12:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(942850, 107876, 24846, '<td valign="top">What a treat to have after photographing it.</td>', 'What a treat to have after photographing it.', '2004-10-05 12:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(942851, 104030, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb colors along with the perfect shutter speed to capture the velvety feel to the water.  I''d move the waterfall just a bit more to the left in th frame.</td>', 'Superb colors along with the perfect shutter speed to capture the velvety feel to the water.  I''d move the waterfall just a bit more to the left in th frame.', '2004-10-05 12:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(942853, 104030, 27503, '<td valign="top">Great framing and colors.</td>', 'Great framing and colors.', '2004-10-05 12:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(942855, 106171, 27503, '<td valign="top">Incredibly sharp and nice blurred background.</td>', 'Incredibly sharp and nice blurred background.', '2004-10-05 12:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(942856, 107091, 19608, '<td valign="top">Looks like fun,  did you try it too?  For me the negative space in this just doesn''t quite work.</td>', 'Looks like fun,  did you try it too?  For me the negative space in this just doesn''t quite work.', '2004-10-05 12:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(942858, 108986, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great texture and stunning eyes.  Exposure perfect.  Border over powering.</td>', 'Great texture and stunning eyes.  Exposure perfect.  Border over powering.', '2004-10-05 12:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(942860, 103619, 24846, '<td valign="top">Interetsing study of man''s internal struggle with one self. Like how you have the left heal off the ground.</td>', 'Interetsing study of man''s internal struggle with one self. Like how you have the left heal off the ground.', '2004-10-05 12:21:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(942861, 108992, 24846, '<td valign="top">Interesting study. Like the cast of shadows. Nice perspective and color.</td>', 'Interesting study. Like the cast of shadows. Nice perspective and color.', '2004-10-05 12:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(942867, 106171, 24846, '<td valign="top">What a majestic stuy. The green really acents the image. Great crop, just enough brown.</td>', 'What a majestic stuy. The green really acents the image. Great crop, just enough brown.', '2004-10-05 12:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(942868, 108537, 19608, '<td valign="top">Well printed - the soft lighting is superb.  The dark areas surround her hair really make the blonde shine.  I don''t like the white square on the gun - it gets too much attention.</td>', 'Well printed - the soft lighting is superb.  The dark areas surround her hair really make the blonde shine.  I don''t like the white square on the gun - it gets too much attention.', '2004-10-05 12:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(942871, 108210, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. Like the way the trees frame in the house.</td>', 'Nice perspective. Like the way the trees frame in the house.', '2004-10-05 12:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(942874, 105984, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  The lady really pops out.</td>', 'Nice capture.  The lady really pops out.', '2004-10-05 12:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(942875, 108897, 19608, '<td valign="top">Super, super portrait.  Lighting is outstanding as is the pose.  It works very well with the gray / white background.  I have two minor problems:  a) The triangle of skin in the bottom right corner, and b) the border is just too much.</td>', 'Super, super portrait.  Lighting is outstanding as is the pose.  It works very well with the gray / white background.  I have two minor problems:  a) The triangle of skin in the bottom right corner, and b) the border is just too much.', '2004-10-05 12:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(942877, 104134, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait</td>', 'Nice portrait', '2004-10-05 12:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(942878, 109031, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the water. Good use of cropping that emphasizes the weight.</td>', 'Nice capture of the water. Good use of cropping that emphasizes the weight.', '2004-10-05 12:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(942880, 103615, 19608, '<td valign="top">The model is superb - eyes are dynamite, expression perfect.  I assume you used some fill flash, looking at the catchlights in her eyes - well done.  The bad news is that the background on the right has way to many overblown highlights.</td>', 'The model is superb - eyes are dynamite, expression perfect.  I assume you used some fill flash, looking at the catchlights in her eyes - well done.  The bad news is that the background on the right has way to many overblown highlights.', '2004-10-05 12:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(942882, 108949, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice wildlife study. I would have liked him looking at me.</td>', 'Nice wildlife study. I would have liked him looking at me.', '2004-10-05 12:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(942883, 107365, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very ominous.  Good find - well composed and exposed.</td>', 'Very ominous.  Good find - well composed and exposed.', '2004-10-05 12:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(942885, 106953, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.Like the b/w and lighting of her face.</td>', 'Nice portrait.Like the b/w and lighting of her face.', '2004-10-05 12:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(942889, 107902, 16901, '<td valign="top">I love this image . The warm , subdued colors of the pumps, I think , enhance the overall quality of the image better than if it had been shot in sepia tone . It bespeaks of a bye gone era more loadly in spite of it''s cluttered busy-ness . The early morning, or , late afternoon light greatly compliments the theme of of the past and invites you to literally step iinto scene  . Great work !  MG.</td>', 'I love this image . The warm , subdued colors of the pumps, I think , enhance the overall quality of the image better than if it had been shot in sepia tone . It bespeaks of a bye gone era more loadly in spite of it''s cluttered busy-ness . The early morning, or , late afternoon light greatly compliments the theme of of the past and invites you to literally step iinto scene  . Great work !  MG.', '2004-10-05 12:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(942978, 107609, 18667, '<td valign="top">Outstanding.<br/> <br/>I cannot think of any other words to describe this.<br/> <br/>Edit: Yes I can... if this were someone in my family, it would be an image passed down among the generations.<br/> <br/>10.</td>', 'Outstanding. I cannot think of any other words to describe this. Edit: Yes I can... if this were someone in my family, it would be an image passed down among the generations. 10.', '2004-10-05 13:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(943003, 107902, 27670, '<td valign="top">Colours just work so well !! beautiful image ! inspiring.</td>', 'Colours just work so well !! beautiful image ! inspiring.', '2004-10-05 13:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(943007, 107609, 26361, '<td valign="top">Love this photo as he looks like an interesting old man that I''d like talking with.</td>', 'Love this photo as he looks like an interesting old man that I''d like talking with.', '2004-10-05 13:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(943008, 107202, 27670, '<td valign="top">Eric Kroll''s revenge ;-) !!! love it !</td>', 'Eric Kroll''s revenge ;-) !!! love it !', '2004-10-05 13:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(943013, 109008, 26361, '<td valign="top">Awesome detail in the feathers &amp; face.</td>', 'Awesome detail in the feathers & face.', '2004-10-05 13:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(943015, 108991, 26361, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, serene morning vista.</td>', 'Gorgeous, serene morning vista.', '2004-10-05 13:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
