(943045, 106171, 26361, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the feathers &amp; face.  The mottled background is a great foil for the majesty of the ealge.</td>', 'Great detail on the feathers & face.  The mottled background is a great foil for the majesty of the ealge.', '2004-10-05 14:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(943047, 108986, 26361, '<td valign="top">Awesome close-up!</td>', 'Awesome close-up!', '2004-10-05 14:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(943049, 108843, 26361, '<td valign="top">Love the colors of this!</td>', 'Love the colors of this!', '2004-10-05 14:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(943070, 109013, 26361, '<td valign="top">Love this in the sepia tone.  Would have liked to see more of the path in the distance instead of just the peek of it near his sleeve.  Great shot!</td>', 'Love this in the sepia tone.  Would have liked to see more of the path in the distance instead of just the peek of it near his sleeve.  Great shot!', '2004-10-05 14:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(943072, 108979, 26361, '<td valign="top">Wow, this makes my eyes hurt.  Would love to know how you did it.  Very cool.</td>', 'Wow, this makes my eyes hurt.  Would love to know how you did it.  Very cool.', '2004-10-05 14:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(943077, 108940, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very nice flower shot. The lighting is my favorite part as it makes the flowers look illuminated from within. 8</td>', 'Very nice flower shot. The lighting is my favorite part as it makes the flowers look illuminated from within. 8', '2004-10-05 14:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(943079, 108843, 23764, '<td valign="top">Terrific job. Clear, statement.</td>', 'Terrific job. Clear, statement.', '2004-10-05 14:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(943082, 106707, 26361, '<td valign="top">Awesome sunset, love the color contrasts of the clouds.</td>', 'Awesome sunset, love the color contrasts of the clouds.', '2004-10-05 14:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(943083, 106488, 8054, '<td valign="top">Use of infrared makes the golf course look like it''s covered in snow. Interesting effect. Although I can easily make out the flag marker and the golfer with his bag, I see the big tree and impressive sky as a main focal points and then see the golfer and course as secondary elements. 5</td>', 'Use of infrared makes the golf course look like it''s covered in snow. Interesting effect. Although I can easily make out the flag marker and the golfer with his bag, I see the big tree and impressive sky as a main focal points and then see the golfer and course as secondary elements. 5', '2004-10-05 14:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(943086, 107300, 26361, '<td valign="top">Great full-length shot of the bridal down.  Maybe a tighter crop would show off the dress more?</td>', 'Great full-length shot of the bridal down.  Maybe a tighter crop would show off the dress more?', '2004-10-05 14:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(943087, 105190, 26361, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sunset.  Looks like a great place to vacation.</td>', 'Gorgeous sunset.  Looks like a great place to vacation.', '2004-10-05 14:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(943117, 107586, 26361, '<td valign="top">Makes you wonder what he''s thinking.  Great shot.</td>', 'Makes you wonder what he''s thinking.  Great shot.', '2004-10-05 15:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(943120, 107202, 18028, '<td valign="top">fantastic image.....nice bar....</td>', 'fantastic image.....nice bar....', '2004-10-05 15:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(943157, 106488, 26361, '<td valign="top">Love the atmosphere of this shot.  Wish the golfer were just a tad bit bigger.</td>', 'Love the atmosphere of this shot.  Wish the golfer were just a tad bit bigger.', '2004-10-05 15:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(943162, 108897, 26361, '<td valign="top">I like the model''s pose, it makes her look relaxed and at ease.</td>', 'I like the model''s pose, it makes her look relaxed and at ease.', '2004-10-05 15:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(943167, 108924, 26361, '<td valign="top">Awesome sunset which contrasts nicely with the silhouette</td>', 'Awesome sunset which contrasts nicely with the silhouette', '2004-10-05 15:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(943170, 108872, 26361, '<td valign="top">Great color study!</td>', 'Great color study!', '2004-10-05 15:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(943172, 108537, 26361, '<td valign="top">The soft lighting is a great contrast to the hard metal of the gun.  I like the extra negative space on the right, it makes me wonder what she''s looking at.</td>', 'The soft lighting is a great contrast to the hard metal of the gun.  I like the extra negative space on the right, it makes me wonder what she''s looking at.', '2004-10-05 15:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(943189, 107876, 26361, '<td valign="top">Wow, this really makes me want to run to a bakery right now.  Great detail &amp; lighting.</td>', 'Wow, this really makes me want to run to a bakery right now.  Great detail & lighting.', '2004-10-05 16:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(943211, 108832, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely striations and a good scene. I do love sunsets but I just wish there was an extra feature of interest here somewhere. A bit cliche perhaps, but a boat, bird, planet, tree - anything to give more scale and context. That said, I do like the subtle wave and the gorgeous hues off the water.<br/></td>', 'Lovely striations and a good scene. I do love sunsets but I just wish there was an extra feature of interest here somewhere. A bit cliche perhaps, but a boat, bird, planet, tree - anything to give more scale and context. That said, I do like the subtle wave and the gorgeous hues off the water.', '2004-10-05 16:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(943212, 108210, 8860, '<td valign="top">For me this scene is just not captivating enough. While your scene is OK, it seems that you have brought nothing fresh to way in which it is shot. This is exactly how I imagine most snapshots would frame the subject: eye-level, fairly central, etc.<br/> <br/>The element of creativity is missing here which is what I''m rating highly in this challenge rather than those who are blessed with simply attractive scenery or subjects to ''make'' the shot.</td>', 'For me this scene is just not captivating enough. While your scene is OK, it seems that you have brought nothing fresh to way in which it is shot. This is exactly how I imagine most snapshots would frame the subject: eye-level, fairly central, etc. The element of creativity is missing here which is what I''m rating highly in this challenge rather than those who are blessed with simply attractive scenery or subjects to ''make'' the shot.', '2004-10-05 16:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(943213, 108275, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great study - if a little too processed/sharpened.</td>', 'Great study - if a little too processed/sharpened.', '2004-10-05 16:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(943214, 107586, 27673, '<td valign="top">If I could look inside his mind......</td>', 'If I could look inside his mind......', '2004-10-05 16:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(943215, 108642, 26361, '<td valign="top">What an idyllic childhood afternoon!</td>', 'What an idyllic childhood afternoon!', '2004-10-05 16:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(943217, 108122, 8860, '<td valign="top">A competent shot but lacking in aesthetic appeal for me. Good tones, composition is a bit bland though.</td>', 'A competent shot but lacking in aesthetic appeal for me. Good tones, composition is a bit bland though.', '2004-10-05 16:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(943218, 108940, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, subject''s a bit uninteresting though. If you like flowers then this is always going to appeal, but I''m looking for creaativity in this challenge and I don''t see very much beyond your lighting.<br/> <br/>Background is quite distracting.</td>', 'Good lighting, subject''s a bit uninteresting though. If you like flowers then this is always going to appeal, but I''m looking for creaativity in this challenge and I don''t see very much beyond your lighting. Background is quite distracting.', '2004-10-05 16:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(943223, 108537, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is competent, but too soft for me. She''s pretty but the pose is a bit awkward - the gun slices through her shoulder severing the continuity of her form. Other than that I''m not sure what to be thinking unless I refer to the title. You''ve kind of achieved your aim with that film noir look but she does look a modern-day girl, and it''s still not quite creative or perfect enough.</td>', 'This is competent, but too soft for me. She''s pretty but the pose is a bit awkward - the gun slices through her shoulder severing the continuity of her form. Other than that I''m not sure what to be thinking unless I refer to the title. You''ve kind of achieved your aim with that film noir look but she does look a modern-day girl, and it''s still not quite creative or perfect enough.', '2004-10-05 16:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(943224, 106953, 8860, '<td valign="top">A powerful look and a strong portrait. Hair is a bit over-swept but she''s lovely and her eyes pierce the subdued tones nicely. Memorable shot and well composed (and so it should be!!).</td>', 'A powerful look and a strong portrait. Hair is a bit over-swept but she''s lovely and her eyes pierce the subdued tones nicely. Memorable shot and well composed (and so it should be!!).', '2004-10-05 16:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(943232, 107995, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is a fairly goos concept but the shot does not grab me otherwise. Yes, the magazine makes her face but why? What else is there going on and there has been little other creative input to the shot beyond the use of the prop. The background is dull and this ultimately looks like a humourous snapshot. Sorry not to be more positive.</td>', 'This is a fairly goos concept but the shot does not grab me otherwise. Yes, the magazine makes her face but why? What else is there going on and there has been little other creative input to the shot beyond the use of the prop. The background is dull and this ultimately looks like a humourous snapshot. Sorry not to be more positive.', '2004-10-05 16:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(943233, 108122, 26361, '<td valign="top">Great b&amp;w.  Looks like one of my littles on a good day.</td>', 'Great b&w.  Looks like one of my littles on a good day.', '2004-10-05 16:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(943237, 108984, 26361, '<td valign="top">Great color study.  The background really brings out the other colors.</td>', 'Great color study.  The background really brings out the other colors.', '2004-10-05 16:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(943239, 106707, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very good use of negative space. The orange of the clouds matches nicely with the masonry of the tower. Very nice details throughout. 10</td>', 'Very good use of negative space. The orange of the clouds matches nicely with the masonry of the tower. Very nice details throughout. 10', '2004-10-05 16:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(943240, 103615, 10702, '<td valign="top">Love the harmony between her green eyes and the green forest. Her skintone seems to be a little red though and could perhaps use a bit more color.</td>', 'Love the harmony between her green eyes and the green forest. Her skintone seems to be a little red though and could perhaps use a bit more color.', '2004-10-05 16:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(943243, 107488, 8054, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the b/w but it appears to be slighly out of focus. 6</td>', 'I love the composition and the b/w but it appears to be slighly out of focus. 6', '2004-10-05 16:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(943246, 108569, 10702, '<td valign="top">This is very unusual shot, the stile is impressive but I''m not sure that it is making the shot better. And the light dots in the tree are very distracting.</td>', 'This is very unusual shot, the stile is impressive but I''m not sure that it is making the shot better. And the light dots in the tree are very distracting.', '2004-10-05 16:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(943249, 103619, 8054, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what is going on with this photo but I like it from a technical standpoint. Lighting seems fairly even and focus is sharp. 7</td>', 'Not quite sure what is going on with this photo but I like it from a technical standpoint. Lighting seems fairly even and focus is sharp. 7', '2004-10-05 16:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(943250, 108924, 10702, '<td valign="top">Great colors, I love it. Show''s clearly how lonely one person is when meeting the universe.</td>', 'Great colors, I love it. Show''s clearly how lonely one person is when meeting the universe.', '2004-10-05 16:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(943252, 108832, 26361, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sunset!</td>', 'Gorgeous sunset!', '2004-10-05 16:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(943255, 107091, 10702, '<td valign="top">Well, negative space. I think you have got many comments about it. I often like some negative space but I think this is a bit to much.</td>', 'Well, negative space. I think you have got many comments about it. I often like some negative space but I think this is a bit to much.', '2004-10-05 16:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(943256, 107995, 26361, '<td valign="top">Wow, great job on magazine placement!  Too cool!</td>', 'Wow, great job on magazine placement!  Too cool!', '2004-10-05 16:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(943257, 107901, 6388, '<td valign="top">colours are awesome.  could mebbe have dodged the highlights on his body a little under the wings to brighten him up.  composition is nice...the square crop seems to go over well here.nice and shallow DOF is uber cool.<br/> <br/>P-ness</td>', 'colours are awesome.  could mebbe have dodged the highlights on his body a little under the wings to brighten him up.  composition is nice...the square crop seems to go over well here.nice and shallow DOF is uber cool. P-ness', '2004-10-05 16:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(943268, 105647, 10702, '<td valign="top">Would like to see more of the collage and also I think the lights in the buildings at the right are really destracting.</td>', 'Would like to see more of the collage and also I think the lights in the buildings at the right are really destracting.', '2004-10-05 16:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(943269, 108991, 10151, '<td valign="top">Very Very nice exposure...would love to see what camera/lens you used.</td>', 'Very Very nice exposure...would love to see what camera/lens you used.', '2004-10-05 16:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(943272, 105190, 10151, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. Just enough motion blur!</td>', 'Wonderful image. Just enough motion blur!', '2004-10-05 16:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(943273, 107902, 10702, '<td valign="top">This looks like a setup for theatre or something. Alot of small things in great colors. This is one of my favorite in this challenge.</td>', 'This looks like a setup for theatre or something. Alot of small things in great colors. This is one of my favorite in this challenge.', '2004-10-05 16:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(943274, 108986, 10702, '<td valign="top">It''s a little bit grainy and looks almost as taken through glass, But a real good closeup and great shot.</td>', 'It''s a little bit grainy and looks almost as taken through glass, But a real good closeup and great shot.', '2004-10-05 16:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(943279, 109014, 6388, '<td valign="top">remarkably sharp.  beautiful depth and texture.  would like to see a little more light on his face, esp around the eye (would have to be done post-processing i''d assume, since fill-flash and reflectors tend to irritate birds :).  like the centred crop, and  the white border works to balance the image out.<br/>very nice.</td>', 'remarkably sharp.  beautiful depth and texture.  would like to see a little more light on his face, esp around the eye (would have to be done post-processing i''d assume, since fill-flash and reflectors tend to irritate birds :).  like the centred crop, and  the white border works to balance the image out.very nice.', '2004-10-05 16:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(943284, 103105, 10702, '<td valign="top">Not much to say here, 10<br/> <br/>I love the composition and the warm lightinh.</td>', 'Not much to say here, 10 I love the composition and the warm lightinh.', '2004-10-05 16:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(943286, 109013, 10702, '<td valign="top">I think I would rather like this without the grain. Nice sepia colors but the shot seems a bit medicore for this masters challenge.</td>', 'I think I would rather like this without the grain. Nice sepia colors but the shot seems a bit medicore for this masters challenge.', '2004-10-05 17:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(943292, 108995, 10151, '<td valign="top">Love the gain...give the feeling of a gritty dive gig.  One thing though....he''s playing bass.</td>', 'Love the gain...give the feeling of a gritty dive gig.  One thing though....he''s playing bass.', '2004-10-05 17:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(943295, 106707, 10151, '<td valign="top">The most tunning image I''ve seen in a long while! not sure how natural this is, but, frankley, I don''t care. 10</td>', 'The most tunning image I''ve seen in a long while! not sure how natural this is, but, frankley, I don''t care. 10', '2004-10-05 17:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(943297, 106488, 10151, '<td valign="top">IR? Stunning.</td>', 'IR? Stunning.', '2004-10-05 17:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(943326, 107969, 27439, '<td valign="top">Great piece of work! Even bether than I think i would be :)</td>', 'Great piece of work! Even bether than I think i would be :)', '2004-10-05 17:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(943337, 107599, 8054, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective you showed in this photo. Colors, contrast and saturation are very good except for the very bright spot which is out of place. Judging by the shadows I see on the trees in the background, it appears that the sun is coming from the right side vs the left by the bright spot. Maybe I''m wrong. 5</td>', 'I love the perspective you showed in this photo. Colors, contrast and saturation are very good except for the very bright spot which is out of place. Judging by the shadows I see on the trees in the background, it appears that the sun is coming from the right side vs the left by the bright spot. Maybe I''m wrong. 5', '2004-10-05 17:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(943372, 107387, 22267, '<td valign="top">Absolutely incredible - this photo took my breath away.... I only wish I could capture someones life like this!</td>', 'Absolutely incredible - this photo took my breath away.... I only wish I could capture someones life like this!', '2004-10-05 18:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(943374, 106953, 22267, '<td valign="top">Stunning... you have captured her soul.</td>', 'Stunning... you have captured her soul.', '2004-10-05 18:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(943377, 107609, 22267, '<td valign="top">Stunning!</td>', 'Stunning!', '2004-10-05 18:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(943378, 108992, 6388, '<td valign="top">love the diagonals.  you took this at absolutely the right time of day, with the shadows moving in the direction of the grain rows.  Even the wisp of cloud cooperated.  nice colours, and the deep DOF works nicely. bump up from original vote.</td>', 'love the diagonals.  you took this at absolutely the right time of day, with the shadows moving in the direction of the grain rows.  Even the wisp of cloud cooperated.  nice colours, and the deep DOF works nicely. bump up from original vote.', '2004-10-05 18:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(943379, 108979, 22267, '<td valign="top">Oh my god! What a talented person you are! Truly incredible! It just looks like a painting done in indian ink! Well done!</td>', 'Oh my god! What a talented person you are! Truly incredible! It just looks like a painting done in indian ink! Well done!', '2004-10-05 18:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(943382, 107902, 22267, '<td valign="top">Amazing - looks like the set for a broadway musical!</td>', 'Amazing - looks like the set for a broadway musical!', '2004-10-05 18:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(943385, 108832, 6388, '<td valign="top">apt title.  interesting cloud pattern, and sunburst.  technically almost perfect.  compositionally I might have opted for less blue, and fill the frame with more cloud, but that''s just a personal preference thing.  nice shot.</td>', 'apt title.  interesting cloud pattern, and sunburst.  technically almost perfect.  compositionally I might have opted for less blue, and fill the frame with more cloud, but that''s just a personal preference thing.  nice shot.', '2004-10-05 18:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(943391, 103619, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very interesting take on the challenge - hope you post some how-to notes.  This would really work well as a commercial for gym clothes or shoes, or similar.  The model is a bit ironic - adding a bit of humor, doesn''t look like he works out all that much.  Both lighting and exposure very well done.</td>', 'A very interesting take on the challenge - hope you post some how-to notes.  This would really work well as a commercial for gym clothes or shoes, or similar.  The model is a bit ironic - adding a bit of humor, doesn''t look like he works out all that much.  Both lighting and exposure very well done.', '2004-10-05 18:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(943396, 107488, 19608, '<td valign="top">I realkly want to like this image - it has some neat features.  But - I just don''t quite connect for some reason.  The empty chair is significant yet seems to be such a small part of the scene.  With the strong back light - I''m not sure the lit bulbs do much except draw the eye away from the other nice areas.  Finally - a very small point, but the border is overdone for my tastes.  Perhaps the reason I don''t connect is that it doesn''t seem right to scale - if the chair is normal size - the ceiling must be 20 feet.</td>', 'I realkly want to like this image - it has some neat features.  But - I just don''t quite connect for some reason.  The empty chair is significant yet seems to be such a small part of the scene.  With the strong back light - I''m not sure the lit bulbs do much except draw the eye away from the other nice areas.  Finally - a very small point, but the border is overdone for my tastes.  Perhaps the reason I don''t connect is that it doesn''t seem right to scale - if the chair is normal size - the ceiling must be 20 feet.', '2004-10-05 18:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(943401, 103219, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very unusual, but effective portrait.   I''m wanting more though - seems like you are just teasing me.</td>', 'A very unusual, but effective portrait.   I''m wanting more though - seems like you are just teasing me.', '2004-10-05 18:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(943403, 105984, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice macro - well exposed and perfectly composed.  DoF is ok - not much you can do with shots like this.  The green seems a bit off-color to me.</td>', 'A very nice macro - well exposed and perfectly composed.  DoF is ok - not much you can do with shots like this.  The green seems a bit off-color to me.', '2004-10-05 18:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(943409, 109013, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ah - a real "country feel"  - a dad taking two of his youngins on a walk.  You image invokes a true emotion - exactly what it''s supposed to do.  I do believe it would be stronger without the telephone pole in the upper right.  Great timing on the footsteps - and excellent black and white technique as well.</td>', 'Ah - a real "country feel"  - a dad taking two of his youngins on a walk.  You image invokes a true emotion - exactly what it''s supposed to do.  I do believe it would be stronger without the telephone pole in the upper right.  Great timing on the footsteps - and excellent black and white technique as well.', '2004-10-05 18:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(943414, 108992, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great lighting at the perfect time of day.  The study of texture is fantastic.  I relly like the long shadows as well - they add a nice sence of time and a strong compositional element.  I have two suggestions for imporovement: a) The top of the closest bale merges with the one directly behind.  It would be best to have a bit of separation between them.  (Get higher or a step closer to the front one.) b) The title is doesn''t show much imagination - I''m sure you could make it relate to how you feel about the scene much better.</td>', 'Great lighting at the perfect time of day.  The study of texture is fantastic.  I relly like the long shadows as well - they add a nice sence of time and a strong compositional element.  I have two suggestions for imporovement: a) The top of the closest bale merges with the one directly behind.  It would be best to have a bit of separation between them.  (Get higher or a step closer to the front one.) b) The title is doesn''t show much imagination - I''m sure you could make it relate to how you feel about the scene much better.', '2004-10-05 18:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(943416, 108210, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice scenic.  I''m sure the exposure is right on, but I wonder what it would do with it deliberately darkened and perhaps a warming filter added?  It''s still an excellent entry and obviously fitting for a master''s camera.</td>', 'A very nice scenic.  I''m sure the exposure is right on, but I wonder what it would do with it deliberately darkened and perhaps a warming filter added?  It''s still an excellent entry and obviously fitting for a master''s camera.', '2004-10-05 18:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(943418, 108995, 19608, '<td valign="top">Emotive - what a photo should do, create a feeling in the viewer.  I really love the added noise, but do not like the blown out highlights.  Excellent model.</td>', 'Emotive - what a photo should do, create a feeling in the viewer.  I really love the added noise, but do not like the blown out highlights.  Excellent model.', '2004-10-05 18:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(943431, 108454, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice scenic, perfect exposure.  Post card of the hoodoos.  I like the tuft of grass coming from the top of the tall one.  Maybe a title "Mother and daughter?"</td>', 'Nice scenic, perfect exposure.  Post card of the hoodoos.  I like the tuft of grass coming from the top of the tall one.  Maybe a title "Mother and daughter?"', '2004-10-05 18:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(943434, 109019, 19608, '<td valign="top">Cute little model - having fun.  Are the colors accurate - them seem a bit washed out?</td>', 'Cute little model - having fun.  Are the colors accurate - them seem a bit washed out?', '2004-10-05 18:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(943439, 108843, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb scenic and perfect timing when the moon broke through the clouds.  The moon''s reflection in the forground is the prefect counter point.  All the techie stuff (exposure, composition, DoF) is excellent.  You are the proudreceiver of my 3,000th comment - which will win you absolutely nothing!</td>', 'Superb scenic and perfect timing when the moon broke through the clouds.  The moon''s reflection in the forground is the prefect counter point.  All the techie stuff (exposure, composition, DoF) is excellent.  You are the proudreceiver of my 3,000th comment - which will win you absolutely nothing!', '2004-10-05 18:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(943441, 107901, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors, composition and Dof.</td>', 'Excellent colors, composition and Dof.', '2004-10-05 18:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(943447, 104134, 19608, '<td valign="top">What captivating eyes and very well captured.   I love her expression as well - a true portraint rather than a snapshot. B&amp;W well handled.</td>', 'What captivating eyes and very well captured.   I love her expression as well - a true portraint rather than a snapshot. B&W well handled.', '2004-10-05 18:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(943451, 107397, 19608, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting - and a well-done one at that.  The colors are a bit "unreal" which adds to the effect.  Sky is dynamite.  Border a bit strong.</td>', 'Looks like a painting - and a well-done one at that.  The colors are a bit "unreal" which adds to the effect.  Sky is dynamite.  Border a bit strong.', '2004-10-05 19:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(943457, 108269, 19608, '<td valign="top">I love the layering effect of the bands of color, it gives the photo a lot of depth.  Although it is dead center (the bright area) - it seems ok for me - nice to be able to "break the rules" and end up with a great image.  Try this for a title - bet it will score higher, "World War 4 starts!"</td>', 'I love the layering effect of the bands of color, it gives the photo a lot of depth.  Although it is dead center (the bright area) - it seems ok for me - nice to be able to "break the rules" and end up with a great image.  Try this for a title - bet it will score higher, "World War 4 starts!"', '2004-10-05 19:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(943461, 108875, 19608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene taken at the perfect time of day.  The muted colors create such a calming effect.  I could look at this for some time without tiring of it.</td>', 'Beautiful scene taken at the perfect time of day.  The muted colors create such a calming effect.  I could look at this for some time without tiring of it.', '2004-10-05 19:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(943463, 108122, 19608, '<td valign="top">The EYES!  PERFECT.  A classic "little boy portrait" - that his parents will cherish forever.</td>', 'The EYES!  PERFECT.  A classic "little boy portrait" - that his parents will cherish forever.', '2004-10-05 19:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(943471, 109013, 24613, '<td valign="top">B + W works really well with this.  Great work!</td>', 'B + W works really well with this.  Great work!', '2004-10-05 19:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(943473, 107995, 24613, '<td valign="top">Verry creative.</td>', 'Verry creative.', '2004-10-05 19:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(943479, 107902, 7743, '<td valign="top">Even though there''s a lot of ''stuff'' in the photo it feels balanced and organized.  The soft colours set a nostalgic mood.  The focus seems a bit off as items on the right seem sharper than those on the left. 7</td>', 'Even though there''s a lot of ''stuff'' in the photo it feels balanced and organized.  The soft colours set a nostalgic mood.  The focus seems a bit off as items on the right seem sharper than those on the left. 7', '2004-10-05 19:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(943495, 108897, 24613, '<td valign="top">Your model is way to pretty to not have a big smile on her face!  Actually, the expression is great, the border is nice, and overall the photo is great.  Good Stuff!</td>', 'Your model is way to pretty to not have a big smile on her face!  Actually, the expression is great, the border is nice, and overall the photo is great.  Good Stuff!', '2004-10-05 19:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(943496, 109032, 24613, '<td valign="top">This is really cool!  Great work!</td>', 'This is really cool!  Great work!', '2004-10-05 19:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(943497, 103619, 24613, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to hear how you did this.  Top notch!</td>', 'Can''t wait to hear how you did this.  Top notch!', '2004-10-05 19:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(943498, 106707, 24613, '<td valign="top">Sweet!!</td>', 'Sweet!!', '2004-10-05 19:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(943511, 103615, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good skin tone and hightlights in your model''s hair.  The one finger at the bottom is a bit distracting as are the bright areas in the trees.  Catchlight in the eyes is perfect. 7</td>', 'Good skin tone and hightlights in your model''s hair.  The one finger at the bottom is a bit distracting as are the bright areas in the trees.  Catchlight in the eyes is perfect. 7', '2004-10-05 19:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(943519, 108995, 7743, '<td valign="top">You''ve caught a good expression on the musician''s face.  The crop at the top seems a little bit too tight  and the grain is uneven.  There seems to be too much grain at the top and none at the bottom.  6</td>', 'You''ve caught a good expression on the musician''s face.  The crop at the top seems a little bit too tight  and the grain is uneven.  There seems to be too much grain at the top and none at the bottom.  6', '2004-10-05 19:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(943525, 106488, 27439, '<td valign="top">Amazing light and tone in this picture! Great work :)</td>', 'Amazing light and tone in this picture! Great work :)', '2004-10-05 19:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(943527, 109019, 7743, '<td valign="top">Great expression on the girl''s face.  She looks like she''s mad at the bubble.  Even though she''s concentrating on the one bubble it might work to not have the image as tightly cropped on the right or use a vertical crop that would include more or the girl.<br/> <br/>The subtle colouring adds to the mood.  The depth of field is perfect keeping the background from being distracting.</td>', 'Great expression on the girl''s face.  She looks like she''s mad at the bubble.  Even though she''s concentrating on the one bubble it might work to not have the image as tightly cropped on the right or use a vertical crop that would include more or the girl. The subtle colouring adds to the mood.  The depth of field is perfect keeping the background from being distracting.', '2004-10-05 19:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(943541, 107995, 7743, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image.  The exposure seems bang on though a reflector may have helped on the right to add light to the left side of your model.  The hair on the your model''s right (image left)  detracts from her face blending more with the magazine.  If it were pushed back I think the blend would work even better.  Good choice of background. 8</td>', 'This is an interesting image.  The exposure seems bang on though a reflector may have helped on the right to add light to the left side of your model.  The hair on the your model''s right (image left)  detracts from her face blending more with the magazine.  If it were pushed back I think the blend would work even better.  Good choice of background. 8', '2004-10-05 19:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(943576, 107586, 7743, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photojournalistic portrait.  There are two things that I think would make it even better, 1)  Crop closer to the boy''s head on the left to remove some of the dark area and 2) either have  his hand in focus or crop just above it.  I think the DOF might be a little bit too shallow since the left side of his head seems to be out of focus.<br/> <br/>The exposure on his face seems just right. 6</td>', 'This is a wonderful photojournalistic portrait.  There are two things that I think would make it even better, 1)  Crop closer to the boy''s head on the left to remove some of the dark area and 2) either have  his hand in focus or crop just above it.  I think the DOF might be a little bit too shallow since the left side of his head seems to be out of focus. The exposure on his face seems just right. 6', '2004-10-05 20:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(943593, 108275, 7743, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and texture in the gorilla''s fur.  The catch light in the  left eye seems off.<br/> <br/>I think a tighter crop from the top would work here (just down to the dimple on the skull).  A rule of thumb is to either include all of something or crop a fair bit so it doesn''t look like a miss.  This works for most subjects, not just portraits. 7</td>', 'Great contrast and texture in the gorilla''s fur.  The catch light in the  left eye seems off. I think a tighter crop from the top would work here (just down to the dimple on the skull).  A rule of thumb is to either include all of something or crop a fair bit so it doesn''t look like a miss.  This works for most subjects, not just portraits. 7', '2004-10-05 20:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(943606, 106931, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good sharpness from foreground to background which works well with this type of image.  Nice leading line with the waterway.  Zooming slightly to make the mountains more prominent on the horizon or a higher vantage point may provide more impact.  The exposure seems bang on. 7</td>', 'Good sharpness from foreground to background which works well with this type of image.  Nice leading line with the waterway.  Zooming slightly to make the mountains more prominent on the horizon or a higher vantage point may provide more impact.  The exposure seems bang on. 7', '2004-10-05 20:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(943614, 108832, 7743, '<td valign="top">Exposure is perfect.  You''ve captured some nice texture in the clouds and the colour on the water gives it a metallic look.  However, for more interest I believe you either need something silhouetted on the beach or in the water. 6</td>', 'Exposure is perfect.  You''ve captured some nice texture in the clouds and the colour on the water gives it a metallic look.  However, for more interest I believe you either need something silhouetted on the beach or in the water. 6', '2004-10-05 20:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(943621, 108924, 7743, '<td valign="top">The silhouetted figure on the hilltop adds interest however the central location makes the image a bit static.  Cropping part of the image at the right I think would add impact to it and it would remove the blown out part of the sky.  7</td>', 'The silhouetted figure on the hilltop adds interest however the central location makes the image a bit static.  Cropping part of the image at the right I think would add impact to it and it would remove the blown out part of the sky.  7', '2004-10-05 20:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(943628, 103105, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, love the warm colors too.</td>', 'Nice lighting, love the warm colors too.', '2004-10-05 20:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(943639, 107397, 7743, '<td valign="top">Great texture and contrast.  I think it would also work well in BW.  The crop seems a little tight on the right and on top.  A little less zoom I think would help here.  Exposure seems bang on. 8</td>', 'Great texture and contrast.  I think it would also work well in BW.  The crop seems a little tight on the right and on top.  A little less zoom I think would help here.  Exposure seems bang on. 8', '2004-10-05 20:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(943756, 108986, 25388, '<td valign="top">technically sharp and well composed; the eyes are the wow factor that earns this a 10 IMO. Congratulations.</td>', 'technically sharp and well composed; the eyes are the wow factor that earns this a 10 IMO. Congratulations.', '2004-10-05 21:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(943760, 106707, 25388, '<td valign="top">incredible colors and so well composed. Congratulations.10.</td>', 'incredible colors and so well composed. Congratulations.10.', '2004-10-05 21:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(943763, 108843, 25388, '<td valign="top">perfectly titled; this conveys the emotion of solitude perfectly. Technically superb; congratulations.</td>', 'perfectly titled; this conveys the emotion of solitude perfectly. Technically superb; congratulations.', '2004-10-05 21:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(943766, 103105, 25388, '<td valign="top">The color and subjects give this image the wow factor. wonderful used of lighting; congratulations.</td>', 'The color and subjects give this image the wow factor. wonderful used of lighting; congratulations.', '2004-10-05 21:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(943767, 109013, 22689, '<td valign="top">Fantastic ! I confess that I''m a bit tired with oversaturated photos in this challenge.Yours is very different with nice tones , good focus and "feelings" !!!Well done ! A 10 of course !</td>', 'Fantastic ! I confess that I''m a bit tired with oversaturated photos in this challenge.Yours is very different with nice tones , good focus and "feelings" !!!Well done ! A 10 of course !', '2004-10-05 21:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(943770, 109019, 25388, '<td valign="top">wonderful capture of expression and including the bubble makes this even better. Might be a little over cooked in USM but that''s minor. Bumping to 9. Congratulations.</td>', 'wonderful capture of expression and including the bubble makes this even better. Might be a little over cooked in USM but that''s minor. Bumping to 9. Congratulations.', '2004-10-05 21:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(943772, 104027, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot.  I like the lines, the way them make me a bit dizzy but the shelf or ceiling or whatever that is on the left is very distracting, really overpowers the rest of  the shot ;(  A 7</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot.  I like the lines, the way them make me a bit dizzy but the shelf or ceiling or whatever that is on the left is very distracting, really overpowers the rest of  the shot ;(  A 7', '2004-10-05 21:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(943776, 103619, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very cute, interesting but I have a feeling it was more PS than actual photography, I could be wrong.  I can''t wait to read how this was done.  I''m not a purist but I like more actual photo and PS, a 7</td>', 'Very cute, interesting but I have a feeling it was more PS than actual photography, I could be wrong.  I can''t wait to read how this was done.  I''m not a purist but I like more actual photo and PS, a 7', '2004-10-05 21:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(943782, 108122, 12448, '<td valign="top">Why yes he does have a very dirty face but near as dirty as my James was the other day, LOL! ;)<br/> <br/>Great shot but the glare on the eyes is very distracting and a little less contrast would have made this shot much better for me personally.  The face is so clear while the ears and neck are blurred, intentionally, I don''t know but I would have liked to seen the whole head in focus.  A 7</td>', 'Why yes he does have a very dirty face but near as dirty as my James was the other day, LOL! ;) Great shot but the glare on the eyes is very distracting and a little less contrast would have made this shot much better for me personally.  The face is so clear while the ears and neck are blurred, intentionally, I don''t know but I would have liked to seen the whole head in focus.  A 7', '2004-10-05 21:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(943784, 108642, 12448, '<td valign="top">I bet they had so much fun running around in their pretty dresses!  A wonderful , carefree, candid moment but the sun is very bright and the girl in the background actually ends up being more of a distraction to me than an addition to the shot.  A 7 to start but going to an 8 for cute factor :)</td>', 'I bet they had so much fun running around in their pretty dresses!  A wonderful , carefree, candid moment but the sun is very bright and the girl in the background actually ends up being more of a distraction to me than an addition to the shot.  A 7 to start but going to an 8 for cute factor :)', '2004-10-05 21:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(943789, 108875, 12448, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and really want to like ti more but the soft focus just doesn''t seem to work for me.  There seems to be a lot of grain in the grass and the line of light on the mountains is just a little too straight to me, can''t quite explain it, almost too perfect and if that is the way you caught it, GOOD JOB!  But the lack of contrast hurts this shot for me.  A 7</td>', 'I really like this shot and really want to like ti more but the soft focus just doesn''t seem to work for me.  There seems to be a lot of grain in the grass and the line of light on the mountains is just a little too straight to me, can''t quite explain it, almost too perfect and if that is the way you caught it, GOOD JOB!  But the lack of contrast hurts this shot for me.  A 7', '2004-10-05 21:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(943791, 109031, 12448, '<td valign="top">Good clear focus, nice catching of the water droplets, technically a wonderful shot, good composition on the man holding the, what is he holding?  Cutting off the top leaves me wanting.  Also just a tad more contrast would really help this pop, a 7</td>', 'Good clear focus, nice catching of the water droplets, technically a wonderful shot, good composition on the man holding the, what is he holding?  Cutting off the top leaves me wanting.  Also just a tad more contrast would really help this pop, a 7', '2004-10-05 21:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(943798, 107876, 12448, '<td valign="top">That does look delicious.  But a few little things grabbed my attention, one the strawberry is upside down to me.  If it was turned over it would look more like a little heart.  The white background is very nice but the shallow DOF bothers me for some reason.  If it was just  a bit deeper it might appeal to me more.  I started at a 7 but am raising to a 8</td>', 'That does look delicious.  But a few little things grabbed my attention, one the strawberry is upside down to me.  If it was turned over it would look more like a little heart.  The white background is very nice but the shallow DOF bothers me for some reason.  If it was just  a bit deeper it might appeal to me more.  I started at a 7 but am raising to a 8', '2004-10-05 22:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(943803, 105190, 10080, '<td valign="top">Just awesome!</td>', 'Just awesome!', '2004-10-05 22:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(943804, 108992, 12448, '<td valign="top">How lucky to find these!  I like the design of the hay stacks but the overall composition of the shot doesn''t really appeal to me.  I tried my magic envelope and think a tighter crop on the right, leaving the main haystack as the focus might make it appeal to me more.  Also the late afternoon soon really didn''t help this, the colors are great but the light is still a bit harsh.  A 7</td>', 'How lucky to find these!  I like the design of the hay stacks but the overall composition of the shot doesn''t really appeal to me.  I tried my magic envelope and think a tighter crop on the right, leaving the main haystack as the focus might make it appeal to me more.  Also the late afternoon soon really didn''t help this, the colors are great but the light is still a bit harsh.  A 7', '2004-10-05 22:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(943808, 108210, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes it is but you have to almost search for it.  It gets lost in the rest of the shot, the sand, the trees are all fighting for my attention, a closer shot of the house with beacon would really help this shot jump out more at me.  Or even the dunes or the sea or lake behind you.  A 7</td>', 'Yes it is but you have to almost search for it.  It gets lost in the rest of the shot, the sand, the trees are all fighting for my attention, a closer shot of the house with beacon would really help this shot jump out more at me.  Or even the dunes or the sea or lake behind you.  A 7', '2004-10-05 22:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(943815, 109008, 10080, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!!! I may need to paint this one!</td>', 'Wonderful shot!!! I may need to paint this one!', '2004-10-05 22:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(943837, 107202, 23680, '<td valign="top">Good composition, I might have like to seen a more interesting bar area, but really, who''s looking at the bar :)  8</td>', 'Good composition, I might have like to seen a more interesting bar area, but really, who''s looking at the bar :)  8', '2004-10-05 22:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(943838, 107586, 23680, '<td valign="top">Very emotional shot, the only thing I would change would be to have the hand in the foreground more in focus 8</td>', 'Very emotional shot, the only thing I would change would be to have the hand in the foreground more in focus 8', '2004-10-05 22:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(943840, 106707, 23680, '<td valign="top">Too saturated for my tastes 6</td>', 'Too saturated for my tastes 6', '2004-10-05 22:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
