(943857, 108872, 23680, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of my favorites - I love everything about this shot, the composition, the colors, it''s a simple subject but very effective !  10</td>', 'Definitely one of my favorites - I love everything about this shot, the composition, the colors, it''s a simple subject but very effective !  10', '2004-10-05 22:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(943861, 103105, 23680, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting but a little soft  7</td>', 'Nice lighting but a little soft  7', '2004-10-05 22:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(943865, 103619, 23680, '<td valign="top">Very original would like to see how this one was done 8</td>', 'Very original would like to see how this one was done 8', '2004-10-05 22:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(943867, 104134, 23680, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white 6</td>', 'Nice use of black and white 6', '2004-10-05 22:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(943870, 108233, 23680, '<td valign="top">Good action shot 7</td>', 'Good action shot 7', '2004-10-05 22:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(943874, 105647, 23680, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, the sky looks a little unnatural but it is a nice contrast with the building 7</td>', 'Interesting shot, the sky looks a little unnatural but it is a nice contrast with the building 7', '2004-10-05 22:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(943875, 108832, 23680, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, what more can I say 9</td>', 'Beautiful, what more can I say 9', '2004-10-05 22:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(943877, 107995, 12611, '<td valign="top">pretty tricky; the head is a little big but you are a cunning trickster with a great eye for interesting elements, (the rolls on the shirt... the details on the chair)</td>', 'pretty tricky; the head is a little big but you are a cunning trickster with a great eye for interesting elements, (the rolls on the shirt... the details on the chair)', '2004-10-05 22:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(943878, 108875, 23680, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell whether that is a line of fog across the top of the mountains or a reflection but it is a splits the picture in a weird way 7</td>', 'I can''t tell whether that is a line of fog across the top of the mountains or a reflection but it is a splits the picture in a weird way 7', '2004-10-05 22:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(943880, 106953, 23680, '<td valign="top">Stunning portrait, very compelling 10</td>', 'Stunning portrait, very compelling 10', '2004-10-05 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(943883, 107969, 23680, '<td valign="top">Very nice the only thing I don''t care for is the blue in the lower left corner 9</td>', 'Very nice the only thing I don''t care for is the blue in the lower left corner 9', '2004-10-05 22:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(943884, 108269, 23680, '<td valign="top">This just looks unnatural to me for some reason, can''t quite put my finger on why 7</td>', 'This just looks unnatural to me for some reason, can''t quite put my finger on why 7', '2004-10-05 22:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(943886, 108986, 23680, '<td valign="top">I love this shot wouldn''t change a thing 10</td>', 'I love this shot wouldn''t change a thing 10', '2004-10-05 22:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(943887, 109014, 12611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird. Fantastic detail and focus. If you are somebody who likes bird shots, you will love this shot! nice job!</td>', 'Beautiful bird. Fantastic detail and focus. If you are somebody who likes bird shots, you will love this shot! nice job!', '2004-10-05 22:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(943888, 108979, 23680, '<td valign="top">Different than anything else in the challenge, well done 9</td>', 'Different than anything else in the challenge, well done 9', '2004-10-05 22:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(943896, 108949, 23680, '<td valign="top">Great capture - looks like it should be in a magazine :)   Maybe just a little closer crop on the bottom showing more of the bamboo 9</td>', 'Great capture - looks like it should be in a magazine :)   Maybe just a little closer crop on the bottom showing more of the bamboo 9', '2004-10-05 22:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(943897, 105190, 23680, '<td valign="top">Amazing work 10</td>', 'Amazing work 10', '2004-10-05 22:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(943900, 107995, 23680, '<td valign="top">This is definitely different.  I think the background (closet) takes a little away from the shot 8</td>', 'This is definitely different.  I think the background (closet) takes a little away from the shot 8', '2004-10-05 22:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(943903, 108897, 23680, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the wide border 6</td>', 'I don''t care for the wide border 6', '2004-10-05 22:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(943905, 108767, 12611, '<td valign="top">got to love mist! fantastically great yellow blue grey green. The size of the shot is distracting, but the adventurous path is established.</td>', 'got to love mist! fantastically great yellow blue grey green. The size of the shot is distracting, but the adventurous path is established.', '2004-10-05 22:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(943911, 107091, 23680, '<td valign="top">Interesting 8</td>', 'Interesting 8', '2004-10-05 22:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(943914, 108569, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great shot, dazzling and phallic! you have the eye and this would make a great poster. This holds up well against all the other masters shots, its clean, well composed and interesting.</td>', 'Great shot, dazzling and phallic! you have the eye and this would make a great poster. This holds up well against all the other masters shots, its clean, well composed and interesting.', '2004-10-05 22:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(943915, 106488, 23680, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like all the different textures 10</td>', 'Nice, I like all the different textures 10', '2004-10-05 22:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(943919, 109013, 23680, '<td valign="top">I like the coloring, gives it a nostalgic feel 8</td>', 'I like the coloring, gives it a nostalgic feel 8', '2004-10-05 22:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(943922, 107300, 23680, '<td valign="top">Nice bridal portrait, I normally don''t like this type of border but it works for this particular shot 9</td>', 'Nice bridal portrait, I normally don''t like this type of border but it works for this particular shot 9', '2004-10-05 22:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(943925, 107609, 12611, '<td valign="top">Vintage, yet modern, nice shadow, wonderfully captured emotion. Maybe a touch of overexposed sunlight, but you are the master!</td>', 'Vintage, yet modern, nice shadow, wonderfully captured emotion. Maybe a touch of overexposed sunlight, but you are the master!', '2004-10-05 22:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(943931, 105966, 12611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but perhaps it might have been better to show a glow of light through the ballon rather than an overexposed flame and darkness for most of the shot, but luck is a fickle thing, even to a master! good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but perhaps it might have been better to show a glow of light through the ballon rather than an overexposed flame and darkness for most of the shot, but luck is a fickle thing, even to a master! good luck!', '2004-10-05 23:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(943932, 109019, 23680, '<td valign="top">Absolutely adorable - I like the soft focus 10</td>', 'Absolutely adorable - I like the soft focus 10', '2004-10-05 23:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(943933, 108992, 23680, '<td valign="top">Good colors and contrast just not very interesting to me 6</td>', 'Good colors and contrast just not very interesting to me 6', '2004-10-05 23:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(943935, 108454, 23680, '<td valign="top">Nice job 8</td>', 'Nice job 8', '2004-10-05 23:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(943936, 108767, 23680, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the fog in this picture, it seems to cut the trees 7</td>', 'I don''t like the fog in this picture, it seems to cut the trees 7', '2004-10-05 23:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(943937, 109031, 23680, '<td valign="top">Very nice - good job - that''s all I can say !   10</td>', 'Very nice - good job - that''s all I can say !   10', '2004-10-05 23:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(943940, 108537, 23680, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white or sepia, I can''t tell on my monitor but it looks good 8</td>', 'Nice use of black and white or sepia, I can''t tell on my monitor but it looks good 8', '2004-10-05 23:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(943942, 108210, 12611, '<td valign="top">You have captured my happy place. I am deeply moved by a sense of calm with this shot. Beatifully composed to be a hopeful, pretty, safe, warm and wonderful shot/ andx its nice in the day.</td>', 'You have captured my happy place. I am deeply moved by a sense of calm with this shot. Beatifully composed to be a hopeful, pretty, safe, warm and wonderful shot/ andx its nice in the day.', '2004-10-05 23:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(943946, 103615, 12611, '<td valign="top">Is this her name? I hope so. because if you mean in in the "mercy me, look here" sense, your a bit off. The eyes are portrayed wonderfully, and this really speaks to the viewer.</td>', 'Is this her name? I hope so. because if you mean in in the "mercy me, look here" sense, your a bit off. The eyes are portrayed wonderfully, and this really speaks to the viewer.', '2004-10-05 23:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(943985, 108537, 12611, '<td valign="top">soft, shiny and dangerous. the light is brilliant, the detail is stunning, (the freckles on the shoulder) And the gun is phallic and the expression is perfect. this is a masterpiece. This is a 10. This is done very very well.</td>', 'soft, shiny and dangerous. the light is brilliant, the detail is stunning, (the freckles on the shoulder) And the gun is phallic and the expression is perfect. this is a masterpiece. This is a 10. This is done very very well.', '2004-10-05 23:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(944014, 108569, 14773, '<td valign="top">very very nice......tons of light and texture</td>', 'very very nice......tons of light and texture', '2004-10-05 23:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(944018, 104134, 14773, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait. I just love the simplicity and the tousled hair. Very innocent.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait. I just love the simplicity and the tousled hair. Very innocent.', '2004-10-06 00:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(944020, 108992, 5822, '<td valign="top">Your contrast I think is too strong and the shot is a tad too dark.  Looks like you used a polarizer in low light at the wrong angle and didn''t really get the benefit of the filter.  Composition is not inspiring. 4</td>', 'Your contrast I think is too strong and the shot is a tad too dark.  Looks like you used a polarizer in low light at the wrong angle and didn''t really get the benefit of the filter.  Composition is not inspiring. 4', '2004-10-06 00:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(944022, 107202, 14773, '<td valign="top">I know you''ve heard this before, and probably from me, but I don''t think this genre is appropriate for this site.  This stuff normally comes in plastic wrap at local drug stores ;-)</td>', 'I know you''ve heard this before, and probably from me, but I don''t think this genre is appropriate for this site.  This stuff normally comes in plastic wrap at local drug stores ;-)', '2004-10-06 00:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(944025, 107586, 14773, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a fantastic shot.  Really, very good job. Beautiful light and .. well. .. everything.</td>', 'Wow, what a fantastic shot.  Really, very good job. Beautiful light and .. well. .. everything.', '2004-10-06 00:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(944034, 107901, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice saturated color and macro.  Trying to decide if the halos around the green leaves are oversharpening, or just wind movement.  Looks to be the latter.  I''m not really fond of the angle of view, as I don''t think it brings out the best in either the flower or the bug.  6</td>', 'Very nice saturated color and macro.  Trying to decide if the halos around the green leaves are oversharpening, or just wind movement.  Looks to be the latter.  I''m not really fond of the angle of view, as I don''t think it brings out the best in either the flower or the bug.  6', '2004-10-06 00:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(944040, 107300, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and the whites really shine, you got them right on.  Tthe greens are very deep and rich and contrast very well with the whites.  PP was also done well and really gives the image a dreamy effect.  Any bride would love a picture like this to add to the album or hang on the wall. Very well done. 10</td>', 'Beautiful composition and the whites really shine, you got them right on.  Tthe greens are very deep and rich and contrast very well with the whites.  PP was also done well and really gives the image a dreamy effect.  Any bride would love a picture like this to add to the album or hang on the wall. Very well done. 10', '2004-10-06 00:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(944048, 102742, 5822, '<td valign="top">I hope this wins the blue just based on it''s message and composition alone. It says so much and says it so well.  I wish I could give this a 100, but you''ll have to settle for a 10.</td>', 'I hope this wins the blue just based on it''s message and composition alone. It says so much and says it so well.  I wish I could give this a 100, but you''ll have to settle for a 10.', '2004-10-06 00:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(944051, 108173, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and detail on this macro.  6</td>', 'Great clarity and detail on this macro.  6', '2004-10-06 00:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(944063, 108872, 23560, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9. It''s unique and the contrast of blue and orange is spot on.</td>', 'I gave this a 9. It''s unique and the contrast of blue and orange is spot on.', '2004-10-06 00:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(944064, 103619, 5822, '<td valign="top">Certainly looks like there was a lot of cloning out body parts, but I still think this is a brilliant image. Really made me think.  Probably the shoes were stationary in place and then you had the subject change position in a long exposure and cloned out in ps.  That''s my best guess, but I hope you have a different explanation. 9</td>', 'Certainly looks like there was a lot of cloning out body parts, but I still think this is a brilliant image. Really made me think.  Probably the shoes were stationary in place and then you had the subject change position in a long exposure and cloned out in ps.  That''s my best guess, but I hope you have a different explanation. 9', '2004-10-06 00:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(944066, 107586, 23560, '<td valign="top">9. You''ve clearly captured a moment here. That is the sole purpose of photography, no?</td>', '9. You''ve clearly captured a moment here. That is the sole purpose of photography, no?', '2004-10-06 00:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(944073, 106488, 23560, '<td valign="top">8. It''s different, uniqur and the  lone figure really adds to the scale of the pic. Those crazy clouds help a lot too.</td>', '8. It''s different, uniqur and the  lone figure really adds to the scale of the pic. Those crazy clouds help a lot too.', '2004-10-06 00:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(944077, 106953, 23560, '<td valign="top">8. She''s beautiful. I''m a sucker for a beautiful dark woman. Plus, you caught a great expression with extreme crispity. I made that word up by the way. Like it? Crispity. It''s catchy :)</td>', '8. She''s beautiful. I''m a sucker for a beautiful dark woman. Plus, you caught a great expression with extreme crispity. I made that word up by the way. Like it? Crispity. It''s catchy :)', '2004-10-06 00:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(944078, 105966, 23560, '<td valign="top">8. It''s just bloody gorgeous and well exposed.</td>', '8. It''s just bloody gorgeous and well exposed.', '2004-10-06 00:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(944079, 108986, 5822, '<td valign="top">Boy, you certainly got in this little fellows face, or used a 600mm lens. Detail and sharpness are exceptional. Contrast is also very good, but I think the DOF is just a bit too narrow and would have liked to have seen it even all around.  Did you have to clone out cage? Excellent work.  9</td>', 'Boy, you certainly got in this little fellows face, or used a 600mm lens. Detail and sharpness are exceptional. Contrast is also very good, but I think the DOF is just a bit too narrow and would have liked to have seen it even all around.  Did you have to clone out cage? Excellent work.  9', '2004-10-06 00:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(944083, 103788, 23560, '<td valign="top">8. Excellent photo. I don''t know why I like it so much. Maybe it''s the crispness or the lines contrasting against the soft flowing clouds. It makes me miss sailing even though I''ve never sailed. So you know it''s good.</td>', '8. Excellent photo. I don''t know why I like it so much. Maybe it''s the crispness or the lines contrasting against the soft flowing clouds. It makes me miss sailing even though I''ve never sailed. So you know it''s good.', '2004-10-06 00:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(944088, 106707, 23560, '<td valign="top">8. You clearly caught a moment in this one. Colors and saturation are wondrous. Detail and sharpness are a great complement to the soft colors on the right. The warm tones are just so inviting. Beautiful work.</td>', '8. You clearly caught a moment in this one. Colors and saturation are wondrous. Detail and sharpness are a great complement to the soft colors on the right. The warm tones are just so inviting. Beautiful work.', '2004-10-06 00:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(944091, 107609, 23560, '<td valign="top">8. Lighting, mood and capture are excellent. There''s not much I can say here. I don''t believe this photo can be improved upon.</td>', '8. Lighting, mood and capture are excellent. There''s not much I can say here. I don''t believe this photo can be improved upon.', '2004-10-06 00:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(944097, 107876, 23560, '<td valign="top">7. A great studio shot. Subject matter is a bit boring but the red strawberry is almost erotic for some reason. I love the DOF.</td>', '7. A great studio shot. Subject matter is a bit boring but the red strawberry is almost erotic for some reason. I love the DOF.', '2004-10-06 00:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(944100, 107488, 23560, '<td valign="top">7. I gave bonus points because the image isn''t barreled in any way. I wish it was a bit crisper but the mood is well delivered. The frame, for once, helps.</td>', '7. I gave bonus points because the image isn''t barreled in any way. I wish it was a bit crisper but the mood is well delivered. The frame, for once, helps.', '2004-10-06 00:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(944102, 106707, 5822, '<td valign="top">Brilliant and rich saturated color. Brillaint composition. Brilliant photograph! 10</td>', 'Brilliant and rich saturated color. Brillaint composition. Brilliant photograph! 10', '2004-10-06 00:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(944110, 103619, 23560, '<td valign="top">7. You have entirely too much time on your hands. Please lend me that excellent camera and sit down, wont you? :D Anyways, the pic is great. But I''m sure the 100+ comments before mine already said that. The photo, however, isn''t that engaging. I like at it and I don''t feel moved in any way. Perhaps it''s the brilliant white ''studio-ish'' background. I can''t help but feel a dramatic dark lighting setup would set the stage for an "inner battle" of sorts. It would push the ''fight'' instead of the technique. Great work!</td>', '7. You have entirely too much time on your hands. Please lend me that excellent camera and sit down, wont you? :D Anyways, the pic is great. But I''m sure the 100+ comments before mine already said that. The photo, however, isn''t that engaging. I like at it and I don''t feel moved in any way. Perhaps it''s the brilliant white ''studio-ish'' background. I can''t help but feel a dramatic dark lighting setup would set the stage for an "inner battle" of sorts. It would push the ''fight'' instead of the technique. Great work!', '2004-10-06 00:49:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(944116, 108537, 23560, '<td valign="top">7. Flawless ''hollywood'' capture. I wish she had a bit more expression...perhaps more ''sex'' in the eye but, technically, the shot is spot-on.</td>', '7. Flawless ''hollywood'' capture. I wish she had a bit more expression...perhaps more ''sex'' in the eye but, technically, the shot is spot-on.', '2004-10-06 00:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(944121, 107387, 23560, '<td valign="top">7. 1st off, I love this instrument. You caught a great expression and moment. On the other hand, this shot feels too sharp and I really miss the edge of the case. Great work, nonetheless.</td>', '7. 1st off, I love this instrument. You caught a great expression and moment. On the other hand, this shot feels too sharp and I really miss the edge of the case. Great work, nonetheless.', '2004-10-06 00:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(944123, 103219, 5822, '<td valign="top">Looks like this image is about textures. Nice lighting and great composition.  I like the subtle interplay of shadows/light. The rich black of the background really help to bring out the glow of her skin  I also like the way you took just a part of the body and used it to make an interesting composition.  A very suggestive image. Well done. 9</td>', 'Looks like this image is about textures. Nice lighting and great composition.  I like the subtle interplay of shadows/light. The rich black of the background really help to bring out the glow of her skin  I also like the way you took just a part of the body and used it to make an interesting composition.  A very suggestive image. Well done. 9', '2004-10-06 00:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(944128, 102742, 23560, '<td valign="top">Cute kid+great message+great selective saturation=7. Nice work. This one can get onto magazine covers methinks.</td>', 'Cute kid+great message+great selective saturation=7. Nice work. This one can get onto magazine covers methinks.', '2004-10-06 00:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(944132, 107397, 23560, '<td valign="top">Never in my life will I get to see a place like this. I hope I do, but I probably won''t. That being said, thank you for sharing this part of the world with me. It''s beautifully captured and exposed and the mood is wonderfully conveyed. 7.</td>', 'Never in my life will I get to see a place like this. I hope I do, but I probably won''t. That being said, thank you for sharing this part of the world with me. It''s beautifully captured and exposed and the mood is wonderfully conveyed. 7.', '2004-10-06 00:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(944134, 103219, 23560, '<td valign="top">6. A bit plain for my taste. Nothing in the pic is truly holding my attention. I look to the lips, but no smile or expression. I look to the shoulder but it''s rather flat and plain. Overall just a bit too simple for me.</td>', '6. A bit plain for my taste. Nothing in the pic is truly holding my attention. I look to the lips, but no smile or expression. I look to the shoulder but it''s rather flat and plain. Overall just a bit too simple for me.', '2004-10-06 00:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(944136, 108995, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the composition a lot and the high grain and high contrast lighting help to give the impression of a smoky club scene.  Great capture of the musician''s facial expression as well. 9</td>', 'I like the composition a lot and the high grain and high contrast lighting help to give the impression of a smoky club scene.  Great capture of the musician''s facial expression as well. 9', '2004-10-06 00:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(944149, 108940, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice color to these backlit subjects but where''s the water droplets to give it some sparkle? 6</td>', 'Nice color to these backlit subjects but where''s the water droplets to give it some sparkle? 6', '2004-10-06 01:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(944153, 108992, 23560, '<td valign="top">6. The photo does not jump out at me. It doesn''t scream..."Hey, I''m special and one of a kind". It''s a stack of haystacks with some horizontal lighting. I think going out there with a ladder would have conjured up more dramatic results and angles. It''s a good pic, don''t get me wrong...but you''re going head-to-head with fantastic shots in this competition. Couldn''t you light a couple on fire? Just kidding. ;) On the positive I will say the colors are great. the contrast of orange and blue is great.</td>', '6. The photo does not jump out at me. It doesn''t scream..."Hey, I''m special and one of a kind". It''s a stack of haystacks with some horizontal lighting. I think going out there with a ladder would have conjured up more dramatic results and angles. It''s a good pic, don''t get me wrong...but you''re going head-to-head with fantastic shots in this competition. Couldn''t you light a couple on fire? Just kidding. ;) On the positive I will say the colors are great. the contrast of orange and blue is great.', '2004-10-06 01:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(944166, 107202, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very erotic and playful and the light on the bar and her red hair are exceptionally strong points of this image, beside her...uh, well 9</td>', 'Very erotic and playful and the light on the bar and her red hair are exceptionally strong points of this image, beside her...uh, well 9', '2004-10-06 01:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(944171, 108984, 23560, '<td valign="top">It''s a great pic...but it''s a pepper. I''ve seen sooo many peppers. I do think the RGB idea was great....but my god....another pepper? I gave you a 6 based on technical merit and capture. The subject matter, unfortunately, is too cliche for my taste.</td>', 'It''s a great pic...but it''s a pepper. I''ve seen sooo many peppers. I do think the RGB idea was great....but my god....another pepper? I gave you a 6 based on technical merit and capture. The subject matter, unfortunately, is too cliche for my taste.', '2004-10-06 01:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(944198, 106171, 23560, '<td valign="top">I had originally given you a 6. I bumped it to a 7 because I started to ask myself, "Could I capture this?". Probably not. Actually, definitely not. It''s sharp, well composed and contains a subject that is quite elusive.  I think you did a great job and I congratulate you.</td>', 'I had originally given you a 6. I bumped it to a 7 because I started to ask myself, "Could I capture this?". Probably not. Actually, definitely not. It''s sharp, well composed and contains a subject that is quite elusive.  I think you did a great job and I congratulate you.', '2004-10-06 01:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(944206, 107091, 5822, '<td valign="top">In just a few short seconds this photo has grown on me and I like it very much. Has a historical feel to it.  Cropping is impeccable and the height of the image, as well as, the dark solid earth really give this picture great impact. Very very well done. 10</td>', 'In just a few short seconds this photo has grown on me and I like it very much. Has a historical feel to it.  Cropping is impeccable and the height of the image, as well as, the dark solid earth really give this picture great impact. Very very well done. 10', '2004-10-06 01:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(944209, 107969, 23560, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 6. It''s a great pic and very well executed, but in my personal opinion, I find photos like these quite cliche.</td>', 'I gave you a 6. It''s a great pic and very well executed, but in my personal opinion, I find photos like these quite cliche.', '2004-10-06 01:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(944226, 108233, 5822, '<td valign="top">Clarity and DOF and color are very well done but I think the composition is a bit cluttered. Also,  the exit in the stadium seems to be connected to #8''s head. 6</td>', 'Clarity and DOF and color are very well done but I think the composition is a bit cluttered. Also,  the exit in the stadium seems to be connected to #8''s head. 6', '2004-10-06 01:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
