(944251, 106171, 5822, '<td valign="top">Terrific detail, DOF and color, though I feel this subject with this pose and attitude is a bit hackneyed.  A technical marvel that lacks a new view.  8</td>', 'Terrific detail, DOF and color, though I feel this subject with this pose and attitude is a bit hackneyed.  A technical marvel that lacks a new view.  8', '2004-10-06 01:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
