(945357, 107586, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is amazing. Love the sharp contrast that forces you to look at the boy''s face with just a hint of his ear. The DOF that blurs his hand is also a nice touch. 10</td>', 'This is amazing. Love the sharp contrast that forces you to look at the boy''s face with just a hint of his ear. The DOF that blurs his hand is also a nice touch. 10', '2004-10-06 11:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(945367, 108454, 8054, '<td valign="top">I can almost see the totem poles that could be formed out of these rock "shapes" (for lack of a better word). Contrast is good and I love the deep blue of the sky. It feels a bit oversharpened, however. 7</td>', 'I can almost see the totem poles that could be formed out of these rock "shapes" (for lack of a better word). Contrast is good and I love the deep blue of the sky. It feels a bit oversharpened, however. 7', '2004-10-06 12:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(945369, 109031, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action shot freezing the water drops. The smooth texture of the statue looks like it was processed through Neat Image but I''m probably wrong as marble tends to have that texture. Colors and contrast are excellent. 9</td>', 'Nice stop action shot freezing the water drops. The smooth texture of the statue looks like it was processed through Neat Image but I''m probably wrong as marble tends to have that texture. Colors and contrast are excellent. 9', '2004-10-06 12:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(945373, 107901, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great insect macro study. I think I would have liked to see more details of the dragonfly in sharp focus rather than shallow DOF. That works fine for the flower but not for the dragonfly, imo. Maybe you wanted to force the viewer to look at the head only. 7</td>', 'Great insect macro study. I think I would have liked to see more details of the dragonfly in sharp focus rather than shallow DOF. That works fine for the flower but not for the dragonfly, imo. Maybe you wanted to force the viewer to look at the head only. 7', '2004-10-06 12:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(945477, 103105, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is so precious. I love the softness and the lighting. Emotional impact is great. I do wish we could see the mamas hands though. 10</td>', 'This is so precious. I love the softness and the lighting. Emotional impact is great. I do wish we could see the mamas hands though. 10', '2004-10-06 12:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(945483, 106707, 10263, '<td valign="top">Very striking. Almost like a painting. I love what you did with the sky.. very moody feeling.</td>', 'Very striking. Almost like a painting. I love what you did with the sky.. very moody feeling.', '2004-10-06 12:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(945487, 108984, 26733, '<td valign="top">Fantastic color!</td>', 'Fantastic color!', '2004-10-06 12:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(945488, 104134, 10263, '<td valign="top">Beautiful child. I love her expression.. sweetness with maybe a touch of arrogance. Excellent shot</td>', 'Beautiful child. I love her expression.. sweetness with maybe a touch of arrogance. Excellent shot', '2004-10-06 12:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(945493, 107397, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. I love that it has the feel of a painting. We need a tutorial on this one :)</td>', 'This is wonderful. I love that it has the feel of a painting. We need a tutorial on this one :)', '2004-10-06 12:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(945518, 108275, 10263, '<td valign="top">He looks so intelligent. I like the choice of black and white. The white spots on his lips and chin keep drawing my eyes to them. I think it would have been more effective to remove them.  A little less of a crop on the top would be good too. We almost, but not quite, see the tip of his fur on top. To me thats distracting. Still a great shot though.</td>', 'He looks so intelligent. I like the choice of black and white. The white spots on his lips and chin keep drawing my eyes to them. I think it would have been more effective to remove them.  A little less of a crop on the top would be good too. We almost, but not quite, see the tip of his fur on top. To me thats distracting. Still a great shot though.', '2004-10-06 13:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(945610, 108276, 17291, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. Great job!</td>', 'I love this picture. Great job!', '2004-10-06 13:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(945618, 109019, 17291, '<td valign="top">Great job!</td>', 'Great job!', '2004-10-06 13:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
