(945633, 107020, 17291, '<td valign="top">Great job!</td>', 'Great job!', '2004-10-06 13:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(945642, 107902, 17291, '<td valign="top">Great job!</td>', 'Great job!', '2004-10-06 13:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(945691, 103788, 5746, '<td valign="top">This shot is perfect. The onlz think I could change is to show a little bit more of the object. The lower part looks a bit "unfinished". It end suddenly, but - on the other hand - I have no idea, what was hapenning below. Maybe there was something spoiling the whole composition. Excellent choice of making it a B&amp;W picture.</td>', 'This shot is perfect. The onlz think I could change is to show a little bit more of the object. The lower part looks a bit "unfinished". It end suddenly, but - on the other hand - I have no idea, what was hapenning below. Maybe there was something spoiling the whole composition. Excellent choice of making it a B&W picture.', '2004-10-06 14:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(945696, 107387, 5746, '<td valign="top">The model looks straight into the camera. It looks as if he was posing, not playing actually. I would''ve wait for him to look at the instrument or notes. Great idea with blurring the background - it fits perfectly.</td>', 'The model looks straight into the camera. It looks as if he was posing, not playing actually. I would''ve wait for him to look at the instrument or notes. Great idea with blurring the background - it fits perfectly.', '2004-10-06 14:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(945710, 108875, 5746, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull atmosphere. I would''ve increase saturation a bit. Pink on the sky and the waters is worth it. Great proportions. Congratulations :)</td>', 'Wonderfull atmosphere. I would''ve increase saturation a bit. Pink on the sky and the waters is worth it. Great proportions. Congratulations :)', '2004-10-06 14:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(945718, 102742, 5746, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful model. Brilliant idea, and great execution. I would''ve pose the model differently, so she doesn''t look like standing on one leg, but it''s just such a detail. If I could vote, it would''ve been one of my favourites.</td>', 'What a wonderful model. Brilliant idea, and great execution. I would''ve pose the model differently, so she doesn''t look like standing on one leg, but it''s just such a detail. If I could vote, it would''ve been one of my favourites.', '2004-10-06 14:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(945721, 107599, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice image and great composition. My only complain are the transitional shades which appear pastel magenta and then pastel cyan. This shift affected the greenery. Outside of this, the image has breath, great reflections and the water in the foreground is just grand. Bumping to 6</td>', 'A very nice image and great composition. My only complain are the transitional shades which appear pastel magenta and then pastel cyan. This shift affected the greenery. Outside of this, the image has breath, great reflections and the water in the foreground is just grand. Bumping to 6', '2004-10-06 14:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(945725, 105647, 5746, '<td valign="top">Magnificent building. I would''ve cropped the black area more tightly - make it more panoramic - or leave more of the sky. The sky colour is so intense. I wonder if it''s an original colour?</td>', 'Magnificent building. I would''ve cropped the black area more tightly - make it more panoramic - or leave more of the sky. The sky colour is so intense. I wonder if it''s an original colour?', '2004-10-06 14:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(945733, 108991, 5746, '<td valign="top">The mist looks to me more like blur than real mist. But that IMHO of course. I think it could be a good idea to make a picture of the forrest through the mist. At least a part of it covered by mist - to get more contrast between sharp tops of the trees and their middle/lower  parts softened by mist. Water isn''t nice background for the mist I think. I hope I made myself clear. It''s hard to explain :)</td>', 'The mist looks to me more like blur than real mist. But that IMHO of course. I think it could be a good idea to make a picture of the forrest through the mist. At least a part of it covered by mist - to get more contrast between sharp tops of the trees and their middle/lower  parts softened by mist. Water isn''t nice background for the mist I think. I hope I made myself clear. It''s hard to explain :)', '2004-10-06 14:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(945751, 105190, 5746, '<td valign="top">The cliff silhouette is so dramatic. The low speed effect softens the image too much. I think it would''ve been better without it - but it''s of course my taste. Not necesarily the best taste :)</td>', 'The cliff silhouette is so dramatic. The low speed effect softens the image too much. I think it would''ve been better without it - but it''s of course my taste. Not necesarily the best taste :)', '2004-10-06 14:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(945783, 108269, 5746, '<td valign="top">I looked at it for a long time. I think the white foam on the waves and the strong coloured grass is distracting a bit. I tried to crop it just above the foam and it looks more interesting than, directing my eyes straight to the light. On the other hand, I''m not really sure if my idea is a good one. Just the thought about it.</td>', 'I looked at it for a long time. I think the white foam on the waves and the strong coloured grass is distracting a bit. I tried to crop it just above the foam and it looks more interesting than, directing my eyes straight to the light. On the other hand, I''m not really sure if my idea is a good one. Just the thought about it.', '2004-10-06 14:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(945793, 106171, 5746, '<td valign="top">I wish the bird could look more directly into the camera. I know, it''s hard to convince it :) Terrific detail. Just my personal wish to look straight into it''s eyes.</td>', 'I wish the bird could look more directly into the camera. I know, it''s hard to convince it :) Terrific detail. Just my personal wish to look straight into it''s eyes.', '2004-10-06 14:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(945794, 105966, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice and dramatic with great warm colors against the hint of blue sky. However, something is lost because we are left more with the play of light and dark to paint an effect rather than an image because detail is not available. I would consider, my taste, to capture the flame partly covered rather than fully exposed and allowing a sheer zone 10 display. Again, the image has a moving effect because it conveys activity in the night and it is more a colorful pleasing effect to move the imagination. Bumping up one notch.</td>', 'Very nice and dramatic with great warm colors against the hint of blue sky. However, something is lost because we are left more with the play of light and dark to paint an effect rather than an image because detail is not available. I would consider, my taste, to capture the flame partly covered rather than fully exposed and allowing a sheer zone 10 display. Again, the image has a moving effect because it conveys activity in the night and it is more a colorful pleasing effect to move the imagination. Bumping up one notch.', '2004-10-06 14:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(945803, 107599, 5746, '<td valign="top">I think, I would try a bit different angle - to move with the camera more to the left. Just a bit. I have a filling the left empty space is to big in proportion with busy right side. BTW you have great footprints on the sand on the right. I don''t know what was happening on the right side of the area, but if there was nothing disturbing, the footprints could be exposed a bit more, to add some story behind the picture.</td>', 'I think, I would try a bit different angle - to move with the camera more to the left. Just a bit. I have a filling the left empty space is to big in proportion with busy right side. BTW you have great footprints on the sand on the right. I don''t know what was happening on the right side of the area, but if there was nothing disturbing, the footprints could be exposed a bit more, to add some story behind the picture.', '2004-10-06 14:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(945814, 107901, 5746, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. When backround is so empty, I think the leaves could be more sharp, or the should be something in the background. On the other hand, it''s probably difficult or near to impossible to get sharp image of such model :)</td>', 'Nice macro. When backround is so empty, I think the leaves could be more sharp, or the should be something in the background. On the other hand, it''s probably difficult or near to impossible to get sharp image of such model :)', '2004-10-06 14:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(945820, 106488, 5746, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. I would''ve probably cropped more of the lower part of the image (under the tree), but I''m not sure really. The sky is great and desaturation gave it real "winter look".</td>', 'Excellent image. I would''ve probably cropped more of the lower part of the image (under the tree), but I''m not sure really. The sky is great and desaturation gave it real "winter look".', '2004-10-06 14:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(945827, 108454, 5746, '<td valign="top">The lower left part of the picture - I would''ve cropped it more tightly - close to the smaller totem. Generally - great composition :)</td>', 'The lower left part of the picture - I would''ve cropped it more tightly - close to the smaller totem. Generally - great composition :)', '2004-10-06 14:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(945831, 109008, 5746, '<td valign="top">It''s a perfect model :) A professional look :) Taking advantage of the wonderful colours, I would''ve increase the contrast a bit, to make it''s beak and eyes more black.</td>', 'It''s a perfect model :) A professional look :) Taking advantage of the wonderful colours, I would''ve increase the contrast a bit, to make it''s beak and eyes more black.', '2004-10-06 14:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(945836, 107586, 5746, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull picture. Just the blurred hand is a bit disturbing. The face alone with the shadows on the right would''ve been great.</td>', 'Wonderfull picture. Just the blurred hand is a bit disturbing. The face alone with the shadows on the right would''ve been great.', '2004-10-06 14:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(945840, 107902, 5746, '<td valign="top">Probably it was very colourfull picture. I would love to see it without selective desaturation. Could have more nostalgic look than.</td>', 'Probably it was very colourfull picture. I would love to see it without selective desaturation. Could have more nostalgic look than.', '2004-10-06 14:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(945847, 108269, 6388, '<td valign="top">kind of surreal.  I love the clouds and sunburst, but the grass up front looks a little off...almost like the effect you get when you use shadow/highlight filter in Photoshop, or you over-dodge or something.  not sure what it is.  nice overall effect in the image.  good balance, nicely divided into thirds.  I''d really like to see the original of this.  my guess is you''ve done a lot of work to improve it.<br/>Pedro</td>', 'kind of surreal.  I love the clouds and sunburst, but the grass up front looks a little off...almost like the effect you get when you use shadow/highlight filter in Photoshop, or you over-dodge or something.  not sure what it is.  nice overall effect in the image.  good balance, nicely divided into thirds.  I''d really like to see the original of this.  my guess is you''ve done a lot of work to improve it.Pedro', '2004-10-06 14:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(945851, 108276, 6388, '<td valign="top">So nice.  love the colours.  REALLY love the texture you get from the low sunlight.  the shadows at the bottom in front of the focal tree bug me a little, but that''s a nit-pick.  I love it.  looks like fall near my house.  well done.</td>', 'So nice.  love the colours.  REALLY love the texture you get from the low sunlight.  the shadows at the bottom in front of the focal tree bug me a little, but that''s a nit-pick.  I love it.  looks like fall near my house.  well done.', '2004-10-06 14:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(945861, 107488, 17126, '<td valign="top">wow. striking.</td>', 'wow. striking.', '2004-10-06 14:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(945862, 108072, 6388, '<td valign="top">interesting portrait.  the crop could be a little tighter and still retain enough detail in his surroundings to place him.   a tiny bit of dodging in his face you really bring out the detail; his face has a lot of character, and wants to be recognized :)<br/>nice job.<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'interesting portrait.  the crop could be a little tighter and still retain enough detail in his surroundings to place him.   a tiny bit of dodging in his face you really bring out the detail; his face has a lot of character, and wants to be recognized :)nice job. Pedro', '2004-10-06 14:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(945866, 109013, 17126, '<td valign="top">this is so chill. awesome pic.</td>', 'this is so chill. awesome pic.', '2004-10-06 14:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
