(945874, 102742, 17126, '<td valign="top">Trying to figure out the L, but what an amazing picture. would give it a 10 if i could vote.</td>', 'Trying to figure out the L, but what an amazing picture. would give it a 10 if i could vote.', '2004-10-06 14:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(945875, 106953, 6388, '<td valign="top">very nice.  i think i can see a hint of colour in there...or maybe i''m imagining it.  nice effect, though the pic overall is a little dark for a portrait in my mind.  her face blends into the backdrop a little too much i think.  a little creative dodging would make this a masterpiece.  nice submission...I like it.<br/> <br/>P<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-08 00:23:00.</i></td>', 'very nice.  i think i can see a hint of colour in there...or maybe i''m imagining it.  nice effect, though the pic overall is a little dark for a portrait in my mind.  her face blends into the backdrop a little too much i think.  a little creative dodging would make this a masterpiece.  nice submission...I like it. P', '2004-10-06 14:59:50.000000', '2004-10-08 01:23:00.000000', 1),
(945882, 108122, 17126, '<td valign="top">amazing eyes. lucky chap. :)</td>', 'amazing eyes. lucky chap. :)', '2004-10-06 15:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
