(945918, 103105, 5746, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. Very soft image. Looks more like painting, but I like it. I wish tehere was more detail on the front of the big monkey (lower part of the face and the chest), but then probably image couldn''t be so soft.</td>', 'Great portrait. Very soft image. Looks more like painting, but I like it. I wish tehere was more detail on the front of the big monkey (lower part of the face and the chest), but then probably image couldn''t be so soft.', '2004-10-06 15:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(945923, 108986, 5746, '<td valign="top">I believe the cropping is too tight. But the eyes, the feathers are great. I can see some bluriness on the right side - could be edited.</td>', 'I believe the cropping is too tight. But the eyes, the feathers are great. I can see some bluriness on the right side - could be edited.', '2004-10-06 15:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
