(945972, 107488, 5746, '<td valign="top">It''s probably due to resizing, but it could be sharpened a bit. I like it a lot, it has misterious atmosphere, but I would like to try and leave only the left window with the chair. I wonder how it would come out?</td>', 'It''s probably due to resizing, but it could be sharpened a bit. I like it a lot, it has misterious atmosphere, but I would like to try and leave only the left window with the chair. I wonder how it would come out?', '2004-10-06 15:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
