(946031, 107091, 5746, '<td valign="top">Great title, great concept. The people look so small, like insolent ants, trying to fly. The effect is strenghten by the fact that you left a lot of sky.  I would increase contrast a little bit to make it more dramatic - but I''m not sure about it. Just an idea.</td>', 'Great title, great concept. The people look so small, like insolent ants, trying to fly. The effect is strenghten by the fact that you left a lot of sky.  I would increase contrast a little bit to make it more dramatic - but I''m not sure about it. Just an idea.', '2004-10-06 15:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(946036, 107397, 5746, '<td valign="top">Wow. What an atmosphere! I wish there is a bit more stauration only. Wonderful picture.</td>', 'Wow. What an atmosphere! I wish there is a bit more stauration only. Wonderful picture.', '2004-10-06 15:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(946079, 108767, 489, '<td valign="top">Maybe move the horizon up, significantly, to get the focus on the mist shrouded trees? All that negative space seems to drag the viewer away.</td>', 'Maybe move the horizon up, significantly, to get the focus on the mist shrouded trees? All that negative space seems to drag the viewer away.', '2004-10-06 15:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(946080, 108949, 5746, '<td valign="top">What a look :)<br/>Baboos are probably very high. I wish you left it, it would''ve looked like a jungle, not like a cage like it looks now.</td>', 'What a look :)Baboos are probably very high. I wish you left it, it would''ve looked like a jungle, not like a cage like it looks now.', '2004-10-06 15:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(946084, 108276, 489, '<td valign="top">The sky looks just a lttle too blown out in the left. A bit distracting. I love the color in the trees, though.</td>', 'The sky looks just a lttle too blown out in the left. A bit distracting. I love the color in the trees, though.', '2004-10-06 15:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(946086, 108979, 5746, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution. The middle vase is softer than the others. Maybe more contrast on it?</td>', 'Great idea and execution. The middle vase is softer than the others. Maybe more contrast on it?', '2004-10-06 15:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(946089, 106171, 489, '<td valign="top">Majestic bird. The background seems a little pixelated, though that may be a function of resizing to 640. Good shot.</td>', 'Majestic bird. The background seems a little pixelated, though that may be a function of resizing to 640. Good shot.', '2004-10-06 15:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(946094, 108569, 5746, '<td valign="top">The tree on the left is distracting a bit. I''m not sure if the challenge rules allow erasing it, but if it is so, I would''ve done it.</td>', 'The tree on the left is distracting a bit. I''m not sure if the challenge rules allow erasing it, but if it is so, I would''ve done it.', '2004-10-06 16:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(946095, 107876, 489, '<td valign="top">I think this might have benefitted from just a bit more DOF. It seems to go too soft too quick on the right.</td>', 'I think this might have benefitted from just a bit more DOF. It seems to go too soft too quick on the right.', '2004-10-06 16:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(946101, 106931, 5746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I would just cropped a bit the lower part of the image. The water is relatively too much comparing to the sky. IMO of course.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I would just cropped a bit the lower part of the image. The water is relatively too much comparing to the sky. IMO of course.', '2004-10-06 16:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(946109, 103189, 5746, '<td valign="top">The upper part of the image is soooo heavy. Did you think of leaving the black cloud only and cropping the dark sky above it?</td>', 'The upper part of the image is soooo heavy. Did you think of leaving the black cloud only and cropping the dark sky above it?', '2004-10-06 16:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(946116, 104134, 5746, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. She could look a little bit more to the center. She''s got beautiful eyes. She could also took a different pose, or you could use sightly different angle - without the hand visible.  I would like also  to see it in sepia - she has romantic look, which looks great in sepia.</td>', 'Nice portrait. She could look a little bit more to the center. She''s got beautiful eyes. She could also took a different pose, or you could use sightly different angle - without the hand visible.  I would like also  to see it in sepia - she has romantic look, which looks great in sepia.', '2004-10-06 16:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(946131, 109008, 25388, '<td valign="top">great colors and sharpness and I like the black background; bumping up to 9</td>', 'great colors and sharpness and I like the black background; bumping up to 9', '2004-10-06 16:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(946137, 103615, 5746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful green eyes. I would''ve either leave her face only, or a bit of her figure. The shoulder looks so tiny, and the finger on the tree... Just an idea.</td>', 'Beautiful green eyes. I would''ve either leave her face only, or a bit of her figure. The shoulder looks so tiny, and the finger on the tree... Just an idea.', '2004-10-06 16:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(946142, 109019, 19708, '<td valign="top">An absoute priceless moment captured here. The angle of the eyes is prefect!<br/>The "texture" of the shot works well, giving it an added character.<br/>My favorites in this challenge. Bumping  to a ((10))</td>', 'An absoute priceless moment captured here. The angle of the eyes is prefect!The "texture" of the shot works well, giving it an added character.My favorites in this challenge. Bumping  to a ((10))', '2004-10-06 16:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(946144, 103105, 19708, '<td valign="top">Stunning capture here. The lighting is SUPERB!<br/>Bumping up a notch and one of mytop 5 favorites in this challenge ((9))</td>', 'Stunning capture here. The lighting is SUPERB!Bumping up a notch and one of mytop 5 favorites in this challenge ((9))', '2004-10-06 16:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(946145, 108210, 5746, '<td valign="top">I would''ve try a different angle (more to the right), focus on the beacon alone (and the surrounding trees, which give beautiful framing and contrast to the red r9oof and walls) and cropped the sand.</td>', 'I would''ve try a different angle (more to the right), focus on the beacon alone (and the surrounding trees, which give beautiful framing and contrast to the red r9oof and walls) and cropped the sand.', '2004-10-06 16:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(946147, 108276, 19708, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition &amp; choice of time of day to shoot it.<br/>Looks like the cover of a jigsaw puzzle, and can see this as one.<br/> <br/>Well Done! One of my top 5 favorites in this challenge. Bumping up to ((9))</td>', 'Excellent composition & choice of time of day to shoot it.Looks like the cover of a jigsaw puzzle, and can see this as one. Well Done! One of my top 5 favorites in this challenge. Bumping up to ((9))', '2004-10-06 16:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(946150, 109013, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice story portrayed here. (In Good Hands jumps to mind).<br/>2 boys on a lazy afternoon walk in the country with their Dad. Country, rustic feel.<br/>Just enough touch of civilization with the power lines &amp; pole, yet not distracting.<br/>Well Done ! ((9))</td>', 'Nice story portrayed here. (In Good Hands jumps to mind).2 boys on a lazy afternoon walk in the country with their Dad. Country, rustic feel.Just enough touch of civilization with the power lines & pole, yet not distracting.Well Done ! ((9))', '2004-10-06 16:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(946153, 108767, 19708, '<td valign="top">Stunning image captured here.<br/>Calm, serene. One of my top 5 favorites in this challenge.<br/>Bumping up another notch ((9))</td>', 'Stunning image captured here.Calm, serene. One of my top 5 favorites in this challenge.Bumping up another notch ((9))', '2004-10-06 16:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(946154, 108767, 5746, '<td valign="top">Without the lower part of the image (the path) the picture would''ve been pure magic :) You captured morning mist perfectly!</td>', 'Without the lower part of the image (the path) the picture would''ve been pure magic :) You captured morning mist perfectly!', '2004-10-06 16:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(946158, 107995, 5746, '<td valign="top">It drew my attention instantly. Great idea and execution. I would only use pure gray background if possible. BTW the girl''s outfit fits the image perfectly.</td>', 'It drew my attention instantly. Great idea and execution. I would only use pure gray background if possible. BTW the girl''s outfit fits the image perfectly.', '2004-10-06 16:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(946159, 103619, 19708, '<td valign="top">Not really my kind of shot, but I take my hat (and lens cap) off to you for your creativity and actually making this work. ((8))<br/></td>', 'Not really my kind of shot, but I take my hat (and lens cap) off to you for your creativity and actually making this work. ((8))', '2004-10-06 16:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(946168, 107609, 19708, '<td valign="top">Striking contrasts and great composition. Tone is very suitable for this shot.<br/>Not really sure the title fits to us outsiders, and suspect that there was a cider press nearby.  Well Done. ((8))</td>', 'Striking contrasts and great composition. Tone is very suitable for this shot.Not really sure the title fits to us outsiders, and suspect that there was a cider press nearby.  Well Done. ((8))', '2004-10-06 16:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(946171, 107300, 5746, '<td valign="top">Desaturation round the bride is unnecessary I think or it''s a bit too much. I don''t know how the original looks like, but her face could be sharpened a bit also. It is blurred due to resizing probably. I like her hair in motion.</td>', 'Desaturation round the bride is unnecessary I think or it''s a bit too much. I don''t know how the original looks like, but her face could be sharpened a bit also. It is blurred due to resizing probably. I like her hair in motion.', '2004-10-06 16:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(946175, 105966, 5746, '<td valign="top">I would prefer to see it centered, and more visible the upper part of baloon. It is probably difficult, since there is no much light inside and the night is really dark. Just a thought, since I would''ve been probably unable to make such great night shot :)</td>', 'I would prefer to see it centered, and more visible the upper part of baloon. It is probably difficult, since there is no much light inside and the night is really dark. Just a thought, since I would''ve been probably unable to make such great night shot :)', '2004-10-06 16:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(946176, 105966, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great exposure under very difficult lighting conditions!<br/>Just a hint of sky was perfect for this shot.<br/>Plano festival perhaps? Well Done! ((8))</td>', 'Great exposure under very difficult lighting conditions!Just a hint of sky was perfect for this shot.Plano festival perhaps? Well Done! ((8))', '2004-10-06 16:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(946183, 108537, 5746, '<td valign="top">I wish the background was solid black. I like her hair reflection - she really looks like a movie star. her left arm looks pixelated, probably "thanks" to compression.</td>', 'I wish the background was solid black. I like her hair reflection - she really looks like a movie star. her left arm looks pixelated, probably "thanks" to compression.', '2004-10-06 16:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(946187, 107397, 19708, '<td valign="top">Deep, rich composition here.<br/>Half of me wants to say too dark in some areas, the the other half says no. Perhaps a little unbalanced with it being so much brighter in the center area.<br/>In any case, Well Done ! ((8))</td>', 'Deep, rich composition here.Half of me wants to say too dark in some areas, the the other half says no. Perhaps a little unbalanced with it being so much brighter in the center area.In any case, Well Done ! ((8))', '2004-10-06 16:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(946189, 108832, 5746, '<td valign="top">IMO the lower left corner doesn''t add to the image. Apart from that, great light fiesta!</td>', 'IMO the lower left corner doesn''t add to the image. Apart from that, great light fiesta!', '2004-10-06 16:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(946195, 107969, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great timing &amp; control of the lighting here.<br/>Had to study this a few,then  realizing it''s been inverted.<br/>(hard to stand on my head too - LOL)<br/>Well Done ! ((8))</td>', 'Great timing & control of the lighting here.Had to study this a few,then  realizing it''s been inverted.(hard to stand on my head too - LOL)Well Done ! ((8))', '2004-10-06 16:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(946204, 102660, 19708, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition here. <br/>What strikes me most about this is the eyes. They are perfectly placed in the composition and keep drawing my own eyes to them. Nice tonality.<br/>Bumping up a notch. Well Done! ((9))<br/></td>', 'Beautiful composition here. What strikes me most about this is the eyes. They are perfectly placed in the composition and keep drawing my own eyes to them. Nice tonality.Bumping up a notch. Well Done! ((9))', '2004-10-06 16:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(946210, 108924, 5746, '<td valign="top">What a view!!!<br/>Just the right side (the bright part of it) - I would''ve cropped it.</td>', 'What a view!!!Just the right side (the bright part of it) - I would''ve cropped it.', '2004-10-06 16:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(946213, 108537, 19708, '<td valign="top">Not sure the "Astroturf" appearing vest &amp; chain do much for me here, but this is a stunning image! Wonderful tone used.<br/>Well Done! ((8))</td>', 'Not sure the "Astroturf" appearing vest & chain do much for me here, but this is a stunning image! Wonderful tone used.Well Done! ((8))', '2004-10-06 16:35:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(946217, 106953, 5746, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful woman! Just her right arm - it''s blurred a bit. Maybe it would''ve been better to crop it (than the right side needs cropping too).</td>', 'What a beautiful woman! Just her right arm - it''s blurred a bit. Maybe it would''ve been better to crop it (than the right side needs cropping too).', '2004-10-06 16:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(946229, 107202, 5746, '<td valign="top">Very sexy. I wish there was a story behind it. A reason, why she is bending down. I don''t know: somebodys legs in the first plan (as if she was asked to do it), or she should be picking something from the table, or preparing a meal or a drink. Something like that.</td>', 'Very sexy. I wish there was a story behind it. A reason, why she is bending down. I don''t know: somebodys legs in the first plan (as if she was asked to do it), or she should be picking something from the table, or preparing a meal or a drink. Something like that.', '2004-10-06 16:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(946236, 109013, 5746, '<td valign="top">For such subject I would prefer centered composition. But, on the other hand, I know, that many people doesn''t like it very much. I just feel, that the grass on the right is a bit too much.</td>', 'For such subject I would prefer centered composition. But, on the other hand, I know, that many people doesn''t like it very much. I just feel, that the grass on the right is a bit too much.', '2004-10-06 16:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(946242, 108072, 5746, '<td valign="top">Why have you cropped him so tight? A Kozak without a horse? But it''s a wonderful model, great clarity and colours. I wonder where did you find real Kozak those days :)</td>', 'Why have you cropped him so tight? A Kozak without a horse? But it''s a wonderful model, great clarity and colours. I wonder where did you find real Kozak those days :)', '2004-10-06 16:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(946247, 107969, 5746, '<td valign="top">What a great shot! Looks like a magic lamp. I wish it was centered, but I''m a "centered maniac". Never mind :)</td>', 'What a great shot! Looks like a magic lamp. I wish it was centered, but I''m a "centered maniac". Never mind :)', '2004-10-06 16:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(946253, 108872, 5746, '<td valign="top">It''s perfect. I''m not sure if the motive on the left is painted, or hangt, or added during processing? Maybe leaving it out or leaving more context would''ve help? The window alone on the yellow wall is wonderful.</td>', 'It''s perfect. I''m not sure if the motive on the left is painted, or hangt, or added during processing? Maybe leaving it out or leaving more context would''ve help? The window alone on the yellow wall is wonderful.', '2004-10-06 16:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(946275, 108173, 5746, '<td valign="top">I think, that its head only, would give an interesting "alien" effect.</td>', 'I think, that its head only, would give an interesting "alien" effect.', '2004-10-06 16:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(946283, 108984, 5746, '<td valign="top">Pepper comes in many colours. Use it :) Or... why not to show whole pepper. It''s shape is intersting, and the light will bring out different shades of red.</td>', 'Pepper comes in many colours. Use it :) Or... why not to show whole pepper. It''s shape is intersting, and the light will bring out different shades of red.', '2004-10-06 17:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(946290, 108275, 5746, '<td valign="top">Great face expression. You really captured him :)<br/>I think cropping is a bit too much in the upper part, but only a little bit.</td>', 'Great face expression. You really captured him :)I think cropping is a bit too much in the upper part, but only a little bit.', '2004-10-06 17:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(946299, 108233, 5746, '<td valign="top">I was waiting for their legs to show... than it''s over. Suddenly. I think you could try to leave their legs and the man on the right hands. It wouldve add dynamism to the scene.</td>', 'I was waiting for their legs to show... than it''s over. Suddenly. I think you could try to leave their legs and the man on the right hands. It wouldve add dynamism to the scene.', '2004-10-06 17:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(946307, 108642, 5746, '<td valign="top">It has an impressionist look and fill of Degas paintings. I love it. I love the natural framing by the plants and shadows. I only wish the frame was complete (the lacking element in the lower left corner, or - the plants on the left could be cropped a litlle more (the make the left side visibly heavier than the right one).</td>', 'It has an impressionist look and fill of Degas paintings. I love it. I love the natural framing by the plants and shadows. I only wish the frame was complete (the lacking element in the lower left corner, or - the plants on the left could be cropped a litlle more (the make the left side visibly heavier than the right one).', '2004-10-06 17:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(946318, 108276, 5746, '<td valign="top">Yes, that is the real golden Autumn. Just the heavy shadow in the lower part of the image gives strong contrast, without which I think the picture would''ve been more optymistic. But... it doesn''t have to be optymistic (especially with the dark cloud above), does it?</td>', 'Yes, that is the real golden Autumn. Just the heavy shadow in the lower part of the image gives strong contrast, without which I think the picture would''ve been more optymistic. But... it doesn''t have to be optymistic (especially with the dark cloud above), does it?', '2004-10-06 17:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(946329, 102660, 5746, '<td valign="top">The cropping is a bit too harsh to me. I would''ve either desaturate it completely, or make her eyes more blue. They look a bit too gray to me (and she probably has beautiful blue eyes).</td>', 'The cropping is a bit too harsh to me. I would''ve either desaturate it completely, or make her eyes more blue. They look a bit too gray to me (and she probably has beautiful blue eyes).', '2004-10-06 17:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(946339, 104030, 5746, '<td valign="top">It''s perfect for centered composition. Especially the rock looks "bend" into oval. Wonderful detail and colours. Beautiful location :)</td>', 'It''s perfect for centered composition. Especially the rock looks "bend" into oval. Wonderful detail and colours. Beautiful location :)', '2004-10-06 17:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(946347, 107609, 5746, '<td valign="top">At first I thought the shadow is too deep - especially on his face. After the second look I like it a lot. Moving the model to the most left side is a great idea :)</td>', 'At first I thought the shadow is too deep - especially on his face. After the second look I like it a lot. Moving the model to the most left side is a great idea :)', '2004-10-06 17:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(946349, 109014, 5746, '<td valign="top">What a nice bird. I wish the background gives more contrast, but I guess it would''ve been difficult too convince the bird to change location and stay still :)</td>', 'What a nice bird. I wish the background gives more contrast, but I guess it would''ve been difficult too convince the bird to change location and stay still :)', '2004-10-06 17:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(946355, 108122, 5746, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful shining eyes!<br/>The cropping is too tight (IMO) and there is some blur on his shoulder, but it doesn''t disturb me much. Just the cropping.</td>', 'What a wonderful shining eyes!The cropping is too tight (IMO) and there is some blur on his shoulder, but it doesn''t disturb me much. Just the cropping.', '2004-10-06 17:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(946362, 107020, 5746, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Absolutely.<br/>I would just leave it without a frame, but it''s a meaningless detail.</td>', 'Stunning. Absolutely.I would just leave it without a frame, but it''s a meaningless detail.', '2004-10-06 17:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(946371, 108940, 5746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture. I wish the background was green (to make it more "spring-like"), but nevertheless great picture and lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful picture. I wish the background was green (to make it more "spring-like"), but nevertheless great picture and lighting.', '2004-10-06 17:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(946569, 109019, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very sweet shot.  I love the expression  and also the muted tones of the shot.  Very nice treatment.  The one little bubble is the perfect touch.</td>', 'Very sweet shot.  I love the expression  and also the muted tones of the shot.  Very nice treatment.  The one little bubble is the perfect touch.', '2004-10-06 19:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(946572, 106953, 14620, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  Perfect clarity and the eyes just pop against the darkness of the shot.  Exotic model and great composition.</td>', 'Wonderful!  Perfect clarity and the eyes just pop against the darkness of the shot.  Exotic model and great composition.', '2004-10-06 19:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(946591, 103615, 3799, '<td valign="top">good photo but the blown out highlight on the hair is distracting 6</td>', 'good photo but the blown out highlight on the hair is distracting 6', '2004-10-06 19:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(946625, 104134, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait study. Excellent details and lighting is also very nice but maybe a bit bright on her forehead. Would like to see a bit more contrast. 7</td>', 'Very nice portrait study. Excellent details and lighting is also very nice but maybe a bit bright on her forehead. Would like to see a bit more contrast. 7', '2004-10-06 19:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(946626, 108875, 8054, '<td valign="top">The volumetric lighting is very nice and very subtle. However, I see lots of noise in the shadow area just below the stream of light and maybe even in the grassy area. Or maybe it was just overprocessed in Neat Image. 5</td>', 'The volumetric lighting is very nice and very subtle. However, I see lots of noise in the shadow area just below the stream of light and maybe even in the grassy area. Or maybe it was just overprocessed in Neat Image. 5', '2004-10-06 19:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(946631, 107202, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great shot, DrJOnes! Or at least it looks like oone you would enter. Love the DOF although nt very shallow but I like it. It shows items you''d find in a house like the bar. Would have been really good if the maid had a feather duster. Great skin tones and even lighting. 9</td>', 'Great shot, DrJOnes! Or at least it looks like oone you would enter. Love the DOF although nt very shallow but I like it. It shows items you''d find in a house like the bar. Would have been really good if the maid had a feather duster. Great skin tones and even lighting. 9', '2004-10-06 19:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(946633, 107995, 23956, '<td valign="top">A rather large stripe down the side of her left arm has been desaturated. Otherwise, excellent!</td>', 'A rather large stripe down the side of her left arm has been desaturated. Otherwise, excellent!', '2004-10-06 19:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(946638, 108537, 23956, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but unfortunately my first thought was that her vest looks like a toilet rug. The texture is probably a bit too fuzzy for the sort of glowing soft focus effect you employed for this shot. I might also have put the end of the gun barrel in the center of the circle of light on the background, rather than have it end on the edge of her skin.</td>', 'Great shot, but unfortunately my first thought was that her vest looks like a toilet rug. The texture is probably a bit too fuzzy for the sort of glowing soft focus effect you employed for this shot. I might also have put the end of the gun barrel in the center of the circle of light on the background, rather than have it end on the edge of her skin.', '2004-10-06 20:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(946668, 108767, 23956, '<td valign="top">Better without the bottom fifth of the image.</td>', 'Better without the bottom fifth of the image.', '2004-10-06 20:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(946679, 107902, 23956, '<td valign="top">Nice desaturation/coloration, it really gives each of the colored items its own significance. Well done.</td>', 'Nice desaturation/coloration, it really gives each of the colored items its own significance. Well done.', '2004-10-06 20:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(946700, 107969, 23956, '<td valign="top">I might have called this "Kiwi Cloud" or "Atomic Kiwi" or perhaps "the K Bomb". Very nicely done, although I wonder why it was necesary to blur the background. The highlights are so vivid that I''d think that green would be neutral enough without extra attention.</td>', 'I might have called this "Kiwi Cloud" or "Atomic Kiwi" or perhaps "the K Bomb". Very nicely done, although I wonder why it was necesary to blur the background. The highlights are so vivid that I''d think that green would be neutral enough without extra attention.', '2004-10-06 20:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(946720, 108979, 26975, '<td valign="top">I want to know how this is done</td>', 'I want to know how this is done', '2004-10-06 20:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(946721, 108897, 23956, '<td valign="top">Photographically excellent, but the pastels and neutrals of the dried eucalyptus (and whatever those blue things are) seems to me to clash badly with the strong geometrics of her scarf.  I''m sure your choice of props was intentional, this being a studio shot, but to a casual viewer it just doesn''t fit. The stool is fine, but I''d definitely lose the other stuff on this shot.</td>', 'Photographically excellent, but the pastels and neutrals of the dried eucalyptus (and whatever those blue things are) seems to me to clash badly with the strong geometrics of her scarf.  I''m sure your choice of props was intentional, this being a studio shot, but to a casual viewer it just doesn''t fit. The stool is fine, but I''d definitely lose the other stuff on this shot.', '2004-10-06 20:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(946750, 108991, 6388, '<td valign="top">fabulous.  I did a whole series like this in the early spring, and it''s still my favourite style.  a little hot in the upper right, which can be avoided it you expose for the white point (the brightest part) and dodge the rest of the photo up to it.  As it stands the bright part overshadows (pardon the pun) the rest of the picture.  Unless of course you wanted it like that, then forget everything i said.  that''s just how I''d have done it :)<br/> <br/>P-ness</td>', 'fabulous.  I did a whole series like this in the early spring, and it''s still my favourite style.  a little hot in the upper right, which can be avoided it you expose for the white point (the brightest part) and dodge the rest of the photo up to it.  As it stands the bright part overshadows (pardon the pun) the rest of the picture.  Unless of course you wanted it like that, then forget everything i said.  that''s just how I''d have done it :) P-ness', '2004-10-06 20:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(946758, 108454, 6388, '<td valign="top">Arizona or Utah?  ok maybe nevada.  i think AZ.  anyway - the composition is decent, though i think the bigger of the two peaks is cramped at the top...maybe a little more of that beautiful blue sky would open it up some.  Nice DOF and tonal range...perfect exposure.<br/> <br/>P-ness.</td>', 'Arizona or Utah?  ok maybe nevada.  i think AZ.  anyway - the composition is decent, though i think the bigger of the two peaks is cramped at the top...maybe a little more of that beautiful blue sky would open it up some.  Nice DOF and tonal range...perfect exposure. P-ness.', '2004-10-06 20:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
