(946949, 107609, 16148, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  My number one pick for this challenge.  Wonderful composition and use of negative space.  Good luck.</td>', 'Excellent!  My number one pick for this challenge.  Wonderful composition and use of negative space.  Good luck.', '2004-10-06 22:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(946960, 105647, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting, interesting blue sky. Almost seems unnatural, but I''m sure that''s very close to how your camera caught it. The lights on the left are a bit distracting, but I don''t know if there was something on the right that was even worse. I wonder what a vertical layout would look like. Looks like this shot used a slow shutter speed, well done.</td>', 'Lovely lighting, interesting blue sky. Almost seems unnatural, but I''m sure that''s very close to how your camera caught it. The lights on the left are a bit distracting, but I don''t know if there was something on the right that was even worse. I wonder what a vertical layout would look like. Looks like this shot used a slow shutter speed, well done.', '2004-10-06 22:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(946979, 104030, 9668, '<td valign="top">Love the luminescent trees. Green seems a tad oversaturated, but slow shutter speed usaully brings out more color.  Lovely water fall, I''m such a sucker for shots like this. Well done.</td>', 'Love the luminescent trees. Green seems a tad oversaturated, but slow shutter speed usaully brings out more color.  Lovely water fall, I''m such a sucker for shots like this. Well done.', '2004-10-06 22:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(946982, 102660, 9668, '<td valign="top">I do notice that the only color saturated part is her eyes, lovely tone color. Great portrait, looks natural.</td>', 'I do notice that the only color saturated part is her eyes, lovely tone color. Great portrait, looks natural.', '2004-10-06 22:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(946995, 109008, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems a bit harsh. Lovely macro shot. Title could be a bit more original, but it describes the subject well.</td>', 'Lighting seems a bit harsh. Lovely macro shot. Title could be a bit more original, but it describes the subject well.', '2004-10-06 22:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(947047, 108275, 9668, '<td valign="top">I love the eyes in this shot. They really convey the thoughts/emotion of the gorilla.</td>', 'I love the eyes in this shot. They really convey the thoughts/emotion of the gorilla.', '2004-10-06 22:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(947064, 107876, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lovely food shot. I like the soft lighting, excellent use of DOF, focused on the strawberry. Interesting masters entry, but I like that it is not a landscape or a portrait.</td>', 'Lovely food shot. I like the soft lighting, excellent use of DOF, focused on the strawberry. Interesting masters entry, but I like that it is not a landscape or a portrait.', '2004-10-06 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(947075, 104027, 9668, '<td valign="top">My guess is that this is a shot by Konador, but I could be totally wrong. The black curve on the top left distacts me, although there may not have been a better angle to shoot from.  This shot has alot of depth to it, all leading to the black spot.</td>', 'My guess is that this is a shot by Konador, but I could be totally wrong. The black curve on the top left distacts me, although there may not have been a better angle to shoot from.  This shot has alot of depth to it, all leading to the black spot.', '2004-10-06 23:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(947081, 107901, 24805, '<td valign="top">i can''t vote, but i think this guy should win. the color and shape composition are incredible. DOF is good and everything that needs focus is crystal clear. the pose (it sounds strange to talke about insects posing) does a good job of pulling the eye through the picture. good work. keep it up!</td>', 'i can''t vote, but i think this guy should win. the color and shape composition are incredible. DOF is good and everything that needs focus is crystal clear. the pose (it sounds strange to talke about insects posing) does a good job of pulling the eye through the picture. good work. keep it up!', '2004-10-06 23:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(947087, 108979, 24805, '<td valign="top">great concept. the composition is good, not incredible, and the image quality feels a little interpolated. keep experimenting like this though, it''s always good to see something fresh!</td>', 'great concept. the composition is good, not incredible, and the image quality feels a little interpolated. keep experimenting like this though, it''s always good to see something fresh!', '2004-10-06 23:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(947090, 107586, 24805, '<td valign="top">so close to perfect! the hand in the bottom left is really distracting, but everything else is incredible: expression, lighting, technical execution, composition, etc. keep it up!</td>', 'so close to perfect! the hand in the bottom left is really distracting, but everything else is incredible: expression, lighting, technical execution, composition, etc. keep it up!', '2004-10-06 23:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(947091, 102742, 24805, '<td valign="top">visually this image is outstanding. the concept feels a bit trite. i think it would work better if it were just "peace" without the "L." i really appreciate teh creativity and technical quality, however. keep it up!</td>', 'visually this image is outstanding. the concept feels a bit trite. i think it would work better if it were just "peace" without the "L." i really appreciate teh creativity and technical quality, however. keep it up!', '2004-10-06 23:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(947095, 102742, 17203, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept and execution. I like the color choice, the use of selective desaturation (rare for me), and the simple composition. Looks like a Sonifo shot. (9)</td>', 'Excellent concept and execution. I like the color choice, the use of selective desaturation (rare for me), and the simple composition. Looks like a Sonifo shot. (9)', '2004-10-06 23:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(947097, 108642, 9668, '<td valign="top">Love the expession on her face. The girl in the back adds a lot of depth to this shot. I also like the lumenescent lighting, shadows on the right are a bit distracting.</td>', 'Love the expession on her face. The girl in the back adds a lot of depth to this shot. I also like the lumenescent lighting, shadows on the right are a bit distracting.', '2004-10-06 23:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
