(947187, 107586, 17203, '<td valign="top">Very expressive. I don''t think you''d lose anything by cropping out the blurry hand.</td>', 'Very expressive. I don''t think you''d lose anything by cropping out the blurry hand.', '2004-10-07 00:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(947200, 107902, 17203, '<td valign="top">One of the best examples of selective desaturation I''ve seen. Nice job!</td>', 'One of the best examples of selective desaturation I''ve seen. Nice job!', '2004-10-07 00:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(947202, 107902, 13772, '<td valign="top">I like the desaturation and the old time feel of this photo. The balance of how everything hung on the wall and around is so amazing. I think this would be better with a tighter crop focusing on the gas tanks, to include the skull. Nice work and hope you do well!   7</td>', 'I like the desaturation and the old time feel of this photo. The balance of how everything hung on the wall and around is so amazing. I think this would be better with a tighter crop focusing on the gas tanks, to include the skull. Nice work and hope you do well!   7', '2004-10-07 00:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(947203, 107995, 17203, '<td valign="top">Outstanding creativity. The blue ribbon really picks up the color in her eyes. (12) ;-)</td>', 'Outstanding creativity. The blue ribbon really picks up the color in her eyes. (12) ;-)', '2004-10-07 00:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(947212, 108872, 13772, '<td valign="top">This is a well done photo. The only thing is that I find my eye wondering to the sun on the wall instead of the window which is what I think you want the viewer to focus on. Maybe try cloning out the sun and decore around it and see how it looks. Just a suggestion. I feel this would be a great negative space picture. Good job.  5</td>', 'This is a well done photo. The only thing is that I find my eye wondering to the sun on the wall instead of the window which is what I think you want the viewer to focus on. Maybe try cloning out the sun and decore around it and see how it looks. Just a suggestion. I feel this would be a great negative space picture. Good job.  5', '2004-10-07 00:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(947217, 109019, 13772, '<td valign="top">Great capture! I like the way she is looking at the bubbles and the over all feeling I get. The softness of the photo is nice. Great job and good luck!   9</td>', 'Great capture! I like the way she is looking at the bubbles and the over all feeling I get. The softness of the photo is nice. Great job and good luck!   9', '2004-10-07 00:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
