(947235, 108991, 13772, '<td valign="top">To me this photo is not all that appealing. I like the shadows in the water and front or lower part but the back looks a little too over processed for me. I would like to see it in color. Nice work and good luck.   5</td>', 'To me this photo is not all that appealing. I like the shadows in the water and front or lower part but the back looks a little too over processed for me. I would like to see it in color. Nice work and good luck.   5', '2004-10-07 00:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(947244, 108269, 13772, '<td valign="top">Wow the sun is really coming through those clouds. Looks like one heck of a storm coming. The picture seems a little soft to me and I would like to see a little more detail. i hope that makes since?  Nice work.   5</td>', 'Wow the sun is really coming through those clouds. Looks like one heck of a storm coming. The picture seems a little soft to me and I would like to see a little more detail. i hope that makes since?  Nice work.   5', '2004-10-07 00:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
