(947253, 109008, 10275, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail all over. The colour is superb. However the eye should be the most sharpest point of the image and it just isn''t. That is the only tiny flaw. The photo is otherwise great.</td>', 'Amazing detail all over. The colour is superb. However the eye should be the most sharpest point of the image and it just isn''t. That is the only tiny flaw. The photo is otherwise great.', '2004-10-07 00:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
