(947363, 108991, 8054, '<td valign="top">Love the duotone and the slight rose tint in the upper right. Hard to tell if you applied a soft focus of if it was passed through Neat Image a bit too much. I think the latter after closer inspection of the tree leaves as they feel overprocessed to me and/or out of focus. That''s too bad because had the leaves been in focus and not as processed, I probably would have given this a 10. 6</td>', 'Love the duotone and the slight rose tint in the upper right. Hard to tell if you applied a soft focus of if it was passed through Neat Image a bit too much. I think the latter after closer inspection of the tree leaves as they feel overprocessed to me and/or out of focus. That''s too bad because had the leaves been in focus and not as processed, I probably would have given this a 10. 6', '2004-10-07 01:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
