(947367, 106931, 23394, '<td valign="top">simply stunning.  what a wonderful place to be.  love how the lines pull you in and lead you around.  this is the type of image you can look at for a while and never get tired of being there.  thanks for the trip!</td>', 'simply stunning.  what a wonderful place to be.  love how the lines pull you in and lead you around.  this is the type of image you can look at for a while and never get tired of being there.  thanks for the trip!', '2004-10-07 01:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(947368, 106488, 22734, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image with this giamt tree as the subject and the human evidence to give a sense of size. This is great. The sky is simply fabulous.  Yes, the title indicates a golf course, seems such beauty should never be made available to any sport. Bumping up two notches.</td>', 'A beautiful image with this giamt tree as the subject and the human evidence to give a sense of size. This is great. The sky is simply fabulous.  Yes, the title indicates a golf course, seems such beauty should never be made available to any sport. Bumping up two notches.', '2004-10-07 01:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(947369, 103788, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is an image with that rustic feel of the deep blue seas. The angle brings to mind those pirate movues where the music thunders as the camera is raised. The sky here proved very opportuned to give it that grit and sense of great expanse. I adore sepia and this subject lends itself for the overall effect. Great angle. You have my 8</td>', 'This is an image with that rustic feel of the deep blue seas. The angle brings to mind those pirate movues where the music thunders as the camera is raised. The sky here proved very opportuned to give it that grit and sense of great expanse. I adore sepia and this subject lends itself for the overall effect. Great angle. You have my 8', '2004-10-07 01:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(947371, 108072, 8054, '<td valign="top">Alright, I must be ignorant because I have no idea what a Kozak is but I will give you the benefit of the doubt that the man in the picture is an accurate representation. Very sharp details. Contrast is excellent for the most part (shirt has bright spots) as are the colors. I really like how I can see individual hairs of the horse''s mane and the wrinkles of the skin on the man''s hand. I could go on. Excellent work. Minus half a point for the man not looking at the camera but I''ll round up. 9</td>', 'Alright, I must be ignorant because I have no idea what a Kozak is but I will give you the benefit of the doubt that the man in the picture is an accurate representation. Very sharp details. Contrast is excellent for the most part (shirt has bright spots) as are the colors. I really like how I can see individual hairs of the horse''s mane and the wrinkles of the skin on the man''s hand. I could go on. Excellent work. Minus half a point for the man not looking at the camera but I''ll round up. 9', '2004-10-07 01:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(947372, 106171, 8054, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t really like centered photographs for creative content such as DPC challenges but this one works very well. The background is well muted and not distracting. Details are superb and very clear. Excellent photo! My only complaint is the border. Such a magnificent bird almost plays second fiddle to a thick border. I would have preferred a thinner border if any at all. 9</td>', 'Normally I don''t really like centered photographs for creative content such as DPC challenges but this one works very well. The background is well muted and not distracting. Details are superb and very clear. Excellent photo! My only complaint is the border. Such a magnificent bird almost plays second fiddle to a thick border. I would have preferred a thinner border if any at all. 9', '2004-10-07 01:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(947374, 108642, 8054, '<td valign="top">A very good action shot of children at play. But his photo lacks balance and symmetry. The bench does not have its equal on the right side. Same with the bush on the left although it at least has shadows on the right but not enough to balance out. I think it would have been better if those shadows on the right and the branches on the left were cropped out or at least arranged better. 6</td>', 'A very good action shot of children at play. But his photo lacks balance and symmetry. The bench does not have its equal on the right side. Same with the bush on the left although it at least has shadows on the right but not enough to balance out. I think it would have been better if those shadows on the right and the branches on the left were cropped out or at least arranged better. 6', '2004-10-07 01:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(947375, 106707, 23394, '<td valign="top">boy, what a dilemma...this image is just like another one of my favorites, and now i can''t decide if i like the red one better than the blue one.  i think the red/orange is just a little too overpowering.  this gives the feeling of imminent hell, where the other one, while also dark, seems to offer hope.<br/> <br/>(i''ll tell you what, it''s downright freaky to open up two explorer windows to dpc and toggle back and forth rapidly between the two images...have you done that?)</td>', 'boy, what a dilemma...this image is just like another one of my favorites, and now i can''t decide if i like the red one better than the blue one.  i think the red/orange is just a little too overpowering.  this gives the feeling of imminent hell, where the other one, while also dark, seems to offer hope. (i''ll tell you what, it''s downright freaky to open up two explorer windows to dpc and toggle back and forth rapidly between the two images...have you done that?)', '2004-10-07 01:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(947377, 109019, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very cute! It''s almost as if she''s distracted by the single bubble just enough to lose concentration on the task at hand (making more bubbles). I also see noise along with your soft focus. 6</td>', 'Very cute! It''s almost as if she''s distracted by the single bubble just enough to lose concentration on the task at hand (making more bubbles). I also see noise along with your soft focus. 6', '2004-10-07 01:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
