(947379, 107202, 23394, '<td valign="top">where''s the feather duster?  i mean, what''s a maid if she doesn''t have all the tools?  great capture.  btw, can i get her number.  i''m sure my wife will be ecstatic when i tell her i''ve found a new maid!</td>', 'where''s the feather duster?  i mean, what''s a maid if she doesn''t have all the tools?  great capture.  btw, can i get her number.  i''m sure my wife will be ecstatic when i tell her i''ve found a new maid!', '2004-10-07 02:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(947381, 107091, 8054, '<td valign="top">Maybe this man had grand dreams of flying into the sky suggested by the negative space.Other than that, I just see five people working to get a glider into the air. Composition is good by putting the negative space in front of the glider (mostly). 6</td>', 'Maybe this man had grand dreams of flying into the sky suggested by the negative space.Other than that, I just see five people working to get a glider into the air. Composition is good by putting the negative space in front of the glider (mostly). 6', '2004-10-07 02:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(947382, 102742, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a wonderful shot, one of my favorites for the challenge.  it really brings home the naive promise of hope that is necessary for our survival.  if only we could let children rule the world...</td>', 'what a wonderful shot, one of my favorites for the challenge.  it really brings home the naive promise of hope that is necessary for our survival.  if only we could let children rule the world...', '2004-10-07 02:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(947383, 109013, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know why, but i feel i''ve been on this road before...<br/> <br/>beautiful capture, really like the duo-toes.  composition is flawless and the image is timeless.  great job!  one of my top picks for the challenge.</td>', 'i don''t know why, but i feel i''ve been on this road before... beautiful capture, really like the duo-toes.  composition is flawless and the image is timeless.  great job!  one of my top picks for the challenge.', '2004-10-07 02:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(947384, 108986, 8054, '<td valign="top">I wonder if wet owl smells like wet dog. Anyway, great close up shot but I see noise and color seems a bit towards blue. 6</td>', 'I wonder if wet owl smells like wet dog. Anyway, great close up shot but I see noise and color seems a bit towards blue. 6', '2004-10-07 02:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(947385, 108924, 22734, '<td valign="top">The big breast panorama. This is intriguing but the vermillion- orange poses an immeduate sense of incongruity. Is this smoke rather than clouds? Because if this orange formation is at the same level as the clouds of blue-grey sky then this can not be.  For example, the transition never goes from vermillion to deep royal blue while the clouds are within close proximity.  Of course fog rising can do this because it is on a differemnt plane.  Another mystery is the pure yellow and cyan on the bottom right. <br/> <br/>Certainly a strong image with the silhouette and while I will blame the pure yellow and cyan to a ps color shift, I will give the artist the benefit of the doubt about the vermillion coiuds. Bumping up.</td>', 'The big breast panorama. This is intriguing but the vermillion- orange poses an immeduate sense of incongruity. Is this smoke rather than clouds? Because if this orange formation is at the same level as the clouds of blue-grey sky then this can not be.  For example, the transition never goes from vermillion to deep royal blue while the clouds are within close proximity.  Of course fog rising can do this because it is on a differemnt plane.  Another mystery is the pure yellow and cyan on the bottom right.  Certainly a strong image with the silhouette and while I will blame the pure yellow and cyan to a ps color shift, I will give the artist the benefit of the doubt about the vermillion coiuds. Bumping up.', '2004-10-07 02:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(947386, 108276, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is gorgeous!  we''re still waiting for our leaves to turn, and until then, this is what i''m looking at!  great composition and use of lighting.  you really captured the moment.  the detail is tremendous.  one of my top picks for the challenge.  good luck!</td>', 'this is gorgeous!  we''re still waiting for our leaves to turn, and until then, this is what i''m looking at!  great composition and use of lighting.  you really captured the moment.  the detail is tremendous.  one of my top picks for the challenge.  good luck!', '2004-10-07 02:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(947388, 104030, 23394, '<td valign="top">i have no clue why this image needed to be validated...it comes across to me as a simply beautiful image.  great capture.  it really pulls you into a peaceful place.  i bet you really enjoyed being there after you made your image.  one of my top picks for the challenge.  good luck!</td>', 'i have no clue why this image needed to be validated...it comes across to me as a simply beautiful image.  great capture.  it really pulls you into a peaceful place.  i bet you really enjoyed being there after you made your image.  one of my top picks for the challenge.  good luck!', '2004-10-07 02:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
