(947414, 103105, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a moment to capture.  love the lighting, but really love their expressions.  great job!</td>', 'what a moment to capture.  love the lighting, but really love their expressions.  great job!', '2004-10-07 02:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(947416, 107969, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a wild shot.  can''t wait to find out how you did it.  can''t say if the blue in the back takes away from the overall cohesiveness of the image or not.</td>', 'this is a wild shot.  can''t wait to find out how you did it.  can''t say if the blue in the back takes away from the overall cohesiveness of the image or not.', '2004-10-07 02:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(947420, 103615, 23394, '<td valign="top">lovely image.  wish her hair wasn''t so blown out, as well as the sky behind the trees.  this would probably be stronger with a different background and less direct sunlight.</td>', 'lovely image.  wish her hair wasn''t so blown out, as well as the sky behind the trees.  this would probably be stronger with a different background and less direct sunlight.', '2004-10-07 02:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(947447, 106488, 23394, '<td valign="top">what an incredible image.  the detail is simply stunning.</td>', 'what an incredible image.  the detail is simply stunning.', '2004-10-07 02:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(947449, 107488, 22734, '<td valign="top">This images is great. A high ceiling, gown like curtains with backlight, in this case, outside light. The tones are just smooth. Many amateurs fail with this image because they forget the importance of holding the camera''s sensor parallel to the wall. It has a much classier feel then Hotel California. While this image is a great mood setter, it gives the viewer no distinct  sense of texture. It is beautiful and leaving a lot to the imagination. Bumping up to 7</td>', 'This images is great. A high ceiling, gown like curtains with backlight, in this case, outside light. The tones are just smooth. Many amateurs fail with this image because they forget the importance of holding the camera''s sensor parallel to the wall. It has a much classier feel then Hotel California. While this image is a great mood setter, it gives the viewer no distinct  sense of texture. It is beautiful and leaving a lot to the imagination. Bumping up to 7', '2004-10-07 02:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(947463, 107969, 22734, '<td valign="top">It is very sad that even in the master''s challenge, the overall technique of many members is so wanting that they question an effect to contradict with validation what their comprehension denies them. Do these members really believe that an entrant would risk their reputation to suffer a DQ? Please, look at more pictures daily and at least extend the courtesy of the doubt.<br/> <br/>This image has a very strong visaul impact, but its greatmess is not rooted in art but a deftly and lethal technique whose output creates a sci-fi effect. great.<br/> <br/></td>', 'It is very sad that even in the master''s challenge, the overall technique of many members is so wanting that they question an effect to contradict with validation what their comprehension denies them. Do these members really believe that an entrant would risk their reputation to suffer a DQ? Please, look at more pictures daily and at least extend the courtesy of the doubt. This image has a very strong visaul impact, but its greatmess is not rooted in art but a deftly and lethal technique whose output creates a sci-fi effect. great. ', '2004-10-07 03:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(947480, 105190, 15407, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo, it even inspires for me the sounds &amp; smell of the ocean.  My ONLY nitpick, There seem to be places that appear slightly over sharpened, the larger rocks at the right upper 2/3''s of the shore and the outline of the rocky bluff at the top right. All in all I like it very much -</td>', 'A beautiful photo, it even inspires for me the sounds & smell of the ocean.  My ONLY nitpick, There seem to be places that appear slightly over sharpened, the larger rocks at the right upper 2/3''s of the shore and the outline of the rocky bluff at the top right. All in all I like it very much -', '2004-10-07 03:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(947484, 108537, 15407, '<td valign="top">Its such a nice shot except for the ''gun''.  It looks like a stapel gun to me. Some of the guns I''ve seen on the sight that look like pieces of art &amp; if the gun she was holding looked as fine as she does I would have voted it up a point.</td>', 'Its such a nice shot except for the ''gun''.  It looks like a stapel gun to me. Some of the guns I''ve seen on the sight that look like pieces of art & if the gun she was holding looked as fine as she does I would have voted it up a point.', '2004-10-07 03:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(947489, 107300, 15407, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  What a challenge to have the beautiful bride standout from the background. I like they way you blended into the transistion of the framing.</td>', 'Very well done.  What a challenge to have the beautiful bride standout from the background. I like they way you blended into the transistion of the framing.', '2004-10-07 03:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(947493, 107995, 15407, '<td valign="top">A great idea and done nearly to perfection !</td>', 'A great idea and done nearly to perfection !', '2004-10-07 04:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(947516, 103219, 15407, '<td valign="top">This was a real ringer for me in this challenge many others have a completely different wow factor.  Was that what you were trying to achieve?  The Essence for me evoked PURE sensuality!  So beautiful are each and every line and curve! I prefer color in most photos yet the use of black &amp; white on this works very well. The focus shows great detail yet enhances the theme of soft and sensual.  You deserve to do well with this !</td>', 'This was a real ringer for me in this challenge many others have a completely different wow factor.  Was that what you were trying to achieve?  The Essence for me evoked PURE sensuality!  So beautiful are each and every line and curve! I prefer color in most photos yet the use of black & white on this works very well. The focus shows great detail yet enhances the theme of soft and sensual.  You deserve to do well with this !', '2004-10-07 04:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(947525, 107969, 12611, '<td valign="top">stunning shot, brilliant water, perhaps a bit processed looking in the green and blue?</td>', 'stunning shot, brilliant water, perhaps a bit processed looking in the green and blue?', '2004-10-07 04:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(947527, 108949, 12611, '<td valign="top">perfectly interesting composition, perhaps focus is not perfectly acheived, could be my eyes.</td>', 'perfectly interesting composition, perhaps focus is not perfectly acheived, could be my eyes.', '2004-10-07 04:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(947530, 108269, 15407, '<td valign="top">All of the colors in this photo are amazing.  Your timing was spot on, (or on the spot).  Just amazing!   While viewing it the music of  ''Close Encounters'' to ran through my mind.</td>', 'All of the colors in this photo are amazing.  Your timing was spot on, (or on the spot).  Just amazing!   While viewing it the music of  ''Close Encounters'' to ran through my mind.', '2004-10-07 04:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(947531, 105984, 12611, '<td valign="top">stunning detail. this is green as nature intended it. perhaps there is just a bit missing to make this a trule compelling shot, the composition or "focus zones" may seem a bit unnatural or... artificial.</td>', 'stunning detail. this is green as nature intended it. perhaps there is just a bit missing to make this a trule compelling shot, the composition or "focus zones" may seem a bit unnatural or... artificial.', '2004-10-07 04:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(947533, 108767, 15407, '<td valign="top">I like the atmospheric conditions you have illustrated so very well here yet I find the rock outcrop somewhat distracting. Perhaps a crop of about 515x640 may have worked ?   Perhaps slightly less sharpening.<br/></td>', 'I like the atmospheric conditions you have illustrated so very well here yet I find the rock outcrop somewhat distracting. Perhaps a crop of about 515x640 may have worked ?   Perhaps slightly less sharpening.', '2004-10-07 04:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(947537, 109032, 12611, '<td valign="top">great idea, black and white is not really doing it for me though. I do like the compostiion but the focal point is the face and it is out of focus, and the blurry obscured hip area is distracting.</td>', 'great idea, black and white is not really doing it for me though. I do like the compostiion but the focal point is the face and it is out of focus, and the blurry obscured hip area is distracting.', '2004-10-07 04:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(947541, 103788, 12611, '<td valign="top">great composition and clouds. I love the shadowy detail against the sail. Perhaps I would like better context for teh shot, les "cropping", showing more of the boat or horizon. I still like it better than most shots though.</td>', 'great composition and clouds. I love the shadowy detail against the sail. Perhaps I would like better context for teh shot, les "cropping", showing more of the boat or horizon. I still like it better than most shots though.', '2004-10-07 04:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(947542, 106707, 19959, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. Very good landscape.</td>', 'Beautiful colors. Very good landscape.', '2004-10-07 04:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(947544, 104134, 12611, '<td valign="top">The shot is very compelling as a portrait. Most times people worry about the technicality of teh exposure, composition and lighting at the expense of capturing the emotion and essence of the subject. You have not achieved perfet exposure, overexposed imo, but the portrait works because of the captures essence and expression. you had the patience and direction to make it happen.</td>', 'The shot is very compelling as a portrait. Most times people worry about the technicality of teh exposure, composition and lighting at the expense of capturing the emotion and essence of the subject. You have not achieved perfet exposure, overexposed imo, but the portrait works because of the captures essence and expression. you had the patience and direction to make it happen.', '2004-10-07 04:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(947547, 105190, 19959, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-10-07 04:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(947548, 107397, 12611, '<td valign="top">Beautifully pleasing colors and obviously a skilled post processor! I love the detail adn quality of the texture of teh building against the clouds. The area of darkness on the right does not add to the ominous feeling,  and muddles the shot up. Nice though, looks like a travel poster for rural ireland or wales.</td>', 'Beautifully pleasing colors and obviously a skilled post processor! I love the detail adn quality of the texture of teh building against the clouds. The area of darkness on the right does not add to the ominous feeling,  and muddles the shot up. Nice though, looks like a travel poster for rural ireland or wales.', '2004-10-07 04:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(947550, 107995, 19959, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Very well executed.</td>', 'Excellent. Very well executed.', '2004-10-07 04:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(947551, 107586, 15407, '<td valign="top">This is a thought provoking image, for me the potential in this scene was treamendious.  The expression on the face and in the eyes is greatI  The posture of the head conveys even more emotion.  I believe that were the arm and hand not in the picture it would have appealed to me more... its so hard to make a comment like that for me as many times those just are not what happens when you capture an image. I hope you do well with this.</td>', 'This is a thought provoking image, for me the potential in this scene was treamendious.  The expression on the face and in the eyes is greatI  The posture of the head conveys even more emotion.  I believe that were the arm and hand not in the picture it would have appealed to me more... its so hard to make a comment like that for me as many times those just are not what happens when you capture an image. I hope you do well with this.', '2004-10-07 04:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(947553, 108979, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great Idea, is there a ripple in the background though? this pulls me away from the vases.</td>', 'Great Idea, is there a ripple in the background though? this pulls me away from the vases.', '2004-10-07 04:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(947557, 108072, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait of a "character"- not essentially the person but the thing represented, as referenced through the title, perhaps crop a little less leg, or more horse- but those are nit-picketty random thoughts. nice blue, nice job!</td>', 'This is a great portrait of a "character"- not essentially the person but the thing represented, as referenced through the title, perhaps crop a little less leg, or more horse- but those are nit-picketty random thoughts. nice blue, nice job!', '2004-10-07 04:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(947560, 108173, 15407, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting depth of field you''ve created.  I like the colors and some of the detail yet some of it seems a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'This is an interesting depth of field you''ve created.  I like the colors and some of the detail yet some of it seems a bit oversharpened.', '2004-10-07 04:46:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(947562, 106171, 12611, '<td valign="top">great focus throughout the shot! from feathers to beak- you have made the most of a bird portrait adn the eagle really takes on a proud, predatory feeling. nice.</td>', 'great focus throughout the shot! from feathers to beak- you have made the most of a bird portrait adn the eagle really takes on a proud, predatory feeling. nice.', '2004-10-07 04:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(947566, 108832, 12611, '<td valign="top">lovely sunset. The great thing is that you captured the color essence of the whole sunset genre. blue/ teal/cobalt/ orange yellow. I love the late sunsets for this reason, and the dark beach draws a perfect line into the detailed water.I like it a lot.</td>', 'lovely sunset. The great thing is that you captured the color essence of the whole sunset genre. blue/ teal/cobalt/ orange yellow. I love the late sunsets for this reason, and the dark beach draws a perfect line into the detailed water.I like it a lot.', '2004-10-07 04:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(947571, 109013, 12611, '<td valign="top">"I''ll be back soon honey, just going to put the kids down" I love the title, the vague references in here, the power line looming like a crucifix, the black hat. AM I reading too much into it? I also like the weeds and grass on the close right, perhaps too much processing on the more distant weeds, good contrast to make a black adn white appear sepia.</td>', '"I''ll be back soon honey, just going to put the kids down" I love the title, the vague references in here, the power line looming like a crucifix, the black hat. AM I reading too much into it? I also like the weeds and grass on the close right, perhaps too much processing on the more distant weeds, good contrast to make a black adn white appear sepia.', '2004-10-07 04:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(947575, 107586, 12611, '<td valign="top">compelling, slightly journalistic, slightly out of focus. very well done with a superb background, great detail and a nice level of contrast.</td>', 'compelling, slightly journalistic, slightly out of focus. very well done with a superb background, great detail and a nice level of contrast.', '2004-10-07 04:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(947578, 109019, 15407, '<td valign="top">What a cutie... I''m curious about the lighting and the tone of the picture. A high ISO?   The lack of blur with her head is understandable,  as she''s following the bubble with her eyes... something about that makes me smile.</td>', 'What a cutie... I''m curious about the lighting and the tone of the picture. A high ISO?   The lack of blur with her head is understandable,  as she''s following the bubble with her eyes... something about that makes me smile.', '2004-10-07 04:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(947582, 107902, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice detail. At first I did not appreciate the symmetry, but It works. You really waited for the perfect light and that is commendable. Perhaps the only complaint, --"clutter"? too much for the eye to soak in?</td>', 'Nice detail. At first I did not appreciate the symmetry, but It works. You really waited for the perfect light and that is commendable. Perhaps the only complaint, --"clutter"? too much for the eye to soak in?', '2004-10-07 04:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(947585, 108276, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful- stunning, ominous, inspiring- I love this shot and the fact that you have conveyed the true emotional power of nature. Best of luck. "10"</td>', 'This is beautiful- stunning, ominous, inspiring- I love this shot and the fact that you have conveyed the true emotional power of nature. Best of luck. "10"', '2004-10-07 04:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(947586, 108233, 12611, '<td valign="top">fantastic... hey- get that cameraman off the field! lol! perhaps a cop is in order, but thats only a scant suggestion.</td>', 'fantastic... hey- get that cameraman off the field! lol! perhaps a cop is in order, but thats only a scant suggestion.', '2004-10-07 04:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(947587, 108843, 16301, '<td valign="top">Very cool colors, I like the composition. I would have composed it in a portrait orientation with that big rock in the top left of the frame. (9)</td>', 'Very cool colors, I like the composition. I would have composed it in a portrait orientation with that big rock in the top left of the frame. (9)', '2004-10-07 04:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(947588, 108924, 15407, '<td valign="top">Where you able to pose the model? It would have been interesting to see a few other silhouettes... not that there was a lot of time though!  I also wondered if you could have sacrificed some of the grandeur in the sky for a larger view of the model?</td>', 'Where you able to pose the model? It would have been interesting to see a few other silhouettes... not that there was a lot of time though!  I also wondered if you could have sacrificed some of the grandeur in the sky for a larger view of the model?', '2004-10-07 04:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(947590, 108269, 12611, '<td valign="top">maybe too stunning? the compostion immediately hits you as why is  there so much grass- its a good color but it makes the whole thing clunky. You are a master of color though. Look at that green on the water and blue sky. absolutely great.</td>', 'maybe too stunning? the compostion immediately hits you as why is  there so much grass- its a good color but it makes the whole thing clunky. You are a master of color though. Look at that green on the water and blue sky. absolutely great.', '2004-10-07 05:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(947591, 106953, 12611, '<td valign="top">sensual, alluring, well contrasted, well expressioned. I like the lip shine adn the whites of the eyes. The only thing is, I just want to wipe that hair strand out of her face. that drives me nuts!</td>', 'sensual, alluring, well contrasted, well expressioned. I like the lip shine adn the whites of the eyes. The only thing is, I just want to wipe that hair strand out of her face. that drives me nuts!', '2004-10-07 05:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(947592, 107300, 12611, '<td valign="top">I''m not really too impressed. The border is distracting. I can''t really see the brides faces. her shape is unflattering in this pose  and although on the surface it appears "Artsy" the background is wierd and the symmetry is distracting. <br/>but... what do I know-our wedding was mostly black adn white journalistic candids showing emotion. There may be some symbolism here that i am missing. good luck.</td>', 'I''m not really too impressed. The border is distracting. I can''t really see the brides faces. her shape is unflattering in this pose  and although on the surface it appears "Artsy" the background is wierd and the symmetry is distracting. but... what do I know-our wedding was mostly black adn white journalistic candids showing emotion. There may be some symbolism here that i am missing. good luck.', '2004-10-07 05:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(947595, 107902, 15407, '<td valign="top">AMAZING! How big is this scene?   The lighting is incredible. Where the cat or the dog?  Everything is in its place! (Except for the hose &amp; nozzle on the pumps). Its more like being in a dream than looking at a picture maybe a movie set or in a museum?  In any event I like it!</td>', 'AMAZING! How big is this scene?   The lighting is incredible. Where the cat or the dog?  Everything is in its place! (Except for the hose & nozzle on the pumps). Its more like being in a dream than looking at a picture maybe a movie set or in a museum?  In any event I like it!', '2004-10-07 05:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(947617, 107902, 16046, '<td valign="top">Well done</td>', 'Well done', '2004-10-07 05:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(947618, 106953, 16046, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, great light</td>', 'Nice contrast, great light', '2004-10-07 05:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(947620, 105190, 16046, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good shutter speed</td>', 'Very nice, good shutter speed', '2004-10-07 05:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(947621, 107901, 16046, '<td valign="top">almost looks fake, well done</td>', 'almost looks fake, well done', '2004-10-07 05:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(947622, 107969, 16046, '<td valign="top">very creative, well done</td>', 'very creative, well done', '2004-10-07 05:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(947626, 107969, 15407, '<td valign="top">"How the heck did they do that"? Its a corker:  but is it of, by and for a Kiwi? Or just inspirational homage? Time will tell In any event, Im going to have to learn the tricks of this trade!  It also reminded me of Bikini Island.</td>', '"How the heck did they do that"? Its a corker:  but is it of, by and for a Kiwi? Or just inspirational homage? Time will tell In any event, Im going to have to learn the tricks of this trade!  It also reminded me of Bikini Island.', '2004-10-07 05:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(947634, 106488, 15407, '<td valign="top">Did you use your Ice Wedge ? I''ll enjoy reading about how you did this!</td>', 'Did you use your Ice Wedge ? I''ll enjoy reading about how you did this!', '2004-10-07 05:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(947638, 102742, 15407, '<td valign="top">I LIKE everything about this !  Very Well done...</td>', 'I LIKE everything about this !  Very Well done...', '2004-10-07 05:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(947641, 104134, 15407, '<td valign="top">The eyes of a child!  Moody Blues.  Very well done</td>', 'The eyes of a child!  Moody Blues.  Very well done', '2004-10-07 05:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(947645, 108642, 15407, '<td valign="top">What a great place and time to be ....alive!  I''m sure that when they look back at this picture many years from now it will put a very warm feeling in their hearts as I msur it does for you now!</td>', 'What a great place and time to be ....alive!  I''m sure that when they look back at this picture many years from now it will put a very warm feeling in their hearts as I msur it does for you now!', '2004-10-07 06:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(947647, 108897, 15407, '<td valign="top">You got this RIGHT! Simply beautiful!</td>', 'You got this RIGHT! Simply beautiful!', '2004-10-07 06:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(947648, 103615, 15407, '<td valign="top">To get that gleam in her eyes and have the face so soft illustrates you expertise with the camera and/or post processing.  It''s beautiful. The backlighting compliments the composure.</td>', 'To get that gleam in her eyes and have the face so soft illustrates you expertise with the camera and/or post processing.  It''s beautiful. The backlighting compliments the composure.', '2004-10-07 06:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(947650, 104030, 15407, '<td valign="top">Naturally beautiful.  It appears a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'Naturally beautiful.  It appears a bit oversharpened.', '2004-10-07 06:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(947659, 107901, 15407, '<td valign="top">Such a large depth of field to try and cover from a short range is difficults at best with just a flower let alone and Red Dragon thats not holding still for anyone!  Tough shot &amp; a good capture!</td>', 'Such a large depth of field to try and cover from a short range is difficults at best with just a flower let alone and Red Dragon thats not holding still for anyone!  Tough shot & a good capture!', '2004-10-07 06:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(947665, 105966, 15407, '<td valign="top">Dark-thirty &amp; a very bright source of light .... What you need is a MONSTER fill flash setup or about a dozen remote flashes to fill in some detail/color on the other ballons.</td>', 'Dark-thirty & a very bright source of light .... What you need is a MONSTER fill flash setup or about a dozen remote flashes to fill in some detail/color on the other ballons.', '2004-10-07 06:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(947672, 109013, 15407, '<td valign="top">I think the ''tone'' of the picture would have been nicer if they were walking towards the camera.  The power lines could have been left out of the picture.</td>', 'I think the ''tone'' of the picture would have been nicer if they were walking towards the camera.  The power lines could have been left out of the picture.', '2004-10-07 06:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(947684, 106488, 16046, '<td valign="top">great golf shot, looks like winter play</td>', 'great golf shot, looks like winter play', '2004-10-07 06:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(947685, 109019, 16046, '<td valign="top">great eyes, nice capture</td>', 'great eyes, nice capture', '2004-10-07 06:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(947687, 107365, 16046, '<td valign="top">cool image, nice work</td>', 'cool image, nice work', '2004-10-07 06:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(947689, 106171, 16046, '<td valign="top">nice detail and contrast</td>', 'nice detail and contrast', '2004-10-07 06:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(947734, 109008, 24896, '<td valign="top">superb detail and colours...the eye looks a little flat needs more colour and lighten the shadows behind the eye and from the beak on its neck</td>', 'superb detail and colours...the eye looks a little flat needs more colour and lighten the shadows behind the eye and from the beak on its neck', '2004-10-07 07:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(947735, 103189, 24896, '<td valign="top">awesome capture....love the sky above the clouds</td>', 'awesome capture....love the sky above the clouds', '2004-10-07 07:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(947743, 104027, 27503, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot - nice curve to lead the viewer into the picture.  The left wall is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like it a lot - nice curve to lead the viewer into the picture.  The left wall is a bit distracting.', '2004-10-07 07:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(947745, 107902, 27503, '<td valign="top">Excelent picture - lots of interest and the colors are spot on.</td>', 'Excelent picture - lots of interest and the colors are spot on.', '2004-10-07 07:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(947747, 103788, 27503, '<td valign="top">The sky is really good and gives this picture edge.</td>', 'The sky is really good and gives this picture edge.', '2004-10-07 07:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(947749, 105190, 27503, '<td valign="top">Nice blurring of the sea and the sunset cast great colors on the sea.</td>', 'Nice blurring of the sea and the sunset cast great colors on the sea.', '2004-10-07 07:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(947752, 109019, 27503, '<td valign="top">I like it!</td>', 'I like it!', '2004-10-07 07:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
