(947757, 108875, 27503, '<td valign="top">Peacefull.</td>', 'Peacefull.', '2004-10-07 07:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(947758, 108843, 27503, '<td valign="top">The colors are spot on.</td>', 'The colors are spot on.', '2004-10-07 07:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(947761, 108233, 27503, '<td valign="top">Þessi er flott!</td>', 'Þessi er flott!', '2004-10-07 07:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(947768, 108995, 23394, '<td valign="top">even though the focus is spot-on, the shot itself is just ok.  for performance shots to really work, you have to connect the viewer to the moment.  here, the face is too shadowed to get a read on emotion of the moment.  while you have nailed the focus on the visible hand, we can''t see what the other hand is doing--we''re only getting part of the story.  on a positive note, the grain works very well here (and in shots like this) to help capture the emotion usually associated to listening to music in darker venues.<br/> <br/>another thing to keep in mind about band shots:  even though there are some bass players who are very energetic (think sting about 20 years ago), most are there to hold down the beat.  the more interesting shots are going to be of the performers who are making the music stand on its edge.</td>', 'even though the focus is spot-on, the shot itself is just ok.  for performance shots to really work, you have to connect the viewer to the moment.  here, the face is too shadowed to get a read on emotion of the moment.  while you have nailed the focus on the visible hand, we can''t see what the other hand is doing--we''re only getting part of the story.  on a positive note, the grain works very well here (and in shots like this) to help capture the emotion usually associated to listening to music in darker venues. another thing to keep in mind about band shots:  even though there are some bass players who are very energetic (think sting about 20 years ago), most are there to hold down the beat.  the more interesting shots are going to be of the performers who are making the music stand on its edge.', '2004-10-07 08:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(947776, 108072, 24642, '<td valign="top">Strong and clear portrait.  The white shirt really cuts out from the background and leads the aye to the face. A honest photograph. -9</td>', 'Strong and clear portrait.  The white shirt really cuts out from the background and leads the aye to the face. A honest photograph. -9', '2004-10-07 08:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(947778, 108897, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful portrait, very well composed, very compelling.  i think it could be improved slightly if the lighting on the face was a little more balanced.  if the shadow from her nose was softened, this would move up a notch for me.  i like how the black top allows her torso to contribute to the composition without taking focus away from her face.</td>', 'this is a beautiful portrait, very well composed, very compelling.  i think it could be improved slightly if the lighting on the face was a little more balanced.  if the shadow from her nose was softened, this would move up a notch for me.  i like how the black top allows her torso to contribute to the composition without taking focus away from her face.', '2004-10-07 08:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(947782, 102660, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent portrait shot.  the eyes grab you, the line of her face against her hair holds you.  the hint of a strong jaw adds character to a powerful image.  as much as i love this shot, if it doesn''t top 10, i''ll be willing to bet it is because of the earrings and necklace.</td>', 'excellent portrait shot.  the eyes grab you, the line of her face against her hair holds you.  the hint of a strong jaw adds character to a powerful image.  as much as i love this shot, if it doesn''t top 10, i''ll be willing to bet it is because of the earrings and necklace.', '2004-10-07 08:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(947783, 107609, 24642, '<td valign="top">I praise you for your selection of subject.  Very good composition with the aid of shadows.  The light is harsh but it does not kill the texture in the old mans clothes.  I can almost feel the fabric.  The cropping is just right and I like that you choose to crop the middle of the hat and the top button on the jacket is a must.  The lighting on the fingers is fantastic.  Very good work. -10 (I just gave two 10s)</td>', 'I praise you for your selection of subject.  Very good composition with the aid of shadows.  The light is harsh but it does not kill the texture in the old mans clothes.  I can almost feel the fabric.  The cropping is just right and I like that you choose to crop the middle of the hat and the top button on the jacket is a must.  The lighting on the fingers is fantastic.  Very good work. -10 (I just gave two 10s)', '2004-10-07 08:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(947784, 107387, 24642, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites.  The musician is really isolated from the background, it really helps having the guy in the black shirt right behind the hand.  Nice tonal range.  Perhaps a bit over sharpened, I can se white halos around the instrument and on the left side of the face.    Anyway ,very good work. -10 (I just gave two 10s)</td>', 'One of my favourites.  The musician is really isolated from the background, it really helps having the guy in the black shirt right behind the hand.  Nice tonal range.  Perhaps a bit over sharpened, I can se white halos around the instrument and on the left side of the face.    Anyway ,very good work. -10 (I just gave two 10s)', '2004-10-07 08:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(947785, 108122, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a killer shot.  the focus is perfect, the expression priceless.  bw really brings this to life.  if this doesn''t do as well as you''d like, i''d attribute it to the shallow dof.</td>', 'this is a killer shot.  the focus is perfect, the expression priceless.  bw really brings this to life.  if this doesn''t do as well as you''d like, i''d attribute it to the shallow dof.', '2004-10-07 08:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(947791, 108924, 24642, '<td valign="top">A great sky, the rusty colour of the cloud on the left is beautiful against the blue sky.  Although there is a area over the horizon (the strong cyan and yellows) on the right which hits me in the eye.  -7</td>', 'A great sky, the rusty colour of the cloud on the left is beautiful against the blue sky.  Although there is a area over the horizon (the strong cyan and yellows) on the right which hits me in the eye.  -7', '2004-10-07 08:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(947792, 108122, 24642, '<td valign="top">Straightforward good work.  One of the best portraits in the challenge. -9</td>', 'Straightforward good work.  One of the best portraits in the challenge. -9', '2004-10-07 08:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(947793, 108537, 24642, '<td valign="top">A beautiful blonde with a gun, who can resist that?  This is top quality all over.  Good composition and lighting, the tonal range in the hair is fantastic.  The ayes  and the expression on the models face is priceless. She doesn''t need a gun to get full control over me. -9</td>', 'A beautiful blonde with a gun, who can resist that?  This is top quality all over.  Good composition and lighting, the tonal range in the hair is fantastic.  The ayes  and the expression on the models face is priceless. She doesn''t need a gun to get full control over me. -9', '2004-10-07 08:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(947794, 104134, 24642, '<td valign="top">Straightforward portrait, good overall lighting but a bit to bright on the far side of the face. -8</td>', 'Straightforward portrait, good overall lighting but a bit to bright on the far side of the face. -8', '2004-10-07 08:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(947795, 103788, 24642, '<td valign="top">Great sky and shadows.  The viewpoint is good and leaves enough room for the beautiful sky.  I also like the border and the title.  -8</td>', 'Great sky and shadows.  The viewpoint is good and leaves enough room for the beautiful sky.  I also like the border and the title.  -8', '2004-10-07 08:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(947796, 108767, 24642, '<td valign="top">Great capture, my top rated landscape in the challenge.  The graduation in the top half between the yellow and the blue is a bit crude. This photograph reminds me of the works of Mark Rothko  -8</td>', 'Great capture, my top rated landscape in the challenge.  The graduation in the top half between the yellow and the blue is a bit crude. This photograph reminds me of the works of Mark Rothko  -8', '2004-10-07 08:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(947797, 108986, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good cropping and I like the border.  I can''t see any flaws in this shot. Simply very good. -8</td>', 'Good cropping and I like the border.  I can''t see any flaws in this shot. Simply very good. -8', '2004-10-07 08:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(947799, 107995, 24642, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and well executed.  The selection of the setting works well, I especially like the harmony in the sweater and the white woodwork behind the chair.  The only thing I don''t approve is the title, it doesn''t add anything to the shot.  I think this shot can have a title that has humour or raises questions about beauty and identity. -8</td>', 'Clever idea and well executed.  The selection of the setting works well, I especially like the harmony in the sweater and the white woodwork behind the chair.  The only thing I don''t approve is the title, it doesn''t add anything to the shot.  I think this shot can have a title that has humour or raises questions about beauty and identity. -8', '2004-10-07 08:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(947800, 107586, 24642, '<td valign="top">Peaceful portrait.  Beautiful lighting and good tonal range.  The background and shadows really add depth. -8</td>', 'Peaceful portrait.  Beautiful lighting and good tonal range.  The background and shadows really add depth. -8', '2004-10-07 08:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(947801, 109019, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very cute and a good title.  The post processing works well with this shot. -8</td>', 'Very cute and a good title.  The post processing works well with this shot. -8', '2004-10-07 08:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(947827, 106707, 18349, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit oversaturated for my taste, but the composition is nice; I like the use of quasi "negative space" with the sky.  Interesting capture.</td>', 'Seems a bit oversaturated for my taste, but the composition is nice; I like the use of quasi "negative space" with the sky.  Interesting capture.', '2004-10-07 09:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(947849, 108843, 23394, '<td valign="top">while this is an absolutely beautiful image, i think it would be much stronger without the moon and the moon''s reflection.  they are a distraction that forces my eye away from Haystack Rock, rather than letting my eye wander, leisurely absorbing the rich colors and textures you have captured.  it''s amazing how something that small can have such a strong impact on someone''s viewing experience.</td>', 'while this is an absolutely beautiful image, i think it would be much stronger without the moon and the moon''s reflection.  they are a distraction that forces my eye away from Haystack Rock, rather than letting my eye wander, leisurely absorbing the rich colors and textures you have captured.  it''s amazing how something that small can have such a strong impact on someone''s viewing experience.', '2004-10-07 09:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(947859, 103619, 23394, '<td valign="top">all i can say is "thank you!"  i will always be able to point to this ''validated'' image as an example of what''s possible/acceptable.  great job, all the way around.  i have some ideas as to how you did this, but can''t wait to get the real scoop!  good luck!</td>', 'all i can say is "thank you!"  i will always be able to point to this ''validated'' image as an example of what''s possible/acceptable.  great job, all the way around.  i have some ideas as to how you did this, but can''t wait to get the real scoop!  good luck!', '2004-10-07 09:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
