(948061, 108940, 23394, '<td valign="top">what beautiful colors.  i love how you''ve caught the texture of the petals.  you really nailed the background.  it is not so sanitized to make the image feel artificial, but it''s not busy enough to distract from the subject.  great job.  even though some might see another boring flower shot, i see one of my top picks for the challenge.  good luck!</td>', 'what beautiful colors.  i love how you''ve caught the texture of the petals.  you really nailed the background.  it is not so sanitized to make the image feel artificial, but it''s not busy enough to distract from the subject.  great job.  even though some might see another boring flower shot, i see one of my top picks for the challenge.  good luck!', '2004-10-07 11:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
