(948075, 103788, 3799, '<td valign="top">i love the picture and the fact that you changed it from color to b&amp;w but i wish there was just a bit more of the bottom of the ship in there 7</td>', 'i love the picture and the fact that you changed it from color to b&w but i wish there was just a bit more of the bottom of the ship in there 7', '2004-10-07 11:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(948076, 103219, 23394, '<td valign="top">boy, i don''t know what to do about this image.  i want to like it, but i find reasons not to (like why couldn''t the background either be completely flat or a little busier.  or do i like the lips pulling me off the image, being up in the top corner).  i want to not like it, but i find reasons that i do (like the lighting, the lines, the hint of modesty).  i guess i like it more than i don''t like it.  i''m sorry i can''t tell you any more.  good luck!</td>', 'boy, i don''t know what to do about this image.  i want to like it, but i find reasons not to (like why couldn''t the background either be completely flat or a little busier.  or do i like the lips pulling me off the image, being up in the top corner).  i want to not like it, but i find reasons that i do (like the lighting, the lines, the hint of modesty).  i guess i like it more than i don''t like it.  i''m sorry i can''t tell you any more.  good luck!', '2004-10-07 11:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(948079, 107397, 5391, '<td valign="top">Either a stunning Heida original or a masterful imitation of her tremendous style.  Superb color tones, the plants growing on the ruins provide a mystical feeling and that gray-blue burned sky adds such mood.  A 10, easy!</td>', 'Either a stunning Heida original or a masterful imitation of her tremendous style.  Superb color tones, the plants growing on the ruins provide a mystical feeling and that gray-blue burned sky adds such mood.  A 10, easy!', '2004-10-07 11:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
