(948095, 106707, 10390, '<td valign="top">BobsterLobster remake of IMAGE_ID=34566 (I would guess this is a BobsterLobster''s work at least).  But it''s ok, I like this one not less than the other one, and it''s one of the best in this challenge imo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-08 15:53:15.</i></td>', 'BobsterLobster remake of IMAGE_ID=34566 (I would guess this is a BobsterLobster''s work at least).  But it''s ok, I like this one not less than the other one, and it''s one of the best in this challenge imo.', '2004-10-07 11:55:42.000000', '2004-10-08 16:53:15.000000', 1),
(948097, 109031, 5391, '<td valign="top">I normally don''t care at all for images of statues, but have recently added one to my portfolio myself, though it doesn''t compare to this.  I did rate this a 9 but am changing it to a 10.  The capture of those sharply defined water droplets turn this into your own work of art, rather than a photo of someone else''s statue.  I''ve never seen anything quite like it, it''s simply superb.  10</td>', 'I normally don''t care at all for images of statues, but have recently added one to my portfolio myself, though it doesn''t compare to this.  I did rate this a 9 but am changing it to a 10.  The capture of those sharply defined water droplets turn this into your own work of art, rather than a photo of someone else''s statue.  I''ve never seen anything quite like it, it''s simply superb.  10', '2004-10-07 11:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(948098, 108872, 23394, '<td valign="top">i love this image.  it is my top pick for the challenge.  i love the colors, the composition, and most of all, it''s sheer simplicity.  it really goes to show that if you stop to look at what''s around you, you can find some really incredible images.  great job.  good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'i love this image.  it is my top pick for the challenge.  i love the colors, the composition, and most of all, it''s sheer simplicity.  it really goes to show that if you stop to look at what''s around you, you can find some really incredible images.  great job.  good luck with the challenge!', '2004-10-07 11:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(948099, 106953, 5391, '<td valign="top">I love the amazing tonal range you''ve captured here, that luminous skin and the beautiful gaze of the model.  Framing is perfect, too.  Wonderful!  10</td>', 'I love the amazing tonal range you''ve captured here, that luminous skin and the beautiful gaze of the model.  Framing is perfect, too.  Wonderful!  10', '2004-10-07 11:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
