(948259, 107969, 11467, '<td valign="top">Ha! Greatidea! I assume that is dropped into water! 8.</td>', 'Ha! Greatidea! I assume that is dropped into water! 8.', '2004-10-07 13:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(948265, 107202, 11467, '<td valign="top">A wonderful image. Erotic without being offensive, Great setting colours, lighting etc. 8</td>', 'A wonderful image. Erotic without being offensive, Great setting colours, lighting etc. 8', '2004-10-07 13:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(948269, 104027, 11467, '<td valign="top">Great image, I keep waiting for the bottom to appear though. Seems cropped off. 7.</td>', 'Great image, I keep waiting for the bottom to appear though. Seems cropped off. 7.', '2004-10-07 13:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(948270, 108767, 11467, '<td valign="top">Cool atmosphere here. Is missing some focus point but still a wonderfull image. 7</td>', 'Cool atmosphere here. Is missing some focus point but still a wonderfull image. 7', '2004-10-07 13:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(948273, 108924, 11467, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture. Composition could perhaps be made more interesting, but I see the problem, crop left and loose the salmon coloured clouds there, crop right and loose the fire coloured clouds there. I probably would have left the same though I find my eye goes straight to the middle &amp; stops too fast there. 7.</td>', 'Amazing capture. Composition could perhaps be made more interesting, but I see the problem, crop left and loose the salmon coloured clouds there, crop right and loose the fire coloured clouds there. I probably would have left the same though I find my eye goes straight to the middle & stops too fast there. 7.', '2004-10-07 13:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(948278, 108991, 11467, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I think a Swan on the right would have been cool (Didn''t you have a blowup one in your photobag?) Still I can''t fault it. 7</td>', 'Nice photo. I think a Swan on the right would have been cool (Didn''t you have a blowup one in your photobag?) Still I can''t fault it. 7', '2004-10-07 13:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(948286, 107586, 5822, '<td valign="top">I really like the tones, play of shadow and light, as well as, the angle of view.  And such soulful eyes!  Could definitely see this in National Geographic.  Beautiful ! 10</td>', 'I really like the tones, play of shadow and light, as well as, the angle of view.  And such soulful eyes!  Could definitely see this in National Geographic.  Beautiful ! 10', '2004-10-07 13:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(948308, 108984, 9452, '<td valign="top">I really like what you did here. You made this look much more interesting that it could be. The contrast of colors, the sharpness and the composition are perfect! I like you  post all the details (including lens and focal lenght). 10 from me</td>', 'I really like what you did here. You made this look much more interesting that it could be. The contrast of colors, the sharpness and the composition are perfect! I like you  post all the details (including lens and focal lenght). 10 from me', '2004-10-07 14:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(948375, 109008, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clear, vivid, and some personality, too. This should do well!</td>', 'Clear, vivid, and some personality, too. This should do well!', '2004-10-07 14:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(948378, 108233, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super action shot of a key moment (it appears by your title). Wonderful stuff.</td>', 'Super action shot of a key moment (it appears by your title). Wonderful stuff.', '2004-10-07 14:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(948381, 108767, 6870, '<td valign="top">It pays to go out early! Lovely colors captured  here. It''s amazing how fast and how  much the sky changes in the morning, isn''t it? The mist is great, and I like the extra sky you included.</td>', 'It pays to go out early! Lovely colors captured  here. It''s amazing how fast and how  much the sky changes in the morning, isn''t it? The mist is great, and I like the extra sky you included.', '2004-10-07 14:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(948383, 108995, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the grain here and the tight crop.  It puts more emphasis on the hand motion and the bass strings (your title might be incorrect ; )<br/>Excellent lighting as well.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'I like the grain here and the tight crop.  It puts more emphasis on the hand motion and the bass strings (your title might be incorrect ; )Excellent lighting as well.  One of my favorites.', '2004-10-07 14:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(948384, 108991, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super clarity where it needs to be, and the softer focus and misty atmosphere really make this photo special. Congratulations!</td>', 'Super clarity where it needs to be, and the softer focus and misty atmosphere really make this photo special. Congratulations!', '2004-10-07 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(948385, 104027, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super point of view and excellent exposure in a difficult situation. Curves are marvelous.</td>', 'Super point of view and excellent exposure in a difficult situation. Curves are marvelous.', '2004-10-07 14:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(948387, 108276, 6870, '<td valign="top">I must have shot hundreds of fall shots like this, but not many of them were of much worth. This one however, is really nice and effective. You chose a good time of day, and your composition and colors/contrasts work very well.</td>', 'I must have shot hundreds of fall shots like this, but not many of them were of much worth. This one however, is really nice and effective. You chose a good time of day, and your composition and colors/contrasts work very well.', '2004-10-07 14:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(948389, 109019, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the muted, old fashioned colors and the soft focus here. Fun moment of capture, too. 8</td>', 'I like the muted, old fashioned colors and the soft focus here. Fun moment of capture, too. 8', '2004-10-07 14:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(948392, 109013, 509, '<td valign="top">This is a powerful image.  The sepia tones and the soft/surrealness of the background are wonderful touches.  Not sure if this was intended, but the telephone pole resembles a cross.  This strengthens the composition and also adds (to me) a religious theme - also tied in with the innocense of youth and the walk down the road.  I don''t know if thats what you were going for, but that''s what the image speaks to me.  It invokes emotion.  10</td>', 'This is a powerful image.  The sepia tones and the soft/surrealness of the background are wonderful touches.  Not sure if this was intended, but the telephone pole resembles a cross.  This strengthens the composition and also adds (to me) a religious theme - also tied in with the innocense of youth and the walk down the road.  I don''t know if thats what you were going for, but that''s what the image speaks to me.  It invokes emotion.  10', '2004-10-07 14:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(948395, 103619, 6870, '<td valign="top">INteresting concept and a clear, well lit photo. The soft blur at the edges of visibility kind of upstage what''s going on, IMO, b ut I still like how the drama is very present.</td>', 'INteresting concept and a clear, well lit photo. The soft blur at the edges of visibility kind of upstage what''s going on, IMO, b ut I still like how the drama is very present.', '2004-10-07 14:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(948396, 108072, 509, '<td valign="top">Color and tone are expressed well here.  The blue adds a nice impact.  Including more of the background might better show the environment (it stands very well as a portrait, but imho, I would like to see more</td>', 'Color and tone are expressed well here.  The blue adds a nice impact.  Including more of the background might better show the environment (it stands very well as a portrait, but imho, I would like to see more', '2004-10-07 14:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(948397, 107876, 6870, '<td valign="top">Okay, I''ll start my diet tomorrow! Nice point of view for this image, though perhaps a little bright/light.</td>', 'Okay, I''ll start my diet tomorrow! Nice point of view for this image, though perhaps a little bright/light.', '2004-10-07 14:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(948399, 107969, 509, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I have no idea how this was done and like it all the more so = )</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I have no idea how this was done and like it all the more so = )', '2004-10-07 14:44:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(948401, 107488, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting, stark, simple image. I like the symmetry and use of pattern and texture here. I''m not "wow''ed by it, but I think many people might be. Good, solid photography here.</td>', 'Interesting, stark, simple image. I like the symmetry and use of pattern and texture here. I''m not "wow''ed by it, but I think many people might be. Good, solid photography here.', '2004-10-07 14:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(948403, 108992, 509, '<td valign="top">A nice exposure, but I would prefer more contrast with the shadows to add more drama.  A composition that plays more to the shapes of the haystacks might strengthen this imho.</td>', 'A nice exposure, but I would prefer more contrast with the shadows to add more drama.  A composition that plays more to the shapes of the haystacks might strengthen this imho.', '2004-10-07 14:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(948404, 105647, 6870, '<td valign="top">Rule of thirds works well here, and I like the light on the building and in the sky. I''d like to see more detail in the black, black foreground, though. Interesting subject and great idea.</td>', 'Rule of thirds works well here, and I like the light on the building and in the sky. I''d like to see more detail in the black, black foreground, though. Interesting subject and great idea.', '2004-10-07 14:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(948408, 108276, 509, '<td valign="top">The lighting and sky really offset and bring out the gold in the trees here.  I really can''t critique this, well done.</td>', 'The lighting and sky really offset and bring out the gold in the trees here.  I really can''t critique this, well done.', '2004-10-07 14:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(948411, 108275, 6870, '<td valign="top">Perhaps just a tad oversharpened, and you might try deepening your darker tones, but still a wonderful capture. The expression and moment are engaging, and your use of light is very effective.</td>', 'Perhaps just a tad oversharpened, and you might try deepening your darker tones, but still a wonderful capture. The expression and moment are engaging, and your use of light is very effective.', '2004-10-07 14:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(948414, 108275, 509, '<td valign="top">A good capture of emotion.  Some detail in the fur seems to have been lost with the sizing and compression limits though.</td>', 'A good capture of emotion.  Some detail in the fur seems to have been lost with the sizing and compression limits though.', '2004-10-07 14:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(948416, 102660, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very effective capture. Her expression is lovely and spontaneous. The photo may be a bit light; some darkening of the tone may have a bit more impact, but well done. I''m sure she''s pleased with this.</td>', 'Very effective capture. Her expression is lovely and spontaneous. The photo may be a bit light; some darkening of the tone may have a bit more impact, but well done. I''m sure she''s pleased with this.', '2004-10-07 14:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(948421, 107609, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very stark use of contrasts here. I like the sculpting your lighting accomplishes, but I am tempted to think that the lines between light and dark are a bit abrupt and harsh. Still, nice capture of an interesting person and moment.</td>', 'Very stark use of contrasts here. I like the sculpting your lighting accomplishes, but I am tempted to think that the lines between light and dark are a bit abrupt and harsh. Still, nice capture of an interesting person and moment.', '2004-10-07 14:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(948469, 104027, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent architectural study... I enjoy the curves and shapes that make up the impact in this photo...</td>', 'Excellent architectural study... I enjoy the curves and shapes that make up the impact in this photo...', '2004-10-07 15:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(948483, 108122, 772, '<td valign="top">Great portrait!  The tonality and lighting here is phenomenal and the candid nature of it really sets it off nicely.</td>', 'Great portrait!  The tonality and lighting here is phenomenal and the candid nature of it really sets it off nicely.', '2004-10-07 15:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(948485, 108872, 772, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work... simplicity is too underrated these days.</td>', 'Beautiful work... simplicity is too underrated these days.', '2004-10-07 15:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(948487, 107609, 772, '<td valign="top">I like this photo quite a bit.  The hard directional light really works well for me in this image...</td>', 'I like this photo quite a bit.  The hard directional light really works well for me in this image...', '2004-10-07 15:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(948492, 105647, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this photo has too much negative space in the foreground to be ''strong''.  The exposure is nice, but there is just a bit too much ''nothingness''  in the composition...</td>', 'I think this photo has too much negative space in the foreground to be ''strong''.  The exposure is nice, but there is just a bit too much ''nothingness''  in the composition...', '2004-10-07 15:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(948504, 105190, 11897, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image,  I would love to compare it with a faster exposure, ie. to see the water in its normal state, great shot. 9</td>', 'Beautiful image,  I would love to compare it with a faster exposure, ie. to see the water in its normal state, great shot. 9', '2004-10-07 16:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(948509, 103105, 11897, '<td valign="top">added this to my favourites early on, great picture 10</td>', 'added this to my favourites early on, great picture 10', '2004-10-07 16:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(948512, 103788, 11897, '<td valign="top">wonderful tones, and now one of my favourites, well done. 10</td>', 'wonderful tones, and now one of my favourites, well done. 10', '2004-10-07 16:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(948514, 109013, 11897, '<td valign="top">A splendid choice of b/w as averse to colour, amongst my favourites from this challenge, 10</td>', 'A splendid choice of b/w as averse to colour, amongst my favourites from this challenge, 10', '2004-10-07 16:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(948517, 108173, 11897, '<td valign="top">wow!    But for my dread of wasps,I assume it is some sort of stinger :)  this would go into my favourites, brilliant picture.<br/>10</td>', 'wow!    But for my dread of wasps,I assume it is some sort of stinger :)  this would go into my favourites, brilliant picture.10', '2004-10-07 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(948518, 107995, 11897, '<td valign="top">Cleverly done. 9</td>', 'Cleverly done. 9', '2004-10-07 16:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(948546, 107300, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot but i think the border fading may be a bit much for my personal taste...</td>', 'This is a nice shot but i think the border fading may be a bit much for my personal taste...', '2004-10-07 16:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(948547, 104134, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice natural light portrait... black and white works nicely here...</td>', 'Nice natural light portrait... black and white works nicely here...', '2004-10-07 16:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(948549, 103788, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice study of shape and texture... the sky is phenomenal in support of the subject... excellent work :)</td>', 'Very nice study of shape and texture... the sky is phenomenal in support of the subject... excellent work :)', '2004-10-07 16:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(948570, 106488, 1360, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Is this IR?</td>', 'Beautiful.  Is this IR?', '2004-10-07 16:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(948575, 106171, 25388, '<td valign="top">good sharpness and "pose"; I''m distracted by the color of the background ye I know that''s the natural color; I wonder if a selective desaturation would tone it done some? Exellent shot anyway.</td>', 'good sharpness and "pose"; I''m distracted by the color of the background ye I know that''s the natural color; I wonder if a selective desaturation would tone it done some? Exellent shot anyway.', '2004-10-07 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(948671, 102742, 22781, '<td valign="top">This is in my top 3 for this challenge. (So that means a 10)<br/>Why? I don''t know. It''s funny, has a heavy message, but the child makes the photo lighter. I totaly believe this one!</td>', 'This is in my top 3 for this challenge. (So that means a 10)Why? I don''t know. It''s funny, has a heavy message, but the child makes the photo lighter. I totaly believe this one!', '2004-10-07 17:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(948676, 108872, 22781, '<td valign="top">Very very simple looking photo, it''s allmost unreal. Love the use of negative space.<br/>One of my top 3.</td>', 'Very very simple looking photo, it''s allmost unreal. Love the use of negative space.One of my top 3.', '2004-10-07 17:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(948679, 106953, 22781, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, and you are in my top 5 of this challenge...<br/>That leaves me with one question... Where do you guy''s/girls get your models....</td>', 'This is a great shot, and you are in my top 5 of this challenge...That leaves me with one question... Where do you guy''s/girls get your models....', '2004-10-07 17:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(948682, 107488, 22781, '<td valign="top">Strange, voted this a 7 while voting... Now returning for comment and seeing the thumbnail it looks like 3 white dresses of 3 ghosts....<br/>Upping to 8 for making me rethink...</td>', 'Strange, voted this a 7 while voting... Now returning for comment and seeing the thumbnail it looks like 3 white dresses of 3 ghosts....Upping to 8 for making me rethink...', '2004-10-07 17:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(948715, 106953, 3585, '<td valign="top">yes</td>', 'yes', '2004-10-07 17:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(948723, 107091, 3585, '<td valign="top">Icarus taking no chances on his second attempt. Just my kind of framing. Good job</td>', 'Icarus taking no chances on his second attempt. Just my kind of framing. Good job', '2004-10-07 17:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(948725, 108276, 6532, '<td valign="top">Surreal.  Great drama as a result of the lighting.  Am I biased because the birch is one of my favorite trees?  Good job! The only thing I would like to see a bit different is the shadow in the foreground... but I realize it is difficult to control nature.  9</td>', 'Surreal.  Great drama as a result of the lighting.  Am I biased because the birch is one of my favorite trees?  Good job! The only thing I would like to see a bit different is the shadow in the foreground... but I realize it is difficult to control nature.  9', '2004-10-07 17:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(948728, 108991, 3585, '<td valign="top">Lots of volume, great atmosphere</td>', 'Lots of volume, great atmosphere', '2004-10-07 17:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(948737, 107902, 3585, '<td valign="top">I like the surreal tidyness of this scene</td>', 'I like the surreal tidyness of this scene', '2004-10-07 17:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(948741, 108991, 6532, '<td valign="top">This pic continues the dramatic captures that seem to be popular in this challenge.  I like that this one is b/w.  However, I am some what bothered there doesn''t seem to be sufficient clarity of the details in the foreground.  There is also something about how much of the picture is in the fog.  Overall I like it - just these minor points.  Good job! 9</td>', 'This pic continues the dramatic captures that seem to be popular in this challenge.  I like that this one is b/w.  However, I am some what bothered there doesn''t seem to be sufficient clarity of the details in the foreground.  There is also something about how much of the picture is in the fog.  Overall I like it - just these minor points.  Good job! 9', '2004-10-07 17:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(948746, 105190, 6532, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  There isn''t a thing I would change.  The capture of the action and the dramatic lighting is beautiful.  One of my favorites for this challenge and over all!! Good job. 10.</td>', 'I really like this one.  There isn''t a thing I would change.  The capture of the action and the dramatic lighting is beautiful.  One of my favorites for this challenge and over all!! Good job. 10.', '2004-10-07 17:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(948748, 107202, 3585, '<td valign="top">from somebody who knows too much about models and very little about maids. Nice result nevertheless.</td>', 'from somebody who knows too much about models and very little about maids. Nice result nevertheless.', '2004-10-07 17:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(948750, 107300, 6532, '<td valign="top">Will you take my wedding pictures!  This is one lucky bride to have this capture of her special day.  Good job. 10</td>', 'Will you take my wedding pictures!  This is one lucky bride to have this capture of her special day.  Good job. 10', '2004-10-07 17:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(948752, 108986, 6532, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail.  Is this a friend of yours?</td>', 'Amazing detail.  Is this a friend of yours?', '2004-10-07 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(948754, 106953, 6532, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The hair in the face is an effective piece.  Good job. 10</td>', 'Very nice.  The hair in the face is an effective piece.  Good job. 10', '2004-10-07 17:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
