(948862, 107995, 26362, '<td valign="top">I think your concept is one of the most creative of the challenge. However, I really don''t care much for the background. The magazine made me really analyze the face to see just how well you lined everything up, and I must say you did well :)</td>', 'I think your concept is one of the most creative of the challenge. However, I really don''t care much for the background. The magazine made me really analyze the face to see just how well you lined everything up, and I must say you did well :)', '2004-10-07 18:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
