(948876, 107609, 26362, '<td valign="top">I must compliment you on the lighting in this shot... this has that soft yet real quality of truly classic portrait shots. Thanks for sharing such a thoughtful picture.</td>', 'I must compliment you on the lighting in this shot... this has that soft yet real quality of truly classic portrait shots. Thanks for sharing such a thoughtful picture.', '2004-10-07 18:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(948877, 108843, 509, '<td valign="top">The ripples in the water add a nice texture to this shot.  There are three elements that draw my attention: the sky, the rock, and the water.  As the water is the most unique element in the shot, I''d like to see a crop wherein the water occupies the bottom 2/3 of the shot, or a horizon more biased to either the top or bottom of the frame.  If the rock was dead center, it would play well with the vertical symmetry.  That said, this is a lovely subject.  The moon and its reflection are nice touches as well.</td>', 'The ripples in the water add a nice texture to this shot.  There are three elements that draw my attention: the sky, the rock, and the water.  As the water is the most unique element in the shot, I''d like to see a crop wherein the water occupies the bottom 2/3 of the shot, or a horizon more biased to either the top or bottom of the frame.  If the rock was dead center, it would play well with the vertical symmetry.  That said, this is a lovely subject.  The moon and its reflection are nice touches as well.', '2004-10-07 18:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(948878, 104030, 26362, '<td valign="top">This misty look of the falls is well captured here, against the dark rock and green foilage. Wonderful nature shot! 9</td>', 'This misty look of the falls is well captured here, against the dark rock and green foilage. Wonderful nature shot! 9', '2004-10-07 18:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(948879, 108872, 509, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity here, both with the subject and colors.  Nice work</td>', 'I really like the simplicity here, both with the subject and colors.  Nice work', '2004-10-07 18:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(948882, 108276, 26362, '<td valign="top">The shadows on the bottom and the dark clouds on the top help frame the trees beautifully. It''s hard to find such a good shot in natural light like this! Well done! 9</td>', 'The shadows on the bottom and the dark clouds on the top help frame the trees beautifully. It''s hard to find such a good shot in natural light like this! Well done! 9', '2004-10-07 18:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(948884, 107609, 509, '<td valign="top">The lighting and shadows contrast well. The use of negative space also focuses the attention on the man''s face and cup.  The only suggestion I have is to darken the cup a little so as not to draw attention away from the eye.  My gaze is drawn first to the cup due to its luminence (spelling?) within the scene.</td>', 'The lighting and shadows contrast well. The use of negative space also focuses the attention on the man''s face and cup.  The only suggestion I have is to darken the cup a little so as not to draw attention away from the eye.  My gaze is drawn first to the cup due to its luminence (spelling?) within the scene.', '2004-10-07 19:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(948887, 105984, 509, '<td valign="top">A very nice macro shot,  a closer crop might be more powerful, though I do like the inclusion of his natural habitat.</td>', 'A very nice macro shot,  a closer crop might be more powerful, though I do like the inclusion of his natural habitat.', '2004-10-07 19:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
