(949176, 108072, 15407, '<td valign="top">Faultless, Extrodinary &amp; Fantastic...  your competition tugged at my heart strings so I only gave this a 9 ... but if you dont get the red I hope you get the blue!</td>', 'Faultless, Extrodinary & Fantastic...  your competition tugged at my heart strings so I only gave this a 9 ... but if you dont get the red I hope you get the blue!', '2004-10-07 22:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
