(949682, 103788, 19708, '<td valign="top"><b>HOLY CRAP!</b> <br/>I honestly had no idea this would fall in the top three. I hoped it would be in the top ten considering the competition in this challenge.<br/>In as far as my initial comment here, those were the first words I expressed to myself and still find them appropriate.<br/> <br/>For those that were curious, here is the color version:<br/>And no, no dodging or burning was done on either shot.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=111148" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/111148.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/111148.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/111148.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>What can I say. Thank You All!<br/>Just being able to participate in this challenge was honors enough.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-09 14:17:54.</i></td>', 'HOLY CRAP! I honestly had no idea this would fall in the top three. I hoped it would be in the top ten considering the competition in this challenge.In as far as my initial comment here, those were the first words I expressed to myself and still find them appropriate. For those that were curious, here is the color version:And no, no dodging or burning was done on either shot.  What can I say. Thank You All!Just being able to participate in this challenge was honors enough.', '2004-10-08 01:05:13.000000', '2004-10-09 15:17:54.000000', 0),
