(949760, 107995, 17203, '<td valign="top">I am just appalled that this didn''t finish somewhere in the top 5. I seriously thought this would be a ribbon. Oh well, at least I got to enjoy skiprow''s comment. ;-)</td>', 'I am just appalled that this didn''t finish somewhere in the top 5. I seriously thought this would be a ribbon. Oh well, at least I got to enjoy skiprow''s comment. ;-)', '2004-10-08 01:32:10.000000', NULL, 0),
