(950096, 107995, 3280, '<td valign="top">Thanks so much for all of the comments.  I took this one morning before church as my wife was dolled up.  The ugly background was even worse in color and the reason for the DeSat.  If I had it to do over again I would certainly use a plain background and a closer crop.  It was an honor to compete and a blast to read all of the comments all week.</td>', 'Thanks so much for all of the comments.  I took this one morning before church as my wife was dolled up.  The ugly background was even worse in color and the reason for the DeSat.  If I had it to do over again I would certainly use a plain background and a closer crop.  It was an honor to compete and a blast to read all of the comments all week.', '2004-10-08 08:31:07.000000', NULL, 0),
