(950174, 108210, 3102, '<td valign="top">Hey, there''s no shame in being in the bottom of this pack :)<br/> <br/>I had a much better idea that I spent several hours on very early one morning, but Mother Nature refused to cooperate... so I went with this as a last minute idea.  I still like the shot, and enjoyed the rather consistent recommendations, although the actual landscape of this scene makes it rather difficult to come up with the vantage point many people are suggesting.<br/> <br/>This was a fun challenge despite my personal outcome, and this is certainly a batch that I''ll review from time to time for inspiration!</td>', 'Hey, there''s no shame in being in the bottom of this pack :) I had a much better idea that I spent several hours on very early one morning, but Mother Nature refused to cooperate... so I went with this as a last minute idea.  I still like the shot, and enjoyed the rather consistent recommendations, although the actual landscape of this scene makes it rather difficult to come up with the vantage point many people are suggesting. This was a fun challenge despite my personal outcome, and this is certainly a batch that I''ll review from time to time for inspiration!', '2004-10-08 10:27:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(950175, 106707, 8522, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Sonifo:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a beautiful shot!  The colors are amazing.  I would have loved to take this walk with you to get this shot.  Someday maybe. :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Come on over!</td>', 'Originally posted by Sonifo: This is a beautiful shot!  The colors are amazing.  I would have loved to take this walk with you to get this shot.  Someday maybe. :-)   Come on over!', '2004-10-08 10:27:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(950176, 108995, 3102, '<td valign="top">Hey, there''s no shame in being at the bottom of this pack... I know -- I''m right there with ya!  :)  I really enjoy your work -- this is still quite a cool shot.</td>', 'Hey, there''s no shame in being at the bottom of this pack... I know -- I''m right there with ya!  :)  I really enjoy your work -- this is still quite a cool shot.', '2004-10-08 10:29:14.000000', NULL, 0);
