(950234, 106953, 14773, '<td valign="top">I love(d) the hair over the eye and the black pupils. It''s apart of what makes this shot so different and well -great- as opposed to just a head shot.</td>', 'I love(d) the hair over the eye and the black pupils. It''s apart of what makes this shot so different and well -great- as opposed to just a head shot.', '2004-10-08 11:27:24.000000', NULL, 0),
