(950393, 107397, 17148, '<td valign="top">I loved this one, I gave it a 10, probably because I have something very similar. Not trying to say that you stole it...haha. Anyways I like your house better than mine. Great job! I really do mean it.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=93020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17148/thumb/93020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17148/thumb/93020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17148/thumb/93020.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-08 12:49:23.</i></td>', 'I loved this one, I gave it a 10, probably because I have something very similar. Not trying to say that you stole it...haha. Anyways I like your house better than mine. Great job! I really do mean it.', '2004-10-08 13:48:43.000000', '2004-10-08 13:49:23.000000', 0),
