(950539, 107876, 11800, '<td valign="top">LOvely food shot. Look how many people said they were hungry after voting on this! The dof is perfect, especially for modern menus, cookbooks and ads. What I like best about it is the two points of the crust form a perfect jaw to hold the strawberry and reinforces the desire of the viewer to bite into the sweet. The orientation of the strawberry is the only thing that could have made this better. I have to give you congrats for moving outside your comfort zone and doing something different. For such a light shot, you kept the whole outline of the sweet separate from the background. Awesome light control.</td>', 'LOvely food shot. Look how many people said they were hungry after voting on this! The dof is perfect, especially for modern menus, cookbooks and ads. What I like best about it is the two points of the crust form a perfect jaw to hold the strawberry and reinforces the desire of the viewer to bite into the sweet. The orientation of the strawberry is the only thing that could have made this better. I have to give you congrats for moving outside your comfort zone and doing something different. For such a light shot, you kept the whole outline of the sweet separate from the background. Awesome light control.', '2004-10-08 15:47:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(950543, 106707, 16301, '<td valign="top">Well deserved Bob, congrats...</td>', 'Well deserved Bob, congrats...', '2004-10-08 15:48:26.000000', NULL, 0),
