(950778, 107488, 10390, '<td valign="top">This is a very good image and underrated imo. First I gave it an 8, but I lowered it to 7 after viewing it again (sorry). I like the motive and the composition in it. I think this could have done better as a duotone image with some levels work.  Otherwise a well seen motive, I really like it. It should have ended up in 11-15th place imo as it is.</td>', 'This is a very good image and underrated imo. First I gave it an 8, but I lowered it to 7 after viewing it again (sorry). I like the motive and the composition in it. I think this could have done better as a duotone image with some levels work.  Otherwise a well seen motive, I really like it. It should have ended up in 11-15th place imo as it is.', '2004-10-08 18:01:21.000000', NULL, 0),
