(954268, 106707, 26757, '<td valign="top">This is fabulous!  <br/>Wonderful composition, and angle of lighting with regard to your positioning, I like that you have excellent shadow detail, and the that the highlights, though bright are far from blown away.  Just a spectacular shot.<br/>Where is Castle Hill?<br/>I would love a print of this one!<br/>ginette</td>', 'This is fabulous!  Wonderful composition, and angle of lighting with regard to your positioning, I like that you have excellent shadow detail, and the that the highlights, though bright are far from blown away.  Just a spectacular shot.Where is Castle Hill?I would love a print of this one!ginette', '2004-10-11 12:06:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(954476, 107202, 4564, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Nazgul:</b></div><hr/><i> Man thats Egomanic to say that everyone that voted this 4 or lower has a serios problem.....<br/> <br/>Could it be that this shot is not perfect (or below avarege) like you seem to belive?<br/>Could it be that you yourself have your head up your ass?<br/>and last but not least could it be that some people are tired of people like you who prefer not to be anounymous like most of us when it comes to voting.... I mean you could just as well spray your name on the wall in the background on each photo you submit.....<br/> <br/>And if your such a pro what the hell are you doing here? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>So, according to you, people should vote with their feelings and not with a minimum of objectivity?  Being tired of my shots, does that entitle them to vote the shots under 4 because they don''t like the style?  <br/> <br/>My comment had nothing to do with ego.  <br/> <br/>Like it or not, it''s my opinion and I will not stay silent when facing that amount of low scores from puritains.<br/>I stand by my comment.<br/> <br/>And what do you have against pros anyway?  I didn''t know this site was not accepting pros. <br/> <br/>Martin</td>', 'Originally posted by Nazgul: Man thats Egomanic to say that everyone that voted this 4 or lower has a serios problem..... Could it be that this shot is not perfect (or below avarege) like you seem to belive?Could it be that you yourself have your head up your ass?and last but not least could it be that some people are tired of people like you who prefer not to be anounymous like most of us when it comes to voting.... I mean you could just as well spray your name on the wall in the background on each photo you submit..... And if your such a pro what the hell are you doing here?   So, according to you, people should vote with their feelings and not with a minimum of objectivity?  Being tired of my shots, does that entitle them to vote the shots under 4 because they don''t like the style?   My comment had nothing to do with ego.   Like it or not, it''s my opinion and I will not stay silent when facing that amount of low scores from puritains.I stand by my comment. And what do you have against pros anyway?  I didn''t know this site was not accepting pros.  Martin', '2004-10-11 14:41:47.000000', NULL, 0),
