(959978, 105190, 1779, '<td valign="top">great shot. love the slow shutter fx. on the subject of wierd changes in the photos after shoting in adobe rgb, i have the same problem every time i up load sany shot to the internet. even if I change it to srgb before. I''ve read everything I could about it and still cannot make my pictures look the same. wich was never a problem before. in my case the don''t over saturate, the look very whashed out. if you find anything, let me know. congrats, again.</td>', 'great shot. love the slow shutter fx. on the subject of wierd changes in the photos after shoting in adobe rgb, i have the same problem every time i up load sany shot to the internet. even if I change it to srgb before. I''ve read everything I could about it and still cannot make my pictures look the same. wich was never a problem before. in my case the don''t over saturate, the look very whashed out. if you find anything, let me know. congrats, again.', '2004-10-14 21:02:38.000000', NULL, 0),
