(1072414, 107969, 15497, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Falc:</b></div><hr/><i> Terje,<br/> <br/>what sort of lighting setup did you use for this? I''m guessing at least a couple of flahes.<br/> <br/>falc </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I used two flashes. One from above the aquarium with a softbox, and one from the side. I also had a mirror at the bottom of the aquarium, so the light would reflect upwards. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Falc: Terje, what sort of lighting setup did you use for this? I''m guessing at least a couple of flahes. falc   I used two flashes. One from above the aquarium with a softbox, and one from the side. I also had a mirror at the bottom of the aquarium, so the light would reflect upwards.  ', '2004-12-21 17:37:06.000000', NULL, 0),
