(1131432, 108173, 32657, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo which I found by accident doing a search for something else.  I felt the need to register as a basic user simply to correct a mistake seen in many of the comments. This insect is a "she," not a "he" as stated in a number of comments. There are thousands of species of wasps (which include yellowjackets [one word folks], hornets, etc.) in which no males have ever been discovered.  For more details on some species of hornets and yellowjackets, see <a href="//creatures.ifas.ufl.edu/urban/occas/hornet_yellowjacket.htm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//creatures.ifas.ufl.edu/urban/occas/hornet_yellowjacket.htm</a> .</td>', 'This is a very nice photo which I found by accident doing a search for something else.  I felt the need to register as a basic user simply to correct a mistake seen in many of the comments. This insect is a "she," not a "he" as stated in a number of comments. There are thousands of species of wasps (which include yellowjackets [one word folks], hornets, etc.) in which no males have ever been discovered.  For more details on some species of hornets and yellowjackets, see //creatures.ifas.ufl.edu/urban/occas/hornet_yellowjacket.htm .', '2005-01-25 17:57:32.000000', NULL, 0),
