(1454665, 109019, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has an old timey feel to it. The look in her eyes seems almost too severe.  Like the colored part is too far off to the right. I know she''s looking at the bubble, but maybe move slightly to the right so you were seeing her more straight on. Just a thought. Overall, I like the color and concept alot.</td>', 'This has an old timey feel to it. The look in her eyes seems almost too severe.  Like the colored part is too far off to the right. I know she''s looking at the bubble, but maybe move slightly to the right so you were seeing her more straight on. Just a thought. Overall, I like the color and concept alot.', '2005-06-14 12:05:10.000000', NULL, 0),
